window.FWN_INFINITE_MANA_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_INFINITE_MANA_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":3401,"title":"Chapter 3401: Chapter 3400 Carnage! II","paragraphs":["Within a certain Spoke of the Wheel.","Inside the Immovable Sacred Palace of the Expanse.","|How is it?|","Palace Master Antiope and Nisa gazed towards Pioneer Heracles who was focusing on a concentrated singularity of shocking complexity at this moment.","His brows were furrowed as his whole existence of an extremely high level of complexity seemed to be under a great strain!","|When we did this before, we had much more power, and I wasn't alone. Seeking to grasp a pathway that we took before also carries a high level of complexity, and finding the coordinates of that place we nearly fell into to recreate it and then superimpose it on a certain location...is even harder. I do not know how long it will take.|","...!","His words showed just how tremendously the degree of difficulty was even for him, and Palace Master Antiope looked at Palace Master Nisa at this moment before her gaze became firm- her hand turning sharp and sinking into her chest firmly as bursts of golden radiance erupted out.","Her face became pale and gray thereafter as her hand pulled out a dazzling golden singularity that she pushed forward to a shocked Pioneer Heracles.","|Half of my Source of Existence. Use it freely to make sure we achieve our intended purpose.|","...!","Her eyes were filled with conviction.","She knew the terror of the Infiniverse Dowager and the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian as she would do anything.","She would do absolutely anything if the Source of such beings could truly be taken into that place and never get the chance to grow and terrorize countless weavings!","Pioneer Heracles looked at her as his gaze became even firmer, grasping her Source of Existence and taking it into himself while he focused on the complex singularity before him even more.","BOOM!","Tendrils of brilliance erupted all around him as a massive golden Rune of Existence appeared, followed by a purple one, a green one...and many more colors!","His expression turned euphoric as he exclaimed with shock.","|I've found it...I've found the start of the pathway! So long as I follow it, I could bring these weavings to that frequency that terrified us, and then impose it on their location!|","...!","They couldn't do it before.","He couldn't catch any trace of the pathway or reverse it before this, but now, after adding the Source of Existence of Palace Master Antiope, he was successful.","But...was it all because of this, truly? Or was there another hand at play?","Pioneer Heracles controlled his emotions as he turned towards Antiope and Nisa.","|The Blancverse Domain is still in the same place? I'll begin directing coordinates towards it right away so that the moment I get a hold of the weavings of that terrifying Frequency, I can impose them there.|","|Mmm, still at the same place. We have to hurry. Anything can change in an instant.| Palace Master Antiope replied weakly as she focused on the information she was receiving from the Immovable Sacred Legions that were observing a distant Blancverse.","By all means, everything seemed to be proceeding smoothly!","—","In the Trunk of the Primaltree of Existence.","Within the weavings of the Tresoverse Domain of the Omnifather.","Two seas of complexity crashed into each other, the explosion being something that caused a heavy impact in the weavings of existence- so much so that the whole domain filled with Tresorverse Towers of Existence and the place where all the Golden Titans had been imprisoned were distorted and fractured!","Weavings of existence themselves unwound and shattered as if a painting was torn to pieces, with dozens of Towers of Existence thrown back and filled with cracks as some directly shattered.","On the other side, Golden Titans seethed as from among them, multiple cried out as their weavings of Existence began to collapse.","Those attempting Ordinance Amalgamation, and those Severing their Existence who were smashed with the deadly impact of weavings, especially those massive golden fists that questioned their very core concepts...their weavings began to deteriorate and collapse as they roared out!","In the chaotic weavings of extinct Existence, many wills swept out to ascertain the current situation as they saw a single Golden Tower of Existence still remained right where it was, the illusory figure of a devilishly handsome Emperor gazing at everything with a cruel light as he bellowed out.","|Apocalypse!|","HUUUM!","There was a need for decimation and carnage.","And so, even in this reality where Existence itself was torn to pieces with the very domain of the Omnifather being affected, the Ordinance of Apocalypse was imposed as tremendous weight and complexity was added to it.","Instantly, dreary darkness and crimson flames began to descend and cover an equivalent length of...ten Omniverses.","Ten!","The weavings of Apocalypse imposed themselves over such a vast region as illusory decimated Omniverses began to emerge all around, typhoons of cataclysm forming as hellish flames began to rage!","It was the advent of an Apocalypse that would bring about even more carnage.","But...in the midst of all of this.","|Haha!|","A golden light shone along with a burst of radiant laughter.","It stemmed from the side of the Golden Titans as, at this moment, a terrifying aura rose and continued climbing up with perverted madness.","With utterly perverse weavings of complexity!","It was not quasi.","It was not halfway.","It was a genuine, unblemished aura of Existence Severing as from among the masses of Golden Titans, one had managed to rapidly and successfully sever the shackles that bound them and truly enter into the Existence Severing stage!","Such a phenomenon caused many gazes to change as powerful Towers occupied by Antediluvian Leviathans and the strongest among the Commonwealth, and those who didn't belong to any specific Lineage but had high attainments at Ordinance Amalgamation all came to float around a single Golden tower.","The tower that held a single illusory entity with an Origin Sacred Complexity Rune of Existence spinning rapidly as opposite him...","A massive Golden Titan took center stage while a few others collapsed, his eyes radiating a terrifying light as he looked toward Noah.","|I'm gonna fucking flay you to pieces!|","With indomitable might, an Existence Severing entity moved against the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian!"]},{"number":3402,"title":"Chapter 3402: Chapter 3401 Criticality! I","paragraphs":["Existence Severing.","A higher order among the weavings of complexity- a higher order of a Constellation!","There were Minor Constellations, Greater Constellations, and Elder Constellations!","Existence Severing was the last cusp among Greater Constellations as when one went even further beyond, they would have Pioneered their own path and become Elder Constellations.","The level of complexity they could wield...","BOOOM!","Was fast.","And immeasurably heavy.","Instantly, a golden hand enlarged and smashed onto the golden tower surrounded by a Severed Source of Existence- the strike being so heavy that the tower tumbled back and even smashed into other Towers!","Bellows erupted out as over a dozen towers were thrashed like pinballs, heavy damage transferred throughout as the only one that was holding it together was the tower that was struck first.","The massive illusory visage of the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian had its chest split, but it was healing rapidly while staring out towards the entity that successfully severed their existence.","A terrifying Golden Titan that had muscles roiling above its skin, a golden horn protruding on its forehead as currently, a terrifying might swirled around it.","|So many years...so much desolation!|","He bellowed out with maddened fervor as Noah...had withstood a strike against such a being!","But of course, this wasn't the first time.","The Infiniverse Megalos Body had survived an Existence Severing will from the Daughter of Existence, and he himself had survived the Will of the Weaver from the Ancient Phrike, Vujun, when he attained the Infiniverse Megalos Physiology!","They could survive, but they couldn't take too many strikes.","After all, the complexity was far too intricate for those who had severed their Existence- escaping the bounds of common sense and becoming capable of doing things others couldn't imagine.","After all, a single Severed Source of Kuklos from Noah had made it possible to traverse into another Weaving of Existence. Of course, the tremendously complex weavings of the Infiniverse Megalos Seed were required, but this was what Severing could do!","|Ah...|","The Golden Titan raised his hands high as the descent of Apocalypse itself in the surroundings was halted and rejected, the many illusory shattered Omniverses disappearing as all the land gradually became painted with a golden hue.","This...was the Ordinance of Gold itself.","Gold.","|Gold!|","The Golden Titan proclaimed gloriously as his single word was akin to a declaration.","Instantly, in the proximity of ten Omniverses, everything began to turn Gold.","|OOH!|","Dozens of Towers of Existence became anchored in space as they began to turn Gold, those within it feeling their very weavings become stagnant as all their wills and very being gradually turned into Gold!","First, own Severed their existence.","They became unshackled as the Source they Severed could then be imposed with wild abandon on the surrounding existence- to cause an effect that would have never been so widespread and possible compared to before!","Many eyes watched as this tinged of Gold surged towards Noah's Tower.","In the back, the Tower holding the illusory visage of Old Man Eudemus shot forward, accompanied by one with the visage of the Sword of the Commonwealth as behind them, a golden Tower with the illusory visage of the Viceroy followed!","|Do not let him die!| Old Man Eudemus bellowed out.","His eyes were hazy as they looked at the illusion of the devilishly handsome man who had appeared in front of him days ago as someone who had not even become One With Existence- as someone who hadn't even stepped into the Omniversal Realm!","And now, here he was showing a Severed Source of Kuklos.","There were only two weavings that could be true.","One was that he had always and already been at the Existence Severing stage the time his Omniverse X-999 was discovered and concealed it even in front of Old Man Eudemus.","The other was that truly, he had been an entity that had not even entered the Omniversal Realm, and had not even touched the states of Existence days ago when they first met.","And in that period of time, he had gone through to become One With Existence, attain his Eye of Existence, and then proceeded to declare the Ordinance of Kuklos, Amalgamated with it, and even Severed it!","\"...\"","Two possibilities.","One seemed like sheer fantasy and was filled with incredulity.","After all, if a being truly could truly become One With Existence, attain his Eye of Existence, declare an Ordinance, Amalgamate with it, and even Sever it in a few days...what were the rest of them even doing? They should just lie down and die!","It should be impossible, but Eudemus still deemed it as a possibility.","So if there was even a shred of such a possibility being real...this being could not die!","But how could they stand against a genuine Existence Severing entity?","The allure of gold oppressively pressed all around as it currently blanketed the Tower that Noah was in, seeking to impose its weavings right away!","The dazzling Severed wheel of Kuklos rotating around the tower gradually became slower and slower- but it still held off against this terrifying power of Existence Severing.","In the distance, Old Man Eudemus arrived as the illusions of multiple stacked wheels rotated around his tower, with his weavings enhanced by a Constellation Rune of Existence actually being empowered enough to momentarily stand against the Severed Ordinance of Gold pressing down!","|Pull back! Fight together!|","Old Man Eudemus bellowed out towards Noah's Tower of Existence.","Behind him, the Sword of the Commonwealth had a cold gaze as he looked towards Noah, while the Viceroy held a cloudy expression during all of these shocking revelations!","But even in the face of all these unfolding wonders and dangers, Noah's massive illusory body still looked towards the Existence Severing Golden Titan with coldness and tyranny.","As if he still had cards up his sleeves he had yet to pull out!","Others didn't know.","But at this moment, the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian was wondering.","Was it time for the deployment of Tzar Versepiercers?!"]},{"number":3403,"title":"Chapter 3403: Chapter 3402 Criticality! II","paragraphs":["Just as the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian was about to make a drastic decision.","HUUM!","The Trunk of the Primaltree of Existence trembled and vibrated as from above, the weavings of space tore while a single finger bloomed.","A single finger!","And yet this finger was exceeding the size of an Omniverse alone as it appeared and pressed down with shocking complexity above the Existence Severing Golden Titan!","The Golden Titan who bellowed out while throwing a punch upwards, a tide of Gold flowing with him.","Yet before this single finger, the tide of gold seemed unfathomably small.","The allure of gold did nothing, unable to change any weavings of existence in the face of this finger as it cracked and dissipated like foam, the expression the the Golden Titan rapidly changing and worsening as he screamed out while his whole body exploded to become a massive golden sea!","A gold sea that was stretching out to be as vast as possible, rapidly exceeding the length of two Omniverses and only growing.","Yet, the descending finger that didn't seem to have any superfluous air continued to come down, a terrifying force erupting from it the closer it came as the expanding gold sea began to rapidly constrict and become smaller.","As if an unseen pressure of complexity that this gold sea could do nothing against was focused on it!","From exceeding the size of two Omniverses, the golden sea was shrunk so rapidly and heavily that it became the size of a Cosmos, galaxy, and then a world in a matter of seconds.","In another second, the single white-skinned finger continued pressing down as the golden sea became the size of a pebble, its sheen of gold being astonishingly bright as heavy and unresigned screams could be heard from it!","And yet, it still couldn't fight back.","It was compressed to become the size of a grain of sand soon after as within moments...","POP!","The Severed Source of Gold- a newly established Existence Severing entity, perished under the complexity of a single finger.","|...|","The chaotic domain turned utterly silent.","|...|","The chaotic domain turned utterly silent.","Utter silence!","A single finger had extinguished an Existence Severing entity as how large a gap was required for this?","Such a reality caused those within the Towers of Existence to rejoice while the Golden Titans opposing them gazed forth with blazing resignation.","Why.","Why did they have to be treated like this at every turn?","Why, after cycles of imprisonment, they couldn't even fight back?","Any Golden Titan who successfully crossed the bridge and Severed their existence represented their hopes in getting out of this place- with the Omnifather promising in the past that so long as they used their power to fight their way out, they would have their freedom!","And yet...","|Liars!|","|Cowards!|","|Enlavers!|","...!","The bellows of the Golden Titans rang out with interminable brilliance as their complexity moved like a churning tide.","Those whose Existence was collapsing as they failed to Sever or amalgamate.","Those who still had hope in the process as they continued to seek a path forward!","They all moved as one and continued surging forth like an endless golden sea.","The finger dissipated after killing the Existence Severing Golden Titan, never to reappear again since then.","Noah's illusory gaze had turned above towards the Source of that single finger with a somber gaze, his eyes only turning back to the Titans a moment later as his golden tower moved with wild abandon once more.","Within him, the Origin Sacred Complexity Rune of Existence continued to spin and be studied as he sought to understand and replicate it for himself, with the Infiniverse Megalos Seed making even greater advancements in this field as all of its domains contained in the Blancverse within the Expanse were experiencing further advances due to Runes of Existence!","A language to speak and get ever closer to the Wheel of Existence.","This area was designated one to focus on even during battles as Noah continued to test the limits of what he could do!","Far from the Tresoverse Domain of the Omnifather though.","Within the Omniverse of the Protectors where Noah had left a single body to study the droves of records of the Commonwealth inside a Library.","This body had been sitting opposite Old Man Eudemus, who was shifting about multiple chess pieces, but these chess pieces had all fallen over at this moment haphazardly as Old Man Eudemus looked at him with a difficult gaze.","\"Which one is the truth?\"","He asked with complex emotions as he sighed.","\"That you always had a Severed Source of Kuklos before you even came here, or that you forged it in the past few days when you had not even become One With Existence?\"","...!","Old Man Eudemus wanted to know.","He felt like it was critical to know!","Noah looked at this being seeking to solve the Three Body Problem as he smiled and shook his head.","\"Does it really matter?\"","WUU!","Whether it was one or the other.","What would it truly change?","The gaze of Old Man Eudemus became even more cloudy at such a reply as he asked slowly.","\"Did you solve it? Are you further advanced than us in this field- is that why? I ask this not to advance my own hubris, but for the betterment of the Megalos Ynnere. For the solution of the two other Bodies entangled with it. I only seek to understand.\"","The man's words were filled with earnestness.","Noah looked at the haggard appearance of Old Man Eudemus as he asked with contemplation.","\"What do you know about different Weavings of Existence? Different Frequencies of Existence that are just like ours, but different?\"","...!","Two questions.","But they caused the facial muscles of Old Man Eudemus to tremble as more chess pieces fell!","\"You mean...?\" His pupils vibrated all around as he asked like a starved scholar.","Noah looked at the chessboard as he continued.","\"Other weavings of existence where another version of Old Man Eudemus may exist. A version where the Commonwealth prospered and became distinguished across the Megalos Ynnere. A version of Weavings of Existence where the Commonwealth was destroyed without a single part of their forces surviving. A version of weavings of existence where Outerversal Morphons have already overcome any resistance and rule over the Megalos Ynnere. Different variations, different Frequencies, and we all exist alongside them on the Wheel of Existence.\"","BOOM!"]},{"number":3404,"title":"Chapter 3404: Chapter 3403 Criticality! III","paragraphs":["The words Noah uttered out were ones that caused Old Man Eudemus to leave behind many things he knew.","To listen without bringing any preconceptions of what he knew!","Different weavings of existence.","Different Frequencies of the Wheel of Existence!","Old Man Eudemus looked towards Noah somberly as he calmed himself and spoke out.","\"These...different weavings- are a thing of fantasy that I have only thought of in theory. Whispers that seem to be extinguished just as quickly as they arise. How are you...able to speak of them so freely? How did you learn of them?\"","He asked probingly while making sure he wasn't crossing the line. He didn't know much about the being in front of him, and he knew even less now that he mentioned something as shocking as this!","He proceeded carefully.","And Noah looked at the chaotic chessboard before him as he began to pick up the pieces.","\"I learned of them through Dreams. An endless dream of countless possibilities, and I only gathered a glimpse of such weavings.\"","...!","Through Dreams.","Old Man Eudemus smiled when he heard this.","\"A dream...how do you know it was real? That it wasn't something constructed of your own weavings?\"","It wasn't that he didn't believe.","It was just that this represented far too important a concept!","Yet Noah only smiled while picking up the pieces.","\"It was very real. After coming back from a unique Frequency of Existence, I was able to Sever the Source of Kuklos right after. How can it not be real?\"","WAA!","The old hands of Eudemus trembled at such words.","Did this confirm that one possibility? That this entity before him truly went from nothing to Existence Severing in days?!","This possible truth caused him to become unfathomably serious as he became silent.","Silent with contemplation.","Silent with heaviness!","Until after a whole minute passed...","\"Did you glean any solutions to the Three-Body Problem through this? Did you understand any more than we currently know? Do those different weavings...provide any solutions?\"","Understanding and solutions. Were there any to be obtained through these different weavings? Noah smiled at this as he replied while shaking his head.","\"I do not know any more than you do. I only know of other possibilities. Other ways to acquire power. The solution you seek, at the end of the day, may be obtained simply if you hold a sufficient amount of power. If you expand what you can currently observe. Because what you know about the Megalos and the Expanse is only a fraction that an Existence Severing entity or a Pioneer of Existence. In terms of Complexity, Pioneers and Existence Severing entities fall in the same stage of Constellations as if you exceed this and attain a Source Complexity...the Three Body Problem may not be a problem to you at all.\"","...!","What a peasant knew and what a king knew were very different.","The eyes of Old Man Eudemus trembled as he repeated the words that resonated in his mind.","\"Source Complexity...Source? Are they able to redefine their own Source? Forge other Sources? How close are they to the Wheel of Existence?\"","The Shield of the Commonwealth wondered.","And the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian smiled with reminiscence as he replied.","\"I've met one such being in the Expanse. He's either at Source Complexity if not higher. Bob was his name.\"","\"Bob?\" Old Man Eudemus raised his brows.","And Noah nodded lightly. \"Bob.\" —","Within unique and unfathomable weavings of existence.","\"I feel a tingle...is someone talking about me?\"","An entity with a round head surrounded by multicolored waves of singularities scratched his smooth top and looked around.","His surroundings were utterly complex weavings of chaotic brilliance- with it being difficult to even discern what exact location he was in based on this.","But the senses of this being were never wrong as his singularities for eyes turned contemplative.","\"Could it be that kid? Or that girl? Or the most recent one?\"","Many faces passed across his eyes as he couldn't decide, eventually shaking his head before he began to frown.","Moments later, around these complex weavings that even most Source Complexity entities would have a hard time figuring out, a pathway opened amidst the multicolored radiance as a figure slowly walked in.","\"Sir Bob, I hope you don't mind my intrusion. I came to see if I could pick the brain of someone as esteemed as you. Maybe a cup of tea as well?\"","...!","The voice was feminine in nature.","It stemmed from an entity who seemed to be made of pure white light, her form humanoid as her face only held two singularities and a mouth!","A star of white floated above her head serenely as she gave off immense waves of peace and serenity.","Yet when Bob looked at her, his singularities squinted as a sharp light flashed through them.","\"You motherfucker. You wouldn't come here unless you wanted to use your light to prevent me from seeing something. What are you planning? What have you done?\"","WAA!","His words were direct without any roundabout means.","He looked at the entity that was made of pure white light who looked wrong right after!","\"Sir Bob, I would never. I respect you far too much for me to do something like that. I truly came to pick your brain about something.\"","...!","The entity stated so as she floated near the immensely complex weavings around Bob, starting that she came here to discuss something, and yet so far, she had not mentioned anything!","Bob looked in her direction coldly as he shook his head while voicing out.","\"Don't fuck around with me. I have no qualms about ignoring any semblance of rules if I'm really pissed off. When will you all come to learn and accept not to interfere with the weavings of the Wheel of Existence? When will you understand that it never needed any of us to ensure its flow? The Wheel has been here long before you or I. Who was overseeing its flow then? You all...\"","Bob shook his head with great distaste as he looked at the being before him!"]},{"number":3405,"title":"Chapter 3405: Chapter 3404 Criticality! IV","paragraphs":["The being before Bob shook their head and replied serenely.","\"You observe and ensure. I also observe and ensure. I only move because others move. We all move to stop the movements of others who may do what they shouldn't, or go where they shouldn't. We are all on the same side.\"","...!","Bob looked at this being calmly as he shook his head in a manner that seemed to show his disinterest and apathy.","As if he knew that whatever he said would not matter here.","So he simply lied back and relaxed while echoing out a few more words.","\"One of these days, you all are going to force the hand of something truly heavy with your actions. When that day comes and you all cannot bear the weight...\"","Foreboding words.","With them, everything faded into oblivion as the weavings in this area became heavily veiled!","At such a moment.","Within the Expanse.","Inside of the Immovable Sacred Palace.","|Haha...this should be impossible- but I think I've found it. I'm barely able to hold on, but I've found it! With it, the pull of the Frequency will absolutely take in the chosen targets and any possible signatures of their weavings across these weavings of Existence. Clones, separate bodies...anything sharing a connection will be taken without fail! Haha!|","Pioneer Heracles didn't believe the smoothness of how everything had been going so far.","With bloody eyes, he turned towards Antiope again.","|The Blancverse hasn't moved, right?! It is still at the same place? I can move these weavings there right away if so!|","His whole existence was vibrating as he couldn't keep this up too long.","A terrifying singularity of complexity- and even he was afraid of it as he could now only keep it at bay for so long!","|Wait, let me confir-...! What!|","Palace Master Antiope gritted her teeth as blood flowed from her mouth.","|The Blancverse just moved! Hold on, the Immovable Sacred Legions are tracking it again!|","The situation instantly turned chaotic.","Pioneer Heracles was somber as he only spoke out grimly. |It has to be quick. It has to be quick!|","It had to be quick.","As their forces scrambled within this region of the Expanse.","Noah was within the Infiniverse Megalos Seed as he observed the dazzling emergence of grander and grander concentrations of complexity as multiple massive Amplification Runes of Existence were now forged and floating across many regions of the Infiniverse Megalos Seed.","This was just the start as these Runes of Existence were extremely versatile, and there were far too many uses!","Around him, the very Ordinance of Runes swirled as he continued to fill it with waves of Complexity to aid in the understanding and forging of Runes of Existence.","He wanted the time to freely study them as this whole time, he sensed the cluster of Ordinance Amalgamation entities in the background who seemed to be intent on observing him and not making a move.","They no doubt came as the forces that the now-dead Daughter of Existence promised would come, with there being one or multiple Existence Severing entities behind them.","He couldn't yet freely decimate Existence Severing entities, but he also wasn't worried about the protection of the Blancverse!","But being under a constant surveillance was also not something he preferred as if they wanted a chase until some time passed and they would all be eradicated in time...he would give it to them.","\"Let's move.\"","He spoke succinctly as authority pulsed lightly from him, through the Infiniverse Megalos Seed, and into the Blancverse Domain as it blazed brilliantly before warping away- moving rapidly across the golden strings of existence!","—","In a faraway region of the Expanse.","Flickering shadows could barely be discerned as everything about themselves was masked- as if nothing about their auras could leak or touch any weavings of Existence here.","At this moment, one shadow looked at another.","Barbatos stared at the shadow of Amalthos as he spoke with stern eyes.","\"The weavings below are at a critical juncture. The target is moving away as we simply need to keep it in position now, and then ensure they are pulled towards that place. Remember, we do not peer through their weavings at all- no knowing their identities or anything else. We cannot be entangled!\"","\"Yes, yes.\" Barbatos rolled her eyes at this as she pressed down with her hands, exerting a silent pressure along with Amalthos beside her!","The complexity of their power was something few could understand.","A press of their hands could mean far too many things as at this moment...a Blancverse that was moving rapidly across the Expanse became wrapped by a terrifying silver black light.","Instantly, the strings of existence around it flickered and pulled as if they had fallen under the control of another, and this Blancverse followed a path in reverse as within moments, it returned right back into the position it was at!","...!","The Immovable Sacred Legions that were already setting off came to a stop as they looked at the returning Blancverse Domain in shock and stupor.","It came back? This...","Even as their weavings buzzed, they reported this information back to the Immovable Sacred Palace of the Expanse!","Within the Blancverse, Noah and the Infiniverse Megalos Body stepped out of the Infiniverse Megalos Seed- entering the larger Blancverse itself as their gazes were somber.","The action of the Blancverse Domain was shockingly reversed, a terrifying weavings of power pressing down from all around as Noah felt a sense of foreboding!","The Infiniverse Megalos Body also moved sternly as she stared at the boundless complexity of the silver black light surrounding the Blancverse, her hands clapping and releasing a heavy shockwave that...","BZZT!","Was only absorbed seamlessly akin to the waves of a sea.","Noah's weavings burned when he saw this.","A terrifying Sacred Primal Eye of Existence opened as he tried many things!","Moving the Blancverse was shockingly deemed impossible as if a terrifying complexity locked them down in place.","He sought to move the Infiniverse Megalos Seed...and even this was anchored in place!","Every single thing was shockingly anchored in space in a manner they couldn't even fight against- this type of complexity they faced far exceeded the bounds of Existence Severing as it had to be that of a Pioneer or higher!","The silver black authority...held a feeling of inevitability as if it stated no matter how much one struggled, what it deemed to come to pass would come to pass.","Why? Why did this terrifying power seek to keep them in place? Noah did not want to wait to find out.","Infinite waves of authority began to leak out from him as by his side, Ruination appeared and turned into a massive, austere armament!","These...were the weavings of their actions.","But far from them.","In the Immovable Sacred Palace of the Expanse.","|They...they returned to the same initial location! They can't seem to move, as if they are being held down...|","Palace Master Antiope blinked in shock and confusion at the scene that didn't make sense.","But before her, Pioneer Heracles could barely hold on any longer as he roared out while releasing the singularity filled with shocking complexity in his hands.","|I cannot hold it any longer! If he is in those same coordinates, then I shall send it there!|","BOOM!","The space around them splintered and shattered as a singularity filled with shocking complexity warped, instantly appearing above a Blancverse in a far away location!"]},{"number":3406,"title":"Chapter 3406: Chapter 3405 Inevitability! I","paragraphs":["Palace Master Antiope and Nisa watched the terrifying singularity warp and held towards a certain location.","Their weavings felt breathless at this moment as they almost couldn't believe it.","Would it truly succeed?!","|I...I want to see it for myself! If the Infiniverse Dowager and the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian are truly about to disappear forever, I want to see it for myself!|","Her eyes were burning with crazed fervor as she remembered the humiliation and fear she felt at the hands of the Infiniverse Dowager.","Having to run away just from hearing she neared their positions!","She wanted to see her disappearance for herself!","BOOM!","The space in front of her splintered as she disappeared into it- golden strings leading to the area where the Immovable Sacred Legions were burning brightly.","The haggard visage of Pioneer Heracles was ashen as he didn't even get the chance to stop her, his eyes cloudy as he sighed and also moved- Palace Master Nisa also gritting her teeth and following.","Two Existence Severing Constellations and a Pioneer.","They already had the location on hand as with a single jump, they warped above the Immovable Sacred Legion within moments and observed the shocking reality up ahead.","The moment they arrived...","|Move further back!|","Pioneer Heracles shouted out towards everyone as he warped away a distance of three Omniverses.","The others soon scrambled away as well as they watched a terrifying silver-black radiance hold down a Blancverse, and now, an even more terrifying complexity erupted out in the form of a singularity as it ensnared the Blancverse and everything within it!","From the singularity, a gray string bloomed.","A single gray string.","And yet it carried such a complex and profound ancientness that even from afar, every single entity felt a sense of trepidation.","A sense that told them if that gray string touched them, their weavings would cease to exist!","Ordinance Amalgamation Entities, the two Existence Severing Palace Masters, and Pioneer Heracles, all felt this same sensation without a doubt equally.","As if power didn't matter before this gray string.","Before the gray frequency that Pioneer Heracles had simply pulled upon a minuscule amount of its weavings for.","And even this nearly cost him all his weavings as he wasn't seeking to traverse across another frequency of existence- but simply to start the journey towards a specific frequency to cover a certain area!","The power of the frequency in question would do the rest.","It's pull, once caught in it- even Source Complexity entities could not run away from it.","But for everything to line up and work out as it was...far too many things had to align just right.","Pioneer Heracles was somber as he saw the silver black brilliance of authority in the surroundings slowly begin to fade away.","The power that had actually held the Blancverse here.","|There is another hand at play here...it wasn't just us making a move!|","Pioneer Heracles became even more haggard at this realization as the others were stern.","Palace Master Antiope had a crazed look as she peered deeply into the Blancverse, where a shocking level of complexity far exceeding even the most top-tier Ordinance Amalgamation entities was erupting out.","|It doesn't matter, does it? So long as the Infiniverse Dowager and the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian are lost towards that frequency!|","She spoke freely with a hint of exhilaration as she saw weavings of that frequency entirely wrap around the Blancverse.","It would not be able to escape now no matter what!","So she freely talked as while peering into the Blancverse, her eyes came in contact with the three Entities currently within it- especially the one she always feared this whole time!","The gaze of the Infiniverse Dowager.","HUUUM!","Palace Master Antiope subconsciously stepped back and breathed heavily before she stood firm and stared back.","The Infiniverse Dowager was about to forever disappear.","Nothing of her weavings could hurt her!","While staring straight at the Infiniverse Dowager, her fierce gaze caught the enraged eyes of the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian as well.","A terrifying calm rage she had only heard of before during events of that great war where hundreds of thousands of Existence Severing entities fell.","But so what? No matter what his rage could do now-","OOOOH!","...!","She felt the bellow of the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian travel from afar as it shook her to her core, observing a terrifying Golden Severed wheel blooming around him as it sought to break from the influence of the inescapable weavings covering the whole Blancverse!","That...","|Existence Severing?!|","Palace Master Antiope was shocked while Pioneer Heracles shook his head with a wry smile.","|What did I tell you about not underestimating them? Especially the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian. Imagine if we had gone in and fought thinking they only held power at Ordinance Amalgamation, and then they suddenly reveal a Severed Source of Existence. I wouldn't be surprised if they had other tricks, so this path was the best one! Even if another hand played a part in it...|","Heracles looked around them silently as he couldn't sense any weavings of anything else whatsoever.","The only thing he saw...was the Blancverse beginning to warp as it rapidly began to be swallowed into a terrifying gray string!","|Existence Severing, Pioneer...none of it matters before the weavings of that frequency.| Palace Master Antiope gritted her teeth as she looked towards the disappearing Blancverse and bellowed out all her fears and frustrations.","|You will not be missed, Infiniverse Dowager! You can fuck off all the way, Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian!|","A bellow of all her resentment from so many years. From the sleepless nights and the terror she felt towards their future weavings!","It reached the Blancverse and the entities within that had tried everything to no avail.","|Antiope, hush! Never celebrate before utmost completion!| Pioneer Heracles remained stern as he looked around constantly- observing the rapid rate of disappearance of the Blancverse!","At the same time, those within the Blancverse became unfathomably somber as they stared above- at gray light wrapping around everything as it made one thing abundantly clear.","Inevitability.","This single word and what it stood for was made abundantly clear at this moment!"]},{"number":3407,"title":"Chapter 3407: Chapter 3406 Inevitability! II","paragraphs":["Nothing worked.","No matter if Noah Severed all the hundred plus Sources of his existence, no matter if they were all amalgamated with him- he had the distinct feeling that even with such complexity, he couldn't escape that blooming gray brilliance.","He recognized it to be the brilliance of a frequency of the Wheel.","But it was far too terrifying.","Once wrapped up in its light, it was inevitable to flow into it as this held many implications!","And the ones to cause all this...","|...You will not be missed, Infiniverse Dowager! You can fuck off all the way, Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian!...|","The intent of the newly appearing entities from a distance rang out clearly across the Blancverse as the culprits were made clear.","Infiniverse Dowager.","Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian.","They knew them.","They knew of them!","But...","'From other weavings of existence?'","Noah's eyes were bright as he thought of the only possibility where these beings could have met them or known of them.","He had many questions and things to think of, but the terrifying gray light above didn't give any recompense as with a brilliance of inevitability, it touched him, the Infiniverse Megalos Seed and Body, and Ruination!","Instantly, his gaze became even more somber.","Far from the Expanse.","In The Megalos Ynnere.","Opposite a chess board, a figure of Noah seated in front of Old Man Eudemus instantly changed his expression as a terrifying gray light wrapped around him, and he disappeared right away. ...!","On the other side of the chess board, Old Man Eudemus scrambled back with a horrified look as his weavings of existence continued to shake from merely being near the gray light!","In another region of the Megalos Ynnere.","Within an Omniverse where the Great Ponderor had taken refuge in.","Nietzsche looked utterly terrifying as the new Master that had just bound his Megalos Regnum was warped away by a gray light that made him feel like a newly born Morphon!","Within the weavings of the Tresoverse Domain of the Omnifather.","Inside of a Golden Tower of Existence, Noah's brilliance was only just beginning to unfold when in the next moment, blinding gray light that caused the Golden Titans and those within other Towers of Existence to feel trepidation and fear erupted out.","It consumed the brilliant Golden Tower Noah was in as anybody near scrambled away with fear, and when they looked back...they only saw a split tower.","Lifeless and dim, it was decimated as the weavings of the one within it were far gone.","Nobody moved in the next few seconds as they feared the reappearance of the gray light that had just flashed!","Any weavings of Noah's.","His clones.","His other bodies.","Anything related to Noah Osmont...was not spared as it was ensnared by the terrifying gray light that only left behind terrified observers.","All of it was brought back and superimposed on his body within the disappearing Blancverse!","Back in the Expanse, Noah stared at the terrifying gray light somberly as he spoke to the Infiniverse Megalos Seed.","\"Be ready for anything. Entanglement is guaranteed, but death is not.\"","He couldn't feel a sensation of death from this terrifying gray light.","But the feeling it did give seemed to be even worse than death! What could be worse than death?","He didn't know, but he would be ready for it as he watched the gray light that was enveloping everything.","—","Within the Expanse.","Surrounded by complex weavings of Existence, a shadowy figure confirmed a few things before he nodded.","\"Alright, let's go. The target is ensnared in the weavings of that frequency as we have ensured the success of this event. Mission parameters stated not to be near whatever blooms here.\"","Amalthos uttered out calmly as his figure began to flicker with silver black radiance.","What others found unfathomably hard to do- the traversal of different weavings of existence, was merely something that required a decent amount of effort to achieve.","Since they were done here, and were not supposed to peer and see any details regarding those involved in this event, their mission was entirely completed as the only thing remaining was to ensure that none of this could be traced back to them!","\"Yes, yes. Let's go.\" Beside him, Barbatos was wrapped up in the same brilliance as her shadowy body began to flicker away.","Within the span of an instant...","WAP!","The shadows of these two beings entirely disappeared as if they were never here to begin with!","And silence reigned in this area as slowly, veiled complexity began to die down.","It began.","But it didn't take long before space flickered with radiance as a single dark shadow returned!","\"Haa, escaping the senses of that fool is hard.\"","The shadow of Barbatos flickered as a part of it remained!","Going against mission parameters, a part of it silently came back as...","It was curious.","For the first time, it wanted to see the contents of the mission.","\"Hmm...\"","Her hands moved haphazardly as thousands of terrifying Runes of Existence burst around her.","She had to do a few things to ensure no blowback or entanglements by observing those of other weavings of existence- especially those she had a hand in completely altering their future weavings.","From her shadowy brilliance, her figure slowly became clear.","Dark hair and eyes that pulsed with appalling complexity. A somewhat small figure, but with curves that showed a gorgeous sculpted visage. The chest and waist were plentiful as her skin shone with a caramel-colored radiance!","Her eyes held an inquisitive light as she questioned and wondered.","Who was involved? Why was it best for the Wheel of Existence for them to be sent away to that place? Why was it deemed this was the path to follow to ensure the smooth flow of the Wheel? Who deserved to not just be killed, but locked away like this?","\"Who, who, who....\" She spoke with curiosity as she freely looked at this moment, the veil she and others always set up when conducting their missions being broken down as she was able to see down below for the equivalent length of over 100 Omniverses of distance.","She saw the Immovable Sacred Legions and the Pioneer amidst them who should be the one they had been subtly aiding and influencing to find the frequency of that place.","She then saw the Blancverse being 97% pulled into that place as her inquisitive eyes rapidly delved into it, intent on seeing just who was deserving of this treatment!","She saw the inside of it.","She saw multiple figures.","But her attention and all weavings of existence were pulled towards and locked onto a single figure.","A face.","A man with the visage and demeanor of an Emperor.","With devilish handsomeness and profound valor.","At this moment, he was bellowing out with defiance and calm rage as he still burned with shocking complexity against the inevitable pull nobody could escape!","Seeing his face, her heart shuddered.","Her mind buzzed as tears rapidly began to flow down her face.","\"Ah...\" She let out a silent scream as she felt heart-searing pain- as if something within her was being pierced by trillions of needles!","Subconsciously, she reached out towards that figure that valiantly stood in defiance even while wrapped in the light of inevitability!","\"No...!\"","She didn't know why.","She didn't know why it hurt so much!","But she had to...","WAP!","Like a flickering singularity, the Blancverse entirely disappeared.","Along with everything inside of it.","\"NO!\"","Barbatos screamed out as she felt like her own heart had disappeared!","Her body was trembling uncontrollably as her mental state buzzed, unable to make heads or tails about what was going on.","Who was that? Who was that?!","Why did her heart break so much just seeing him? Why did she feel such an appalling sense of desolation right now as he was forever taken away?!"]},{"number":3408,"title":"Chapter 3408: Chapter 3407 The Erasure of Noah Osmont! I","paragraphs":["\"Ah...!\"","A scream that wasn't all scream echoed out for nobody to hear.","Barbatos lay on a swirling field of abundant complexity as her face was filled with pain and confusion.","She felt like she had lost every single thing important to her- when she didn't even know she had it!","Tears freely streamed down her face as her heart...","\"Why? Why?!\" She didn't understand it.","She clutched her chest and felt the pain in her heart as if she had wronged her most precious person.","All her life, she had lived with privilege and power within her weavings of Existence.","When she had Pioneered her path long ago, she was trained for the complex missions through different weavings of Existence and the one critical thing to do during traversal.","To avoid Entanglements.","To not observe who or what was within those weavings of existence, as unforeseen results could occur during Entanglements!","She didn't expect that the first time she dropped the veil to see just who she had helped throw into that unforgivable frequency was- this would occur.","She felt a sense of desolation even though she didn't know who the person she was looking at was. It could only mean...","A version of herself here was connected to that man in an extremely unfathomable way!","She raised her tanned hands as she looked at herself. She wiped the tears and stood up, feeling the aching in her heart as she knew she couldn't just sit here.","She knew she had to leave and not entangle herself even deeper, but...she just couldn't!","So she looked around.","She saw the figures who were responsible for initiating this event and the ones she and Amalthos had aided to ensure its success.","She saw them, and she flickered away from existence!","—","In a region filled with golden strings.","Palace Master Antiope looked towards Pioneer Heracles with excitement and trepidation as she asked.","|How will this affect those weavings of Existence? Those frequencies were the future Infiniverse Dowager waded through? With her source sent to that place, would events rewrite themselves? Will entire Frequencies of the Wheel correct themselves? Will This present action that we took change past results concerning us?!|","She bombarded question after question as she became increasingly excited with each.","The change.","The result of their actions!","If the Infiniverse Dowager and the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian had their Source Weavings locked away in that place, then many things should change...or have already changed in the past.","As she asked this, Palace Master Nisa beside her also had a complex expression as she thought of many things.","Pioneer Heracles on the other hand, had a difficult expression.","|This...is hard to say as nobody truly understands the weavings of different Frequencies of Existence. Due to the paradoxical factor and uncertainty of time in some Frequencies- we can't truly tell the results of our actions in the past. The best possibility I can think of...is for us to experience the results in our current future.|","...!","It was confusing.","Anything dealing with the Frequencies of the Wheel took extremely extraordinary minds to truly understand!","|So...nothing that we went through in the past has changed? We won't suddenly revert back to our original Weavings of Existence since we never would have had to leave due to the Infiniverse Dowager that is no longer there?|","Palace Master Nisa asked hesitantly.","And Pioneer Heracles massaged his temples as he replied.","|If everything was to be changed like that and we were returned to our previous weavings, it would also mean that we never arrived in these weavings to find the young Infiniverse Dowager and the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian to begin with. If we weren't here, then they wouldn't be locked away right now. It...is truly difficult and paradoxical to understand as we can go in circles thinking about it, but we should see the change ourselves in the coming future, and not the past. We will know soon enough the initial results of locking away the Source Weavings of Existence of the Infiniverse Dowager and the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian.|","Convoluted. Hard to grasp.","But Pioneer Heracles made it clear that changes would likely occur forward in time! From now on.","But what possible changes could bloom from what they just did?","Palace Master Antiope's mind was buzzing with possibilities as she was about to speak again when...","TING!","A booming and utterly terrifying sound that caused their weavings of existence to buzz emerged above them.","A sound akin to something that was tightly wound snapping.","|What...?|","Their gazes were stern as they looked up, and there, within the Expanse...","TING!","Their wills vibrated as they saw a golden string snap.","A golden string.","A String of Existence!","There were countless of them stretched out across the Expanse as those truly powerful knew how to utilize them to traverse tremendous distances of hundreds or thousands the equivalent length of Omniverses in a short period of time.","They held even more complex meanings that very few knew about, but at this moment...","TING! TING!","With horrific snapping sounds, the tightly wound Strings of Existence were breaking one after another.","The halves disappeared on opposite ends as if one didn't observe it closely, they wouldn't even be able to know that it happened as even now, you had to look extremely close to see that there were larger gaps between some strings of existence compared to others!","It was an eerie unfolding of reality as Pioneer Heracles was ashen.","|What is this?|","He had to ask. With this phenomenon occurring as soon as they successfully sent the Source Weavings of Existence of the Infiniverse Dowager and the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian into that place where they could never return, they could not say that it wasn't connected!","But...why did such a phenomenon occur in response to that?","HUUM!","Amidst this shocking unfolding of reality, all of nearby surroundings for the span of the equivalent length of ten Omniverses turned silver black and froze.","All weavings froze as in the next second, the visage of Barbatos appeared before Pioneer Heracles and the two Existence Severing Constellations beside him!"]},{"number":3409,"title":"Chapter 3409: Chapter 3408 The Erasure of Noah Osmont! II","paragraphs":["But their figures remained utterly frozen as they didn't even know they were in this state!","Their wills, their eyes, their very existence knew absolutely nothing.","In such an environment...","TING!","Barbatos turned up as she also observed the snapping Strings of Existence, her gaze becoming stern as with every snap...she felt the concentration of the weavings of the Expanse lessen!","She turned her head towards the three Entities that she and Amalthos had aided without knowing their identities.","She now became entangled with them as well as she floated towards their frozen figures- tendrils of silver light leaking from her fingers and connecting onto the foreheads of the three beings!","WUU!","Brilliance vibrated and trembled as the eyes of the frozen Pioneer Heracles, Antiope, and Nisa became blank while their heads were forcefully turned up.","Barbatos wanted to know.","Who were they targeting? Why?","She invasively entered their weavings of existence and began to peruse as very quickly, her expression changed!","Much of their weavings were scattered. Their memories lost through scattered weavings of existence.","They did not even belong within this Weaving of Existence as they fell here after running away from theirs!","When it came to the distant weavings of that place, Barbatos wasn't able to pull anything as she could only wade through their weavings in this frequency of Existence.","And there, she found names.","\"The Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian...\"","She uttered out these words as her heart ached even more.","This was the man that she had helped send away.","She had noticed within the Blancverse Domain that was entirely eaten up in that inevitable frequency, there was a sparkling circular domain inside of it that seemed like a miniature world.","She wasn't able to see through it in time, but there were abundant forms of life within! Was her version of existence within this frequency in there, or was she still somewhere else?","She needed answers as she gazed coldly at the three entities before her, the weavings she had managed to uncover being far too little and too scattered.","But at least she now had a direction.","She waved her hands as, in the next moment, an illusory image with extreme clarity appeared.","Constructed from all the weavings she had just obtained and what she herself saw, it was the illusory image of the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian.","His body glowed with unfathomable valor as his eyes were stern and filled with the illusion of countless weavings.","His whole visage gave off an air of dominance and power as when Barbatos looked at him, she felt her heart become ever tighter!","She had to find out more about him. About his weavings. About who he was.","And this frequency she was in...should have the answers!","She brought his illusory image into her hands and crystallized it, holding it close as she disappeared thereafter.","Moments later, the frozen space returned to normal.","|What is this? Why would that happen?!|","Palace Master Antiope looked above as she asked why Strings of Existence would be snapping!","This was something they had never heard of before, nor had they seen until now.","They all felt a tremendous sense of foreboding as not a single one of them...knew or realized that their weavings had just been frozen with their memories read in the last few moments!","Not a single one!","Their hearts only felt a sense of unease as Pioneer Heracles became extremely somber.","He began to ask himself.","What had they truly just done, and what implications would it have?","As he began to see Strings of Existence snapping, he realized that none of them could truly and fully grasp just what they had done!","—","Noah Osmont.","His weavings, his being.","Everything about him had been taken away as his absence was felt in only a few places.","The Tresorverse Sacred Domain of the Omnifather.","The Omniverse of the Protectors.","Small areas within the Megalos Ynnere.","His weavings entirely disappeared as at this moment, no shred of Noah Osmont existed within this Frequency of the Wheel!","Within the Expanse.","In the Primal Eldritch Palace of the Expanse where bountiful auras of Outerversal Morphons seethed.","HUUUM!","In a core region, weavings were trembling heavily as the Great Mother and the Great Segregator turned to observe Ozymandias.","His stellar obsidian visage currently radiated a tremendous sense of rage that caused the tentacles of this Outerversal Morphons to shudder, looking at him in shock as the Great Mother asked.","|O Instrument of the Beyonder, what happened?|","All others were sent away after the brief eruption of authorities that caused many powerful Morphons to enter the domain of the Great Segregator, and only the three of them were left with the Great Segregator being very agreeable after the gains she made earlier.","But now...just what had changed so drastically? They all looked towards Ozymandias whose eyes burned with interminable brilliance.","Ozymandias.","Ozymandias!","He was not Noah Osmont.","He was Noah Osmont- a piece of him that was born in an entirely different Megalos and held a different Source of Existence!","But...Ozymandias was still able to access things from Noah, and Noah could also access things from Ozymandias!","Ozymandias raised his hand in the next moment as...","WUU!","The blaring Ordinance of Infinity bloomed with a glorious blue on his stellar black skin.","WUU!","It rapidly changed to colorless as Quintessence bloomed after that, along with Tyranny, Cheats, Protagonist, and more!","His body flashed with brilliance as all dozens of Ordinances built by Noah Osmont were also his to access!","But...Ozymandias could not currently feel anything regarding his other self.","It was not death, as this sensation would be extremely painful even to Ozymandias.","But...as if they cut off, Ozymandias wasn't able to grasp any weavings of Noah.","No memories. No sight. Nothing.","And the heavy connection Ozymandias shared with the Infiniverse Megalos Seed...it felt like it was so distant and closed off that he couldn't draw any power from it!","Whatever that terrifying Frequency it was where they were drawn into, all weavings seemed to be excluded as at this moment, Ozymandias could not ascertain the state of existence of Noah Osmont.","But there were still many things he could do.","WAA!","His head whipped up as he uttered out coldly.","|The Immovable Sacred Palace of the Expanse has chosen to step on my dignity and must perish. Do you know of it?|","...!","The Great Mother and Great Segregator looked at him incredulously while making sure they heard right.","The Immovable Sacred Palace of the Expanse stepped on his dignity? But...he had just arrived in the expanse and was with them this whole time!","As they gazed at him like this, the body of Ozymandias in the Megalos Beyond also began to move.","He had to make a descent into the Megalos Ynnere.","Within the Megalos Ynnere, there was something in Omniverse X-999 that he had to grasp!","There were many things occurring and countless moving pieces beginning to churn at this moment, but the biggest thing was singular.","The question of where exactly the other part of himself was sent to!"]},{"number":3410,"title":"Chapter 3410: Chapter 3409 Gray! I","paragraphs":["The sensation was a terrible one.","The moment that everything about him was swallowed by the gray brilliance of the unknown frequency, he found himself shuttled across unknown distances as after that...he felt a sense of weightlessness as he was falling from the skies!","Skies.","When his eyes could see again, this was exactly what he saw, but... its texture seemed off.","Its color seemed off.","The very skies looked gray and without any brilliance, and his figure was shuttling through them speedily as he approached...an equally gray earth!","WHOOSH! He felt the rough winds as he willed his weavings.","His weavings.","His...?!","There was absolutely no response.","No Mana. Ordinances. Absolutely nothing whatsoever!","\"Master!\"","Through the rough winds, he heard the voice of the Infiniverse Megalos Body that currently held in her hands...a round structure with intricate weavings and patterns nearly four times her size, with a few gaps contained within it.","Through the gaps, Noah could barely discern a dim structure that looked like an infinity symbol- something he soon recognized to be the Extremity Vein of the Infiniverse Megalos Seed as around it, there were gray circles that seemed to be teetering and about to fall at any moment!","Also in the skies, the figure of Ruination could be seen as she held on to a white ring three times her size.","A white ring.","This was what Ruination held while the Infiniverse Megalos Body had what seemed to be the Infiniverse Megalos Seed, with all three of them shuttling through the skies and towards a gray earth below.","\"Master!\"","With the earth nearing, the Infiniverse Megalos Body moved her arms to try and get ever closer to Noah, her other hand holding onto him and wrapping around his figure- her body positioning itself below him while she cushioned him above!","And...","BOOM!","Their figures smashed onto the gray earth.","The moment it happened, Noah almost bellowed out a heavy roar.","Because for the first time in what seemed like forever, he felt the wind knocked out of him. He felt every muscle in his body aching with immense pain- his head buzzing as he nearly fainted!","He!","The Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian!","The Owner of the Infiniverse Megalos Seed!","He nearly fainted as within his body, he couldn't will any ounce of power as he felt like an utterly normal, mundane human being.","\"Master, are you okay?\"","Below him, the figure of the Infiniverse Megalos Body asked with caution and care as she was speaking with her mouth.","Words were coming out as sounds, with no intent or weavings of authority flowing from her either.","Noah nodded heavily while rising, his face wincing in pain as he looked towards his left hand...and saw the wrist being bent in an utterly wrong direction.","\"...\"","He withstood the pain and clutched his hand- forcefully bending it back in the right place as even more waves of pain burned across his body!","He breathed heavily as he looked around, seeing Ruination also coming towards them as she dragged the white ring with her, while the Infiniverse Megalos Body still held on to the Infiniverse Megalos Seed with one hand- the other hand steadily supporting Noah.","They looked around them as they seemed to have fallen...on a mountain full of gray earth and corpses.","Corpses of humanoid beings and a myriad of other animals, and even corpses of what looked like plant-like creatures!","They were strewn all around this area as Noah looked at all of this grimly while speaking out.","\"What is the assessment?\"","He turned his head towards the Infiniverse Megalos Body.","She seemed to have lost her color as she had a head full of dark hair, her eyes holding white pupils filled with dimming radiance.","She was adorned in a gray robe that was ripped on the bottom, showing the thigh of her left leg all the way down.","Her eyes held...emotions. Complex emotions at that as none of her monotone emotionless weavings could be seen!","\"The moment we appeared here, all weavings and authority seemed to be restricted entirely. I focused all my efforts on the Infiniverse Megalos Seed as within, the workings of gravity, mana, or anything else dealing with authority were slowly shutting down. I ensured the safety of all life forms within, even during the impact here. But all quintillions of existences within the Infiniverse Megalos Seed are in a miniaturized state comparable to the Aletheian Havens and worlds they are in. Since all authority seems to be nullified, we cannot take them out, nor can we become smaller and enter the Aletheian Havens themselves.\"","...!","Noah's eyes carried a terrifying light as he heard this!","Absolute nullification of all authorities.","And it seemed far more than that as his body felt so weak to the point that he found it similar to a time before he even awakened.","\"But...compared to the absolute rejection Master faces, I can innately sense some weavings of the Infiniverse Megalos Seed still active. It's as if this rejection of authority affects biological lifeforms more absolutely, but planetary constructs have a thin level of leeway. I can ensure the safety of all Lifeforms in the Infiniverse Megalos Seed this way, but I still need to be careful not to apply too much force to it. Before all authorities were cut off, I sent a message to all prevalent people under Master to adapt to the current situation as long as they could, and that we may not be able to communicate with them, but that you were okay.\"","\"...\"","The Infiniverse Megalos Seed took care of everything.","Noah closed his eyes as he thought of his son. His mother.","Adelaide, Barbatos, Sona, and many others who depended on him!","He was sure that they were currently frantic in trying to get through to him, and he couldn't even sense or see them!","He breathed out as he looked at the massive circular construct five times their size that the Infiniverse Megalos Body still held onto.","They couldn't miniaturize themselves to enter any of the Havens within, but it was still so big that one could pass through the gaps and touch the dangling rings of Havens.","But it felt like with a simple touch, all of it could come crashing down and kill quintillions due to the horrific state of things all around."]},{"number":3411,"title":"Chapter 3411: Chapter 3410 Gray! II","paragraphs":["Noah breathed out as he assessed his own body and spoke.","\"My level of strength is akin to that of an utterly normal human. You two...\"","He looked at Ruination and the Infiniverse Megalos Body.","Ruination has traces of her crimson gold hair still present, her figure covered with a red gold bodysuit that tightly hugged her curves and showed her exquisite figure.","She used her fingers to tug on her skin as she spoke.","\"Master, My skin and body seem to emulate that of a human's, but its composition is that of some form of metal. I estimate my strength...\"","She clenched her hand into a fist and punched down, causing a cloud of earth to erupt and covering her pretty face with gray sand.","She coughed and wiped the dust away as she continued.","\"My strength and resiliency may be five to ten times that of a normal human, Master. But I cannot access any authority whatsoever.\"","This was the conclusion Ruination arrived at.","In her hands, Noah looked at the white ring she held as he sighed and asked.","\"That is the Blancverse Domain?\"","\"Yes, Master.\"","...!","A white ring.","Dim with no power, this was what remained of the Blancverse Domain.","Ruination stared at it curiously before she turned to stare at the Infiniverse Megalos Body that was holding onto the massive construct five times their size.","The two women looked at each other calmly before the Infiniverse Megalos Body spoke.","\"I cannot estimate my power compared to a normal human, but the Infiniverse Megalos Seed feels weightless to me- akin to it being a part of my body. A limb or a piece of hair.\"","As she spoke, she raised the massive construction up and down slowly.","\"The absolute denial of authority seems to affect lifeforms differently, with my makeup being forged from the Infiniverse Megalos Seed itself as it isn't as absolutely suppressed as all others may be.\"","\"...\"","This was the state of things.","It was a shocking reality to ascertain as Noah rose up while ignoring the pained muscles all over his body, looking around him once more.","They seemed to be in an area that was dry and barren, gray sand and cracked earth stretched out all around as lifeless decomposing bodies sat all around them.","He looked at their variations and uniqueness as he asked the Infiniverse Megalos Seed again.","\"What assessment can you make about this place?\"","He asked her and relied on her for many things as if he still had his Sacred Primal Eye of Existence, he could open it and observe everything as many prompts would come.","But there were no prompts.","There was no system.","There was no Atlas of Existence.","Absolutely nothing!","The dark hair of the Infiniverse Megalos Body fluttered in the wind as her gorgeous figure looked around them and spoke heavily.","\"We are likely in a Frequency of Existence that denies all possible weavings of authority absolutely. Seeing the bodies around us, it is likely that countless entities from many frequencies fall into this place, with those who are unlucky like us and drop from the skies facing an immediate death once they smash onto this earth. Around us could be corpses of past Existential Dominium Realm Entities, Existence Severing Entities, or even Pioneers. Yet here, they are all the same.\"","WAA!","The Infiniverse Megalos Body looked around before she continued.","\"Seeing the types of bodies here, all seem to be innately related to Matter as those relating to Megalos Ynnere would be deposited in regions around here. I can theorize that elsewhere, those stemming from Dark Matter and Anti-Matter could have their arrival as well. If this truly is a frequency, then these lands may stretch out endlessly and contain all possible lifeforms from countless frequencies that have been stuck here for who knows how many years. Of course, since no weavings of existence are prevalent here, normal physiological humans would age normally, and in less than a hundred years...\"","The Infiniverse Megalos Body looked at Noah.","In his slightly injured state.","He currently had on slightly dirtied obsidian pants and a loose shirt, his body still retaining its muscular visage as the loose shirt showed the outline of his abs and abdominal muscles underneath.","His dark hair and eyes made him seem immensely normal as seeing this current state of being, the Infiniverse Megalos Body unconsciously felt drops of water flowing from her eyes.","\"Ah...\" She brought her hands up and saw the tears coming down as she was shocked, her voice echoing out again.","\"My internal workings also seemed to have gotten scrambled. With my body expressing a high level of emotion compared to before.\"","She said this while wiping her tears away, looking at her Master, who had never been in this state since she was with him, as she couldn't help but feel pained!","Noah looked at her with a smile and patted her head.","\"It's okay. We are in a new place filled with unknown realities and possibilities. We will come out of this stronger than ever, okay? It's a temporary hurdle as we won't always remain in this state.\"","He said this with a straight face.","But the Infiniverse Megalos Body couldn't maintain his heavy gaze as her eyes looked down.","On the side, Ruination was also somber as she stared out into the expanse around them.","Gazing down, the Infiniverse Megalos Body bit her lips as she spoke out.","\"Master, with no authority, no workings of anything...this place is akin to a prison. A prison that nobody would be able to get out of. No portal can be formed, no pathway. No power can be conjured. Once here, it is likely that nobody comes out. I...I can't be of use to Master like I used to. If we cannot find a solution in years or decades and Master starts to age...if a time comes decades down the line where your normal human body gives out, I...\"","For the first time, the Infiniverse felt complex emotions it never experienced before.","She felt...fear.","Not a fear of others or for herself, but the fear of losing her Master.","Of him being trapped here too long and his brilliance being affected!","In this fear, a silent rage burned as she thought of those who had sent them here.","She clenched her fists with her head bowed down, but in the next moment...","\"Ah...\"","She felt a warmth wrap around her.","When she came to, she could feel the body of her Master hugging her.","The warmth...caused her to feel a tremendous sense of ease and peace as she calmed down. What was this? A state of mind being altered by a mere touch?","Her thoughts buzzed as Noah put her head on his chest while he spoke calmly.","\"It's okay. We'll find a solution like we always do. Or do you not trust me to lead us out of something like this?\"","Noah held the body of the Infiniverse as he raised her head and looked into her reddened eyes.","They became heavy and firm at this moment as she nodded, but in such a sweet moment...","PA! PA!","Her gaze changed as she picked up sounds.","Noah also turned towards a certain direction where clapping could be heard at this time, a few figures walking over from a distant hill as it consisted of a few humanoid beings!","\"How sweet. Just arriving at this hellhole and already grabbing each other for company? Haha, what did I tell you all, I definitely saw fresh blood coming down. And two of them...my oh my, are they going to sell for a lot.\"","A vile voice.","Accompanied by a burly man in fur clothes, a jagged sword clasped in his hands as behind him, a dozen others followed with eyes full of smiles and malice- their eyes shining ever so brighter as they locked onto Ruination and the Infiniverse.","On these barren gray lands, the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian landed.","On these barren gray lands, there were countless others who had been ensured in the very same frequency.","On these barren gray lands...a terrifying epic was about to bloom!"]},{"number":3412,"title":"Chapter 3412: Chapter 3411 Gray! III","paragraphs":["Entrants in the dreary gray area they just landed in.","This Weaving seemed utterly terrifying to even be on as no matter one's power, they were entirely normal here with only their body to protect them!","A human was human.","An ant was an ant.","But even in these weavings, there were still people who didn't know how to handle themselves.","Seeing their appearance, Ruination instantly became stern as she appeared in front of Noah, her gaze filled with callous emotion as she gazed ahead.","Those coming made their way over calmly and imposingly as if they weren't worried, the leading burly man even gazing at the white ring that Ruination held in her hands with a smile as he spoke out.","\"New blood that have only just arrived here are always faced with a rude awakening. Nothing here is as it was wherever you came from. You hold that Blancverse Ring in your hand tightly as if it is something worth something here...haha! There are dozens of Blancverse Rings being used as decorations in the nearest Settlement. Whatever authority you used to enjoy before...means nothing here!\"","WAA!","\"In here, men are men, women are women, animals are animals. All are equal, but also not. After all, how could a small girl like you overcome the strength of someone twice your size? I cannot remember how many times I have seen those in a similar state to yours right now- with those ferocious gazes of anger and regality, but do you know what their status was just hours later?\"","His eyes turned sharp and with a vile light of cruelty as they stopped a few meters away from them.","\"There was a graceful woman who asked again and again, do you know who I am?! I am the Pioneer of the Violet Palace of the Expanse! Blah blah blah, she went on. Do you know what her past status afforded her? She was sold for a few bundles of grain and a single cow in exchange to the Warlord of some settlement. Now, she has given that Warlord what, 5 Progeny? Haha, man, are you all in for an awakening.\"","...!","A Pioneer.","Here, she held no authority to defend herself as she was sold and used to make children by some Warlord!","The burly man in dark fur scratches his beard as the jagged sword in his hands glinted with a sharp light.","\"I am Doxono, and I will be the bringer of realization for you all. The pretty man...can be sold for a few bundles of grain as there are others with unique dispositions. You two girls...it almost feels like a shame to sell you, so we may just keep you to ourselves. Come, you can attack first. Come see just which new lands you are currently in.\"","He pointed his sword forward.","Noah's eyes were calm as he stared at this being.","He had listened intently as through his words, he had obtained many critical bouts of information regarding this new place as he didn't stop this being from talking!","He learned a bit about what type of civilization was here.","The strong ruled.","He looked as apart from Doxono with the sword, others behind him held makeshift wooden clubs- these clubs showing bloodstains as they had been used far too many times.","Noah's eyes radiated a silent calm as he placed his hands on Ruination while stepping forward toward these dozen or so men.","Their faces were unkempt, their fur clothes tattered, and their eyes sunken. They looked malnutritioned as in this place, one had to also ask...where would they obtain food and water?","Against such beings, did Noah really need Ruination to move?","He walked forward calmly as behind him, Ruination and the Infiniverse wanted to follow- but they listened to his wishes!","\"Show me how powerless I am-\"","SAA!","Before his words even finished, Doxono had already swung his sword to bisect him as truly, these entities were brutal!","His feet had already moved as he didn't even look at the sword that was swung down, only staring deeply into the eyes of this burly man.","His body only slightly turned sideways as the sword breezed inches from his clothes.","The pupils of Doxono constricted, but Noah already charged into his space after evading- his uninjured right hand shooting forward and stabbing into the eyes of this being!","\"GAH!\"","A furious yell echoed out the head of Doxono thrashed side to side, those behind him becoming somber and moving forward as in this short period of time while the forefront Doxono reached for his bleeding eyes, he found the grip of his sword being taken away as an instant later...","SQUELCH!","A swift sound of something being cut echoed out.","Those behind Doxono stopped in place as they saw above the head of their leader who could not see, a jagged sword had cut halfway into his head, blood and brain matter flowing freely!","\"Hmm?\"","Noah pulled out the sword as he saw his strength was truly too little.","He couldn't even cut through a head entirely!","But who was he?","How many years had he experienced? How many weavings had he experienced? Even if his body was that of a normal human, how could he not even be capable of predicting the movements of another normal human?","Feeling the heaviness of the sword in his hands, he looked at the less than a dozen beings before him calmly and spoke.","\"Come on now.\"","Ferocious expressions rose up.","The unnamed extras looked at each other with heavy gazes before they roared out and moved towards Noah!","...!","A few minutes passed thereafter.","In these few minutes, the gray earth was painted red with blood and gore as Noah breathed heavily while standing on top of a mountain of bodies, a single thug still remaining in front of him as he trembled fearfully!","\"Fuck.\"","Noah couldn't help but curse as he felt like he had run a marathon.","His breathing was slightly labored, and he had even gained another small injury on his right shoulder!","\"Master, Ruination could have taken care of all of them without you getting hurt...\" The Infiniverse Megalos Body dragged over the Infiniverse Megalos Seed while observing Noah's state with heartbreak.","When had the Tyrannical Emperor ever looked exhausted and out of breath before?"]},{"number":3413,"title":"Chapter 3413: Chapter 3412 Gray! IV","paragraphs":["Noah nodded towards her with a smile as his figure was currently covered in the blood of his enemies, making him look extremely ferocious.","\"I wanted to gauge the extent of this body compared to those here. And now, we have a little piggy here that looks like it's about to talk. Isn't that right, little piggy?\"","He looked towards the sole remaining unnamed extra that had just witnessed the massacre.","And this being shook while looking at Noah like he was the devil, his mouth opening as he began to squeal.","\"We...we come from a nearby Settlement under the lead of Warlord Maxus....\"","He couldn't read the memories of others anymore or grasp their weavings.","This was the only thing he could do as he listened to the story of this unnamed extra for a few minutes, and continued to stare at him whenever he stopped as he would continue to babble on about anything he could think of after that!","After about half an hour, the mouth of the unnamed extra seemed perched as if he had nothing else to say.","Noah looked at him and nodded.","\"You were a good little piggy.\"","SAA!","The sword in his hands flashed, and a head fell down cleanly.","Thereafter, he could only sigh as he looked up at the gray skies, digesting all the information he had collected so far.","\"It really is a hellhole.\"","To survive, one needed food. One needed shelter. One needed sleep. Thus, many clustered towards Settlements that held loose rules, with a ruling force presiding over it and offering protection to others in exchange for many things!","The first and foremost were resources. The second was pleasure.","When it came to resources, one could find them anywhere across this gray endless stretch of land that some called Hell. Hell Terra Firma.","Others called it The Purgatory Lands.","Everyone that came here from countless possible weavings had a different name for it as only a single need drove them all- to survive and get back to their weavings!","But for those who had been here for years, they had long since given up hope of returning.","So there were Settlements to live and survive.","Those are just Human Settlements.","There were other Settlements where other races converged, these being much bigger as others only heard rumors of them.","Settlements of large beasts and other Lineages that held great stature- Settlements so large that they formed into Kingdoms.","Even if there were no authorities, what would happen if a normal human met a Dragon?","Even without any mana, the human could still be crushed with a single claw! It was akin to a human trying to win a fight against an Elephant or a Dinosaur on the blue planet.","There were even rumors of Settlements of those aligned with Dark Matter and Anti-Matter stretched out in far away regions- with this area here and many, many miles surrounding it only falling under the influence of entities stemming from Matter.","This...was just a brief overview of the knowledge he had gathered so far.","There were no doubt many intricate things going on here after an unknown number of years passed and countless entities came down.","But the main goal was to survive.","There were Huntsman like the ones they met here who waded around the periphery of their Settlement to look for anything and anyone who may have been swept into the Purgatory Lands.","Animals they could eat were routinely found this way!","And there were Gatherers who stayed within Settlements trying to cultivate vegetation in these barren lands- an extremely arduous task as water was an extremely precious and rare resource!","\"...what an inconvenient place.\" Noah shook his head as he looked around while planning his steps ahead.","Shelter and food. There was a Settlement nearby with both as at this moment, Noah made the decision to move forward and obtain a base of operations.","\"Let's go, I'll leave the fighting to you guys from here on out.\" He threw the jagged sword he held towards Ruination as she now dragged both a ring of the Blancverse and a sword in another hand, and the three of them began to walk towards the direction of a Settlement.","They left behind a bloody mess as Noah himself looked like he had just come from a massacre!","On their way there.","In half an hour, they were nearing the outskirts of the Settlement they had only heard of when suddenly, the Infiniverse Megalos Body stopped and showed an expression of shock that soon turned into elation!","\"Master, I feel something. It is faint, and flickering in and out, but I feel another part of me! A part outside of this place...and the one to amplify its sensation right now...!\"","Her eyes became wide.","They all stopped in place as Noah thought about many things, his eyes also lighting up as he thought about his other self.","Ozymandias!","—","Within a certain frequency.","Inside a certain sector of the Megalos Ynnere.","|Master, we are here...|","Near Omniverse X-999.","Savitar spoke with trepidation and continued shock as he looked towards the body of the Instrument of the Beyonder.","This personage had come to him in the Pantheon of Umbra and used his authority commandingly to use the loose channel between the two Megalos that Savitar had been using to send his other bodies through, and the location they arrived at...was Omniverse X-999!","Savitar read between the lines as he was shocked to realize the one who had his Megalos Regnum was Instrument of the Beyonder himself.","The Dreamer of the Megalos and the Instrument were one and the same!","|Stay here.|","His commanding voice seemed to be filled with a chilly light as his massive stellar obsidian body disappeared into Omniverse X-999.","Inside of it.","Ozymandias crossed tremendous distances in a short period of time as very quickly, near a region of space close to Cappadocia.","He appeared in this calm region of space as he waved his hands, and...","HUUM!","A dazzling Dream Aletheian Haven showed itself.","A small, insignificant part of the Infiniverse Megalos Seed that was left behind in Omniverse X-999 after it transcended its weavings of existence to enter the Expanse!","Ozymandias looked at it with bright eyes as his figure disappeared into it- his weavings billowing it out like a vast sea as he sought for anything, absolutely anything with the main component of this small piece that was equivalent to the size of a single Cosmos!"]},{"number":3414,"title":"Chapter 3414: Chapter 3413 Purgatory or Paradise? I","paragraphs":["A small piece of the Infiniverse Megalos Seed.","The moment he arrived in it, Ozymandias released waves and waves of Mana into it as if he was providing a source of power to light it up brightly.","His signature was taken in seamlessly as he went through its very center while wondering.","When the gray brilliance of the Frequency of inevitability hit him, every part of him, whether it be a clone or will, was affected, pulled, and merged back into him by the time he was whisked away!","Only Ozymandias, who shared an entirely different Source of Existence- Dark Matter, was not recognized and ensnared.","But the Infiniverse Megalos Seed...had a part of it not wrapped up in the Entanglement as he could only attribute this to its unique qualities!","What the Infiniverse Megalos Seed actually was.","A form of planetary domain that had risen so far above, to the extent that it became a Megalos Seed.","It had not bloomed into a Megalos yet, but it was on its way there.","When Noah became entangled, his body and the region they were in seemed to all be taken away as he saw the Tower of Existence he was in fracture with a large section of it taken when that clone was pulled back, and the same phenomenon occurred in other places where he was.","Small sections of the land and space around him were also eaten away.","But just because these small sections of land and space became entangled and eaten away into that terrifying Frequency of that place, it didn't then cause all billions of miles of land and space of that domain to also be devoured!","The Infiniverse Megalos Seed was akin to such domains.","It was entangled in the entirety with the Blancverse it was in, but it was akin to a piece of a Megalos being eaten away as it wasn't treated like a normal lifeform!","Thus, a part of it was left behind.","An isolated Dream Aletheian Haven.","It held the workings of the Infiniverse Megalos Seed, but such a small residual weaving of it was left behind as even now, after Ozymandias arrived and began nurturing it with endless waves of Mana did a sense of cognizance and will slowly begin to form.","As it did, Ozymandias had a cold expression as a devouring light erupted from him- the surrounding weavings of Omniverse X-999 also beginning to be pulled in and assimilated into this small isolated Haven to help it grow!","Weavings buzzed as such a process began to take place, the terrific visage of Ozymandias multiplying into two moments later as one left.","Outside of Omniverse X-999, the other body of Ozymandias gazed at the figure of Savitar who held an expression of stupor still as he voiced out coldly.","|Other domains of Outerversal Morphons apart from you and Nietzsche. Let's go.|","He needed fuel currently.","And there were many Omniverses out there as he continued to map sectors- especially Tainted Omniverses under the banner of Outerversal Morphons!","Coming out of his stupor, Savitar nodded brisket before their figures disappeared.","Back in the small isolated Haven, Ozymandias nurtured the connection he held with the Infiniverse Megalos Seed as he currently cradled a golden singularity that had formed after all this time- this singularity containing a budding will as with enough nurturing, it would bloom into enough complexity a sliver of the Infiniverse Megalos Body.","Or so he hoped!","Half an hour passed.","And...","HUUM!","Outside of the isolated Haven, within OmniverseX-999, three terrifying singularities tens of times larger than the Isolated Dream Aletheian Haven itself appeared- these being nothing else but three Dark Matter Cores!","The other body of Ozymandias appeared alongside them as the moment they were transported over, the Isolated Dream Aletheian Haven began to devour and assimilate them greedily!","The singularity in the hands of Ozymandias became denser and denser.","More and more complex.","After a certain point, an emergence of fantastical brilliance erupted out in front of Ozymandias that formed into complex lines of a humanoid figure!","Simmering with multicolored radiance. A level of complexity much, much lower than before!","But undoubtedly...","|Infiniverse...|","Ozymandias called out as the silent visage of the newly built Infiniverse Megalos Body opened its eyes, its pupils hazy and foggy as if there was a tremendously powerful barrier preventing its operations.","Outerversal Authority leaked from Ozymandias among much more, the light of many Ordinances flickering and flowing into the small body before him until...","|Ah...| A voice as if one was taking a breath after a long time came through.","It was followed by light filling the multicolored pupils of the Infiniverse Megalos Body, its eyes landing on Ozymandias as they showed such great surprise and relief to the extent that the moment this body formed, she threw herself towards the towering obsidian stellar body of Ozymandias and hugged it tightly!","|Master!|","A single word.","But it expressed relief. It expressed happiness. It expressed the potential beginning of the end of a terrible nightmare.","Ozymandias looked at her and wondered- just what place was his other self sent to that the monotone Infiniverse Megalos Body now expressed such emotions?","He cradled her head on his stellar chest as he asked lightly.","|Is everyone okay? Those within the Infiniverse Megalos Seed?|","A critical question to put his heart at ease.","And the newly formed Infiniverse Megalos Body blinked while calming herself.","|My state of being has been altered due to that place, and I will work on processing the overflow of emotions, Master. Everyone is okay, but my memories and records of that place are scattered and even delayed in getting to me here, it seems. Here is what I could recover...|","Her forehead glowed as she brought it in contact with his giant chest, bundles of information flowing out from her and into Ozymandias as he became clear on exactly what had happened and where his other self was!","Hell Terra Firma.","The Purgatory!","This was the place his other half was in as at this moment, he began to analyze everything about it!"]},{"number":3415,"title":"Chapter 3415: Chapter 3414 Purgatory or Paradise? II","paragraphs":["Hell Terra Firma.","A place where countless weavings of existence were thrown into to never return.","They couldn't return.","After all, authority was entirely and completely rejected in this place.","One could not form a portal or initiate any sort of weavings that could take them from one place to another.","Powerful entities at the Existence Severing stage or even Pioneers would arrive at this place as within a matter of decades, they would die of old age!","This was where his other self remained locked in, along with quintillions of entities inside the Infiniverse Megalos Seed.","He spoke succinctly as he pulled the Infiniverse Megalos Body away from his chest.","|Are you able to establish a connection? Anything at all? To allow for the formation of a gateway within the Infiniverse Megalos Seed there and this Haven here?|","Terrifying questions were asked.","And the Infiniverse thought for a few seconds before she shook her head.","|Authority continues to be impossible to utilize there, with the Infiniverse having a form of exception that currently only allows its workings to remain stable right now. Forming a gateway would require authority. Transporting anything or anyone else would require authority. And even if somehow the Infiniverse Megalos Seed could be used to form this impossible gateway, it would never be able to leave the Hell Terra Firma lands itself as this...would also require the eruption of authority. So, even in the best-case scenario, the Infiniverse Megalos Seed would forever remain locked in that place.|","...!","Despotic words echoed out. They weren't just left at this though as not long after...","|But, there is an Infiniverse Megalos Seed in that place, and there is now an enlarging and gradually increasing in complexity portion of the Infiniverse Megalos Seed here. It may be possible...to allow the overlap of the two and transport something in a small concentrated area from one to the other. With the amount of remnant authority that the Infiniverse Megalos Seed in the Purgatory Lands holds and this portion of the Infiniverse Megalos Seed possibly allowing this overlap to transport something as small as a grain of sand...maybe.|","Her eyes were filled with hesitation and uncertainty as she looked around at the sandy obsidian stellar radiance all around them.","|Especially if it's through Dreams, we may be able to allow this overlap to transport increasingly bigger things over time. In theory. This opens up a new realm of possibilities when looking at the Purgatory Lands as a whole. A place where countless things from all weavings of existence get locked into with nothing ever being able to leave. What if, theoretically, we gain the capability to move something back and forth? All the things rendered useless in Purgatory Lands due to the absolute rejection of authority. That dead extra stated that rings of Blancverses are being used as decorations. And there are entities that used to be Pioneers or even higher in power. If we could obtain the body of a Pioneer and begin sending its Blood through? All possibilities. All just hearsay. But theoretically....theoretically...|","The Infiniverse Megalos Body ranked on as she made one thing clear.","Possibility.","Theoretically.","There were still a lot of unknowns as when they arrived here...","|We can try.|","Ozymandias spoke with eyes filled with Tyranny.","The Infiniverse Megalos Body looked towards him intently before she nodded.","She turned towards the swirling and increasing concentration of authority in this isolated Haven as her floating figure sat down in space and closed her eyes, terrifying complexity beginning to surge around her as one of the only ways she could see in achieving the possible theory she had...","BOOM!","Was through Runes.","Around her, the beginnings of complex Runes began to flicker as Noah appeared beside her.","Waves of complexity leaked from him as well as it flowed into her and aided in the process, these two beings attempting to do something never done before in a small corner of the Megalos Ynnere!","Within OmniverseX-999, there was a certain Ankyra that felt the eruption of power and complexity within a certain area, but it was so intense compared to himself that he was only forced to observe from a distance.","Far from Omniverse X-999.","In another sector within the Megalos Ynnere.","SAA!","Space distorted as a dazzling figure of a woman appeared, her eyes sharp as her figure was short and blessed.","The new entrant, Barbatos, looked around this region of the Megalos Ynnere as she arrived here to seek more weavings of her Entanglement!","Based on the physiology of the man she felt so much pain over, she knew he would have stemmed from the weavings of Matter as this area was her next stop.","What she had to do...was find the most complex power within the Megalos Ynnere of this frequency and see if they would know anything about the man she sought.","\"Who?\" Her eyes were cold and filled with a calculative light as she sent out silent silver strings of brilliance all around her.","They crossed great distances in a short period of time very quickly; she received some feedback as she looked in a certain direction!","There, the waves of brilliance she sent out returned back to her the illusory scenes of rotating Omniverses around a single being.","A single, massive rune radiating a brilliance that read [SPACE] flashed behind her, and her body shot out and rapidly disappeared!","She crossed the equivalent lengths of hundreds of Omniverses in an extremely short period of time as after a while...","SAA!","Space fizzled and melted as she arrived near a rotating Omniverse.","Below it, a stern figure rose from his seated position as he stared toward her with ever-increasing somberness!","Yet Barbatos looked at him calmly as she spoke.","\"You are Pioneering your own path in this place, good for you. I have no qualms, and only seek to obtain weavings of this man here- have you heard, seen, or grasped anything relating to him before?\"","...!","In front of her, the illusory image of a tyrannical devilish entity flashed, the eyes of the entity surrounded by swirling Omniverses constricting in recognition!","No matter how small it was, Barbatos saw it as her heart filled with elation amidst the constant feeling of pain, betrayal, and heartache that she felt.","She didn't understand why, but she truly felt like her actions had betrayed herself and this being who made her very existence shudder!","Even if she didn't know what she was doing.","She wanted to know him. Who he was.","The entity before her had a complex expression as he spoke out with hesitation","\"The last time anything regarding him was observed...was in the Tresoverse Domain of the Omnifather. A gray light erupted with him at the center as he disappeared entirely. If you seek his origins and records, he seemed aligned with the children of the Commonwealth. You can find them here...\"","The Entity that had set many things in motion for the Omnifather released a bundle of weavings- cooperating with the newly appearing Barbatos as her complexity made him feel extremely stifled!"]},{"number":3416,"title":"Chapter 3416: Chapter 3415 Purgatory or Paradise? III","paragraphs":["\"The Commonwealth...\"","The eyes of Barbatos were bright as she knew she was getting further and further Entangled.","She took the weavings of information from the entity that used to be a so-called Prisoner not too long ago and nodded as her figure disappeared right after!","She left alone a single man who had dazzling Omniverses rotating around him, his expression stern as he felt like he could finally breathe once more.","He looked where Barbatos used to be as he spoke questioningly.","\"A Source...?!\"","Far past a Pioneer.","Possibly a Source Complexity Entity!","Why would such an entity be looking for the weavings of that man? With his exemplary showing in the Tresoverse Domain of the Omnifather and just as rapid disappearance, what about him would prompt a Source Complexity existence to be seeking him?","The Prisoner wondered. But there were no answers.","He continued to monitor the situation within the Tresorverse Domain of the Omnifather as any time that a Golden Titan successfully Severed their Existence and fully entered this stage, he would make a move as a terrifying finger would descend from above to eradicate them.","He almost moved the Existence Severing champions of this Megalos Ynnere that were being given a vastly different opportunity by the Omnifather in another entirely separate Domain, but the amount of losses they would have from being removed there were far too much.","Thus, he moved himself and continued to observe.","Far from his location.","On the Omniverse of the Protectors.","Old Man Eudemus stared at a tear in space that had yet to close with a somber expression, the vibrant visage of The Sword of the Commonwealth also being beside him as this Simian vibrated with terrific power at Ordinance Amalgamation!","Alongside them, there were a few other Ordinance Amalgamation core members of the Commonwealth whose bodies arrived after the shocking commotion- each one seeking to understand the entity who became a Protector under their very noses while holding such terrific power, alongside his terrifying disappearance.","|He didn't ask for anything? Obtain any of our core workings from you?|","The eyes of the Sword of the Commonwealth were chilly as they asked, and Old Man Eudemus turned towards him with an even colder gaze.","|Do not take my silence for weakness, O Linus. What I have said is exactly how everything went down.|","...!","Tensions were high between all sides.","At such a moment...","\"Quite a gathering here. You all are sufficient to be known as core members of this so called Commonwealth?\"","HUUM!","Without their knowledge, a voice echoed out that caused their gazes to change heavily, all of them looking up and seeing a figure shrouded in darkness gazing down at them!","They didn't even know she had been there this whole time as instantly, they all became battle ready!","Above, Barbatos harrumphed as she looked down, seeing the tear in space that reminded her of the one she saw in the Expanse.","He was here before.","Another one of his bodies was here as it was pulled along into that frequency!","Looking at the few Ordinance Amalgamation entities who didn't look like they would make things smooth...","WUU!","She clenched her fist as a silent silver black radiance spread out, freezing everything and everyone here as thereafter, tendrils of silver brilliance flew out from her and connected to the heads of all beings here.","She began perusing their records and memories freely as if he was here, it meant he may have interacted with these beings.","Maybe...she could see more of him?","Maybe-","\"Ah...\"","Her small figure trembled.","From the head of the one called Old Man Eudemus.","She obtained a bundle of records.","His conversations.","His last moments.","Who he was.","\"Noah...Osmont!\"","Barbatos uttered these words as she felt her very existence trembling with complex pain!","The name felt extremely familiar to her, and yet foreign at the same time.","The name caused her heart to feel at great ease, and yet brought down even greater feelings of guilt for having contributed in sending him to a place where nobody came back from!","Nobody.","She confirmed at this moment that any version of herself in these weavings was so intricately connected to this man that the connection...transcended weavings of existence to the extent that this Entanglement she had placed herself in was impossible to remove herself from.","She felt like the feelings of guilt and pain would drown her heart completely if she didn't get closure from them as she had to keep looking!","She went through all the memories multiple times.","His mannerisms.","The way he talked.","His smile.","It all caused her heart to feel heavier and heavier as her version here must have been impossibly bound to this being.","This type of love...","How could she have loved him so much?","Barbatos felt a pang of jealousy at this other version of herself as she was shocked to also learn that Noah had begun to Dream of other Weavings of Existence.","He had just begun, and she and Amalthos were sent off to ensure that he was locked away forever!","Was this a reason why those above wanted him sent there? Because they foresaw he was about to do something in the future that would affect not just his weavings of Existence, but others too?","Barbatos didn't know.","For this, she would have to ask her father to grasp and understand why he and the others decided on the missions that they had to undertake.","\"Noah Osmont...Omniverse X-999!\"","She repeated his name and the home that the Commonwealth found him in as she disappeared an instant later.","She went seeking for Omniverse X-999 in the vast sectors of the Megalos Ynnere!","Where she used to be, all weavings flowed once more as...","BZZT!","Golden wheels erupted all around the Ordinance Amalgamation entities here, their weavings looking around for the woman that was just there as...","There was nothing to be seen.","...!","They remained in a high state of tension as to them, what had just happened was too eerie!"]},{"number":3417,"title":"Chapter 3417: Chapter 3416 Purgatory or Paradise? IV","paragraphs":["Far from the Megalos Ynnere.","Far from any common weavings of existence.","In the place Noah found himself in termed the Purgatory Lands.","Hell Terra Firma!","He stopped a distance away amongst tall, dead, and decaying trees as he looked down in the distance where a small Settlement could be seen.","Everything about it seemed extremely rudimentary, with walls made out of stone and trunks of gray trees protecting a periphery of about 5 or so miles. Equivalent to a truly small town.","This was a major settlement in this area as within it, a few thousand humanoid entities reigned!","And at the forefront was the Warlord Maxus.","Inside the small Settlement, an area for the cultivation of vegetation was tightly guarded, as well as a farm area holding animals such as cows, chickens, and unique variations of what could be considered mythical beasts outside of here...but were smaller in size as they did not hold much power.","So they were being raised and bred for consumption over the years.","This...was a Settlement.","A place with food and shelter, and something that Noah needed if he was going to survive and not die of hunger in the next few days and weeks and months to come...if he really was going to be stuck here for that long!","At this time, he stayed back with the Infiniverse Megalos Body as he spoke to Ruination.","\"Have a talk with the Warlord Maxus. Let him know to either abdicate and work under me, or he will be deposed.\"","Around the Settlement, those standing guard had simple weapons similar to the thugs from before, with the addition of bows and arrows on some along with spears!","Even though authority was entirely rejected in this place, there was still ingenuity and knowledge from many races.","He didn't doubt that, over time, in those larger settlements, much more powerful weapons and defense systems could be developed!","After all, his blue planet didn't have any Mana, and they eventually even developed Nuclear weapons.","But here, would the processes of even nuclear fission and fusion be rejected as advanced weaponry could never be made?","Would more advanced weapons like guns or bombs already be developed in the larger Settlements, or were even these considered a form of rejected authority?","Noah didn't know for sure as, at this moment, Ruination had already begun to move!","\"I will be back soon, Master.\"","Her eyes held a ferocious glint.","Her body was different from normal humans as she was made entirely of unique metalloids, with her strength and resiliency being many times that of a human as she held tremendous advantage here!","She began to freely walk into the small Settlement as for the first time in a while, winds would begin to blow.","—","Inside a small Settlement. Many didn't even bother to give it a name as there was a sense of despondency in these barren lands of Purgatory, with all those here only clustering for survival to ensure they didn't die out in the gray lands out of nowhere.","At the peak of this Settlement was the man who had gathered a number of people and gradually established order- someone who had lived for many cycles and had reached a tremendous level of power before!","But now...","\"Ah....\" He lay on a makeshift bed made of feathers inside a small darkly lit room, letting out a sigh of satisfaction as a barely clothed older woman sat at the edge of the bed with blank eyes.","No matter what power he held before, he was reduced to a normal human here as aside from survival, the only things his body sought and enjoyed were the basal tendencies of his body.","Food, and reproduction!","This was all he was reduced to.","\"The guards outside will get you a few bundles of grain for your services, okay?\" He spoke lazily towards the woman as this time, he didn't hear a reply.","His eyes became sour as he was about to berate when he noticed the older woman clutching her clothes in shock, her eyes turned towards the entrance where the figure of a dazzlingly gorgeous young woman with crimson gold hair appeared!","Her hands and face were stained with blood as she looked coldly towards Warlord Maxus.","Staring at her, Maxus instantly became infatuated and then terrified at the sight of beauty and blood as when he looked out the door, he saw his guards groaning and holding on to broken limbs!","And her cold voice filled with distaste echoed out.","\"My Master asks where you wish to abdicate your authority here or perish. What will it be?\"","WAA!","Her Master.","Her Master?!","The many cycles of experience that Warlord Maxus had buzzed and kicked into his head as seeing how this young woman had gotten past his guards and who knew how many others alone...","\"Abdicate! I will abdicate and present him with all I have...\"","His mind worked rapidly as he spoke as such, while his eyes held a hidden chilling light!","He would lower himself and learn more about this woman and where her power came from, and who this Master of hers was.","And then in time...there were many things he could do.","Ambushed during sleep.","Poisoning the reverses of water and food.","Warlord Maxus lowered his head rapidly as many other thoughts flashed, a unique future painted as he was curious to see how it would unfold!","Yet...","\"Your hidden malice is not so hidden in my eyes.\"","The cold voice of Ruination echoed out as Warlord Maxus raised his head in shock, only to see the right hand of this gorgeous woman swinging sideways across his neck.","SAA!","A clean cut.","As if her hands were sharp swords.","His vision then seemed to shift, and then endless darkness came down!","Ruination looked at the state of this room and the terrified woman on the bed as she grabbed the head of the Warlord and stepped out.","Out of the slightly bigger house of the Warlord than all those here, there was a trail of blood. Groans of pain were apparent for any of those who chose to stand in her way!","All around, a few hundred men and women within this Settlement watched from the sidelines as she walked out towards the entrance while holding the head of the Warlord, a sense of ease and fear spreading as she came to stop at the broken gates of the entrance!","There, she waited silently.","SIU!","An arrow shot out from the roof of a house towards the left, and Ruination didn't even turn around as she caught this arrow with her bare hands and flung it back towards the same direction with even greater speed and force!","BOOM!","The roof of the house was blown off along with an eruption of blood as immense silence reigned in after that.","Within minutes, a woman holding a massive circular structure in her left hand and a white ring on another appeared alongside a devilishly handsome man with a cold gaze, their figures arriving before the broken gates of the Settlement as the woman that held the head of Warlord Maxus bowed towards him!","He nodded while patting her head as if to praise her, and he proceeded to walk into the Settlement with her under the shaken and terrified gazes of many!"]},{"number":3418,"title":"Chapter 3418: Chapter 3417 Purgatory or Paradise? V","paragraphs":["All entities that managed to arrive in the Purgatory Lands had their own uniqueness.","Some used to be powerful entities, others didn't face much of a change in disposition and power compared once they arrived here.","But those who survived here long enough knew that when one came across an oddity or something out of the norm, they didn't mess with it!","So when they saw the head of the old Warlord Maxus held by a bloodied woman who had either killed or heavily injured any who stood in her way, they steered clear of her.","They especially steered clear of the man she brought into the Settlement- and the woman who was effortlessly carrying a massive and intricate ring filled with dazzling lines.","As they walked into the Settlement, Noah looked at the few hundred nearby and those who were hearing the commotion in the distance as he voiced out loudly and commandingly. \"New Leadership has arrived, ladies and gents. Even stronger than that Warlord Maxus as you can see. Proceed as normal, and this Settlement will be something that is unreachable even if a dragon were to pass by. Expect my general to interview you all on where you'll be working on in the near future.\"","...!","His voice carried tremendous power and weight as he planned to use the numbers of this Settlement to begin grand undertakings even in this place!","First, guarantee his safety and survival.","Then, understand and obtain unfathomable things that were deemed useless here, but if he could successfully take them out of here through the Infiniverse Megalos Seed...","His eyes burned with ambition as he went into the depths of the nearest Settlement he arrived at and proceeded to carve out a domain for himself.","As he settled in, Ruination secured the central fortified area where Warlord Maxus used to stay and quickly commanded a few dozen Settlers to follow her in cutting down and carrying the dead gray trees around the Settlement.","They quickly did as told as in a short period of time, an enclosed area surrounded by tout wooden walls was entrenched in the earth- Ruination moving herself to smash and entrench this wall all around!","What occurred within could not be observed by prying eyes.","At such a point, the Infiniverse had placed the dim ring of the Blancverse Domain and the Infiniverse Megalos Seed down on the gray earth, and she was now observing this intricate ring that represented far too many things before her!","\"How is the connection going?\"","Noah asked lightly after finding water to wash the blood off of himself, the cackling of fire being heard off to the side as a few animals were already taken by Ruination and brought over, and Noah was currently cooking them right now.","Ruination herself was sent to continue doing grunt work for now- stabilizing any possible chaos that may arise from their entry into the Settlement, and that the processing of raising animals or farming wasn't disrupted!","Infiniverse and Noah alone remained in this space as Infiniverse placed her hands on the massive Infiniverse Megalos Seed while replying.","\"It's incredible; while we may not be able to send much back and forth, a possible channel is forming through the simple concept of the Infiniverse Megalos Seed existing here and in another place. What exists inside of it in a specified area here...can also theoretically be obtained in that same replicated area elsewhere. That is what another me in the Megalos Ynnere is doing right now with Ozymandias.\"","...!","As she spoke, she walked towards the Infiniverse Megalos Seed five times their size, her body entering through the gaps as they arrived at the base of the slightly dim Extremity Vein surrounded by Aletheian Havens.","At the base of the Extremity Vein, a small pool of vibrant multicolored light was forming and slowly expanding!","\"This little pool of water here...would be the gateway. Equivalent to the small portion of the Infiniverse Megalos Seed in Omniverse X-999 that, after swallowing multiple Dark Matter Cores, has grown to be the length of an Omniverse currently. And yet only this small pool has formed here. Something placed in this pool should theoretically also reflect on the other pool, but the weavings and makeup of what can be sent out are unfathomably little. Something without life is feasible, something small is feasible, something with a consciousness is impossible, something too large is impossible...there are far too many restrictions at this moment as it is debatable whether we can even elevate it to allow you to leave this place in the future, Master.\"","...!","Her gaze and words carried a sense of despondency even in their advancements!","\"The complexity we have access to is far too little. We can accelerate this process with another burst of complexity, but even if Ozymandias Severed more Ordinances or Pioneered his Path, the amount of complexity may still not be enough to change the singular truth about this place- that nobody who comes in can go out.\"","\"...\"","The state of Infiniverse was truly far too affected when it related to Noah's safety and possible exit from this place.","Noah smiled even in the face of all of this.","\"It's okay. We'll take it a step at a time and see what changes. Is it already viable to test out?\"","Noah was filled with a great deal of expectations.","If they could truly turn this impossibly grim situation around...","\"Yes, Master, something small.\"","Something small.","Noah looked around this enclosure as his eyes were drawn to the headless body of a certain Warlord purposefully left behind.","\"Let's try...blood, why don't we?\" ...!","The body of Warlord Maxus was brought forward, the pooled and dried blood of this entity being collected in small amounts by Noah and given to the Infiniverse.","\"He may have been an Existence Severing entity or a Pioneer before this, who knows? Let us test whether this place we have arrived in...is truly a purgatory, or may turn into a paradise for us!\"","He could already imagine it.","If they could really transport things back and forth.","Powerful entities were nothing here as if they confirmed a Pioneer, could they not send his blood back? If Ozymandias obtained the Blood of a Pioneer and severed more Sources of Existence..."]},{"number":3419,"title":"Chapter 3419: Chapter 3418 Purgatory or Paradise? VI","paragraphs":["All pieces were set as now, it only had to be put into practice.","The Infiniverse Megalos Body moved slowly and cautiously as she took a small bundle of blood in her hands and slowly placed it towards the center of the small multicolored pool of water below the Extremity Vein.","The blood sank in silently as there was no large reaction, and both the Infiniverse and Noah watched silently.","The moment of truth for all their theories.","For many possibilities!","They watched on silently as on their side, absolutely nothing changed.","—","In a certain Weaving of Existence. Within the Dream Aletheian Haven that had now become much more than this- other past authorities of the Infiniverse budding and filling it up as it couldn't just be called this anymore.","So Ozymandias termed it the Secondary Infiniverse Megalos Seed!","At the very center of this place, there was an illusory Extremity Vein that had a vibrant multicolored pool below it.","The pool was surrounded by hundreds of radiant Terrestrial Runes of Existence that swirled with power and fervor, causing it to vibrate with complexity.","It was called a pool, but it alone was half the size of an Omniverse in diameter!","It represented possibility.","At this moment, Ozymandias' massive stellar obsidian body was accompanied by the Infiniverse Megalos Body, both of their eyes on the pool before them as the latter began to speak.","|In the Purgatory Lands, our other versions are attempting to place the first test object into this theoretically overlapping domain of the Infiniverse. It is unknown if the same amount of what was placed in would be recovered, if anything comes through at all-|","PA!","Her voice stopped.","Her eyes honed in on the massive multicolored sea!","Its surface was calm and free of any blemishes, and yet at this moment, a wave spread across it!","A round wave spread out in all directions at the center of the sea as after that, the central area bubbled while the Terrestrial Runes of Existence all around it buzzed.","And the waters parted ways at the very center as a single, minute, extremely small drop of Blood rose up!","It seemed as if it were dead before, with its authority gradually increasing as if it were waking up from a long slumber!","...!","Alongside its rising was an explosion of unique complexity that spread out silently- sending out invisible waves from here that even stretched outside Omniverse X-999.","Elation showed on the face of the Infiniverse Megalos Seed.","Ozymandias radiated a terrifying pressure as above him, a massive Eye of Existence opened as it pulsed with obsidian gold grandeur, gazing at the small drop of Blood that rose at the center of the multicolored sea!","[Globule of Blood of an Existence Severing Entity(Maxus)]:: A small drop of blood belonging to an entity lost through the weavings of existence itself. Its volume and concentration are too little to exert any viable effects. It holds little use to the current you apart from researching it to learn about the severed source it may contain...","...!","The drop of blood remained suspended above the multicolored sea until Ozymandias waved his hands towards it, coming to grasp it in his hands with a complex expression as this single test succeeding...meant many things!","The potential empowerment he could undergo could not even be calculated as he spoke with a terrifying light of brilliance to the Infiniverse.","|Have our other selves seek Pioneers- alive or dead. Other possible items viable for passage through this...Frequency Gateway can also be gathered!|","...!","Frequency Gateway.","This was what Ozymandias termed the massive multicolored sea of brilliance where a drop of Blood had just risen from!","|Yes, Master!| The Infiniverse seems to have been supercharged as well, it's figure studying the changes that occured with the successful overlap of an item from one entire frequency to another.","|What was sent through was only a hundredth in volume compared to what was sent in. If we can forge more complex Runes of Existence to stabilize and increase the complexity of the Frequency Gateway...|","Their current power was still too little.","If they were already capable of forging Constellation Runes of Existence...things would be moving much faster!","But it seemed that when it related to the Purgatory Lands, nothing would be so easy.","The body of the Infiniverse pulsed with light as it began to forge another Rune of Existence when...","HUUM! A terrifying light leaked from it as its gaze went above.","Ozymandias was the same as his obsidian gold eye exploded with power and complexity, his body battle-ready!","Because above them, silent fluctuations and alarms were set off as something instantly bypassed into Omniverse X-999 and even went further to arrive in the Secondary Infiniverse Megalos Seed.","Far too quickly!","When their gazes landed on this entrant, so did her gaze land on them.","And...all sides froze.","Utterly froze from pure shock and incredulity on both sides!","Above, the shadowy figure of Barbatos had been scouring the Megalos Ynnere looking for Omniverse X-999 this whole time and found nothing.","And yet just now, unknown waves of complexity even she couldn't put her finger on exploded out from here and drew her gaze to this place!","And...","And!","She looked at the tall, massive visage of a stellar obsidian Outerversal Morphon as this entity caused her heart to pulse the same pain as the man she had been entangled with!","When she looked at him, she felt the same sense of familiarity as if they were one and the same.","The same love. The same hope. The same guilt.","She felt this all at once as when she looked into his pulsing singularities of eyes, she also saw the shock and happiness within them that caused her to feel even worse for what she had done.","He was here.","But how was he here? WAP!","With a single jump, his massive stellar body appeared in front of Barbatos as he asked tenderly.","\"Barbatos?\"","She didn't have the same fair skin. But she was exactly the same apart from that!","...!","He just called out to her once, and her entire weavings were instantly turned tumultuous as her entanglement became further cemented!","His massive hands reached out to her in an embrace as she quickly came out of her reverie- wiping the tears flowing from her eyes as she shook her head.","\"No, I'm not your Barbatos-...!\"","He ignored her words and grabbed her small body, pulling it onto his stellar obsidian chest freely as Barbatos couldn't feel any strength in her body!","She held an unfathomable amount of power that would even make Pioneers despair, and yet at this moment, she found out that somehow, she couldn't muster even a fraction of such power to push away this being.","He simply embraced her, and in the next moment, she felt the heavy weight of guilt and heartache leave her rapidly as she cried.","\"I'm sorry. I'm sorry...I didn't know it would be you. I didn't know our interference was to ensure you were pulled into that place!\"","...!"]},{"number":3420,"title":"Chapter 3420: Chapter 3419 A Heavy Entanglement! I","paragraphs":["She didn't know the interference would ensure that he was pulled into that place.","A single sentence.","And yet it held an overabundance of meaning as Ozymandias and the Infiniverse were briefly shocked at its implications!","Ozymandias looked at the young woman in his arms as her face held immense guilt, and he also sensed the shocking level of Complexity her body emanated as he instantly drew a few conclusions.","Yes, this was not his Barbatos, but another.","A Barbatos with terrifying levels of power as she could only come from different weavings of existence- showcased by her dark skin in comparison to the fair-skinned Barbatos he always knew.","Another conclusion was that somehow, this version of Barbatos was directed to act against him- to ensure that the actions of those entities from the Immovable Sacred Palace struck them!","Another conclusion was that she didn't act alone. Ozymandias instantly recalled that unfathomable silver black radiance that pulled back the Blancverse- the power Noah couldn't overcome no matter how much he tried.","He thought of many things as he went back to her last words.","She didn't know.","It meant she was sent here by some force he didn't even know about, and yet he had somehow fallen in their crosshairs!","Feeling his gaze as he looked at ways in a daze, the guilt within Barbatos became even more intense as she voiced out silently.","\"Please...don't hate me.\" She looked pained. So fearful that Ozymandias couldn't help but sigh and bring her closer!","His body rapidly altered itself as he gained more humanoid features.","He raised her chin and looked into her teary eyes as he went closer and pressed his lips against hers.","...!","This was another Barbatos, but she was his Barbatos. That would never change!","\"I would never be mad at you.\"","After a long kiss, he told her this.","The eyes of Barbatos looked panicked and filled with complex emotions at this simple kiss- and it seemed to wake her up as she pulled back.","She shook her head as if to come out of a trance, her hand raised towards Ozymandias accusingly as she couldn't bring herself to say anything!","At that point, Ozymandias was calm as he asked lightly.","\"Can you explain a little more?\"","A new entrant appeared.","Her power was unknown and seemed much higher than theirs, and she was a very familiar face.","After stabilizing her state of mind, Ozymandias sought more information!","Meanwhile.","In the Expanse.","At the location where a massive Blancverse had just been drawn into a horrific place, only two Existence Severing entities and a Pioneer remained as they observed the Strings of Existence here with somber expressions.","Ever so often, a golden string of existence would snap and disappear as they didn't know what to make of this!","Around the same time that the Frequency Gateway was utilized to transport a minuscule droplet of blood.","TRIIING!","Instantly, a dozen strings snapped all at once and sent out a shockwave of brilliance, Pioneer Heracles and others observing this with somber gazes as Heracles shook his head.","|This is not normal. But our actions shouldn't have triggered something like this...|","They couldn't fathom why.","Even with all their experience, they had never observed strings of the Expanse snapping like this!","|I will share this observation with the other Pioneers within the Immovable Sacred Palace of the Expanse, we can use their connection to reach out to those Source Complexity personages who can grasp a situation like this much more easily...|","Pioneer Heracles took it seriously as he stated this. Palace Master Antiope and Nisa stayed quiet as they didn't disagree when it came to this!","At such a moment, Nisa raised her hand and stated a fact she had just realized.","|The concentration of atmospheric authority of the Expanse has reduced noticeably since the Strings of Existence began to snap in this area...|","...!","A terrifying realization.","What would happen if this continued?","None of them knew as, at this moment; two remained while Pioneer Heracles left to alert others!","—","Back in Omniverse X-999.","Within the Secondary Infiniverse Megalos Seed.","\"I am sorry that I cannot reveal more. I've already ignored everything taught to me and am now faced with a heavy Entanglement within this Weaving of Existence. If I reveal anything regarding where I come from, what type of force I belong to, or even mention any identities, they will know. And they cannot know.\"","The voice of Barbatos echoed out as she seemed to have slowly regained her regality.","Her eyes were still tender whenever they gazed at Ozymandias as what she could see was exactly the same as the visage of Noah on Ozymandias!","At her words, the Infiniverse was reflective while Ozymandias listened calmly.","And after a few seconds...","The Infiniverse had a stern expression as she spoke.","|You can help us rectify this. Your complexity seems to be high as you can help us to ensure that Master's other self can come out from that place.|","...!","The Infiniverse uttered words that caused Barbatos to stare at her with incredulity as she replied while shaking her head.","\"Nobody...comes out of that place. It has been that way for countless cycles. It is a place where countless entities inadvertently fall into, and some are purposefully sent into. Entities who were caught traversing across different weavings of the Wheel...and others who violated rulings they shouldn't have are all sent there. No matter their previous power, no matter their complexity...none have survived.\"","None.","Her words carried a pang of heavy guilt as she knew very well where the existence of Noah Osmont was sent into!","But...Ozymandias raised his hand in the next moment as he showed a drop of glimmering blood.","\"We've already been able to transfer a drop of blood from the Purgatory Lands and have them appear here.\"","...!","Barbatos looked at that drop with somberness and shock, her hands waving as it came into her palm and she scrutinized it.","And moments later, her shock became extremely grave as she looked towards Ozymandias and the Infiniverse!","\"How...?!\""]},{"number":3421,"title":"Chapter 3421: Chapter 3420 A Heavy Entanglement! II","paragraphs":["How?","At such a question, the Infiniverse Megalos Body pointed to the multicolored sea that made up a large portion of the Secondary Infiniverse Megalos Seed.","\"I am different from anything you've come across before. All I need are more complex Runes of Existence to facilitate this process. Amplification, Space, Transfer, Resonance, Overlap. Any single word of the language of the Wheel at a greater level of complexity will allow us to continue doing this at a much greater pace and maybe eventually...even allow Master's other self to return as well.\"","Infiniverse presented the runes all around the multicolored sea as Barbatos observed them all and the dazzling sea with sharp eyes.","She wanted to say it wasn't feasible. She wanted to say that such a thing was impossible!","And yet, she found no reason for this as she could only shake her head with a sense of incredulity before she turned towards Ozymandias.","Ozymandias was gazing at her with a smile as she sighed internally while her body began to glow with silver black radiance.","\"I am already this far entangled, what's a little bit more? I will do all I can to help, but there will come a limit. If I exceed it, the ones who send out people like me on missions across the different Spokes of the Wheel of Existence may find something out.\"","She spoke valiantly as inadvertently, she revealed a little bit more information at the same time!","HUUM!","Her small body began to pulse with waves of incandescence as she closed her eyes.","\"Runes...will gradually seem less complex in your eyes the higher in complexity your weavings of existence become.\"","In front of her, a multicolored Rune of Existence began to form.","Its complexity was utterly frightening as it began to spell the word Amplification, yet it seemed to hold millions of strokes that Barbatos was rapidly making one by one!","The moment it bloomed, the atmospheric levels of authority in the surroundings began to bubble and increase.","\"With your existence Severed, you can begin studying and forging Constellation Runes of Existence as it is akin to being blind and putting on glasses that allow you to see clearly. If you go a step further and Pioneer your own Existence, forging complex Constellation Runes of Existence becomes possible, and if you attain a Source...\"","A Source.","Source Complexity of Existence!","Barbatos showed a Rune made from a few million strokes bloom and be completed in a matter of seconds, its radiance heart shaking as it moved from her and floated towards the massive multicolored sea- its multicolored radiance matching the multicolored sea as both seemed to resonate.","The sea became even more vibrant, and it even enlarged a little more.","\"At a certain point, a single Rune of Existence meant to convey and assert an undeniable authority of a single word can also be infused with the meaning of other words. In that single Amplification Rune of Existence, I was also able to infuse the meaning of resonance- achieving compounding results with a single Rune. When you can start to do this, the language of Runes of Existence will feel like something you've known your whole life.\"","Barbatos explained silently as from her small figure, an unfathomable spark lit up in the next moment as if an endless sea was waking up.","Of tremendous complexity.","Of unfathomable power.","And a moment later...","BOOM!","It all erupted to form dozens of multicolored runes that radiated terrifying complexity.","A complexity so heavy that it spread out into Omniverse X-999 itself and caused this Omniverse to vibrate and tremble slightly!","Yet they formed en masse, multiple Runes of Existence being completed every single second before they were sent around or above the periphery of the multicolored sea- the Frequency Gateway.","They enlarged and spun with radiance as a single rune became as massive as a Cosmos- a single word conveying such terrific power and brilliance that wouldn't fade for an unknown amount of time!","Barbatos continued to do this process for the next hour- allowing for over 30,000 Runes of Existence that seemed to be at the very apex of Constellation Runes to bloom.","Each one felt as brilliant if not more than the most powerful Rune that Noah had attained from the Tresoverse Domain of the Omnifather.","A single one seemed to be just as complex as the single Amarantos Rune of Existence!","Barbatos finished her forging and stopped there as her small figure heaved her blessed chest up and down in tiredness.","\"That...is as much as I can do right now. It's thousands of times more in effect than what the Runes that were here before granted. I need to rest...\"","Her eyes expressed pride and tiredness as in the corner of her eyes; she seemed to be looking towards Ozymandias, waiting for praise!","Ozymandias looked at the dazzling scene of churning brilliance as he nodded.","\"You've done more than enough.\"","Beside him, the Infiniverse seemed to no longer hold any sternness towards Barbatos as she nodded towards her while gazing at her figure like a prized possession she wanted to keep to herself to produce Runes forever!","|I will see just how great a change there is now...|","Her eyes were filled with expectation as she went towards the center of the multicolored sea that was quite literally bubbling with complexity.","This left Ozymandias and Barbatos alone as the latter appeared in front of her once more.","\"Meanwhile, you and I should get to know each other some more. What are the differences, what is the same?\" He spoke while he took Barbatos in his arms once more, his face nudging her tired face as she panicked and gazed down at his chest.","\"We can...talk some more. I can tell you about-\"","She wriggled in his arms as with her power, she could have easily broken out at any time! And yet she remained as if she was enchanted by some feeling. By a complex thought even she couldn't overcome!","She felt Ozymandias shake his head as his arms wrapped around her even more tightly.","\"No, Barbatos, we are not going to talk.\" ...!","With a glimmer of radiance, something unobservable to the eyes of many bloomed within the Secondary Infiniverse Megalos Seed!"]},{"number":3422,"title":"Chapter 3422: Chapter 3421 Giving a Monster Wings! I","paragraphs":["Hell Terra Firma.","The Purgatory Lands!","An unknown number of entities lay within as with the rejection of Mana and any Natal authority, all life forms were the same.","They lived and died.","But there were lifeforms who had long lives even without the influence of Mana.","Turtles who could live for a few hundred years.","Tree lifeforms that could live for a few thousand years.","Dragons, Phoenixes, and other unique variations of lifeforms also had lifespans exceeding one thousand years or more even without Mana!","\"But I am just a lone little human being, you see. My life is extremely short as I have to make the most of it.\"","Noah's voice echoed out as he looked at five humanoid entities suspected to have been Pioneers in this Settlement!","This was the task that Ruination had been given charge of carrying out the moment that the first test succeeded.","She commandingly asked for any information regarding Pioneers in this small Settlement, and in this population of a few thousand- 5 possible ones were identified and found.","From rumors. From something they had said before. From their disposition and gazes.","After knowing the hardships of Hell Terra Firma, very few Pioneers made their past position of power public knowledge as those who were most powerful...were those targeted the most in these lands.","A human woman that used to be an Ordinance Amalgamation entity? Not worth much. A human woman who used to be a Pioneer? Some Warlords of Settlements made it a goal to find them as they felt like they were collecting entities of extremely noble lineage and esteem!","Even male entities at the level of power of Pioneers were prized as in the Purgatory Lands, past complexity still played a role in status.","Noah looked at the five humanoid entities before him and asked thoughtfully while behind him, Ruination gazed on imposingly.","\"I have no ill will towards you all, nor are your lives in danger. You will even be compensated for your services. So...would any of you step forward if you were a Pioneer before you arrived here?\"","...!","He asked calmly as he chewed on a chicken drumstick with his right hand.","Hunger was very real here, and he was a voracious man.","He ate and gazed at the five beings before him- two holding animalistic features as one had the head of a lion, and another had white fur and a tail as she closely resembled a variant of a simian.","A single woman, and five men.","When asked, they looked at each other wryly as a man with fair skin and red hair spoke gruffly.","\"Compensated how?\"","\"Food, water, whatever one needs for survival.\" Noah turned his head towards this being as after he asked such a question...","He stepped out of the lineup and spoke with a gaze of solemnity and power- as if to relive his past life!","\"I reached the heights of a Pioneer before being swept up in this place. What do you need from me?\"","...!","What could he need from a Pioneer?","Noah smiled and brought a few things forward.","\"Just fill this little bowl with your blood.\"","He threw the jagged blade he obtained from an inconsequential extra as well as a small clay bowl, the man looking at this with disturbed eyes, but he made a cut on his palm and did what was asked of him!","Noah watched on and then passed the small bowl filled with crimson blow towards the Infiniverse Megalos Body who was waiting in the distance, and she took it while disappearing into the complex and massive Infiniverse Megalos Seed behind them!","He looked at the red haired man and nodded.","\"This may be the beginning of a long relationship. I'll only ask for a little volume of blood from you each day, and you can live the life of a Warlord.\"","He spoke while also looking at the other four humanoid beings as if he were nudging them on!","None of them moved forward.","And after a few seconds, the visage of the Infiniverse climbed out of the Infiniverse Megalos Seed, her gaze frosty and filled with a cold light as she spoke out.","\"Merely Existence Severing.\"","WAA!","There wasn't a burst of pressure or haki as there would normally be since all authority was rejected.","But the air in the surroundings felt a tad bit colder just from the calm smile fading away from Noah's face, with Ruination making a move behind him as she threw out a punch onto the chest of the red haired man and flung him back like a ragdoll!","\"Do not lie to me, for it will not end well.\"","...!","The eyes of the other 4 vibrated at such a scene and unnatural strength displayed by Ruination.","They looked back to see the wheezing visage of the red haired man who had only claimed to be a Pioneer to try and get resources as in their situation, how could they lose anything?","With all authority here rejected, if one said they were a Pioneer, then they were a Pioneer. After all, there was no way to check.","And yet...this being before them seemed to be able to do just that!","\"So...\" His gaze, now icy, turned towards the remaining four humanoid entities.","\"Any chance that you all are Pioneers?\"","Immense silence reigned in.","Nobody else dared to step up until...","The white furred simian woman rose up with a cold gaze.","Her eyes were radiating a dim light of coldness as she spoke out somberly.","\"These three are useless things, but you can have a bit of my blood every day if you want. All I want to know is how that woman behind you can access such power. Is she of another lineage? A Miniature Titan? Progeny of Dragons? Are all able to access a smidgen of authority unlike everyone else?\"","...!","She rose and asked multiple questions.","Noah raised his brows at her as he affirmed.","\"You are a Pioneer?\"","White hair all over her body. Simian in nature!","This woman came forward and took another clay bowl that Noah put forward, taking out her own knife within her robes and making a cut on her palm as she slowly filled up a small bowl with blood!","\"You can check for yourself.\"","Her gaze was firm.","Noah took the clay bowl and passed it to Infiniverse once more who disappeared into the Infiniverse Megalos Seed, his eyes expectant as this may just be the real deal!"]},{"number":3423,"title":"Chapter 3423: Chapter 3422 Giving a Monster Wings! II","paragraphs":["Within a certain frequency of Existence.","Inside Omniverse X-999.","Within the Secondary Infiniverse Megalos Seed.","Surrounded by utterly intense weavings and swirling multicolored brilliance, the Infiniverse Megalos Body watched with bright eyes as something came through the center of the multicolored pool!","After the shocking revamp done through the hands of Barbatos with over 30,000 utterly complex Runes of Existence, the speed, quantity, and quality at which things traveled across the Frequency Gateway was much faster.","No longer was it just a hundredth or a fraction of what was sent in.","There was still some loss in quantity, but nowhere near as drastic as it was before.","And at this moment.","Finally.","HUUM!","The waters of the multicolored sea trembled as from it, a crimson drop of blood rose and slowly became painted with white gold brilliance as from it, a terrifying aura erupted!","An aura of potency.","An aura of power.","An aura of something that had engineered its own path!","\"Pioneer...\"","The eyes of the Infiniverse Megalos Seed pulsed with a terrifying light as she felt the genuine aura of a Pioneer blooming from the drop of white gold blood!","She wanted to celebrate such a stupendous achievement as she looked back, only to see the enclosed obsidian domain the size of a world where Ozymandias had taken Barbatos in floating silently in the distance.","The Infiniverse knew her Master had now gone hours without any of his clones seeing his...companions in the Infiniverse Megalos Seed, and he seemed to be making up for all this lost time on Barbatos alone as he took her within that enclosed domain and even dilated time within it.","The Infiniverse even saw multiple multicolored Runes of Existence arise and swirl around this obsidian domain- these Runes radiating the singular word of TIME!","A few minutes out here could be hours or days inside of that small enclosed domain as her Master should have gotten to know this new Barbatos quite a bit.","As the Infiniverse looked at the obsidian domain, brilliance flickered from it as Ozymandias showed himself- his body pulsing with much heavier complexity as he seemed to have made tremendous gains!","The Infiniverse looked at him with raised brows as she asked lightly.","|Dual Cultivation with a Source Complexity entity is that fruitful?|","She asked lightly as Ozymandias smiled while shaking his head.","\"More than we can even imagine. But she is too restricted and cannot even reveal a tenth of her Source here, otherwise her people will track her. Obtaining a Globule of Blood of a Pioneer was successful?\"","Ozymandias felt the purity and potency of his existence as he couldn't help but shake his head in amazement.","The Blood of a Source Complexity entity, even if they had just entered this complexity like Barbatos, would be even more potent. But she was also restricted on this as what she termed her Entanglement would get even worse if parts of her were spread into those of this weaving of existence and utilized to accomplish anything!","But the effects of Dual Cultivation alone were tremendous as his Complexity had more than doubled since he began his discussions with Barbatos.","He sent a clone out after he felt the blazing aura of a Pioneer as he now looked at a dazzling globule of Blood","|Yes, Master.|","The Infiniverse spared one last glance into the obsidian room before her hand made a motion towards the white gold drop of blood.","Their confirmation that this unwanted entry into Hell Terra Firma...was actually bound to be an unfathomable opportunity.","Noah was already monstrous.","Ozymandias was already monstrous!","This was akin to giving terrible monsters wings to fly even faster when they were already steamrolling everything even faster than the speed of light.","\"Good...\"","Ozymandias nodded with a smile as the white gold drop of blood eventually fell into his hands.","[Globule of Blood of a Pioneer(Nysa)]:: The scattered Severed weavings of existence and scattered path of a Pioneer have been determined to belong to the Great Pioneer that went missing decades ago from an unknown frequency. On the 10th Cycle of her life, she severed all attachments and weavings that bound her, attaining a Severed State of Existence. On the 11th Cycle of her life, she finally Pioneered her own weavings above Severing. A drop of her blood has generated the capability for you to Sever a single, small aspect of your own weavings, including but not limited to Individual Concepts, Individual Values, and Individual Techniques. Anything Severed will be unshackled from the common norms of existence, even allowing you a sense of definition for the individual severing...","...!","Truly.","A drop of Blood of a Pioneer was collected, and he could continue to do so from Pioneer Nysa in the Hell Terra Firma every single day...","If he could obtain more Pioneers that he could use akin to blood bags consistently, he could obtain a source of Loot that allowed him to sever Existential shackles of every single Ordinance he had...even without the process of Amalgamation with them.","That was how terrifying this was!","Others had the threat of collapse of their Existence during Amalgamation and Existence Severing, while he went about it in such a terrifyingly different way as the results were obscene.","He took the Globule of Blood into his body as he voiced out silently.","\"Sever Outerversal.\"","WUU!","Outerversal Physiology. Megalos Regnum. What hung over them and held them together would soon be bathed with a glorious light of severing as at the same time, Ozymandias waved his hands and caused the appearance of a Blacksmith's Forge the size of a Cosmos to bloom behind them.","Light was already brightly burning in this forge as multiple dazzling items were already inside of it, and they were spat out at this moment as they included thin but extremely durable body armor, sets of white, crimson, and golden full body armors, spears, swords, crossbows, guns, cases of bullets, military grade equipment, helmets, and many others things that looked like the equipment to adorn a terrifying army!","The material utilized was meant to be as light as a feather while holding tremendous durability and heaviness, this being easy work for the Forge of the Secondary Infiniverse Megalos Seed.","Such an assortment of equipment floated out of the forge and towards the center of the multicolored sea below them, the eyes of Ozymandias radiating a terrifying light as he spoke!","\"My other self will have to obtain more Pioneers. Countless are to be found across the Settlements and lands of Hell Terra Firma as for this...he will have access to resources that others cannot even imagine in this hellish lands.\"","...!","They could send things out of Hell Terra Firma as this was a hard hurdle.","What about sending things in?","Ozymandias didn't even bother to ask as dazzling sets of equipment were thrown into the multicolored sea!"]},{"number":3424,"title":"Chapter 3424: Chapter 3423 Giving a Monster Wings! III","paragraphs":["It was a ridiculous occurrence.","Hell Terra Firma was a place where authority was absolutely rejected, and a place where countless entities from all sorts of weavings of existence could find themselves drawn into.","Most of the time, it was accidental.","Other times, it was through the hands of others as it was intentional.","But whichever way it was, once someone arrived there, they would be faced with a complete rejection of mana and everything else and be reduced to an extremely weak state!","Nobody out of all those arriving in Hell Terra Firma was prepared for it.","They would not have the resources nor the weapons to utilize, as if someone was lucky to be holding a weapon or armor at the time of their disappearance into this frequency- they would continue to have this beside them.","But even a weapon made of the most sacred metal would lose their most powerful quality and be reduced to something normal!","Even if one held an entire treasure vault of resources, weapons, and food inside a Spatial Ring, Spatial Necklace, or an Isolated Space deep inside of them- they wouldn't be able to access it as there was no such thing as authority to get through to these spaces and take things out.","So there could be no preparation for Hell Terra Firma.","And such a thing was absolute!","\"...\"","It was.","Now, there was Noah Osmont.","He also did not have any preparations as he initially found himself in the same state as everyone else, with only a slight change as those accompanying him were too unique!","The makeup of the Infiniverse Megalos Seed allowed her a shred of workings.","Ruination's unique composition allowed more strength to be expressed from her.","And now...an utter violation of rules that all others were bound to was about to take place as Ozymandias observed the uniquely crafted items disappear into the multicolored sea that was pulsing with the support of thousands of Constellation Runes of Existence.","Each one was made with the knowledge that authority did not work on Hell Terra Firma.","So the material used had to be those that retained their state in nature without the influence of authority.","Not an armor built as the authority inside it made it impenetrable, but an armor made with metal or crystals that were naturally hard in nature!","Ozymandias utilized combinations of Tungsten, Gold, Titanium, Osmium, Cesium, Diamond, Topaz, and more to construct armaments and weapons that would be nearly unbreakable in nature, with others granted malleability and softness as even heavy armor and huge weapons were forged with extremely light metal to the point that even a child could lift them.","Survival gear to treat wounds, antibiotics, pain medication, containers filled with water, containers filled with foods, and much more were sent into that pool as these resources that were of terrifying scarcity in Hell Terra Firma...Ozymandias was about to flood them into this place!","Just thinking of what his other self could accomplish with all this caused his Outerversal authority being Severed currently to dance with glee and expectations!","—","In the unfathomable frequency known as Hell Terra Firma.","In a minuscule corner of a Settlement, the Infiniverse stared at the Infiniverse Megalos Seed that had a much larger pool of water floating underneath the Extremity Vein- all of this influenced by the shocking number of Runes of Existence on the other side!","What they could send back vastly increased in quality and quantity as currently, they were observing the opposite action.","Sending things here.","It wouldn't be hard, would i-...!?","SAA!","The multicolored pool flickered with a dim radiance as, one after another, items began to rise on its surface as if they had been here all along.","Glittering armaments, weapons, and other items began to bubble and rise on the surface of the pool!","The eyes of Infiniverse lit up as she grabbed them one after another, taking them from the pool and placing them towards a corner of the Infiniverse Megalos Seed as very quickly...","\"Ruination!\"","The Infiniverse Megalos Body called with with hurriedness as there were just too many things bubbling up.","Ruination quickly went over as her eyes lit up at the sight of the items, and she began to quickly take them out of the Infiniverse and pile them behind Noah!","She was sorting weapons in one area, armor in another, and survival tools in other areas.","Hearing the commotion, Noah, who was talking to the white furred Pioneer Nysa, rose up and walked back as well.","Nysa was able to see the massive structure of the Infiniverse Megalos Seed as at this moment, her eyes opened wide in incredulity as she saw a large number of things being taken from it, gradually beginning to form a small mountain as what she saw was so terrific that subconsciously, her figure couldn't remain standing as her knees hit the gray earth!","She rubbed her eyes to make sure she was seeing correctly.","Armors and weapons.","And were those...containers and bottles holding extremely pure water? That...! That...!","Her mind buzzed as the other unidentified does in the background couldn't see Pioneer with as much detail.","Noah came forward at the increasing piles of treasures and smiled with a terrifying devilish glint, his hands looking over all of them before he went forward and picked up a thin and loose golden fabric.","A body suit that was undoubtedly made with his measurements as it felt soft to the touch, yet even a bullet would not be able to pass through it!","The current clothes he had on were taken off of his body as his bare ass was exposed to the figure of Pioneer Nysa in the back who was gazing at this all incredulously, and Noah adorned the protective body suit right away.","He then reached out towards golden boots, briefs, chest plate, and gloves that were all part of a matching full body armor- their heaviness being almost nonexistent even though they could easily knock away even armor piercing rounds of bullets!"]},{"number":3425,"title":"Chapter 3425: Chapter 3424 Giving a Monster Wings! IV","paragraphs":["It felt as comfortable and light as if he were adorning silk robes, and yet their might could likely smash away a normal human.","\"Hmm...\"","He looked at his visage, which was now covered by two layers of armor, as he felt a sense of protection.","As a normal human, he could die here at any time.","Having protective measures would greatly ease his mind!","He looked at the other items piling up into a mountain before him as he took two bottles of water, throwing one towards the dazed Pioneer Nysa while he drank the other.","Relishing the clean taste, he spoke out valiantly.","\"Our cooperation will be a beneficial one. You let me know of any others like you- Pioneers, whether in this Settlement or others. Keep providing blood daily...and you will live a comfortable life here that others can only dream of.\"","...!","His eyes burned with ambition.","He had arrived in a place where force was contained.","Strength ruled, and nobody had an exorbitant amount of it.","It was all equal.","The only differences came in body types as massive animals like Titans or Dragons who formed their own Settlements would still be formidable foes!","Among them, there may be Pioneers, or even Source Complexity existences.","And Noah wanted them all.","Ambition coursed across his body as he grabbed another set of armor and threw them towards the first Pioneer to offer her blood to him, the dazzling gold armaments landing on her feet as she stared at them dazedly!","In a few more seconds, the sound of steps echoed out from behind as Infiniverse came out, her hand holding a piece of paper that listed a catalog of every single thing sent over so far.","Noah accepted it and read through everything as his eyes lit up even more.","Behind him, Ruination appeared while carrying a massive obsidian case twice her size- and she laid it down on the gray earth while pressing a button at the very center that caused this case to open up its compartments!","Within, a neon crimson gold body suit could be seen, the clothes adorning Ruination falling off as an exquisite naked figure briefly showed itself with an ample chest and waist before seconds later, it was wrapped up in the neon crimson gold battlesuit.","The case seemed to hold multiple compartments as at the very center, a glistening obsidian purple sniper rifle lay shining with a dangerous glint as Ruination picked it up and checked it before she swung it behind her back.","In the compartment, there were also two golden desert eagle pistols that she grabbed and checked before they were holstered on straps on the sides of her thighs.","She then picked out two katanas with golden handles and white blades, their sharpness even being felt from afar as they were also sheathed on preset components of her battle suit on her back!","She seemed to be pulling one terrifying weapon after another and placing it on her body as by the time she was done, she could mutilate and cut up ordinary men in a manner where they wouldn't even know what had just happened.","She then came to stand behind Noah like a hardened general as she stared forth coldly.","Noah was staring at the catalog of all things brought over as he voiced out to the Infiniverse.","\"Let me have the Miniature Polyacrylate Housing Unit #1.\"","...!","Miniature Polyacrylate Housing Unit.","Something designed by the Infiniverse Megalos Seed herself that was made up of preset constructed structure through materials that were known as hydrophilic polymers or superabsorbent polymers!","All they needed was to absorb water, and they would rapidly expand to their preset shape.","The Infiniverse modified them to also have a sense of hardness as at this moment, she brought the Miniature Polyacrylate Housing Unit #1 to Noah.","By all means, it looked like a small eaten castle that a child could play with.","But Noah took it and walked to the clearing behind them where the old house of Warlord Maxus used to be.","\"Move back.\"","He gave a simple command to the others as he set the miniature castle on the ground, using the half-drunk bottle of water in his hands as he poured it onto the Miniature Polyacrylate Housing Unit #1!","His own figure dashed away right after as in a few seconds...","WUU!","The miniature castle absorbed every drop of water on it, and without the usage of any authority...it instantly and rapidly began to expand.","The ground shook as if a giant had stepped down, and before anyone could even blink, a glistening silver castle with three pointed peaks appeared before them.","...!","Pioneer Nysa's jaw opened wide.","The other inhabitants of Hell Terra Firma, who had been here for months or years, looked at this scene in utter shock and horror as they wondered what the hell was going on!","They couldn't use any authority, right?","So what exactly was this being doing?!","None of them had an answer as Noah looked at the dazzling work of science before him, walking to it and touching its walls that felt like concrete at this moment.","He opened its silver doors and looked within as he saw a long hall leading into it, and other doors that led to other rooms.","A place fit for an emperor to sleep in, not these snacks within this Settlement.","He smiled at this progression of events as he spoke out other sets of commands.","\"Set up the Miniature Polyacrylate Defense Walls around this whole area. And let us get ready with all the means to raise and equip an army...\"","...!","His words betrayed his wild ambition.","He had to get his hands on more rare entities that were weak and powerless in this place.","Their blood and very being would serve as fuel for power as in the future to come, he would go across Hell Terra Firma while finding a way out of this!","As for those who put him here?","The figures within the Immovable Sacred Palace of the Expanse?","They would face the wrath and gratefulness of Ozymandias alone as they may not even be alive by the time he got out of here!"]},{"number":3426,"title":"Chapter 3426: Chapter 3425 Giving a Monster Wings! V","paragraphs":["The wrath and gratefulness of Ozymandias.","Both would have to be felt hand in hand as even though coming to this place was a plot others made against him, he was about to turn even this place into a tremendous fortune.","Wrath because they potentially trapped him in a place he could not leave. Gratefulness because oh man, things were going to be turned upside down due to it!","Adorned in a radiantly gold set of armament, Noah stared at the cluster of many more things behind him as he prepared.","Around this same period of time.","Within the Source Frequency of the Infiniverse Megalos Seed.","In the Expanse.","The visage of Pioneer Heracles was back at the point of Origin where many things had occurred, and the place where strings of existence had been snapping left and right with varying frequency.","This time, he wasn't alone.","He was accompanied by equally terrifying auras of other Pioneers of Existence of the Immovable Sacred Palace of the Expanse!","Two were humanoid entities with white wings stretching out behind their backs, white robes covering their bodies as their faces seemed to be burning with crackling white flames.","One was a massive silver feathered Phoenix, her eyes piercing and radiating a cold light.","And lastly, there was a calm looking man in green robes and a bamboo hat who was gazing at everything with a serene gaze.","SNAP!","Just then, yet another string of existence snapped as the gazes of all Pioneers here became even colder.","\"When did you say this all began?\"","One of the figures with white wings asked succinctly while Pioneer Heracles answered while waving his hands.","\"We were following up on a unique weaving of existence and came across this scene...\"","Above them, an illusory scene bloomed that showed a radiant Blancverse becoming covered by a gray radiance that rapidly devoured it and everything contained within it.","Seeing such a scene, the two winged Pioneers were shocked as they looked at each other while one whispered...","\"The Irredeemable Frequency...\"","...!","The words alone seemed to induce a sense of somberness as the other Pioneers turned quiet.","A place even they talked about in hushed tones- and even then, there were some who didn't even delve into this field as they didn't know much about it!","This was the case as the Silver Phoenix looked at the Winged Pioneers and asked sharply.","\"Frequency? What are you all talking about?\"","It was an extremely sensitive subject.","For the most part, if others didn't know, it wasn't easily spread.","After all, the little others knew regarding other Frequencies of Existence, the better.","\"It is a Taboo subject. But if Strings of Existence began to snap in this location after such an event occurred...then this is definitely something that needs their attention. I will pass this information above.\"","...!","They had to get even more powerful beings involved.","With that statement, a progression of events unfolded one after another.","A little bit of time passed.","And in another region filled with complex weavings and dazzling Runes of Existence. A spatial light flashed as...","|Sir Bob, something seems to have occurred.|","A figure appeared in the midst of truly complex weavings of existence and spoke towards an entity with an entirely hairless round head.","|Huh? What? Where?| A glint of light shone on the circular head as the singularities of his eyes looked out sharply.","An instant later, the newly appearing figure released a ball of light towards Sir Bob who caught it seamlessly, and he obtained a burst of information as his eyes gradually turned extremely devilish!","Before any time could pass, his figure disappeared entirely.","A single String of Existence within the expanse pulsed with light after that as in a short period of time, the visage of Bob was spat out from this single golden string of Existence to arrive at the area where many other strings were snapping.","The instant he arrived, all weavings here froze as all Pioneers that were here, Heracles included, all froze as if the weavings of existence were no longer moving for them!","Bob looked around as he saw the gaps caused by non-existent strings, and he sighed as he waved his hands right after, the illusion of time being reversed as every single event that had played out began to rewind and be observed by him.","He saw the first string that had snapped.","He saw what happened before even a single string snapped.","He saw...the Blancverse that was very much recognizable to him.","The Blancverse he had given away to the Ninth One.","Inside of this Blancverse, there was a humanoid figure he very much remembered as this figure was gazing out with power and anger even while facing the light of inevitability!","When he got to this point, his singularities for eyes flashed with a sharp light as soon after, he observed the silver black light.","The light that influenced many things and held the Blancverse in place while the light of inevitability was cast on it!","\"...\"","The reason that being had come to him and obscured his gaze.","It was all for this event to be carried out with surety as now, after this event, these inexplicable changes occurred.","Strings of Existence were snapping and disappearing, and nobody knew why!","\"The Logos of the Wheel...I've said it before and I'll say it again. One day, you all are going to hit something far too heavy, and you will not be able to bear the weight. Since I am here, you all must know about this as well. What is it that you plan to do? Can you bear this weight?\"","...!","He spoke calmly as his words showed his anger.","His contained rage.","But even though he seemed to be speaking to himself in this frozen set of weavings, a voice soon rang out thereafter a distance away, veiled in the gaps of Existence.","|We are looking into our database. Spanning an unknown number of frequencies of the Wheel, we should be able to find a matching event and resolve this Entanglement soon.|","...!"]},{"number":3427,"title":"Chapter 3427: Chapter 3426 Giving a Monster Wings! VI","paragraphs":["They should be able to find something matching this event as they would observe how it was solved in other Frequencies and resolve it here as well!","Or so the voice stated.","Bob didn't even look at the source of this voice as he shook his head.","\"You all do not get it.\"","WAA!","\"This isn't some event you can reverse or repair. For the past eons, there has been talk of a change. Of something coming. You can scour your databases again and again, but I doubt you will find anything there. And now...\"","TING!","In these frozen weavings of existence where even Pioneer Heracles and others were stuck and unable to know what was going on...another set of strings of existence snapped all at once, Bob observing the point of snap as after that, these strings recoiled backwards and disappeared towards the stretches of the Expanse.","After that, all weavings in the surrounding area subtly began to change as he even sensed this.","It was a truly minuscule amount of change.","But he sensed it.","The concentration of the weavings of authority themselves reduced, and they were already at a level far below when the event itself had unfolded!","If this continued...","\"When this process reaches an irreversible point...\"","Around Bob's body, maddening waves of silent authority began to bubble and seethe as his circular head glinted with danger!","\"When this process reaches an irreversible point, I will wage war with all of your Logos of the Wheel for your hand in this. You can prepare for that in advance for the hand you laid in this.\"","...!","His voice carried a shocking amount of power as the veiled entity hearing this became extremely somber!","|That will only cause a propagation of more chaos. We have no need nor intention to fight and are only looking after the welfare of the Wheel, just like you.|","The voice was stern as it spoke.","As if it wanted to convey a threat, and yet at the same time knew that it was hard to threaten this being!","\"What you look for are benefits and profits for yourselves. The Wheel does not need us to look after it. It matters not, just know and prepare.\"","...!","After Bob spoke these words, he raised his limbs up and breathed out calmly, waiting for a few seconds before...","TING!","Another string of existence snapped.","But this time, he was ready for it as he moved extremely quickly, his hands shooting out at speeds many times faster than light as his limbs shot forward and grasped onto the two sides of the snapped string!","He reached out and actually held them in both hands, the force of this single string being far too heavy as his arms shook from holding the two sides!","They wriggled like snakes in his hands as he tried to bring them back together, but this action itself seemed to be absolutely impossible.","As if he was trying to bring the skies and earth together.","BOOM!","An explosive force boomed out as the two sides of the string slipped across his hands, his palms burnt with the skin on them shredded as he looked on with calmness.","Everything began to heal rapidly as he spoke again after failing in his intervention.","\"Remember, when this reaches an irreversible point, your Logos of the Wheel and I will be at war.\"","...!","A singular point was reinforced as immense silence settled into the surroundings, only to be broken when...","TING!","Another string snapped.","And the hands of Bob shot out again to grasp onto the split ends, only for things to end the same way as before!","But this didn't mean he could stop.","So he continued!","As this occurred.","Quite a distance away from here, there was another cluster of powerful forces in the Expanse where Outerversal Morphons nested with power and eldritch horror.","It was the Primal Eldritch Palace of the Expanse!","The Great Mother and Great Segregator were looking at Ozymandias with difficult gazes while speaking.","|The Immovable Sacred Palace of the Expanse has multiple Pioneers of Existence overseeing it, with many forces aligned to the Wheel passing through and making their homes there due to its safety. If the Instrument truly wishes to attack them, you will need the support of multiple Pioneers. Not just from the Primal Eldritch Palace of the Expanse, but other Eldritch Palaces as well. As for how you can convince Pioneers to join your cause... |","It was difficult.","Far too difficult!","Why would entities who had already Severed their existence and Pioneered a path unique to them risk their very being just because another entity wanted to wage war?","What was in it for them?","Even the Great Mother looked troubled as she wondered how conflict could have arisen between the Instrument of the Beyonder and the Immovable Sacred Palace of the Expanse.","After listening to the words of the Great Segregator and Great Mother, Ozymandias gazed out with utter tyranny and regality as his body began to ebb and flow with tumultuous waves of complexity.","|Fine.|","WUU!","|I'll do it myself.|","...!","BOOOM!","From him, it was as if shackles came unbound as a light of Severing erupted out from his body.","Severing!","The Great Mother, who was still a cusp away from this, watched on with incredulity and stupor as her tentacles were far too dazed, looking at Ozymandias as if he were a terrifying monster!","Waves of Outerversal Authority erupted all around and then flooded into the body of Ozymandias- his very existence seemingly undergoing elevation as if anyone were to look, they would undoubtedly observe a light of Existence Severing.","But...","But...!","|O Great Instrument, you only just declared your Ordinance!|","The limbs of the Great Mother trembled as she bellowed out, seemingly questioning him regarding Amalgamation that he entirely skipped over to arrive at Existence Severing.","Yet Ozymandias had a calm gaze as a wondrous complexity bloomed around him.","|Who said I had to undergo Amalgamation before Severing?|","...!","Who said!?","It was such a blatant question that the Great Mother and the Great Segregator were dazed with no answer."]},{"number":3428,"title":"Chapter 3428: Chapter 3427: Campaign! I","paragraphs":["To have even an ounce of chance against Existence Severing, one had to undergo Amalgamation with their Ordinance and raise their level of complexity.","The key was complexity.","If it was too weak, the severing would fail and their existence would collapse.","So many spent a great number of years to ensure that their complexity was great enough before they attempted Severing!","It had to be done this way.","This was the natural progression!","But then, there was Noah.","There was Ozymandias.","When it came to the methodology Ozymandias and Noah used, there was a single point about it that made it impossible for others to do the same.","The Blood of a Pioneer allowed him to sever a small part of himself.","A small part.","For him, severing a single Ordinance was a small part of himself.","For others, Severing a single Ordinance meant Severing all of themselves!","It could not be done.","Only if someone had multiple Ordinances, and they were considered small parts of who they were, could this methodology of the Globules of Blood of Pioneers be utilized.","At this moment.","As Ozymandias established the Severing of a single part of himself in the Expanse, another part of him in Megalos Ynnere that was undergoing the same experience was faced with a rapid change in development.","Inside of an enclosed domain where even time was dilated and stretched out.","Ozymandias had been enjoying a lavish time with Barbatos when, at this moment, her figure instantly rose from his arms with a stern expression as a silver-black radiance rapidly converged around her body and shrouded her!","Her expression was cloudy as she started off somberly.","\"Something had happened, and I was called to be questioned.\"","...!","Ozymandias became somber at her words as the last thing Barbatos had done was aid in an event that took away his other self.","\"What happened?\"","He didn’t like the word questioned.","But the expression on Barbatos continued to deteriorate rapidly as she spoke out hastily while also waving her hands!","\"I must wipe out any traces of our Entanglement to ensure they don’t find you. Do not seek me out, if things settle, I will find you!\"","...!","She spoke hurriedly as she released a ball of multicolored brilliance towards Ozymandias before she disappeared!","A silver-black radiance briefly flashed from her and covered all of Omniverse X-999 before ev we everything returned to calmness.","As if nothing had ever occurred in the first place!","Ozymandias caught the multicolored ball of brilliance as it melded into him and granted an explosion of information.","What she couldn’t say before she left.","The reason why she would be questioned!","It seemed that from the position where his Blancverse was swallowed by the weavings of Inevitability, something was occurring.","Strings of Existence were snapping!","And...energy overall was reduced in that area.","Ozymandias had a calm expression as he gazed out of the isolated realm and towards the multicolored sea surrounded by thousands of Runes of Existence.","Across it, there was an overlapping body of water in a frequency where all authority was rejected.","There were no weavings of energy there.","And now, from the location where Noah entered these weavings from, Strings of Existence were snapping while energy began to reduce in that area!","\"...\"","Ozymandias mused to himself.","There was no such thing as a coincidence.","On his body, Outerversal authority continued rising up in intensity as he thought of this issue closely!","At such a moment.","Inside of Ozymandias.","Within the deepest parts of Complexity that made him!","In a domain formed from multicolored radiance that was shadowed by a starry obsidian glint in the background.","Dense lines of different colors stretched throughout, making this region look like a dazzling space filled with intricate webs of weavings.","On these vibrant lines, figures stood or floated as they emanated tremendous tyranny and regality.","They all looked like variations of a single devilishly handsome young emperor- variations of Noah!","One was covered in purple violet robes as he emanated complex waves of Entropy.","Another was valiantly blue, a river of blue in an infinity symbol spinning around him as he was Infinity!","Manadynamics.","Destiny.","Helios, Summoning, Genesis, Loot, Tyranny...all of the Ordinances born from Noah Osmont stood in this spot as they gazed at each other!","Towards the higher positions of this multicolored domain filled with intersecting lines, the grand visage of Quintessence sat off freely to the side as its gaze was also towards a central area on the same level where it stood.","A golden line that held two figures standing close to each other and emanating intense waves of complexity that far exceeded all others here!","One was adorned in golden robes inscribed with hundreds of dazzling Wheels, a rotating golden wheel spinning below his feet while a necklace and earrings that looked like bejeweled wheels were adorned on him.","His face showed Noah’s coldness and apathy as beside him, stellar black radiance shone to show a visage more similar to Ozymandias- with just as much complexity!","It was Kuklos and Outerversal.","The Severed Ordinances- Kuklos and Outerversal!","They sat grandly while emanating intense waves of power, but it was not them who spoke first at this council.","\"Can you all feel it?\"","A stern voice echoed out.","It was none other than Quintessence himself as he started things off in this meeting, asking a question they all understood!","Dazzling wheels spun around Kuklos as he stared at Quintessence and others while replying succinctly.","\"Something is coming. Something far bigger than anything we have come across.\"","...!","They all felt the same sensation.","They weren’t clueless.","Even if they all chose to be purposefully clueless and laid back, they were very clearly and verbally told by a being like Bob that a change was coming.","And now, many things seemed to be occurring and falling into place as they had to prepare.","They had to enact a vision.","A plan for the future to prepare for what is coming.","\"Whatever comes, we will overcome it just like we always do.\"","From a radiant purple line, Tyranny spoke out with regality as the gazes of other Ordinances landed on him.","But...the visage of Destiny replied.","\"Always is not guaranteed. We were helpless before the light of inevitability that drew us in, yes?\"","\"...\"","Silence settled in."]},{"number":3429,"title":"Chapter 3429: Chapter 3428: Campaign! II","paragraphs":["Multiple weavings of Noah Osmont met at this moment as a rare moment of silence settled in within a space filled with terrifying personalities and complexities!","Nothing was guaranteed.","Destiny had an extremely cold expression as he looked at everyone.","\"A single misstep or mistake for others is okay. A misstep for us is catastrophic.\"","...!","\"Our pull into the lands of Hell Terra Firma. If the Infiniverse Megalos Seed did not have its unique qualities to operate by a thin margin and ensure the safety of the Aletheian Havens, quintillions would have died. Quintillions. From a single misstep. We can’t afford to be like others. We can’t afford any mistakes whatsoever.\"","Destiny almost looked enraged and angry at himself for not seeing what had occurred before it occurred!","\"We’ve been able to get a read on the future before. Learn of massive events before they occurred. Different Viewpoints. Protagonists had advances most recently that allowed gazing at cycles of our journey. But all of this, when applied to the larger Frequencies of the Wheel of Existence, the types of complexities and Existences that move within it...could not give much. None of us ever knew of this event occurring before it did, and this is a failure in itself.\"","All others listened silently as it was the dazzling golden figure of Destiny speaking out without filter at this moment!","In the hard silence that followed, a brilliant multicolored light flashed as the glorious manifestation of Megalos that spoke out with mystery.","\"Our lives are determined by the sum of all the choices we made. This is the only determination. The choices- ones that we alone make. Not what lies outside of us, not what powerful entities are out there. Not what terrifying Complexity of enemies there could be out there. The choice to birth Ozymandias allowed us to not be entirely helpless and stuck in Hell Terra Firma like all others. The choice to raise the Infiniverse Megalos Seed to its current stage. The choice of raising Ruination. The sum of all these choices continue to define us and where we are now. So if we want to go to a different place and definition, we simply have to make choices that take us there.\"","WAA!","\"A change that nobody knows of is coming, yes, and we simply have to make the choices to ensure that no matter what change comes, we can overcome it.\"","The words of the Megalos echoed out across this Council as many Ordinances seemed to be pondering.","And amidst this pondering...","\"Just tap me in.\"","A voice echoed out.","Many eyes turned towards it as the visage of a golden robed Manifestation lay down on a white string while throwing a singularity in his hand up and down.","It was none other than Cheats!","He fiddled with a singularity as he turned his head towards all the others and continued.","\"This Hell Terra Firma was a setback and the next big stage of opportunity. We have already begun to violate its most basic rules as if we are successful in utilizing authority within a place all authorities are rejected, our growth would rapidly continue to scale upwards to reach these entities who have lived for millions and billions of years. I’m pretty sure if I get the next Globule of Blood of a Pioneer, and more Globules after that, I could use my severed distinction to slowly expand what can pass through that sea. Cheats...can be a ridiculous idea for a concept, or something that could potentially destroy any semblance of rules and balance if truly applied. In the end, it will be a Choice. Just another choice to add to the sum of choices that define us- but that is my take on all this.\"","...!","A proposition was made.","In the distance, the Protagonist seemed to be brooding as he stayed quiet, while all others thought about what was just said!","\"Well, another option is leaning into Kuklos even more. It all deals with the Frequencies of the Wheel, so if we gain a better understanding of it, maybe we can more easily bypass these limitations. But in that case, we know that there are existences who understand the Wheel of Existence far more than we do, and even those beings cannot do anything regarding Hell Terra Firma. So maybe that’s not the path to go...\"","Cheats spoke languidly again as amidst the thoughtful silence of all Ordinances, the visage of Quintessence rose up while voicing out coldly.","\"All in Favor of Cheats, say Aye.\"","...!","A daring question.","And one that after a few seconds...","\"Aye.\"","\"Aye.\"","\"Aye!\"","Resounding answers boomed out all around!","All of them were different complexities. Different personalities.","But all of them were the will of Noah Osmont. The Will of Ozymandias. It was akin to a single being talking to himself and coming to a conclusion after a short while, and a shocking conclusion was reached this time around as it was centered around utter violation.","How could a frequency be violated in the most obscene ways possible?","A question was asked. And there would be an answer.","—","Hell Terra Firma.","Inside a small Settlement.","Within the gates of the Polyacrylate Defense Walls that bloomed up from water being added to them.","At its very center, an Air Balloon slowly began to rise as within its enclosed basket, the figures of Noah, Ruination, and Pioneer Nysa could be seen as they were setting off for the first target of a beginning campaign.","Left behind was the Infiniverse Megalos Body, which had to ensure the safety of the Infiniverse Megalos Seed, with terrifying weapons and defensive measures laid out as currently, a huge dome could be seen at the center of this location that covered the Infiniverse Megalos Seed entirely.","But Noah and Ruination were setting off as...","\"A Larger Settlement where the Warlord is known to be a Pioneer, and the Generals around him are also theorized to be as such... let’s go collect more fuel, shall we?\"","...!","The start of a Campaign.","Ruination nodded at Noah’s words as she pulled on a few mechanisms, the balloon above slowly beginning to rise as they went towards a certain direction!","Pioneer Nysa still looked at all of this in a daze as the golden armored Noah turned to her.","\"North, you said?\"","Their current guide to this journey, and a bloodbag to continue obtaining blood daily.","She nodded dazedly as the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian began a campaign of conquest with an extremely small force currently!"]},{"number":3430,"title":"Chapter 3430: Chapter 3429: Campaign! III","paragraphs":["Noah had gone across many campaigns of conquests that held varying difficulties.","He had conquered Worlds, Galaxies, Universes, Cosmos, and more as his scale of war was vast!","So what difficulty could a Settlement of entities born of Matter pose to him, when they at most held tools like blunt swords, clubs, and bow and arrows?","The answer was that it was not even worth mentioning.","This was why against a few thousand beings, he only brought and planned to deploy a single soldier.","In the span of half an hour after the hot air balloon designed by the Infiniverse and brought into Hell Terra Firma flew out of the first unnamed Settlement, it arrived and floated above the Settlement mentioned by Pioneer Nysa.","A much larger Settlement that actually held viable defensive walls, and the many buildings within actually held structure as if they were made of clay and wood- giving a sense of order and neatness as if an architecture had designed many things here!","Noah looked down at the Settlement below as he smiled and spoke to Ruination.","\"Make it quick. Do not kill unless you have to. After all, we are peaceful conquerors.\"","...!","He spoke such a calm command as Ruination nodded, and her figure encased in a neon battle suit grabbed the edges of the basket they were in...and she jumped out!","The Air Balloon was descending, and yet Ruination did not even wait as she shot down like a speeding bullet.","—","Hell Terra Firma.","A land of utter despair and nothingness!","Taru arrived here a decade ago as he founded a Settlement and formed a semi structure of government with his remnant fighting techniques and mind.","As an entity who had Pioneered his own path, he ruled over many as there were over a hundred Omniverses he reigned over!","But now...","\"Haha...\"","He shook his head with a sense of desolation as he left a bathroom that was essentially a deep pit dug underground, a small square hole left open as an opening for others to do their business.","He actually had to shit.","For the last decade- whether daily or every two days, someone like him had to do such a thing as defecate!","A Pioneer of Existence.","He ate lavish items and food filled with complexity as they were broken down into pure energy in his body- he never held a need to defecate or urinate!","But now, he was reduced to this.","He raised his eyes to the skies to curse this place he was thrown in out of nowhere once more when...","\"Huh?\"","He rubbed his eyes with hands that had only been washed with water and no soap.","He thought he saw what looked to be a vessel in the skies.","A vessel.","In barren lands such as these that rejected life itself, how could such a thing appear?","But as he stared up, it never left, and actually seemed to be coming closer.","\"Huh?\"","And then, he could swear he saw a human figure jump out of this vessel!","\"What the fuc-...!\"","BOOM!","It was followed by a heavy impact at the center of the Settlement moments later, the vibrations even traveling over to his current position as he felt his legs go weak.","This day.","It was the start of something that Taru would never forget for the rest of his life!","Approximately one hour after this event.","Just one hour.","And yet, the situation within the Graylife Settlement that Taru had aptly named since its conception was a grim and quiet one.","All those of high positions and power were lined up in the center of the Settlement, Warlord Taru included as his expression was one of shock and heaviness as he looked towards the woman who had come from the skies!","She had decimated any ounce of defense inside this Settlement in the span of a few minutes, and all the time that followed was her stating that if they did not resist, they would not be hurt or killed.","Some tried to test their power and luck since that time.","Warlord Taru included as he had techniques of fighting ingrained in his bones when he was still a powerful personage before this!","But...","The woman clad in weapons and with crisscross blades on her back felt like she was on a different level entirely.","As if she wasn’t even human!","Her hands struck out at speeds he couldn’t even see, and he found himself beaten to the ground and in great pain within seconds.","His identity was then unveiled as the Warlord, and he dazedly answered all questions this woman asked.","Questions regarding other Pioneers apart from him in this Settlement.","And minutes later, here they were.","An eerie calmness and silence settled in this area as the terrifying woman stood silently while gazing above- towards an Air Balloon that was just now arriving on the ground!","Warlord Taru was kneeling along with four others who were known as past Pioneers of Existence before they arrived in the Hell Terra Firma, their eyes that seemed to have all of their common sense broken also gazing up at the descending Air Balloon.","Hundreds of other humanoid entities watched on in the background as from the basket of the Air Balloon, a man armored in golden brilliance head to toe stepped out.","He looked at everything nearby as even his eyes were hidden, his body radiating an imposing air as he held a long golden spear that seemed nearly twice his size, and yet he wielded it effortlessly!","The moment he arrived, everyone felt their hearts stifled as the magnetic gaze of this being came to lock onto Warlord Taru and the four other Pioneers isolated in their own space.","His voice was even more magnetic and carried a hint of regality as he called out to them.","\"You five were past Pioneers?\"","...!","It felt like an entity far higher in power was asking a question as even Taru felt a stifling sensation to answer, and he thought carefully while analyzing everything he had seen in the last hour, and he nodded!","The four beside him analyzed the recent events and came to the same conclusions, following along the lead of these powerful beings!"]},{"number":3431,"title":"Chapter 3431: Chapter 3430: Campaign! IV","paragraphs":["The moment they answered in affirmation that they were Pioneers, the golden armored man nodded as Taru could swear that a smile likely appeared under his gold helm.","\"Good!\"","A single word.","This being then turned towards the terrifying woman who had taken down this whole settlement while asking.","\"Information about other Settlements?\"","\"Three that they routinely traded with. I’ve noted down their directions and distance based on their accounts, Master.\"","Ruination answered succinctly as her words caused Warlord Taru to look at her and the golden armored entity with a gaze that now seemed to understand.","They were going from Settlement to Settlement.","They were not the first, and they would certainly not be the last!","The only question was...what did these beings want with Pioneers in these forsaken lands with absolutely no authorities?","Warlord Taru and the others had no idea as the golden armored man nodded at this moment, pointing to them and beckoning them towards the Air Balloon calmly.","\"You five can make your way into the vessel- your safety is guaranteed. Another Pioneer there will explain what you can expect.\"","...!","Words that felt like a command more than anything were uttered out, and Taru and the others looked at each before they rose up- ignoring their injuries and walking towards the vessel.","At this time, the golden armored entity gazed at the masses of hundreds of other humanoid entities here.","All poor souls that were just dragged into this place, and others were even born bere as some children could be seen hiding behind others!","Noah looked at all of them calmly as he asked.","\"Alright, who do you all implicitly trust in this place? Apart from those I will be taking away?\"","WAA!","Who did they implicitly trust?","A heavy question, and many of those in the surroundings looked at each other before the majority of the eyes came to land on a woman with a graceful temperament who currently shielded a few kids behind her!","Someone they all knew well based on her actions in the Settlement.","Noah nodded at this as he motioned with his hands- and Ruination quickly moved to remove something from the Air Balloon.","A silver set of armor and sword!","She threw the silver set of armor and sword over to the woman many had looked towards- and this entity dazedly watched these armaments fall near her feet.","\"You are now deemed a General under the banner of the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian. Continue overseeing this place and take in any new entrants that fall into Hell Terra Firma nearby. If you confirm anyone is a Pioneer, keep tabs on them. I’ll be back here routinely.\"","...!","He spoke towards her succinctly as he began to move back towards the Air Balloon that now held Six total Pioneers of Existence.","A quick entrance, and an equally quick exit!","Once Ruination also came in and closed the latch of the Vessel, it began rising to the skies once more as it only left behind hundreds of dazed entities!","A woman stared at the silver armor on her feet with a stern expression, this past Existence Severing expert thinking of many things as a moment later, she adorned the armament and grasped the sword.","Those within Hell Terra Firma faced the sense of desolation and hopelessness every day.","But they were extremely rapid to adapt as each one normally held years of history and experience!","Like a well-oiled machine, the cogs would soon and very quickly start to move as Noah began moving around Hell Terra Firma- collecting powerful individuals and installing leadership positions while extending his own influence!","—","Omniverse X-999.","Within the Secondary Infiniverse Megalos Seed.","Above a vibrant multicolored sea surrounded by thousands of complex Runes of Existence, Ozymandias and the Infiniverse Megalos Body floated powerfully while the latter spoke out her intent.","|Master, your other self and Ruination have just returned with five more Pioneers from a second nearby Settlement, and-...!|","In the middle of her words, the multicolored Frequency Gateway began to seethe and roil as from its depths, radiant crimson drops of blood rose up that rapidly became filled with life and brilliance- each of these drops of blood radiating their own heart-shaking aura!","Some became crimson gold globules of brilliance.","Others became painted crimson purple or crimson white.","But ultimately...a total of 5 Globules of Blood of Pioneers floated before Ozymandias and the Infiniverse Megalos Body as the former smiled and waved his hands- these penultimate forms of loot coming forward as an illusory eye above him stared at them deeply.","[Globule of Blood of a Pioneer(Taru)]:: The scattered Severed weavings of existence and scattered path of a Pioneer have been determined to belong to the Great Pioneer that went a decade ago from an unknown frequency. On the 50th Cycle of his life, he severed all attachments and weavings that bound him, attaining a Severed State of Existence. On the 60th Cycle of his life, he finally Pioneered his own weavings above Severing. A drop of his blood has generated the capability for you to Sever a single, small aspect of your own weavings, including but not limited to Individual Concepts, Individual Values, Individual Techniques....","[Globule of Blood of a Pioneer(Orlo)]:: The scattered Severed weavings of existence and scattered path of a Pioneer have been determined to belong to the Great Pioneer that went missing years ago from an unknown frequency...","[Globule of Blood of a Pioneer(Sheila)]:: The scattered Severed weavings of existence and scattered path of a Pioneer...","One by one, he observed them all to have similar details as they spun around his body gloriously before moments later, he bellowed out and absorbed all five!","HUUM!","Intense complexity burst out as the hard work of Pioneers- their literal blood flowed into Ozymandias and was then directed towards a single place.","|Bathe the Weavings of Cheats utterly and completely.|","...!","His commanding voice boomed out as the Blood of different Pioneers burned within him, a single Ordinance being focused on as instead of one Drop of Blood of a Pioneer going into it, five burned entirely for Cheats instead!","The result was bound to be a heavy one..."]},{"number":3432,"title":"Chapter 3432: Chapter 3431: Deceive, Deceit, Cheat! I","paragraphs":["Blood.","The Blood of a Pioneer was heavy.","It was the hard work of entities that had waded through cycles of weavings, and he was using it to prop himself up even higher!","Such Blood flowed through Ozymandias and bathed nothing else but Cheats.","|The Complexity of Cheats is being tested.|","|The light of Severing covers Cheats entirely, and it does so multiple times unlike any other parts of your weavings.|","Cheats.","A single part of what made Noah Osmont.","He was a man born of many things, and his power was the accumulation and convergence of a lot of factors.","At times, a part of him shone more than others and took center stage.","Infinity.","Quintessence.","Mana.","Protagonist.","Loot.","It varied over time which part of him took center stage, but each part was paramount to getting him where he needed to be.","Under the agreement of all other parts of him, Cheats was propelled to the spotlight at this time!","Cheats.","A concept that, when placed in comparison to the likes of Infinity or Quintessence, may be considered lesser. May not be taken as seriously.","But what exactly was Cheats?","\"I am...\"","From Ozymandias, golden brilliance began to shine brightly as behind him, a golden robe fluttered into existence.","Cheats.","If one truly asked what it was, the answer was vast!","Ozymandias looked at the multicolored sea before him as he spoke out.","\"Infinite Mana is a cheat.\"","WAA!","\"The Infiniverse Megalos Seed is a cheat.\"","...!","\"Ruination is a cheat.\"","HUUM!","As he spoke, an unfathomable gold radiance emerged from his figure.","Yes! All the astounding things that Noah Osmont had that gave him an edge over others could be considered cheats.","An unfair advantage or special ability, history, or lineage that allowed one to undergo extremely rapid progression compared to others and overcome obstacles impossible for others!","This was the essence of Cheats!","And was this not what he continued to do again and again?","What others achieved in millions of years, in cycles, he achieved in days and weeks?","Even now, the Frequency of Hell Terra Firma that denied all authority- what was he doing within it?","He was violating everything it stood for- something impossible for others, and yet a reality for him.","Cheats...had innately coursed through and held a hand in many parts of what made him!","At this moment, it sought its recognition.","Its gravitas!","BOOOM!","Stellar rivers of golden radiance erupted around Ozymandias and whipped around madly.","|The Weavings of Cheats have been Severed from the commonality and normalcy of existence once, tremendously elevating the complexity.|","|The Weavings of Cheats gaze at the remnant power of the Globules of Blood of Pioneers and pose the question- who decided that one could only undergo Severing once?|","....!","A simple question.","Yet it was one that caused the weavings of existence around Ozymandias to tremble left and right.","His body radiated a pulse of power as a moment later...","BOOM!","|The Ordinance of Cheats has undergone a Second Severing of Existence.|","...!","A concept was severed and put alone on its own standing, outside the scope of other weavings of existence. This was existence severing.","Yet at this moment, Cheats Severed its existence not once, but twice!","And it didn’t stop there.","|The Ordinance of Cheats has undergone a Third Severing of Existence.|","|The Ordinance of Cheats has undergone a Fourth Severing of Existence.|","|The Ordinance of Cheats has undergone a Fifth Severing of Existence!|","Not once. Not twice- but five times!","Five times, Cheats underwent cycles of five Severings as the golden brilliance around Ozymandias became unfathomably pure- its concentration reaching maddening levels.","Its complexity was stupendous as...Ozymandias felt like he could more freely gaze at what made the weavings of existence, and then theorize how to utterly violate their weavings!","This was the stage Cheats was going towards as while it began burning with the light of Existence Severing multiple times over, it felt its brand new complexity...and began to act.","|The Severed Ordinance of Cheats looks at the many possible ways to violate the weavings of Existence.|","It took but a moment after its multiple severings before it began!","|Cheats states that it stands in a League of its own.|","|It should not have to conform to the established weavings of Existence, and begins the establishment of the Quintessential League of Existence.|","...!","|Its own set of rules and principles.|","Dazzling concentrations of golden brilliance were being used and burnt up.","And yet they never ended being produced as from the depths of Ozymandias, Cheats pulled on Mana freely.","Blue brilliance was converted to golden brilliance as never ending complex waves of power continued to spill out senselessly to design whatever Cheats had in mind!","The Quintessential League of Existence.","Its own set of rules and principles!","Such a fantastical weaving began to bloom at this moment as Ozymandias stared at the multicolored sea.","The coming change would be comprehensive.","The coming change would be deadly.","The coming change would violate far too many things!","|The guidelines of the Quintessential League of Existence under the banner of cheats are being defined.| Your next chapter is on empire","|The design of the Relegation Zone of Existence has begun to unfold.|","|The design of the Banner of Invictus has begun to unfold.|","...!","One after another.","A ridiculous set of guidelines and principles began to unfold in a small corner of the Megalos Ynnere of a unique Spoke of the Wheel!","As this process began.","In transcended weavings of existence, within the Expanse.","A terrific light of golden brilliance erupted within the core area of the Primal Eldritch Palace of the Expanse, the visage of Ozymandias within this place rising as on his fully starry obsidian body, white gold wings erupted from behind his back.","The wings were gloriously laced with obsidian tentacles that further expressed their might and tyranny, his figure beginning to move away from the domain that the Great Segregator and Great Mother were in.","Such an action caused them to be dazed as the Great Mother asked cautiously.","|O Instrument of the Beyonder, where...are you going?!|","...!"]},{"number":3433,"title":"Chapter 3433: Chapter 3432: Decieve, Deceit, Cheat! II","paragraphs":["The intent of the Great Mother was filled with instability as if she knew the answer to her question.","But it was all that unbelievable that she still had to ask!","Where exactly could he be going right now?","Without even looking back, the voice of Ozymandias echoed as he began to leave the Primal Eldritch Palace of the Expanse.","|To the Immovable Sacred Palace of the Expanse, of course. I said that I would do it myself.|","...!","To the Immovable Sacred Palace of the Expanse!","The Great Segregator heard such an answer as she stared forth incredulously.","The Great Mother became silent as she stared at the back of the Instrument of the Beyonder that did not stop moving.","She had not known him for long, but she knew him not to be a fool. She didn’t understand his reasons.","She didn’t know how or why the Immovable Sacred Palace of the Expanse had offended him!","Naturally, she wanted to repeat that such a place was guarded by multiple Pioneers of Existence and likely over a Hundred Existence Severing Palace Masters who all stemmed from different locations across the Expanse.","The Expanse was vast as within it, many terrifying Civilizations thrived.","Some transcended from the Megalos Ynnere, Megalos Beyond, and Megalos Nihilos as they made different domains within the Expanse their homes.","Others were already naturally within the Expanse, like the civilization known as Megalonians who thrived long ago within Megalos Mountains in the gaps of the Expanse!","Of course, such a civilization had long since perished in the eons of history, but there were others similar to them in terms of history.","Some of these powerful entities remained in their homes, and others sought opportunity elsewhere as they joined groups that had connections to terrifying connections and weavings.","Groups that for as long as Records were being written, they had existed. Read exclusive chapters at empire","Some had origins relating to Anti-Matter, others stemming from Dark Matter, and the most abstruse of all that stemmed from Matter!","The Immovable Sacred Palace of the Expanse was one such extension of a terrifying power stemming from the weavings of Matter.","Very rarely were there wars across different Palaces in the Expanse.","The times that wars did arise were due to irreconcilable differences between two parties that drew many parties in, and such conflicts caused heavy death tolls across the weavings of this Frequency!","An example of such war was the one where a single being had been in the center of- the Omnifather and what had occurred with the Megalonians of the Megalos Mountains.","That war had carried heavy consequences, with countless entities dying due to it as a portion of the terrifying lineage of Golden Titans were even taken prisoner by the Omnifather.","A terrifying time. A terrifying war!","Such wars were not in line with the purpose of all being to elevate their complexity for as long as they could, but they did occur.","At this moment in time, it would be laughable to even have the Primal Eldritch Palace of the Expanse attack the Immovable Sacred Palace of the Expanse.","And yet even despite all of this, Ozymandias still moved.","Even while knowing about Pioneers of Existence occupying that place while he was merely a newborn that had just now seemingly undergone Severing, he still moved!","The tentacles that made the infinity symbol that was the Great Mother trembled subtly as...she laughed shrewdly thereafter.","|I have not been a good follower of the Beyonder.|","She felt all stress and worries leave her as on the next moment, she began to move towards the Instrument of the Beyonder.","As she did so, the shackles and weight that always held her back seemed to break, and her reservations regarding the next step broke as well!","Her tentacles moved towards the Instrument of the Beyonder as at the same time, she Severed all her worries.","She Severed her Existence!","BOOM!","A terrifying aura began to emerge from her as she voiced out.","|I should never have doubted the Instrument of the Beyonder. I should never have doubted the words of the Great Beyonder!|","...!","She wholly followed the weavings of the Great Beyonder as if she was meant to be part of the weavings of the Instrument, she would not die from a mere Severing of Existence.","So she followed the Instrument while Severing her existence, the Great Segregator behind her gazing at the scene in a daze as two figures left the safe haven of the Primal Eldritch Palace of the Expanse!","In moments, the Great Mother caught up to Ozymandias as she asked with a jubilant tone.","|O Instrument, you know exactly where you need to go?|","Did he know the exact coordinates of the Immovable Sacred Palace of the Expanse?","Towards such a question, Ozymandias just nodded as the vibrant wings behind his back fluttered.","Invictus Maximus!","They were incorporated into the terrifying weavings of Cheats at this moment as with them...","|All those entangled with me through any means of Causality cannot hide. No matter if it is in these Megalos or Expanse, or even another weaving of Existence entirely!|","HUUM!","His gaze radiated a terrifying gold light.","They left the weavings of the Primal Eldritch Palace of the Expanse as Ozymandias felt the unique strings of Existence around them, a dazzling eye opening up above him as he tugged on a certain string, tendrils of obsidian gold brilliance wrapping around him and the Great Mother as their figures turned into streaks of light that cruised on this string of existence!","Its pathway ran straight towards the Immovable Sacred Palace of the Expanse!","—","The Immovable Sacred Palace of the Expanse.","Within its depths, Pioneer Heracles sat amidst a sea of vibrant complexity, Runes of Existence swirling around him as he continued to feel a sense of unease.","Unease!","Ever since they undertook that tremendous mission to send the Source Weavings of the Infiniverse Dowager and the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian to that terrifying Frequency, this unease had not faded!","In fact, it only intensified with every passing hour since that event.","The senses of a Pioneer were extremely sensitive as he didn’t just push away this feeling.","He felt like something was coming, but he couldn’t say what exactly!"]},{"number":3434,"title":"Chapter 3434: Chapter 3433: Deceive, Deceit, Cheat! III","paragraphs":["He shouldn’t have any viable worries.","He shouldn’t be feeling like this when they had just locked away the Infiniverse Dowager and the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian!","So why?","Why was...!","HUUUM!","His head rose.","He felt something.","A ringing.","A signal- something new and foreign seemed to appear in a distant area as, at this moment, he heard a deep roar that seemed to be coming from the depths of the Megalos Beyond!","’Outerversal Authority?’","He raised his brows as he felt the source behind the roar- its complexity heavy, but should at most be at Existence Severing.","This shouldn’t be something that even required someone like him to move as he remained seated where he was, only extending his Eye of Existence outwards to observe what was happening.","And a moment later, a piercing roar filled with interminable power and heaviness boomed out that caused Pioneer Heracles’ gaze to change!","|O Immovable Sacred Palace of the Expanse, the Instrument of the Beyonder has come to pay a visit!|","...!","The Instrument of the Beyonder?!","Pioneer Heracles couldn’t help but rise up as this...was another Calamity that appeared in the future.","Something along the same lines as the Infiniverse Dowager and the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian, but the Instrument of the Beyonder was much more brutal!","He swept out with waves of obsidian Outerversal Authority and poisoned everything into his image, altering entire portions of the Megalos and the Expanse.","Why would he appear here?","First the Infiniverse Dowager and Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian, and now the Instrument of the Beyonder.","What the hell was going on with this Frequency of Existence to have all of these entities here? And it appearing just after two other Calamities were sent away...was this connected?!","Pioneer Heracles had a heavy gaze as moments later, Palace Master Antiope and Nisa appeared in his domain, their gazes also somber!","—","Outside of a dazzling Blancverse Domain that contained countless wonders.","Smaller Blancverse Domain could be seen around this general area, and with the golden Strings of Existence crossing through everything, this whole area looked like a gorgeous paradisiacal land.","Meanwhile, inside the largest Blancverse Domain.","Massive white and gold castles, towers, and monuments floated inside of this Blancverse Domain, its equivalent length being a few times larger than a normal Omniverse as it contained countless intricacies within it.","It also held a concentrated amount of powerful forces that nobody would dare to freely stand against.","Thousands of Ordinance Amalgamation entities, tens of thousands below them in other States of Existence.","Over a hundred Existence Severing Palace Masters!","And an unknown number of Pioneers of Existence.","Just thinking of these forces alone would fill one with trepidation and make them stay far away!","Yet Ozymandias arrived here with the Great Mother in tow, her tentacles shining with a glorious luster of severing as she bellowed out.","|O Immovable Sacred Palace of the Expanse, the Instrument of the Beyonder has come to pay a visit!|","|O Immovable Sacred Palace...!|","|O Immovable Sacred Palace...!|","It rang out, resonated, and boomed out multiple times over.","The reaction was swift as moments later, within the Blancverse Domain, the grandiose auras of a few dozen Existence Severing entities arose and came over.","Their bodies held heavy bursts of Complexity as a booming intent of Palace Master Evrin was among the first to echo out.","|And what might the so called Instrument of the Beyonder that is emanating mere shreds of Existence Severing so boisterously come here? Do you all not know of the Immovable Sacred Palace of the Expanse? You are far from the dark lands tainted by Outerversal Authority!|","WAA!","The words were fearless and filled with animosity.","First, their power only stayed in Existence Severing.","Second, the Immovable Sacred Palace of the Expanse was contained within a Blancverse.","No entity would even be able to affect those within this space.","So why would they ever worry?","As Palace Master Evrin appeared on the edges of the Blancverse, other Palace Masters also appeared as behind them, hundreds of Ordinance Amalgamation entities also showed themselves!","Their lives were cyclical as they all sought for greater complexity. Rarely did something like this happen as they were curious.","Among the arrivals.","The figures of Palace Master Antiope and Nisa also appeared as the moment they did so, Ozymandias honed in on them while the golden wings behind his back pulsed with majesty!","An eye above him unfurled with tremendous grandeur as he raised his hand and caused the appearance of multiple illusory figures. Continue your journey on empire","|I came to the Immovable Sacred Palace for these three beings and these three beings alone. Give them to me, and there will be no karma between the Immovable Sacred Palace of the Expanse and I. Give them to me, and this Palace of yours will still remain standing thereafter.|","...!","Ridiculous words boomed out while the illusory figures of Pioneer Heracles, Palace Master Antiope, and Palace Master Nisa were shown as the targets he wanted.","But he stated that the Immovable Sacred Palace of the Expanse either gives them up, or causality between them would start to be twisted as this Palace may not remain standing any longer after that!","It was so outlandish that nobody could even reply initially.","Even the Great Mother was surprised as she couldn’t help but swell with excitement.","She didn’t know what the Instrument of the Beyonder had in store, but she would follow him all the way!","At this moment, her tentacles moved.","An eye opened amidst all of them as she began to record everything occurring here- and she sent all of their weavings towards the Megalos Beyond, towards the Pantheon of Umbra they were still in.","She wanted to express to every single Morphon the grandeur of the Instrument of the Beyonder!","Within the Blancverse.","Many eyes looked at at the illusory images of Pioneer Heracles, and the Existence Severing Palace Masters Antiope and Nisa as they were incredulous.","These Existence Severing Outerversal Morphons actually came here to ask for a Pioneer of Existence to be given up along with two Palace Masters?!"]},{"number":3435,"title":"Chapter 3435: Chapter 3434: Deceive, Deceit, Cheat! IV","paragraphs":["A Palace Master clad in a crimson robe sneered from within the Blancverse Domain as her voice echoed out.","|You ridiculous buffoon, you actually came here to ask for a great Pioneer of Existence to be handed over to you? Even if he was gracious enough to grant you his presence, you would not be worthy!|","Unworthy!","Unworthy for even the grace of a great Pioneer of Existence!","The red-robbed Palace Master said this while internally sending messages to Antiope and Nisa, wondering what interactions they had that would cause this being to appear here.","She was surprised to find the faces of the two Palace Masters visibly somber and stern as if they were looking at a great enemy!","Was there something the rest of them were missing here?","There would not need to be any worries at all as first, they were inside a Blancverse.","Second, this was their base filled with over a hundred Existence Severing Palace Masters and even Pioneers of Existence!","What were two Existence Severing enemies before such a force?","Another Palace Master spoke up at this time, his voice cold.","|Whatever Palace of the Expanse you stem from, you’d best scram back to it before you perish here. I’ve heard of the little dreams and rumors from Outerversal Morphons regarding a promised champion of theirs before. The Instrument of the Great Beyonder you all look up to. Are you supposed to be it? A little thing whose complexity barely matches one of us here? Fuck off.|","...!","Complete disregard was all they received.","Ozymandias looked at this as his gaze was locked onto the somber expressions of Palace Master Antiope and Nisa.","He began to float towards the Blancverse while keeping his gaze on them.","|You two know what you did. Today, I’ve come to collect.|","WAA!","|Is the Pioneer behind you both still hiding? Even he will not be able to escape today.|","...!","His words and power truly didn’t match.","If it was a terrifying Pioneer of Existence saying these words, they would hold weight and make sense.","But an Existence Severing entity...what basis did he have to stand on for him to even say this?","He reached the outer boundary of the dazzling white Blancverse that would stop anyone, even a Pioneer!","And...","He floated forward.","He floated through the dazzling white ring of the Blancverse as it didn’t pulse, reject, or even act like any sort of barrier- he simply floated right through!","HUUUM!","Instantly, the whole atmosphere changed.","All Palace Masters here gazed forward with shock!","The Ordinance Amalgamation and Ordinance of Existence entities behind them had their jaws opened wide.","The atmosphere instantly turned heavy and serious as Ozymandias acted like he didn’t do much, his gaze still locked onto Antiope and Nisa as he voiced out!","|I will say it again. I come here for the lives of these two here... let us see, Antiope and Nisa? As well as the Pioneer behind them. If you all do not interfere, the Immovable Sacred Palace of the Expanse would not be entangled with me. If you all interfere...I cannot promise that the entire Immovable Sacred Palace will not disappear today.|","...!","Immense shock and silence settled in.","A Blancverse.","It was inviolable!","But that being just violated it so simply!","What was this?","What was this?!","None of them knew.","But of course, this was the violation of Existence itself that Cheats had envisioned.","The violation of the norms of Existence that Cheats was actively altering!","Boundless deceit unfolded. Boundless deception against existence itself unfolded!","At this moment, the newly designed Quintessential League of Existence expressed itself.","But what exactly was the Quintessential League of Existence?","The guidelines that Cheats had enacted with its terrifying authority that was severed five times flashed before the eyes of Ozymandias! Stay connected with empire","The guidelines violated and denied reality as they were simple ones.","First and foremost.","[The distance of an Omniverse around Cheats falls under the influence of the Quintessential League of Existence, and the influence of the Quintessential League of Existence is applied wherever a body of the holder of Cheats is.]","[The First Guidelines of the Quintessential League of Existence are active.]","[The Relegation Zone of Existence is active.]","[The Banner of Invictus is active.]","...!","[Relegation Zone of Existence]:: Under the area affected by the Influence of the Quintessential League of Existence, the Realm of Power that can be expressed can only be as high as the owner of the Quintessential League of Existence.","[Banner of Invictus]:: Any Existence entangled and with a causal relationship with the holder of Cheats will have no barriers or obstacles between the two sides, regardless of distance or even different weavings of existence. If under the influence of the Quintessential League of Existence, one can never leave the Relegation Zone deployed unless the Causality between two sides is settled by any means necessary.","The design of Cheats.","The deceit and deception of existence itself.","Cheats...had chosen to go above and beyond as it established a League of its own.","A League of Existence where the rules of reality, the rules of Existence themselves...were entirely different when Cheats was present!","This...was the Quintessential League of Existence.","A league of his own.","Rules of his own!","|You motherfucker!|","At the moment he intruded into the Blancverse Domain, the Palace Masters instantly reacted and blazed with horrifying bursts of authority!","And yet...Ozymandias remained unfettered as he bellowed out.","|Can you all not see what the ones I came here for are doing while the rest of you throw yourselves into the fire?!|","...!","His words caused the eyes of all to briefly glance towards Palace Masters Antiope and Nisa.","Unlike other Palace Masters, they did not erupt with authority or move forward.","In fact, they even showed a trace of fear on their faces as they moved back!","Such a scene caused many to flash with caution.","Just...what was happening here?","Hesitation bloomed.","All eyes turned to stare at Ozymandias who had just freely breached the Blancverse Domain as they wondered.","Just who the hell was this being?","His humanoid body.","His stellar obsidian makeup. The golden wings behind him that were laced with black tentacles.","His astral face that had two blinding gold singularities!","At this moment, he gave off a menacing feel that made him look like an ancient Morphon unphased by anything.","He looked at every single entity here as his voice remained low and full of confidence.","|Today is a decisive day for the Immovable Sacred Palace of the Expanse.|","WAA!","|Either three Entities die, or the whole Immovable Palace falls. What will it be?|","...!"]},{"number":3436,"title":"Chapter 3436: Chapter 3435: Merely Pioneers of Existence! I","paragraphs":["Either three entities die, or all of the Immovable Sacred Palace of the Expanse perishes!","These heavy words buzzed out as in response...","|What a pompous being. The whole Immovable Sacred Palace of the Expanse may perish? Do you even know what holds it up? Has something like you ever tasted the power of a Pioneer?|","Along with the booming voice, an utterly existence-altering authority manifested as space distorted to reveal an entity with white wings of light flowing graciously behind him!","Near this entity, Pioneer Heracles could also be seen as his eyes showed calmness and seriousness.","Dark hair, blue eyes, and currently adorned in a light blue robe inscribed with stars.","Undoubtedly radiating an air of power far exceeding Existence Severing.","Pioneers.","Two Pioneers had actually appeared!","The moment they did so.","The visage of Ozymandias stopped in place as he locked his gaze on the visage of Pioneer Heracles.","On his stellar obsidian face that only held singularities for pupils, a deep, devilish smile formed- a smile filled with astonishingly impure thoughts to violate the very order of existence itself!","|Heracles is your name, huh? Now that all three of you are present, I can stop talking and start thrashing!|","...!","DUM!","Stay tuned for updates on empire","DUM!","DUM!","It was unknown from where.","But in the surroundings, the sound of drums began to ring.","Akin to a symphony. Akin to a melody foretelling what was to come!","The Severed Ordinances of Existence of all Palace Masters were buzzing and ready to erupt as they made their stance clear!","They would defend their own.","In the middle of the Palace Masters, Antiope recalled the terror she had heard of this Calamity in the future as she grit her teeth and called out a message to all others.","|Do not underestimate him! Treat him as dangerous as even a Pione-...!|","CRACK!","Ozymandias had disappeared where he stood.","Even before Palace Master Antiope could finish her words, her eyelids only flickered with warning innately as in the next moment, a stellar black fist filled with dense and heavy severed authority of existence made contact with her cheek, her innate defenses melting and deforming from the tainting of Outerversal Authority as she was hit with so much force that her body shot sideways like a ragdoll, smashing onto Palace Master Nisa as both continued on for miles!","...!","Many eyes nearly bulged out.","Fast.","It was far too fast!","In the distance, Palace Master Antiope held a bloodied jaw with multiple teeth knocked out, her gaze ferocious and filled with alarm while Nisa held onto her.","The scene was a terrific one!","But would such a being truly be allowed to run rampant when the Pioneers of the Immovable Sacred Palace of the Expanse were right here?!","|Before the grandeur of a Pioneer, do you truly think an Existence Severing entity can run rampant?!|","...!","Even as this thought arose, the Pioneer with white wings and his whole body radiating a terrific while luster of radiance swung his hand down.","|The path I pioneered is the path of Chi. A boorish creature like you cannot even begin to understand it, much less withstand it! This...is the power of a Pioneer!|","BOOM!","His hand had merely swung down.","Yet from above Ozymandias and below him two white palms made from a shockingly complex amalgamation of authorities descended and threatened to make him into a pancake!","At the center of each palm, the Rune of Existence reading [CHI] was utterly radiant and carrying wonders of undeniability!","And yet...","HOOONG!","A golden wheel manifested around Ozymandias and spun.","Kuklos!","The intricate wheel spun with heavy majesty as when the palms came down and up, it was akin to two metals grating against each other as the two white palms never even broke past the wheel to reach Ozymandias!","A simple scene.","But it was one that instantly caused the surroundings to turn eerily quiet.","Palace Masters and Pioneers alike gazed on with blank eyes.","What was this? Not a single person could fathom what they were seeing at this moment as only a single voice echoed out.","|Was this the great power of a Pioneer?|","DUM! DUM! DUM!","The booming drums picked up the frequency.","The hearts of many beings began to feel unsettled.","Outside of the Blancverse, the Great Mother’s tentacles squealed and trembled in sheer excitement as she watched what was happening here and even displayed it on the Pantheon of Umbra!","The grandeur of the Instrument of the Beyonder.","The majesty he displayed as shockingly, at this moment, he withstood the attack of a Pioneer!","How was this possible?","How?!","The power he expressed was still that of Existence Severing as it should not be able to do what it was currently doing!","It was an utter violation of existence as in all this fervor...the visage of Ozymandias surrounded by a dazzling spinning Wheel looked towards the Piooner as his intent weaved out.","|If that is the power of a Pioneer, it seems that I can run rampant freely. Do not believe yourself to be something great with the stage of power you have achieved...you are merely a Pioneer- and I already have multiple entities like you at my beck and call.|","...!","Horrific words echoed out as who could believe them?","But it mattered not to Ozymandias as while keeping at bay the dazzling grandeur of a Pioneers Path, the golden wings behind him flickered with unfathomable obsidian radiance as in the next moment, his back gushed out dense waves of Outerversal Authority.","Alongside these waves of Outerversal Authority, thousands of stellar obsidian gold tentacles unfurled and stretched out all around, turning this nearby region into a scene of eldritch horror as these tentacles went towards anything nearby.","They latched on and gripped the dazzling white illusory hands simmering with flames of CHI from the white winged Pioneer.","They went towards any nearby Palace Masters as they roared out and erupted with their severed Ordinances.","Behind them was the backing of Infinite Mana as at this moment, it was poured out freely.","He was a single being, yes.","But if he expressed infinite waves of mana and altered them to become his source of power for Kuklos, Outerversal, and Cheats, did the number of enemies really matter?"]},{"number":3437,"title":"Chapter 3437: Chapter 3436: Merely Pioneers of Existence! II","paragraphs":["|In one’s life, a critical choice is made that entirely changes the landscape and direction of existence.|","As a sea of Outerversal Authority leaked out and altered the very landscape nearby, the Instrument of the Beyonder made a grand declaration.","|Today, the Immovable Sacred Palace has made a choice, and must now bear the consequences of this choice.|","...!","[Fatalities.]","HUUUM!","A single word was uttered out. A single word, and yet it was filled with ancient vicissitude and wonder.","The radiance of Invictus Maximus blared.","Causality twisted and distorted as it was brought forward, a senseless amount of Mana being utilized for it.","If any entity would eventually die at the hands of Ozymandias, this causality was brought forward and carried out right away as, at this moment, he focused on the Ordinance Amalgamation and Ordinance of Existence entities nearby.","All those nearby.","It was cruel.","It was senseless.","It was the start of the brutal reign of the Instrument of the Beyonder, Ozymandias!","[Singularity Implosion.]","Continue reading at empire","The name of the fatality was uttered as many entities felt a sense of trepidation, multiple other terrifying auras of Pioneers rising and coming over from the depths of the Immovable Sacred Palace of the Expanse as booming voices arose!","|How daring!|","|HOLD!|","Voices filled with authority.","But what the Instrument of the Beyonder had uttered out was already set in stone.","In the next instant, the Ordinance Amalgamation and Ordinance of Existence stage entities in the surroundings suddenly felt a sense of unfathomable ease, and their very weavings of existence shook as from the center of their bodies, terrific gravitational forces of a singularity being born and dying at the same time bloomed.","Their Ordinances were only able to resist it for a fraction of an instant.","And right after, their body crumpled like paper before they exploded into a bloody mess of ground down bones, musculature, and blood!","POP!","POP!","POP!","As if thousands of balloons were popping.","It was a heavy and deafening burst of existence that seemed like the very lifeblood of the Immovable Sacred Palace of the Expanse was being burst under the gazes of all.","|YOU!|","|ABHORRENT!|","|IRRECONCILABLE!|","Three more auras of Pioneers bloomed as blinding bursts of radiance appeared, each of them with dominating waves of existence that all crushed down to extinguish Ozymandias!","In the far distance, the visage of Palace Master Antiope shifted her jaw back in place as her eyes shook from Trauma.","Trauma!","As if she was reliving the nightmare from a long time ago, the brutality and dominance of the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian showed itself off once more!","Wait...no.","This was another Calamity entirely. Why did her terror of the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian flash when she looked at the Instrument of the Beyonder?","As she asked herself this, she recalled the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian before he disappeared under the blinding brilliance of that gray light!","There, she could swear that she saw the same dazzling golden wheel that was also rotating around the Instrument of the Beyonder at this moment!","...!","This realization was akin to a thunderbolt crashing in her mind, her existence being woken up completely as she felt like she had fallen into many layers of hell.","The Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian and the Instrument of the Beyonder...may just be one and the same.","And even though they had forever locked away the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian and the Infiniverse Dowager, the Instrument of the Beyonder was still here.","Their nightmare was still here as this was the reason they were currently targeted!","Her skin began to crawl as she trembled, recalling the qualities of the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian.","Defied Existence freely. Overcame countless difficulties to wage war and decimate others. And if one ever underestimated him...it would be their death!","She didn’t underestimate him. They did all they could to even send him away!","And yet...","And yet...!","Her fear made way to madness.","She felt her fractured jaw as her intent maddeningly roared out, remembering what had been an initiating event that many said was the reason for a cascade of events.","Something that had occurred that caused many to come after the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian!","It was...in his name.","With a shrill voice, she pointed towards Ozymandias while Pioneers moved against him, her intent booming out!","|That is not just the Instrument of the Beyonder! That is the inheritor of the Lineage of the Megalonians! That is THE Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian, resurrected after all these eons!|","...!","Her words spread out far and wide.","Across the Immovable Sacred Palace of the Expanse.","Across all the Pioneers making their entrance here and those who had yet to make a move!","The words and distinction of the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian spread out as many memories instantly flashed within the eyes of those who heard them.","Megalonian.","This was a very unique term and word that was locked away through history- a type of bloodline that many had gone crazy over as multiple forces had joined in to eradicate and devour them!","Their weavings...could tremendously and ridiculously aid one in the elevation of their own as many powerhouses rose from their downfall.","Now, they heard this term again.","The eyes of all Pioneers flashed with indeterminate light of brilliance while even the knowledgeable Existence Severing Palace Masters were shocked!","Outside of the Blancverse, the visage of the Great Mother trembled with anger as she roared out.","|Blasphemous!|","WAA!","How dare they blaspheme the Instrument of the Beyonder and grant him some lineage of a long-destroyed race?!","This was simply to incur the interest of all others as it was entirely false!","Far from the Expanse.","In the Megalos Beyond.","The Pantheon of Umbra!","The gazes of millions of Outerversal Morphons were observing the shocking dominance of the Instrument of the Beyonder against even Pioneers of Existence, their eyes burning with incredulity and fervor when these booming intent of Palace Master Antiope even reached them.","The moment they did hear it, clamor and chaos erupted!"]},{"number":3438,"title":"Chapter 3438: Chapter 3437: The Fragility of Existence! I","paragraphs":["To the Outerversal Morphons, the idea of the Instrument of the Beyonder was something that held together their core beliefs.","Even the Heretical Morphons who did not want to risk the end of the Megalos Beyond on a single being also held that core belief.","Of his identity as a pure Outerversal Morphon spoken about by the Great Beyonder.","To be talked about differently by another- for him to even be called the reincarnation of the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian...this offended every ounce of belief of the Outerversal Morphons as Outerversal Authority chaotically surged about the entire Pantheon of Umbra.","It seemed as if a giant beast that had laid dormant this entire time was waking.","Towards the center of the Pantheon of Umbra, the visage of the Instrument of the Beyonder lay protected by the Observer of Old and Young along with the Great Mother whose tentacles radiated a livid light at this moment.","The Great Wheel was watching their grandiose statures with a stern expression as he steadily began to rise to the stellar black skies of the Pantheon of Umbra, his voice booming out.","|On this day, we see the Instrument of the Beyonder wage war against a Palace of the Expanse by himself- against those stemming from Matter without so much as doubt or hesitation. He fights for us until he is maliciously labeled with names as I ask you all...why are we not fighting beside him? Where is our support to the Instrument of the Beyonder?!|","...!","Such a resonant intent boomed out far and wide, crossing the tall valleys of the Pantheon of Umbra and the sordid mountain that hid millions of Outerversal Morphons.","He asked, where was their support of the Instrument of the Beyonder?","And before they could even answer, the Great Wheel continued.","|We have played back and forth with those stemming from Matter, inserting our tendrils into their Omniverses and simply biding our time and lying in wait. I say enough is enough. To support the campaign of the Instrument of the Beyonder, I will use every ounce of force I have gathered in the Megalos Ynnere and begin a campaign against the very roots of the beings that dare to blaspheme the grandeur of the Instrument of the Beyonder! Who shall move with me?!|","It was a booming intent that was followed by a stark silence.","But an instant later...","|OOOOH!|","|WUUU!|","Horrifying bellows and shrills of Outerversal Morphons from the depths of the worst nightmares boomed out, Outerversal Authority whipping about the Pantheon of Umbra and beginning to spill out like an endless sea.","Out there, there were many beings who would make a move based on their own ideals.","At this moment, some opportunistic beings moved to ignite a war.","A single opportunistic being moved to ignite a Megalos War!","In the depths of the Pantheon of Umbra, the livid tentacles of the Great Mother watched all of this while she stared at the body of Ozymandias brimming with silent power.","How she wished she could at least aid him within that Blancverse where he currently faced multiple Pioneers of Existence and over a hundred Existence Severing Palace Masters!","—","In the dazzling cluster of power that represented the Immovable Sacred Palace of the Expanse.","As the shocking declaration from Palance Master Antiope spread out, it had different implications for many beings.","In die distance, Pioneer Heracles had an ashen gaze as he affirmed this as well, the reality that the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian and the Instrument of the Beyonder being the same person...came with too many heavy implications!","One was that their efforts had failed.","They had done all they could to call upon the weavings of that place to take away this being, and yet a part of him still remained and even came to take revenge today!","The other was that somehow, three of the terrifying Calamities to appear in the future were connected.","And the reason that nothing changed even after everything they had done...meant that these Calamites would still unfold in the future!","|Ah...| At this point, the eyes of Pioneer Heracles bloomed with dim radiance as he thought of something.","One of the reasons for the heavy conflicts between the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian and other forces in the Expanse that caused such a widespread war and destruction was because he was hunted by all of these groups for his lineage.","For his blood.","What followed after that was a sequence of events that only led to wars and cataclysm!","He tried to remember.","Where...had the identity of the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian first identified that caused many Palaces of the Expanse to chase after him?","...!","A tinge of pain crossed through his head at this question as he found...that he couldn’t remember.","Their weavings of existence were scrambled with some lost when they crossed Frequencies of Existence to arrive here, and he seemed to have this lost memory as his gaze only became more ashen when he thought of it!","His blue eyes reflected their endless allure within as he found himself asking.","|Was it...us?|","...!","Beside him, the maddened Pioneer shining with white wings, Pioneer Lightsun gazing towards him with confusion as he wondered what he could be mumbling about in a situation such as this!","’Heracles, is it true? What is the history between you three and this being? Is he truly the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian?!’","The voice of Pioneer Lightsun boomed in his mind as Heracles didn’t answer.","He found himself dazed while questioning...whether they were actually the initiators of a terrifying future.","The Calamity that was the Infiniverse Dowager, Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian, and the Instrument of the Beyonder...were they actually the root cause for the progression of events that led to all this?!","But they only moved and made the choices they made due to these Calamities themselves!","|...|","Uncertainty circled around his weavings of existence as he didn’t know how to think about this, but he found himself questioning many things.","He found himself thinking about the Calamities he heard of or saw from a distance.","The Calamity that was the Nine Pointed Star!","The Calamity that was the Great Usurper!","The Calamity that was the Queen of Matter!","All of them...would not be connected in some way, right?"]},{"number":3439,"title":"Chapter 3439: Chapter 3438: The Fragility of Existence! II","paragraphs":["As one man wondered what was and what could be.","As he wondered of the ages past and the ages to come, and how everything was connected, he wondered of many possibilities to the point that he felt like he was going in circles!","As he did all this.","His cerulean pupils reflected the scene around him as terrific power bloomed all around.","A second Pioneer of Existence had appeared far above others here, his visage similar to the one floating right beside him as he had white wings gloriously flowing behind him, a white robe adorning his visage as glorious white flames burned around him.","On the right, a Silver Feathered Phoenix cried out with valor and regality, and lastly, a calm looking man in green robes and a bamboo hat who was gazing at everything with a serene gaze also appeared!","It was all the Pioneers who were called to observe the snapping of the Strings of Existence and report to those above them.","The Silver Feathered Phoenix moved first as she bellowed out.","|Apprehend him!|","WAA!","Not kill him. No collapse of his weavings of existence.","But apprehend.","This single word already showed the stance that these Pioneers were taking after hearing the screeches of Palace Master Antiope!","They wanted to confirm by locking down and apprehend this Instrument of the Beyonder as if he was actually a Megalonian- a resurgence of that ancient race of beings whose destruction paved the way for the birth of many of the current Pioneers and Source Complexity Entities...there were too many possibilities!","SKAA!","The screech of the Phoenix boomed out as her Path was also laid out.","Inviolable in nature, a silver brilliance flashed over everything and everyone here as it was so pristine it seemed like a mirror had appeared and layered itself over everything, and in the next moment...","WAP!","Everything covered by this light disappeared.","Everything the equivalent length of a quarter of an Omniverse nearby!","The other Pioneers. The Palace Masters nearby.","And the Instrument of the Beyonder as well!","It was the brief flash of the Pioneered Path of Dimensionality of the Silver Feathered Phoenix of the Immovable Sacred Palace of the Expanse!","...!","In the depths of the Immovable Palace of the Expanse, others watched such a scene with somber eyes as there were still Pioneers hidden who had yet to make a move.","Outside of the Blancverse domain, the Great Mother became grave at the disappearance of the Instrument of the Beyonder, but she remained right where she stood even under the possible threat of being killed if any of those remaining hidden Pioneers that always stood guard over the Expanse moved!","She had tremendous belief as she remained where she was, gazing deeply into the Blancverse where it seemed like the whole battlefield was moved to a place where none of them could see.","At a corner of the Blancverse where the Great Mother was not looking towards.","There was a figure of a Palace Master who just so happened to have stayed far enough away, and a veil of shadows covered his figure as his pupils shone with a golden glow.","Unbeknownst to all others, this being crushed a jewel in the depths of his heart that sent out a message.","|Weavings of the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian have been discovered. Current position in the Immovable Sacred Palace of the Expanse- awaiting further orders.|","...!","Nobody else was privy to the message this being sent.","Nobody else would even know where it was headed!","But at this moment, this message flashed across multiple strings of existence, bouncing between some and coursing through others as it took exactly 5 seconds.","Five total seconds, and it arrived at an extremely distant place in a corner of the Expanse.","Here, there were Blancverses that didn’t actually have the allure of white, and they were fantastically colored gold as at least a dozen were floating serenely in a formation.","Towards the central Blancverse, a gold light flashed and disappeared towards a starry purple gold sea that covered over half of this domain.","Inside this sea, thousands of massive humanoid bodies of titans could be seen, their skin gold in color as their bodies expressed tremendous regality and power!","This regality was truly hard to imitate or ever fake as it was born within them- carried by their very lineage.","All of these thousands of massive golden titans that seemed to be as big as cosmos if not larger emanated terrific aura of Existence Severing Entities as just in this region, at least above a hundred Pioneers could also be observed.","They were all quiet, and they were all silent as if they were cultivating a grandiose weaving of existence!","At the center of all of these Golden Titans, there was one who opened his eyes with a boom at this moment as silent fluctuations spread out, his weavings accepting a burst of information as his eyes flashed brightly!","|Origin...Sacred Primal...Megalonian...|","His intent was deep as if it had not spoken in quite a long time, and it reverberated out and woke up some of the Golden Titans near him!","His intent was filled with a deep sense of Complexity- as if this being had already grasped a Source.","A low hum reverberated from him as his golden eyes looked around, his bald head filled with visible gold veins turning as he looked at a few Golden Titans before he spoke out.","|I cannot move currently, but go and check the veracity of these rumors regarding the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian. If there is any truth to them...hmm...|","The Golden Titan hummed as he gave the order.","And from the purple gold sea, at least 20 Golden Titans radiating horrific grandeur of Pioneers arose, their gold eyes flashing with brilliant callous light.","They held a deep history with the weavings of Megalonians.","The power they had gained, the war that followed, and the current structure of the Expanse all held some relation to that past event!"]},{"number":3440,"title":"Chapter 3440: Chapter 3439: The Fragility of Existence! III","paragraphs":["From a unique point in the Expanse, 20 Golden Titans rose up and followed a command.","Verify the veracity and truth of the reappearance of the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian.","After all, they couldn’t just go on the word of someone who may just be using this as a tactic to wipe out their enemy!","And yet the weavings of the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian were important enough for 20 Pioneers to be deployed for confirmation!","Their orders were simple ones.","Contain, apprehend, and verify.","If it truly was the resurgence of the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian, they would be going about things differently than before!","In the past, due to how shockingly effective the effects of Megalonians were on elevating the existence of those who devoured them, they were quickly and entirely wiped out.","|But not this time...|","The Source Complexity Golden Titan smiled with a cold expression as he remembered the weavings passed down to him by the most important personage of the Golden Titans.","The personage had stated how he had dreamed of events long past and remembered the Megalonians they destroyed in the Megalos Mountains.","He had especially dreamed of a defiant Megalonian that slipped through his hands.","From the devoured memories of other Megalonians, he found out the identity of that Megalonian to be...Pyrrhus!","The only Megalonian who was not devoured back then.","The one who dissipated his own existence defiantly!","From this recent dream of that important personage, word was passed down to all their forces to pay attention to any news regarding Megalonians.","It was why based on rumors alone, he deployed 20 Pioneers of Existence!","Because the weavings of that important personage were never wrong, and he may have already discovered something way before others even began to live it.","But no.","There would be no swift death of the Megalonian this time around, if they really did exist.","There would be...a cultivation of more Megalonians. To raise more of them! To have an endless source of Megalonians that reproduce over time!","|A Farm raising Megalonians...how glorious would such a thing be? Would we still be limited to a single Frequency of Existence after that? Having to listen to the snobbish Watchers of the Wheelomachy, or choose between following the orders of the Logos of the Wheel? No, no, no....at such a time, our influence would be entrenched across different Frequencies of Existence, different Spokes of the Wheel!|","...!","His eyes portrayed shocking greed amidst their calmness.","Advancing their complexity even past a Pioneer of Existence alone was far too extreme of a difficulty.","For the vast majority who arrived at the stage of Pioneers alone, they were stuck there.","Pioneering a path alone was hard enough as at this point, one had severed themselves from Existence as they were walking on an untrodden path.","As if they could only see a few inches ahead of them, and were blind of everything all around.","Even the most exceptional geniuses could simply only continue to reinforce their path. Very few would be able to find the Source!","And for those who did find the Source...they didn’t even need to have their difficulties mentioned.","They needed something to spur them.","A catalyst!","Over the eons, the Megalonians...were known to be a perfect Catalyst.","Many Pioneers were born from their massacre. Multiple Source Complexity entities arose from their ashes!","So this time around...expectations were high.","|Let us see...let us see!|","Almost as if this unfathomably powerful was giddy, he waited!","From the Immovable Sacred Palace of the Expanse, there wasn’t only a single spy who observed the happenings and spread the word.","There were many others as word spread quickly- word of the rumor of the resurgence of the weavings of Megalonians!","Whether others believed they were true or not, they had to investigate.","And all of it...stemmed from a single Palace Master who in her fear of what was to come, linked two Calamities together.","For them to be visited by another Calamity hours after they dispatched two of them? For the Instrument of the Beyonder, an Outerversal Morphon, to display a similar golden Wheel just like the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian, and then for him to come specifically for the three of them?!","A Palace Master whose head was already filled with fear of brutality regarding Calamities they had met like the Infiniverse Dowager and the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian, or Calamities they had only heard records of like the Instrument of the Beyonder, the Nine Pointed Star, the Great Usurper, or the Queen of Matter.","They took a shot in the dark- a gamble, and the results would forever be etched in stone. Whether they were right in their assumption or not!","—","|What are you, really?!|","Under the unique isolated space brought to fruition by the Pioneer of Dimensionality.","Five Pioneers of Existence were locked in this space that currently seemed to be the size of half an Omniverse, along with a few dozen Palace Masters!","The Silver Feathered Phoenix radiated waves of brilliance that seemed capable of cutting apart everything as she continued.","|Your weavings are those of an Existence Severing entity, but I’ve noticed that the level of complexity directed towards you from even Pioneers...is capped to be at a maximum level comparable to Existence Severing! Is this your power? How long does such a thing last? Did you believe that just because others cannot momentarily attack you with complexity above your current stage, you could safely taunt and stand against Pioneers?!|","Her words were sharp as her power bubbled, a million silver mirror-like needles forming all around as her body burned with silver flames!","She looked at Ozymandias.","And Ozymandias looked at her along with all other entities locked with him in this isolated space.","He thought of the words of this Pioneer who tried to break down the workings of his Quintessential League of Existence as he nodded with a smile.","|Almost right about a few things. I will let you know that currently, you all stand in a different league of Existence entirely. To survive in this league, one had to be...Quintessential. Unrivaled at the same stage. If not, then many of you are about to understand something that many entities untouched by mana feel on a daily basis. You will feel...the fragility of your existence!|","WAA!"]},{"number":3441,"title":"Chapter 3441: Chapter 3440: The Fragility of Existence! IV","paragraphs":["Cheats had designed and put into place something to ensure fairness and unfairness at the same time.","A league of existence where all others were restricted to the same level of strength as him!","It was applicable to Pioneers to an extent, but if an entity even higher in complexity than this appeared within the periphery of the Quintessential League of Existence, this effect would be much lower.","It wouldn’t be as absolutely carried out for entities such as those, which for example would be someone like Barbatos.","A Source Complexity entity!","Because of this, the backer behind the Quintessential League of Existence that was being designed, refined, and extrapolated more even at this time had to get more powerful.","If Cheats had undergone five Severings and became able to do this, it needed to undergo even more!","After all, unlike others, nothing stopped him from continuing to Sever his weavings of existence multiple times over.","If greater and greater amounts of complexity were the goal, why not continue severing his Ordinances another 10 times? Another 30 times?","With every Severing, there would be an increase in complexity while it became further and further away from the weavings of existence themselves.","As he thought of this, the number buzzing within the weavings of cheats was a simple one.","81.","This was the number of Severings he thought was obscene yet viable enough to do for every concept.","While others severed their singular weavings of Existence once, his goal would be to sever his over 100 different weavings 81 times each- with Cheats being the first!","It was a grand undertaking as to do this, more Blood of Pioneers was needed.","That’s why...","|Come!|","BOOM!","Cheats bloomed out in exuberance as he ignored the other Pioneers, instead going towards his target here and the only dazed Pioneer who seemed to be thinking of too many things.","But...Pioneers were Pioneers even if they were being restricted to lower level weavings of Complexities.","|Answer me!|","WAA!","The Silver Feathered Phoenix cried out with regality as a silver mirror appeared in front of Pioneer Heracles, his body flashing and disappearing as her body flashed to appear where he was instead.","Her demeanor was dominating as her eyes flashed out, the weavings of existence in front of Ozymandias turning into shards of sharp silver shattered weavings of existence that surged towards him dangerously!","A golden Wheel appeared around his body and spun, the sea of Outerversal Authority and tentacles leaking out from him also seeking to taint as a booming impact echoed out.","The attack was heavy, and Ozymandias was stopped in place without being able to advance.","The scaling of power of these Pioneers was still far too high even after it was brought down in complexity!","|Boy, will you not answer?!|","The white winged Pioneers now appeared together, the white flames burning around them seething as they gazed out coldly.","Both Pioneered similar paths, but with slight variations.","One Pioneered the path of CHI, while the other pioneered the path of QI!","At this moment, their bodies pulsed with heaviness as akin to Haki being spread all around and putting pressure on everything nearby, their complexities descended all around!","Even the other Palace Masters felt stifled as they stayed to the side, and the Pioneer of QI made a move this time as he called out calmly.","|True QI Convergence Sword Art- Cut!|","TING!","His body moved like countless sharp blades.","Milky white sword lights shot out like a volcanic eruption as they were far too fast, every single one converging onto the rotating golden Wheel around Ozymandias as...","BOOM!","The Wheel was forcefully shattered, the hand of the Pioneer of QI being inches away from Ozymandias himself as a cutting force caused faint marks to appear on his body, a heavy force smashing him backwards!","|Hmph!|","The Pioneer of QI harrumphed domineeringly.","|Just because of a little imposition of a domain, you think you can reach the heights of a Pione-...!|","His words stopped.","Where his hand had struck out against Ozymandias, he saw that somehow, at a certain point in time, a cut had appeared.","And around this cut, silent, translucent tentacles that he only just noticed now were sucking out his Blood!","|Impudent!|","A burst of QI erupted from him as all invisible tentacles were crushed, his surroundings revealed to have thousands of such tentacles just waiting for someone to come near Ozymandias!","They eerily waved around as the mass of Black tentacles shooting from behind were merely a distraction.","|I told you.|","WUU!","In the distance, the visage of Ozymandias stopped after receiving the impact from the Pioneer of QI, tentacles converging towards his palm and releasing droplets of crimson gold blood that formed into a single Globule of Blood of a Pioneer.","|I will truly show you the Fragility of Existence today.|","The dazzling crimson gold Globule disappeared into his palm right after, and it was directed towards a single thing alone as at this moment, Cheats began to undergo its Sixth Severing!","OOOH!","Opposite him, the Pioneer of QI was enraged as he bellowed out, stellar white rivers erupting around him commandingly before he surged out again!","In the midst of all this.","Pioneer Heracles was now near Palace Master Antiope and Nisa, their expressions all different as Antiope healed herself while breathing haggardly.","Near them, the calm looking Pioneer in green robes and a bamboo hat had a gaze of serenity as he smiled while looking at them.","|So, Heracles, Antiope, Nisa. What’s the backstory here? We accepted you all into our folds because of your uniqueness and power, but you didn’t tell us anything regarding this. Instrument of the Beyonder? Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian? What is all this about?|","...!","Unlike other Pioneers, this calm looking man radiated a silent and harmless air, but he was also known as the Immovable Sacred Guard!","His harmless air was something many had fallen to before as Heracles himself did not let his guard down around this being as he frowned.","What could they say? What could they even reveal?","When it came to different Frequencies of Existence, Entanglements and many other intricacies made things very difficult.","As he pondered how to navigate this, someone else didn’t do as much pondering as Palace Master Antiope began to speak.","|That is a vile creature that only knows and seeks destruction. He is going to become a @%$&$-...!|","Palace Master Antiope stopped as it looked like she had begun speaking gibberish.","She was about to reveal his future status as a Calamity and what many others would come across, but she found herself unable to do so as if her words were being filtered!"]},{"number":3442,"title":"Chapter 3442: Chapter 3441: The Fragility of Existence! V","paragraphs":["Filtered.","This was exactly the feeling that Palace Master Antiope felt as when she tried to speak about events and things that she had experienced herself, they seemed like a distant memory.","Ever since they came into this unique frequency, escaping from the violence and decimation carried out by calamities like the Infiniverse Dowager, part of their memories were already fractured.","And now she couldn’t even speak about it?","She looked at the man in the bamboo hat as she tried to open her mouth again.","|The Instrument of the Beyonder is a @$&$#...!|","Once more, filtered.","She became terrified at such a reality as she looked up all around her, as if there was an unseen force that even she did not understand playing a hand in everything.","The Immovable Sacred Guard looked at this scene as his eyes lit up with understanding and recognition.","|I see, you three are not from this frequency of existence.|","...!","Words that caused their expressions to rapidly change echoed out from the Immovable Sacred Guard.","This entity who remained calm without a change in expression as he nodded and looked towards Ozymandias.","|When it comes to dealing with intrusions and entanglements in different Spokes of the Wheel, a lot of people don’t know just what truly goes into play.|","He seemed to speak from experience and knowledge as if this was something that he knew of to an extent.","|The Wheel of Existence is something that we know frighteningly little about. The Wheel spins as the Wheel spins, its workings unknown to our eyes. If it is something that goes against the weavings of the Wheel, one will come to find that no matter how much you try to go against it, it is as if you’re going against the Wheel itself. Words will fail you. Information that should not be spread will not be spread unless your complexity is extremely high. Even you cannot escape this. You all likely come from a Frequency of the Wheel that has experienced a few things. You think that you came here or arrived here out of your own volition or understanding- I’ll be the first to tell you that you are where you are because that is where you need to be.|","...!","|You only came to this Frequency of the Wheel because that was what you were supposed to do. Palace Master Antiope here spoke about the Instrument of the Beyonder possibly being the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian, because she was supposed to. And now, here we all are- just as we are supposed to. I have found out about your indiscretion, and after this, I will report it to the Watchers who observe and ensure that the right people are in the right Frequencies of the Wheel. You three would likely be returned right here you came from, so do not despair and just hang tight.|","Terrifying words left the mouth of the Immovable Sacred Guard as the last sentence caused even Pioneer Heracles to shiver.","They could not go back. Never!","BOOM!","With an eruption of magnificence, Pioneer Heracles shot upwards- crossing through the silver brilliance that the Pioneer of Dimensionality laid down. His purpose was singular: to leave everything behind!","At such a scene, the Immovable Sacred Guard only shook his head as a terrifying aura erupted from him.","In the far distance, the weavings of Ozymandias became even more complex as from behind- tens of thousands more obsidian tentacles erupted out!","The Quintessential League of Existence only became more potent under the additional severing of cheats- its effects applied even more thoroughly.","But much more was required.","He gazed at the pioneers of CHI and QI who now stayed side by side as they bellowed out.","|Move together!|","The Pioneers were not easy targets as at this point in time, Ozymandias could only injure them.","The Paths they Pioneered were still distinct and far too complex even under the effect of the Quintessential League of Existence!","So he needed something even more unique than what they held to handle them while snipping away at their blood.","|The weavings of Cheats call upon the ever-silent deadly weavings of Plot.|","His mind buzzed with ideas and possibilities as after the Sixth Severing, Cheats proceeded to add another clause under the quintessential league of existence.","|The feature of the Plot of Tragedy has been incorporated into the Relegation Zone of Existence.|","|Under the Relegation Zone of Existence, a single Ordinance or Path of both the enemy combatants and yourself can be momentarily nullified by the alteration of the ongoing Plot. Both sides must be made aware of this weaving before it is carried out, and the Ordinance or Path that is the source of the Quintessential League of Existence is an exception. Once nullified, the selected Ordinances or Paths will remain in this state unless either side has their weavings and complexity perish.|","...!","A glorious new ruling under the banner of a Quintessential League of Existence!","A ruling of sacrifice on both sides.","And Ozymandias deployed it right away as at this moment, a bright fluctuation of intent echoed out for every single entity in this space.","Now, this intent was easy to understand and every single entity was told exactly how they worked.","The Pioneers were enraged at it as it seemed infallible, and so they moved quickly.","|Your weavings of Outerversal Authority are null and void!|","The Pioneer of CHI bellowed out as shockingly, every single tentacle and the budding black sea of obsidian majesty disappeared in an instant.","All Outerversal authority was gone!","Ozymandias smiled at this and nodded.","|Understandable.|","...!","And he disappeared right after.","When his massive figure reappeared, he was far above this Domain of Dimensionality as his figure appeared in front of Pioneer Heracles.","Someone who was currently trying to leave this place after hearing the words of the Immovable Sacred Guard.","His eyes turned livid with power and a sense of madness as he raised his hand up, the brilliance of purple blue majesty seeking to erupt as his Pioneered Path of Time was about to reverse everything.","But...","His purple blue radiance flickered and did not unfold.","Above him, Ozymandias looked down coldly as his intent weaved out.","|Your path was never active this whole time.|","...!"]},{"number":3443,"title":"Chapter 3443: Chapter 3442: The Fragility of Existence! VI","paragraphs":["Plot deemed it so.","Thereafter, a heavy glow of gold erupted out as an intricate golden wheel moved from the body of Ozymandias and descended unto Pioneer Heracles as if it were a cutting disk.","ZING!","It was far too quick.","In the span of an instant, the golden wheel passed from the head of a pioneer and cleaved all the way through.","The eyes of Pioneer Heracles irradiated a tremendous blue light as he could only watch without understanding exactly what was unfolding.","Thereafter, his body was cleaved in half as gushes of blood erupted out!","|You should not have done what you did, O Pioneer Heracles.|","The only thing he heard was the voice of a calamity that he only heard about, but he could swear that it held the musings of a calamity that he had previously met!","The scene was a terrifying one as right after, the geysers of erupting crimson gold blood of Pioneer Heracles were pulled up by a terrific suction force from the visage of the Instrument of the Beyonder.","Without the protection of his path, Pioneer Heracles still observed everything occurring in a daze!","The calamities that he ran away from in a long distant past and future. The Calamities that he told Palace Masters Antiope and Nisa to never underestimate.","He told them again and again that these entities defied existence itself to the point that when you thought they were dead, they somehow weren’t, and even if they were actually dead, somehow- there was another part of them that came to haunt them!","This was exactly what they were.","Calamities.","And if the words of the Immovable Sacred Guard were to be believed, everything was playing out exactly as it should have.","Was it truly so? Was he and Palace Masters Antiope and Nisa just pawns to initiate everything?","Was he...supposed to have the complexity that he had worked hard to raise up again collapse right here?","Who got to decide this? What should happen and should not happen? Even though he had Severed himself from Existence itself and Pioneered his own Path of Time, he still couldn’t carve out his own future?!","He wanted to say that he did not accept this.","He wanted to do many things.","But all he saw was the dominating visage of the Instrument of the Beyonder as only regrets remained.","’Maybe...we should have left the calamities alone...’","This thought passed through his mind as he wondered how things would have played out differently.","As he saw his blood being gathered by the Instrument of the Beyonder, he couldn’t help but utter out his intent.","|You...are just a pawn in all this as well, you know?|","A pawn.","If things were playing out as they should have always played out, then weren’t even the Calamities mere pawns of something larger? The Wheel? Or something else entirely?","Yet towards his words, Ozymandias only smiled and shook his head.","BOOM!","Between them, a bamboo hat appeared that obscured the gaze of Pioneer Heracles, a multicolored brilliance flashing between him and the Instrument of the Beyonder as they were pulled apart.","The Immovable Sacred Guard floated there, gazing straight towards Ozymandias calmly as he watched the dazzling globules of blood disappearing into his body.","|You seem to really like devouring the Blood of others. Of course, I can’t allow you to freely do so.|","...!","The blood of others. The globules of the blood of Pioneers of Existence!","Ozymandias was about to decimate the core Entity responsible for sending his other half into Hell Terra Firma as the major thing he did was collect his blood and weavings!","And oh, did he gain a lot!","|18 Globules of the Blood of the Pioneer of Time, Heracles, have been obtained.|","The prompt flashed in his mind as right away...","’11 to continue Severing Cheats. One to Quintessence, one to Ingeniare, one to Plot, one to Loot, one to Infinity, one to Mana, one to Runes.’","HUUM!","His surroundings trembled tumultuously.","His already radiant figure began to emanate an astounding allure of magnificence.","His complexity began to shoot up exponentially!","ZIING! ZIING!","As if multiple different things were being cut within the depths of his existence, as if multiple sources were being severed.","He extended this severing from just Cheats alone as he also elevated and granted a huge jump onto a few key concepts.","Since he had many, let him use many!","Since Mana made it possible to transform and change every single ordinance into one and allowed the declaration of his many ordinances, let it also be raised ever higher!","|The Weavings of Quintessence have undergone their first Severing of Existence!|","|The Weavings of Mana have undergone their first Severing of Existence!|","|The Weavings of Infinity have undergone their first Severing of Existence!|","|The Weavings of Runes have undergone their first Severing of Existence...!|","One by one, seven more Ordinances were severed.","BOOM!","His own body erupted with multicolored radiance as he stared at the man in the bamboo hat down below.","He stared at the bisected body of Pioneer Heracles as he was caught by the Pioneers of CHI and QI, their faces livid while gazing in his direction.","As the very density and complexity of his existence surged up, Ozymandias looked at the many changes blooming within this isolated Dimensionality as his intent weaved out.","|Look at how fragile existence is. At the nullification of a single Path of a Pioneer, and that was it. His whole complexity, all of his weavings...reduced to absolutely nothing- a mere fraction of what it was before.|","WAA!","The figure of Pioneer Heracles was nearly decimated, but his weavings were still there.","|If a Pioneer of Existence can be this fragile, what about mere Existence Severing entities? What about these oh-so-prideful Palace Masters of the Immovable Sacred Palace of the Expanse?|","He looked around at the distant figures of Palace Masters- especially Palace Master Antiope and Nisa, who trembled with visible fear while gazing at the nearly decimated visage of Heracles!"]},{"number":3444,"title":"Chapter 3444: Chapter 3443: Pawns! I","paragraphs":["Fear was a curious thing.","In many people, fear gave way to recklessness, weakness, and madness. Fear was a gateway for many, many bad choices.","Three entities, in particular, feared the identity and very being of what they knew to be a Calamity.","So as they watched with their own eyes as one of them- the most powerful among them, almost decimated by one of the calamities they escaped from, their fear reached unprecedented levels!","|We must leave!|","Palace Master Nisa bellowed out.","At the same time, the bloodied figure of Palace Master Antiope looked towards the Silver Feathered Phoenix as she pleaded.","|O Pioneer of Dimensionality, please release us from this domain. If you all must stay, that is more than okay, but please let us return to the Immovable Sacred Palace!|","...!","They plead.","Existence Severing Palace Masters pleaded to be taken out of the same enclosed domain as the instrument of the Beyonder!","The silver eyes of the Pioneer of Dimensionality flashed with disdain and distaste as she harrumphed with her intent booming out.","|You all sit on the sidelines as you will be questioned later, and we will get to the bottom of whatever intricacies of connections there are between you and this invader!|","...!","The faces of Palace Masters Antiope and Nisa became ashen as they realized their pleading would get them nowhere.","They wanted to say that for all of them here, there may not be a later. When it came to calamities that defied existence, a future was never guaranteed!","The situation had rapidly changed as at this moment, the Pioneer of Dimensionality was moving alongside the Pioneer of QI and the Pioneer of CHI.","The Pioneer of CHI burned with white flames as a dazzling white Rune began to bloom on his chest, the circulation of his weavings reaching unprecedented levels as he called out heavily.","|This invader has laid down a fairly powerful domain that seems to be moving alongside him. A domain capable of even affecting Pioneers as entire paths can be nullified within this domain. But as always, for something so powerful, there is a cost. As we have seen, we were able to seal his usage of Outerversal Authority for him to choose the seal of the Pioneered Path of Time under Heracles. Theoretically, he should now be powerless, and yet he isn’t- meaning that this entity is an anomaly that may have another one or two Severed Ordinances. An impossibility, but they may appear from time to time. All that we need to do is to ensure that we seal his remaining paths, and this fight will no longer be a fight!|","A terrifying white eye of existence was burning on top of the Pioneer of CHI as he analyzed many things and laid out a plan.","Ahead of them, the Immovable Sacred Guard remained calm with the same expression on his face as he stared towards Ozymandias carefully.","He stared at the seemingly increased level of complexity around him, his gaze a pondering one as he spoke out.","|The Instrument of the Beyonder, yes? If I can express anything before there is more bloodshed to be carried out, it is that all of this is meaningless in the grand scheme of things. What you do here will not change much. Whether you manage to kill the three that you came to kill- these intruders from different Frequencies of Existence. Whether you are an intruder yourself that has chased them here. Whether you manage to hurt me or any of the other Pioneers of the Immovable Sacred Palace of the Expanse who are currently here...it will change nothing in the grand scheme of the Wheel of Existence.|","His gaze was utterly serene. His eyes pulsed with a verdant light of brilliance as he seemed to gaze at everything with apathy and interest at the same time!","He smiled towards Ozymandias and continued.","|Do you know of the countless records just in our Frequencies of Existence? Of the powerful entities within this frequency that are more powerful than me or you? Do you know what they have managed to change in regard to the Wheel of Existence over the eons? Absolutely nothing. The Wheel turns as the Wheel turns, all of us being mere pawns in the grand scheme of things as the most that we can do is sit back, relax, and enjoy.|","...!","His words even caused the other Pioneers and Palace Masters to change.","Ozymandias stared at this unique being with calm eyes as he analyzed the rapid change of his complexity with all of the newly Severed weavings of existence in addition to Cheats continuing its Severings.","He looked at this being as a colorless light of Quintessence and Loot began to burn around him, his intent echoing out in reply.","|Of the few things I dislike in all of existence, the idea of being a pawn or someone that merely has to fall in line in some grand destiny... I dislike this the most. I make my choices, then my choices affect the outcomes around me. Just like I gave you all the choice to not get involved and simply give me the three that I came here for- you all made a choice, and now here we are.|","Choices.","Causality!","His words rang out and caused many gazes to change, but the Immovable Sacred Guard actually let out a light chuckle at this moment and nodded.","|Choices, huh? In that regard, you are right. So let me make a choice right here and now. You wanted those three right? I can give you Antiope and Nisa, but I have to keep Heracles for myself. Someone to question when the Watcher gets here. He is half dead anyway with a major part of his weavings taken by you. How does this sound?|","...!","An unexpected proposition came that shocked everyone, cries ringing out from even the Pioneers of QI and CHI!","|O Pioneer of Teleology!|","|Sir, we cannot!|"]},{"number":3445,"title":"Chapter 3445: Chapter 3444: Pawns! II","paragraphs":["Vehement cries echoed out as the other Pioneers of the Immovable Sacred Palace found the words of the Immovable Sacred Guard to be drastic.","To give the Instrument of the Beyonder exactly what he wanted after all that had happened so far?","The thousands upon thousands of Ordinance of Existence and Ordinance Amalgamation entities that had perished within the Prime Immovable Blancverse?!","They couldn’t possibly just move past all of this!","And yet the figure of the Immovable Sacred Guard did not falter.","He even waved his hands right after as the shocked figures of Palace Master Antiope and Nisa were pulled by an undeniable force and flung towards Ozymandias!","BOOM!","His thick arms moved as they grabbed at the necks of the two gorgeous women, their hair dazzlingly falling on his stellar obsidian skin.","Comparing his complexity to them right now was akin to a comparison between a normal human being and an Olympic athlete.","He did not even have to impose the Plot of Tragedy on these beings as his profound weavings of complexity pressed down on them from all around and stopped the eruption of their Severed weavings of Existence.","After all, apart from Cheats, Kuklos, and the currently inactive Outerversal, there were now the Severed Weavings of Quintessence, Mana, Loot, Runes, Ingeniare, Plot, and Infinity cycling through him!","He grabbed and contained their weavings of existence as he saw the waves of fear and terror in their eyes, their figures trying to turn around to look at the Pioneers and even the Palace Masters behind as they wanted to beg.","Ozymandias stared at the entity that had made a different choice as he hummed and thought to himself.","|Different choices were made. Does this change the outcome?|","The bamboo hat of the Immovable Sacred Guard shone with a dim luster as he raised his hands towards the angry Pioneers behind him and stopped any eruption of authority.","And behind him, the Pioneer of CHI wanted to say that they could play along and utilize the rules of the unique domain that the Instrument of the Beyonder had laid down. They would only have to nullify one or two more Ordinances of this being and he would not be able to even fight against them anymore!","And yet he saw that the Immovable Sacred Guard remained staunch in his position as if he knew something that they did not.","|Interesting.|","Ozymandias voiced out as from his hands, colorless chains of severed Quintessence flowed out freely and wrapped around the figures of Palace Master Antiope and Nisa, their bodies becoming entirely covered by this silver light before they disappeared right after!","He had many questions.","Their weavings and records would have some answers.","As for Pioneer Heracles...his weakening Pioneered Path of Time was continuing to collapse as even if he didn’t die, Ozymandias would regain the nullified cost of Outerversal soon!","He looked at the Immovable Sacred Guard as this entity had made an entirely different choice. He looked at the figure of Pioneer Heracles who was barely hanging on to life as he gauged how much time it would take and nodded.","|The entanglement between us is not one that is irredeemable. We can stop here.|","He didn’t crave baseless violence. He came for what he wanted, and he got it. But even with all of this, he didn’t doubt that even if he was not looking for any enemies, many more than those who were here would come to find him.","After all, the shrewd woman who was the Palace Master Antiope had called to everyone that he was the resurgence of the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian!","Cause and effect.","With just that alone, there could be a stream of enemies that came for him. The only thing he had to do was to ensure his survival as he needed to empower the Quintessential League of Existence so that entities with extremely complex weavings of existence would not be able to ignore or mitigate the effects.","At this unfolding of reality, the Immovable Sacred Guard nodded and smiled as he spoke out to the Pioneer of Dimensionality.","|Let us return to our original location. The fight here has ended.|","His voice was inviolable.","The other Pioneers were frustrated as they looked with glaring eyes towards Ozymandias, but they could not do anything to go against the words of this man before them. Was he not curious to affirm the veracity of whether this being truly had connections to the Megalonians?","They had many questions, but they moved to do what they were told as the silver brilliance of mirrors pulsed all around the surroundings.","In an instant, weavings distorted as everyone found themselves back on the Prime Immovable Blancverse.","And yet... the weavings of the surroundings were unfathomably heavy.","The members of the Immovable Sacred Palace of the Expanse could be seen within as three more veiled Pioneers were now floating within the Prime Immovable Blancverse and staring outwards.","Their appearance also caused many eyes to land on them as the surrounding reality gradually became clear.","Outside of the Blancverse, the figure of the Great Mother was trembling as a man with a muscular visage floated above her- bronze chains emanating from him and piercing her tentacled figure!","He radiated the aura of the Pioneer as he looked into the Prime Immovable Blancverse with curiosity.","He wasn’t the only one here as in the surroundings of the Immovable Sacred Palace of the Expanse, the auras of multiple different weavings of existence could be felt ranging from Ordinance Amalgamation all the way to Pioneers.","The word that was spread by Palace Master Antiope had gone far and wide.","Ozymandias looked outside of the Blancverse Domain of the Immovable Sacred Palace of the Expanse and felt the many auras dangling out there as he hummed and smiled.","His wings, Invictus Maximus, vibrated behind him with the allure of Causality.","Cause and effect!","It all went hand in hand as he would never have a shortage of those throwing themselves at his feet as enemies!","|My oh my, we seem to have gained a great deal of guests in our very short absence.|","The intent of the Immovable Sacred Guard echoed out as he looked around with a smile.","Around the Immovable Sacred Palace of the Expanse, he could already pinpoint Entities from ancient forces stretched out across the Expanse- their history deep and their complexity immeasurable!"]},{"number":3446,"title":"Chapter 3446: Chapter 3445: Identity! I","paragraphs":["The scene was one that could be etched down in history!","Rarely did the glorious factions stretched out across the Expanse gather together, such a thing only occurring for truly momentous occasions or when gathered by a truly complex force.","A terrifying war.","A banquet hosted by utterly terrifying Source Complexity entities.","A complex force.","At this moment, there was a single complex force that gathered every single entity here.","He looked around him- at the myriad of entities that he had never met before nor had he ever envisioned, and yet at this moment they stood and gazed towards his direction.","As if they all knew exactly who their target here was- as if his very image had been plastered all around!","In such a situation, the Immovable Sacred Guard gazed at everyone as if he was welcoming gracious guests.","|I would invite you all into our little Blancverse, if only I knew the cause of why everyone is gathered here. I wonder what it could be?|","His eyes were smiling dangerously, and at the same time, they seemed cold and callous as they affirmed there were truly too many spies in his Immovable Sacred Palace of the Expanse!","For all of these forces to have been gathered here after the mere mention of the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian?","|Do not play games O Pioneer of Teleology. Were you able to confirm the words of your Palace Master? That this man is indeed connected to the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian? And how is it that your people came to know of such a thing?|","A booming voice that caused the outer ring of the Blancverse to tremble from its sheer complexity alone echoed out.","It belonged to an entity that looked like a massive tree the size of the cosmos- with a radiant and majestic face present on the center of the trunk of this tree!","It was an Elder Eonic Ent of the End!","It radiated the aura of a Pioneer as behind it, three other Pioneers and over twenty-five Existence Severing Eonic Ents of the End could be seen, each one shimmering with gold-green radiance.","The Immovable Sacred Guard looked towards this extremely complex being as he shrugged.","|How am I to know the answers to such questions? I find it odd that none of you direct these questions to the man himself. He is right here- the so called Instrument of the Beyonder. The entity that the Outerversal Morphons have been waiting for. Apparently, from the words of a single Existence Severing entity, he also happens to be the Reincarnated Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian. I do not know whether this holds any merit.|","...!","A silent smile remained on the face of the Immovable Sacred Guard as he stated this.","And the gazes of many entities came to lock onto Ozymandias’ figure as an immense silence settled in.","Within this silence...","HOONG!","A deep horn resounded as if it was amplifying the arrival of a truly complex form of life.","The gases of many changed at the blaring of this horn as they also turned their eyes in the distance to observe the procession of twenty dazzling Golden Titans.","Each one radiated a horrific aura of a Pioneer of Existence, but there was one Golden Titan in particular who seemed to excel all others.","This Golden Titan had a single eye pulsing with crimson gold light, a flaming gold crown swirling above him as he wielded a pillar made of trillions of golden suns in his hands.","His mere arrival expressed shocking dominance as he looked into the depths of the Blancverse and honed in on the visage of the Instrument of the Beyonder, his intent booming out.","|It is stated that you are the resurgence of the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian, do you deny it?|","WUU!","His intent alone, what’s so powerful, that his last few words hung in the air and repeated themselves again and again.","Do you deny it?! DO YOU DENY IT?!","...!","Yes.","A simple way for many to ascertain was for this being to say that it was all nonsense.","That it was merely a ruse from his enemy.","And yet...","Ozymandias smiled.","He didn’t gaze at the Golden Titan that had just spoken, nor did he gaze at the myriad of other forces that had arrived here.","His gaze landed on the Pioneer who currently bound down the Great Mother. The only follower who came with him to wage what seemed to be like the pointless war not too long ago.","Who said a Pioneer could bully her and hold her life in his hands?","His weavings began to burn as he did not give anyone an answer. He did not deny the assertions that he was the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian, nor did he bellow out in affirmation that he indeed was what he was accused of being!","|When it comes to such an issue, why would one remain silent? The cleanest way is to obtain and secure his weavings of existence! No more of this back and forth!|","In the distance, the visage of a Nine-Headed Omnivodragon bellowed out as behind it, variations of the regal lineage of Dragons were present.","Different weavings of existence held different views on how things should unfold.","And those who held the most complexity would decide exactly how things unfolded!","|Now, now...|","In this already chaotic situation, another voice rose to prominence as from a corner of the Expanse; golden strings became tainted black as a sea of Outerversal Authority surged forth.","Millions of tentacles flowed out freely as the auras of multiple Pioneers filled with horror inducing power bloomed, a titanic Outerversal Morphons with the face of a squid and a humanoid body floating forward while the tentacles on his face twisted into a smile!","|Do none of you think the Eldritch Palaces of the Expanse will have no say as to what happens to one of our own?|","...!","Weavings of Matter were already involved.","Now, weavings of Dark Matter also began to intertwine as an already chaotic situation deteriorated at a rapid pace!"]},{"number":3447,"title":"Chapter 3447: Chapter 3446: Identity! II","paragraphs":["Noah did not actively seek out trouble or enemies.","But they always seemed to have a way of finding him.","He had only arrived in the expanse as he focused on himself and understanding exactly where he was at.","Thereafter, he met Bob, and then an array of existences who sought to claim the Blancverse that he had attained.","It became a source of great conflict as a Daughter of Existence perished due to her greed, such a thing causing his weavings to be brought to the attention of forces within the Immovable Sacred Palace of the Expanse.","Within the expanse, there were the Pioneer Heracles and two Palace Masters who then proceeded to carry out an irreversible act against him by sending the other half of his existence to a place that was barren with any authorities!","In retaliation, the other remaining half of his existence went to collect these debts as a conflict sparked with all of the Immovable Sacred Palace of the Expanse.","From this conflict, the distinction of the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian was uttered, whether truthfully or not.","And now, here they were.","Entities from ancient Palaces of the Expanse making their appearance, to the extent that even those stemming from the Source of Dark Matter appeared!","It looked like an existential keg about ready to explode as many eyes circled through the surroundings, the appearance of more and more Outerversal Morphons blooming behind the vibrant Outerversal Sea that was tainting the golden strings of existence in the distance.","Their intentions were not entirely clear at this moment, but all those gathered here...were here for the singular possible weaving of a Megalonian.","That was how pristine a Megalonian was!","In the middle of such a perilous situation.","The man at the center of it all radiated a calm allure of power as he kept his eyes on a bronze shining humanoid Pioneer just outside of the Blancverse who had chains radiating from his body and piercing into the tentacled figure of the Great Mother.","Within him, multiple Severed weavings of Existence swirled as his eyes pulsed with profound epiphanies.","Epiphanies of causality. Of actions and their reactions!","His own complexity seemed to be wriggling- twisting and turning as it achieved greater heights during this whole process!","He began to float towards the Great Mother whose tentacles pulsed defiantly even against a Pioneer, his intent echoing out for all to hear.","|I do not particularly enjoy bloodshed and carnage, but if it comes, I more than welcome it.|","WAA!","His stellar obsidian radiance became even more exotic as the gold black wings on his back pulsed with blasts of grandiosity.","|Let it be known that for anyone here who chooses to point their complexity against me should also be ready for the collapse and decimation of their complexity of existence.|","...!","Short and sweet.","After he finished such shocking words that caused the eyes of many to flash with brilliance, his figure took a step and disappeared!","Instantly!","Cerulean brilliance erupted around his stellar obsidian figure as ignoring everything else, he disappeared like a blinding bolt of complexity towards the Great Mother!","His body subtly changed as over his stellar obsidian skin, Runes of cerulean infinity began to be etched all over.","He held a great deal of complexity. He missed the full weight and tonnage of the Infiniverse Megalos Seed, but he still had the weight of the Secondary Infiniverse Megalos Seed!","At this moment, he was taking the complexity of all of his Severed concepts and layering them with the very weight of Infinity.","Of his endless reserves of mana- where he sought to turn their most profound quality into an indomitable weight of existence!","The density of his body reached unprecedented levels as in his hands, the allure of quintessence shone in the form of two infinity symbols that were grasped in his own two hands.","He grasped the center of the dazzling colourless infinity symbols in each hand as they both seemed like discoid blades ready to cut apart anything they came across!","Within these grasped infinity symbols, illusory Runes of Existence shone with tremendous complexity as each one seemed to represent a different Severed Ordinance of Existence.","He reappeared between the Great Mother and the bronze humanoid Pioneer of Existence like a cluster of an unstoppable force, his hands swinging the infinity symbols that he held as if they were weapons as he cut across the bronze chest of this Pioneer.","A booming impact emerged!","BOOM!","Bronze chains shattered and broke as the eyes of the muscular humanoid Pioneer became stern, his figure smashed back a few miles before he re-oriented himself and looked over.","His body that showed a sense of indestructibility currently had a massive gash across his chest- crimson bronze blood leaking out as around Ozymandias, clusters of blood converged into two dazzling globules that were sucked into his body.","...!","There, outside of the protection of the Blancverse, the regal visage of Ozymandias could be seen.","Cerulean tattoos of Infinity covered his obsidian body as they seemed to be coursing with the weight and weavings of other Ordinances within them, his gaze cold as he stood in front of the Great Mother protectively- having even injured a Pioneer of Existence as his Quintessential League of Existence remained fully active!","When others saw this scene, they were flabbergasted by two things.","One was the fact that this being could push back a Pioneer, and the other...was that he had freely left the security of a Blancverse to appear outside of it.","Was this a foolish action, or was he simply that confident?","He answered them in the next moment as his figure gazed out at the myriad of entities out here.","At the over one hundred Pioneers so far and hundreds of Existence Severing entities!","He looked at all of them as his chest expanded defiantly, his eyes those of valor and might as he bellowed out a challenge to all those here!","|Lets! Fucking! Go!|","HOONG!","A horn blew.","Drums began to resound.","A symphony played as the initiating event to a truly drastic future began to unfold at this very moment."]},{"number":3448,"title":"Chapter 3448: Chapter 3447: A Spark! I","paragraphs":["A symphony.","Nothing else could describe the booming sounds occurring at this very moment as the figure of the Instrument of the Beyonder, who was supposedly the resurgence of the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian- he proceeded to injure and draw blood from a Pioneer of Existence!","He then bellowed out to the masses of other Pioneers in the surroundings.","Over one hundred pioneers","A few hundred Existence Severing entities!","They were all witnesses to this glorious moment where a single entity defiantly rebelled against the masses, and his power was not even something astounding to speak about!","He radiated the aura of Severing even at this very moment, and yet even before Pioneers, he was defiant.","Why was this? What gave this man such complex strength? What gave him the confidence to do such a thing?","None of them knew. None!","Only the man in question knew exactly what he was doing as even while he moved to do this, his weavings were conducting a series of complexities that others could not even imagine.","One of these involved the two Palace Masters that he had captured.","Antiope and Nisa.","Two of the three were responsible for his other half being locked away in a barren place right now.","Over the past few seconds, he proceeded to extend his tendrils of influence into their weavings as when they struggled- he collapsed them entirely!","He wanted their memories. He wanted their weavings of existence, and yet only the Severed Weavings of loot were able to bring about any profound effect.","[Severed Source of Existence]:: The entirety of accumulation of the Severed Weavings of Existence that an entity accumulated. The complexity of this Severed Source is somewhat high, and could be utilized as a base reagent when constructing a unique Rune of Existence, as a tool to Sever a Single Aspect of one’s existence, or as a tool that may be viable in the research of Omniversal Weapons of Mass Destruction...","From a single Existence Severing entity came a single Severed Source of Existence!","It could do the equivalent of a single Drop of Blood of a Pioneer, but it was worthy of its distinction.","Apart from this, there came a few records.","Memories!","The memories he read were scattered in bits and pieces, their weavings being disordered almost as if purposefully- many things were hidden not just from him, but even Antiope and Nisa themselves had lost many of their weavings.","But...he still learned a few things.","One was the basis of their fears.","The reason why the three of them did what they did. Why they wanted to lock him away in a frequency that even they and many others feared!","He caught a glimpse of weavings that foretold how these entities came from an entirely different Frequency of Existence.","He didn’t obtain any actual memories of such a frequency, only scattered summaries of what went on within.","These beings were fearful of calamities- Entities that were considered the bringers of destruction onto entire Frequencies or multiple Frequencies of Existence!","The weavings of Time within some frequencies were much different compared to others as where one was living in at this moment in time could be the past of another frequency that was already advanced by over a thousand or even a million years.","It was undoubtedly hard and unfathomably complex to even try and understand it.","But the core point was that these entities believed that within their frequency- a frequency that seemed to be more advanced in time, someone similar to or exactly the same as Noah and the Infiniverse Megalos Seed...were present and causing destruction!","So they ran from such a calamity.","They arrived within this weaving of existence.","They stayed here for many years as they slowly reclaimed their power- with one of them even attaining his path once more.","But then they caught whispers of his weavings, and they moved to end what they believed to be the source of untold destruction!","And the rest was history.","The largest fear that they had before Ozymandias collapsed their existences was them questioning again and again.","Was this how everything was supposed to play out? That they were the initiators of the event that had the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian hunted by a vast number of factions across the Expanse?","Explore more at empire","There were a lot of questions involving exactly what was happening at this moment in time as this caused Noah’s weavings to also ponder.","He tremendously disliked the idea of a pre-set fate or destiny.","That somehow, he was simply a part of a systematic flow of existence- and that he simply had a part to play.","Unthinkable.","Impossible!","He was no mere character.","He was no single figure in some grand weavings of the Wheel of Existence!","He was Noah Osmont. He was Ozymandias. He was the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian!","He was the Protagonist.","As he arrived at this point, the two globules of blood that he had just drawn from the bronze skinned Pioneer burned within him as he called out vigorously.","|Sever the weavings of the Protagonist. Sever the weavings of Fables.|","...!","What was true and what was false... he would decide for himself.","What actions he carried out...He would decide for himself.","His choices, his decisions, his consequences!","His story.","WAA!","The Severed Weavings of the Protagonist and Fables began to burn and join all others as Cheats remained at the forefront at this moment, with the Quintessential League of Existence burning tremendously bright!","Its effects silently applied across a distance of a single Omniverse, and it covered every single entity in the nearby Blancverse and outside of it.","The Pioneers of Existence may not know it yet, but at this moment, the maximum power they could unleash was that at the peak of Severing.","Of course, depending on the Complexity of the Pioneer and just how far above they were in power, what a single one displayed could be 10 or even 100 times more powerful than another Pioneer that could also exhibit only the peak of power at Existence Severing.","Complexity was unique in this way as even in this Quintessential League of Existence where every single entity fell under the Relegation Zone of Existence, he still had to be careful!"]},{"number":3449,"title":"Chapter 3449: Chapter 3448: A Spark! II","paragraphs":["After all, essentially, a farm of Pioneers were presenting themselves before him.","Mere Blood bags that he could use to obtain as many tools as he needed to continue Severing his concepts again and again!","He had a great deal of concepts where if you just took the round number of one hundred. If he truly wanted to Sever every single one of these one hundred concepts eighty-one times, he would need 8,100 Globules of Blood of Pioneers!","So far, he had barely gotten twice a dozen.","So these entities that looked towards him voraciously, as if he was someone they wanted to eat up.. he looked towards them with a similar gaze as his eyes were filled with even more greed!","To them, there was uncertainty on whether he was who he truly was said to be.","But...he did not have any uncertainty.","He moved with certainty as at this moment, he felt the gaze of the Immovable Sacred Guard frown, his figure that grabbed Pioneer Heracles showing a limp Entity with a haggard appearance as his weavings of existence were collapsing at a rapid rate.","They were sealed, and one side had to perish before the other could fully be unsealed.","This process accelerated as around Ozymandias, the glorious weavings of Outerversal returned.","Stellar radiance bloomed around him as right away, he initiated the Plot of Tragedy!","BOOM!","Weavings erupted out in all directions as all those under the Relegation Zone of Existence were told of the singular rule of the Plot of Tragedy.","When Ozymandias initiated its effects, he could choose a single path to seal, while others could also choose a single path of his to be sealed.","There was no specification on exactly who could make the choice to seal a path of his, and none of them would know exactly which one of them was the one that he sealed the path of.","It was a capability that was extremely dangerous and unfathomable in nature.","The moment these weavings flashed and were explained to everyone here in the span of an instant, their gazes rapidly changed.","Some even radiated tremendous complexity all around them, almost as if to superimpose their own domain onto the Relegation Zone of Existence.","But this was not something so simple as a domain!","It was a different league entirely.","A glorious League of Existence where Noah’s weavings were burning all alone.","His body pulsed with seas of dark Outerversal Authority, hundreds of eerie tentacles erupting behind him as he moved.","|For daring to attack my people, your path is sealed!|","...!","Ozymandias spoke out as he appeared above the bronze skinned Humanoid Pioneer whose eyes currently radiated shock and incredulity at being targeted as the first one, and the fact that truly he felt his path rapidly be enclosed and suppressed on all sides by an undeniable power.","When he saw the rapidly flourishing stellar obsidian sea behind Ozymandias, his own mind moved rapidly as he roared out.","|Your Outerversal Authority is also entirely sealed!|","...!","Yes.","Now, both of them would have sealed paths as the level of complexity they could display would be something much lesser. And-...!","TSING!","The infinity symbols that Ozymandias held in his hands swung a few hundred times in the span of an instant the moment that he arrived before the bronze skinned Pioneer.","As he arrived, the recently returned Outerversal Authority was sealed yet again as this was the first and mainly prevalent path that everybody saw.","Yet even after it was sealed, this was merely a single aspect of the existence of Ozymandias.","His complexity did not whittle down by much at all!","So his hands flashed and swung down a few 100 times in the span of an instant.","In the next moment, the eyes of a Pioneer showed unfathomable shock and rising fear as his body became bisected into a few hundred pieces!","Bisected.","Bisected!","A shocking progression.","A ridiculous reality!","And even within such reality, the Pioneer was still alive. Even now, his weavings were so complex that even after his path was sealed and then his body grievously injured, he was still witnessing everything that happened with his own two eyes.","He came here because he heard of the resurgence of the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian.","His path being sealed and collapsed was not something he ever imagined here!","Crimson bronze blood gushed out as it coagulated into multiple droplets, with a Severed light of Loot flashing on these rivers of Blood as they all converged to form a blood red crystalline gem that was pulled into the hands of Ozymandias.","[Zenith Constellation Source of a Pioneer]:: The culmination of achievement on the path of a Constellation Complexity existence. It is equivalent to 25 Globules of Blood of a Pioneer, or it could be used as a consumable item to spur the formation of the Path of a Pioneer. The formation of such a path is currently not recommended until you can fully undergo Amalgamation with your Severed Sources of Existence and become one with them. Otherwise, the chances of a path failing and collapsing are high. Other methods of utilization include using it as a whole to increase the complexity of any aspect of Existence, not just Ordinances or Paths...","The brilliance of Loot shone and provided a tremendous treasure that when Ozymandias observed its weavings, his heart couldn’t help but ache!","He realized how much he missed Ruination who could have multiplied this loot many times over!","Just thinking of this caused his dying rage towards the dead Antiope and others to begin rising again.","Before him, the bisected body of the Pioneer looked haggard and dim as it slowly began to fall apart","|Impossible...|","His intent barely managed to leak out as many watched from the sidelines.","Stay tuned with empire","They watched as before anyone else could make a move, a Pioneer had already fallen!","Around Ozymandias, the obsidian Outerversal Authority returned once more, and with tremendous vigor at this moment.","His eyes were like devilish serpents seeking prey as they gazed around the others at this moment!"]},{"number":3450,"title":"Chapter 3450: Chapter 3449: A Spark! III","paragraphs":["In the distance, twenty Golden Titans looked at the scene with sharp eyes as the one at the forefront spoke out in a calm voice.","||The power he displays at Existence Severing is something worthy of note, but does not entirely make him the Resurgence of the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian. Observe some more and move in groups. If any single path is sealed due to this unique domain we are all currently in, make sure to protect that person so that he does not fall into the hands of this creature.||","...!","He spoke calmly as in his hands, the stanchion made up of trillions of suns began to radiate a horrific heat, Runes of Existence burning within the depths of this pillar that looked like a massive spear!","The flaming crown above him burned with crimson gold flames, and his single eye and pupil on his head held gold flames burning brightly as he continued.","|For him to utilize these means equates to him having multiple paths. Such types of entities are not entirely rare as there are those who seek to deviate from the norms. Those who do not wish to retain the Purity of Existence when it comes towards the Wheel. Even at this stage of power, they do not understand the cruciality of Purity as even if he has two, three, or even four Ordinances of Existence- if they are all sealed simultaneously, he can be easily captured. So allow him to seal as many others as he wishes. Once he reaches a number where he cannot proceed to seal even more...we will know that all of his Ordinances are inactive. Oh...and no close combat.|","|Yes, Great Marshall!|","The Golden Titan quickly analyzed and began giving out commands as a few other factions did the same.","Under the banner of the Quintessential League of Existence, there was a price to pay to achieve its workings, and this price was made clear for both sides as all forces here understood the Plot of Tragedy.","Yet, none of them could initiate this unless Ozymandias did so himself!","As Ozymandias looked around all the entities here, the latent weavings of the Megalos burned within him as the obsession of Pyrrhus tried to rise weakly.","But it was kept under control as he looked towards the Golden Titans in the distance and proceeded to make more choices regarding which concepts to continue Severing- the battle ahead no doubt being an arduous one!","If he didn’t seamlessly utilize the workings of the Quintessential League of Existence while facing all of these powerhouses here...he may find this body of his destroyed.","From the ashes of the collapsed weaving of a Pioneer, Ozymandias raised his hands and spread them outwards, gazing at all those here as he spoke out with maddening confidence.","|Come at me!|","WUU!","Complex brilliance erupted out as from behind, the body of the Great Mother trembled.","Her tentacles showed great fervor as she continued to display everything here towards the Pantheon of Umbra of the Megalos Beyond!","|The Instrument of the Beyonder continues to exceed all known possible norms! The weavings that the Great Beyonder left behind....we will all be witnesses of their happening!|","Fervor.","Belief.","The Great Mother trembled with these emotions as she continued to spread the word.","In the distance, the spreading Outerversal sea behind newly appearing Outerversal Morphons churned, the squid like humanoid Morphon Pioneer at the forefront smiling as behind him, at least a dozen aura of other Pioneers bloomed.","|Muddy the waters. As dark and muddy as possible. Then...we need to confirm things about this Instrument of the Beyonder!|","...!","Everyone had their own goals and purpose.","Regardless of the faction, it was hard to say which side one truly stood on!","An untold distance away from the blooming and bloody battle.","In an unknown region of the Expanse filled with verdant green vines wrapped around golden strings.","The stellar vines stretched out for countless light years as a region equivalent to ten Omniverses was covered by their brilliance.","Towards the center of the tightly wound region of vines.","A massive Antediluvian Leviathan was seated in a cross legged position as in the next moment, another aura appeared on top of the stellar verdant vine he was on.","The Antediluvian Leviathan opened his serene blue eyes, his dark hair flowing calmly as the new entrant kneeled while releasing a bundle of information and also speaking.","\"We have captured news regarding a possible resurgence of the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian. I do not know if the Master wishes to alter...\"","The new entrant pulsed with an aura of a Pioneer as he kneeled towards the Antediluvian Leviathan who radiated a far more complex aura!","An aura that seemed to state that he had already found the source!","This being accepted these waves of information as he became serious, thinking of many things as he waved his hands to dismiss the one who brought the news.","\"Megalonians...O Omnifather, will this Entanglement never leave you? Even if I send you a message about them now, will it even reach you? Are you still...with us?\"","WAA!","His words held doubts and hesitations as he didn’t know for sure.","But he still moved to send a message regardless!","A Source Complexity entity...sent out a message towards an unknown place, not knowing if it would ever arrive!","—","Megalos Ynnere.","Omniverse of the Protectors.","Inside a certain Library filled with collections of records from eons past.","A woman sat within its depths, her power silent this whole time as at this moment, it began to bubble out.","It was pure obsidian brilliance that leaked from behind her, massive tentacles radiating outwards and coiling with each other like massive snakes as they rose up to form an oval gateway!","Clusters of tentacles wreathed and connected together as in under a minute; they formed a massive oval structure that lit up with hazy black light.","Akin to a thin film of light.","Akin to a portal!","And from it...","WUU!","A massive lifeform of a Wheel that was made up of tentacles came through!"]},{"number":3451,"title":"Chapter 3451: Chapter 3450: A Spark! IV","paragraphs":["It was a terrifying scene.","Something that was entirely out of the norm!","Within the depths of the Omniverse of the Protectors, Outerversal Authority he began to leak out in a maddening fashion as the Great Wheel appeared.","He stepped out of the oval portal as behind him, the auras of thousands upon thousands of Outerversal Morphons blazed and began to come through.","The aura of the Great Wheel stood exploded from Quasi-Ordinance Amalgamation and became fully fledged out, his tentacles radiating might of immense greed and valor as he bellowed out.","|The Instrument of the Beyonder is at this moment being besieged by the forces of Matter from all around. Let us fall in line under the grandeur of the Great Beyonder and fight against the forces of Matter ourselves, let us not sit still and do absolutely nothing!|","OOOOH!","His bellows came alongside a burst of eldritch horror, and the tide of an expanding sea of Morphons exploded out into the Omniverse of the Protectors.","A distance away.","The Shield of the Commonwealth, Old Man Eudemus, was sitting opposite a chaotic chess board with all the pieces fallen as he thought about his conversation with a certain man.","And yet, in the middle of his musings, his eyes opened wide as his pupils constricted- his figure rising and looking out into the distance as his face became enraged and he bellowed out angrily.","\"Traitorous creature!\"","BOOM!","The weavings of Ordinance Amalgamation of Kuklos erupted out maddeningly, Old Man Eudemus rising and shooting out like a bullet towards a direction that was gushing out stellar black weavings of brilliance!","This was within the Omniverse of the Protectors.","Apart from this location, in other renowned Omniverses under the banner of the Commonwealth.","As if there were already seeds that were only now sprouting.","As if they had been prepared and were silently waiting this whole time!","Inside of an Omniverse where the main body of the Viceroy was located.","Grandiose golden towers stretched out across a stellar expanse of Cosmos, the regality and wealth being unmatched as hundreds of golden white vessels moved all around.","The Omniverse of the Commonwealth.","Omniverse X-1!","In the heart of the Commonwealth, a heavy explosion bloomed from one of the grandiose golden towers, Outerversal Authority spilling out endlessly like a sea as an entity with the tentacles of an Octopus rose from this sea with millions of Reapers of Existence.","|Bahaha! Why did they initiate this after such a long slumber? I’ve been itching, but this Great One was not entirely ready!|","...!","The booming intent was vile and filled with power, standing powerfully at...Existence Severing!","Within a core location of the Commonwealth, an Existence Severing powerhouse had actually been slumbering as it now rose with the rest of its forces!","SHIING!","Gloriously, a unique power emerged from the center of Omniverse X-1, the Sword of the Commonwealth appeared as his lustrous gold simian fur-like hairs shone with resplendence.","His gaze was a heavy one as he bellowed out.","|To me!|","...!","In the next instant, figures of Simians ranging from Ordinance of Existence and below appeared, their bodies turning into streaks of light that went on to fuse into his figure!","He used to radiate the aura of Ordinance Amalgamation before, but his complexity began to rise at a shocking pace.","His body enlarged as all around him, hundreds of golden wheels bloomed with fervor!","And from the depths of Omniverse X-1...","AWOOO!","A deep, heavy roar that felt like the waking of an ancient treasure erupted.","Lustrous golden towers parted ways as from the depths, an object that was a hundredth of an Omniverse in size rose up, its brilliance dim as if it was on its last waking days.","It looked like a massive wooden structure, and yet it radiated an air of majesty as when it truly revealed itself, one could see that it was made up of...many strokes.","Strokes that formed a Rune!","|Ha! You all truly held it here! A Piece of a Phantom Trace of the Wheel of Existence!|","The booming voice of the Outerversal Morphon erupting out felt the aura of the shocking treasure that was rising, this Existence Severing entity being unable to hide his sense of trepidation as he prepared.","The treasure that made the Commonwealth what it is today.","Something close to the Wheel of Existence, with some even saying it held its musings more than many other things out there.","A Phantom Trace- a mere piece of it at that!","|Defend!|","|Deny!|","|Protect!|","Intents exploded out as at this moment, from many different areas of the Megalos Ynnere- conflict exploded.","Long rooted seeds emerged as from a single spark in a corner of the Expanse, flames began to spread!","At another point in the Megalos Ynnere, multiple Omniverses were rotating around a single entity that was silent in contemplation at this moment.","The Prisoner.","This silent contemplation of his was one where he went over the meeting with a Source Complexity entity seeking Osmont, and he couldn’t make any headway!","But even this contemplation was short-lived.","His eyes turned sharp as he gazed out towards a far distance, tears blooming all across as the radiance of gold spread out.","From this gold, one massive titan after another appeared as they also looked towards distant areas across Megalos Ynerre, their eyes being capable of observing too many things!","Their auras were all at Existence Severing as they chuckled while looking towards the Prisoner.","|We have been waiting all this time and have begun to feel the auras of some of our descendants fading away. You Leviathans and your Omnifather are creatures that never hold to your promises...so we shall use this chaos blooming across your domains to ask- where are our people imprisoned?!|","...!","Terrific power bloomed as the Golden Titans began to gather and float towards the Prisoner.","They came for their people who were imprisoned for eons, remaining at bay due to the power of the Omnifather!","But very few had heard of anything regarding this man for quite some time.","And now, their imprisoned people began to die as when they felt chaos and Entropy surging, they also made their move!"]},{"number":3452,"title":"Chapter 3452: Chapter 3451: A Spark! V","paragraphs":["They were entrenched in the Megalos Ynnere for a while as they searched for traces of the Antediluvian Leviathans- for the abode of the Omnifather where he had imprisoned their people!","And now, they finally picked up their traces.","The key lay with the man before them as these Golden Titans looked at him cautiously while the one at the forefront harrumphed.","|With those weavings, you’d have to be a Pioneer? Can’t fool our eyes too easily here. But even if you are a Pioneer...we’ve killed a few before.|","...!","The group of Golden Titans were surrounded by a seething light of complexity, golden Runes of Existence that read [FORMATION] blooming around them as a hazy and more massive idol of a golden titan slowly formed!","|So, will we find out about our people before or after your death? Oh, and that is without mentioning whether you want those Omniverses around you to be targeted by us or not. In each one, how many quintillions upon quintillions of lives lie within? All that complexity...it would be a shame if it disappeared with a single impact.|","...!","A single, massive hazy golden titan formed from the group of Golden Titans, a flaming crown floating above its head as golden wings stretched out behind it!","Due to those who made it up, it swirled with the complexity of multiple Severed Ordinances of Existence that could be unleashed simultaneously.","Its expression was an angry one, as the Golden Titans were an extremely loyal and close-knit race.","Their people looked out for each other above all else as most of the time, when they cultivated their complexity, they did so together!","Within their habitats of golden seas, eons could pass as they spent time in groups cultivating.","Searching for their descendants...was a given as they were now at a critical step, and could not fail!","The Prisoner looked at them with a deteriorating expression as his body began to wake from a deep slumber, his complexity exploding out!","It was just another region of the Megalos Ynnere delving into weavings of utter entropy.","Chaos!","When chaos truly unfolded, it seemed to be everywhere.","It was a unique thing how every single chain of chaos could be traced back to a single point, with causality constantly twisted and distorted!","One thing led to another.","Randomness. Uncertainty. Causality.","They seemed to flow and conflict with each other as if one got them under control and understood them to a shocking degree of complexity...","\"They would still be confused at the end of the day...\"","Ozymandias shook his head and breathed out a stellar breath of complexity as he looked at the multicolored sea within the Secondary Infiniverse Megalos.","The design of the Quintessential League of Existence was being utilized at this moment to wage a war against enemies far more powerful than him, but this was not the primary intention of this terrifying league.","One must remember, many parts of Noah’s weavings came together to decide that it should be Cheats who took center stage next to design something that would aid and eventually take his other half out of Hell Terra Firma!","This was the main purpose.","So the Quintessential League of Existence was made to place his weavings in a different League entirely, for him to even overcome the restrictions of Hell Terra Firma!","For a closer look at just which guideline would be critical for this purpose, one must turn to the Banner of Invictus.","Under the Quintessential League of Existence, there was the Relegation Zone of Existence and the Banner of Invictus as the current regulations, with others surely to follow.","The Banner of Invictus seemed simple at first glance.","[Banner of Invictus]:: Any Existence entangled and with a causal relationship with the holder of Cheats will have no barriers or obstacles between the two sides, regardless of distance or even different weavings of existence. If under the influence of the Quintessential League of Existence, one can never leave the Relegation Zone deployed unless the Causality between two sides is settled by any means necessary.","A unique ruling of the League.","One of its most critical aspects was its first sentence!","Anybody entangled or with a causal relationship with the holder of Cheats...will have no barriers or obstacles between the two sides.","No barriers.","No obstacles!","Regardless of distance or even different weavings of existence!","This was the elevated stage of the League Noah’s weavings placed themselves on as of course, there was theory, and then there was application.","Just like how truly powerful Pioneers of Existence could display tremendous levels of power even while under the Relegation Zone of Existence.","Based on Noah’s own complexity- on the Complexity of Cheats, the level and depth at which the Banner of Invictus was applied towards truly complex things varied!","Hell Terra Firma was as complex as something could be if it entirely rejected all authority.","But from the other side of Hell Terra Firma, there were still possibilities of influence!","After all, the uniqueness of the Infiniverse Megalos Seed paved a path of survival.","After all, a Pioneer like Heracles could pull upon his recorded weavings of when they nearly fell into Hell Terra Firma, and he used this to briefly open up its gateway to ensnare his enemies!","Frankly, it was a terrific attack when one thought about it.","Have an enemy? Just send them to Hell Terra Firma and they would die within a hundred years.","But of course, Noah had sensed something coming and moved away.","Others with varying levels of complexity would have also done the same.","It was only with the influence of a Source Complexity entity that Noah and the Infiniverse Megalos Seed were pulled back and held in place long enough for this attack to succeed!","So from other weavings of existence, there was a semblance of an effect.","With enough complexity, things could easily be ensnared into Hell Terra Firma.","And at this moment, the newly elevated Quintessential League of Existence showed its grandeur as above the multicolored sea, a domesticated Golden Eagle silently dove into the sea and disappeared!","...!"]},{"number":3453,"title":"Chapter 3453: Chapter 3452: A Spark! VI","paragraphs":["A Golden Eagle!","An entity that radiated low waves of Mana- something equivalent to Noah’s days as a Hunter on the blue planet that would hold a Rank B or Rank A distinction.","Something with negligible complexity.","Such a thing dove into the multicolored sea and disappeared entirely!","|After 9 successful tests, Master, we can confirm that it is now possible to stably transfer lifeforms with very little complexity into Hell Terra Firma utilizing the Frequency Gateway and have them always appear from the Infiniverse Megalos Seed there.|","|The opposite of leaving Hell Terra Firma through the Frequency Gateway has shown failure every single time as of right now, it is still not possible for any lifeforms to leave Hell Terra Firma.|","|The reduction in quality and quantity of things leaving Hell Terra Firma had also been expanded.|","WAA!","Results, success, and failure all came at once as slowly but surely, he made progress!","He nodded as the words of the Infiniverse Megalos Body continued.","|We have also confirmed the distortion of time between this Frequency of Existence and Hell Terra Firma. It changes every few hours, but this Frequency holds a varying rate of time compared to Hell Terra Firma. During some time period, an hour here may be only a single minute within Hell Terra Firma, or an hour here could be 10 hours in Hell Terra Firma. It seems randomized, but I’ve already begun calculations on the possibility of utilizing the Ordinances of Chronos, Time, Relativity, Entropy, and other viable weavings to distort this process in our favor.|","...!","A distortion of time!","Similar to the fractured memories of Palace Master Antiope and Nisa- these beings lived in a frequency that was supposedly advanced in time.","A similar phenomenon was present here, but it varied.","If they could make it work in their favor, then they could have the days of Hell Terra Firma pass by rapidly while only hours and minutes passed by here.","Events in Hell Terra Firma were naturally slower as his other half was undergoing a true trial of time in that place!","He always moved fast.","He crossed realms that took others years in a matter of days. He conquered entire Galaxies, Cosmos, Existential Domains, and Omniverses in a matter of weeks!","And now, his other half had to be in a place where the hours felt like they moved abysmally slow, with the feelings of hunger and stresses of a normal human being at the forefront.","Even getting sick of the common cold was a possibility for the great Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian- how ridiculous was that?","Ozymandias had already sent over a dense bundle of medications, first aid equipment, and herbs that humans in his home world would have considered extinct that promoted overall health and strengthened immunity to an alarming extent.","Every minute detail was theorized and handled to perfection as the possibilities of mistakes and chance happenings were reduced and controlled greatly","And as a result of all this...","HUUM!","The multicolored sea churned heavily as drops of crimson gold blood rose from it- numbering 15 in total as the amount that could pass through was increased tremendously.","This was the result of the Quintessential League of Existence as it had just begun to express its wonders.","And now that they could accelerate this whole process to a ridiculous degree as Ozymandias waved his hands to obtain the Globules of Blood of Pioneers.","|Let Chronos, Relativity, Time...|","His eyes shone brightly as he commanded for multiple other parts of him to be Severed!","And as this process began, he turned his head towards the side of the Frequency Gateway.","There, dozens of domesticated Golden Eagles and Manabourne Warhorses with feathered blue wings floated.","Further behind them, there was an obsidian blue platform radiating a neon light as on top of it, advanced technological vessels and armaments could be seen!","Since authorities were not viable, he would lean into science and technology fully to dominate.","Advanced Warplanes, Helicopters, and even massive metal constructs that looked like eight-legged spiders hummed with technological brilliance- and this was not to mention the heavy crimson tanks and mortars carrying ammunition that would cause even Dragons to cry!","Yes.","He was already preparing for when he had to face other races that held massive statures.","Dragons.","Titans.","Ents.","Any possibility one could think of was accounted for as what could a dragon with an oversized body do against a fighter jet that could move at Mach 9.9?!","His eyes flashed coldly as his voice boomed out.","\"Let us send the tools to accelerate the domination of Hell Terra Firma...\"","WAA!","To others, Hell Terra Firma was a land to die in.","To him, it was something to Conquer and revolutionize!","All of the advanced technological equipment he prepared held their own supply of fuel and source of power, and on the neon platform of things to send were also Electricity Generators, Batteries, along with Coal, Oil, and Natural Gases in addition to their already built Power Plants to generate seamless electricity!","Electricity was a simple advancement for normal humans, not to mention someone like Ozymandias who could pull from the records of Omniverse X-999 that had multiple advanced technological lineages.","It was the mere conversion of mechanical energy into electrical energy through a turbine generator. He could send forth all of this and an endless supply of fossil fuels, coals, and oil!","It meant that very soon, Hell Terra Firma was about to look very different in the lands that Noah touched.","And his most daring package that he was sending into Hell Terra Firma yet...were the dazzling constructs of white gold humanoid autonomous robots sectioned off in the far back.","Many things had to be prepared for them as around them were also satellites that would be able to map out every single area Noah crossed, and even observe other areas he had not explored!","All of this and more was prepared as he may have gone a bit overboard, but the results were bound to be heavy!"]},{"number":3454,"title":"Chapter 3454: Chapter 3453: Serendipity! I","paragraphs":["Hell Terra Firma.","A place of terrifying atrocities and sheer despondency, based on the simple fact that every single entity that used to be comfortable and used to profound authorities that made their lives infinitely easier... all found themselves faced with absolutely nothing.","Returned to a basal state of existence where not a single ounce of authority flowed within them.","And that is how it was, that is how it has always been.","\"So what the hell is this exactly?\"","Where the gray earth should be, a woman with crimson hair stood on a platform that had expanded beneath her feet by simply being watered by the unfathomable entity.","A firm, solid structure that expanded massively in size and stature based on, again, being watered.","And yet this seemed to be the least of all the shocking things that were happening here.","The dilapidated and aged Settlement that used to be here was gradually being overrun by the ever-expanding structures of futuristic buildings, complex weaponry, machinery, and power grids that had been getting built one after another.","Things that she could only remember in her memory being tools of science and technology that the lesser entities who could not fully grasp mana had leaned into were being processed here in wild abundance.","In a short few hours, a complex city filled with neon lights and a terrifying air of technological advancement had been born.","She was the Palace Paster of massive power in her Frequency of Existence, and she had been in Hell Terra Firma for 5 years already.","She was known as the Mistress of Flames, but even she had never come across anything like this.","As a Pioneer, she now had to give blood to the man behind all of this as even now, she found him unfathomably hard to understand!","But she could not do anything else except fall in mine.","And if an entity like this, who could enact change and was seemingly pulling out countless complex structures out of nowhere...he may just be a way out of this barren wasteland.","So she would follow him vehemently.","But this was her thought, and the thoughts of many other collected Pioneers who were initially hesitant.","But now seeing all the structures coming out, not a single entity had even a speck of doubt as they all even wanted to get closer to that man adorned in a golden armor.","The Mistress of Flames was one of them as her eyes shone with sharpness, using her hands to pull down her hair as she also looked down at the size of her chest, and then she stroked forward with affirmation.","—","The revolution of Hell Terra Firma.","Something that could have occurred in a number of years had been occurring in mere hours as more and more complex things continued to come out of the Infiniverse Megalos Seed.","At this moment, Noah was seated on the blue throne in the center of an enclosed room that seemed to be made of reinforced steel. In front of him, there were at least a dozen screens that showed multiple different things, each one shining brightly as the allure of electricity had long been established.","Electric regenerators were the first thing he had brought along with all the required equipment and fuel to run it, and now around the many structures he had laid out, electricity was running and flowing smoothly as power grids were already being installed.","As soon as he reached a sufficient point, it could then begin mass production and movement as the Autonomous Quintessential Androids could be brought here and be fully operational.","When these autonomous creatures began to move under his control, the number of things that he could do would be multiplied dozens of times over.","At this moment, he was observing the launch of the first ever Satellite that would go up on Hell Terra Firma.","Beside him, Ruination and the Infiniverse Megalos Seed watched on calmly as the Satellite blasted higher, reaching an extremely high height on the gray skies before....","|Warning! Warning! Warning! An unknown force is preventing any further ascension and imposing a type of gravitational pressure on Satellite X-01!||","A blooming sound and word flashed on the screens they observed as Noah waved his hands.","\"Slow the ascent and be stationed here.\"","His words were quickly received as the advanced artificial intelligence model that could pick up his voice and commands proceeded to make the necessary arrangements.","Soon, a Satellite hung in the distant space as thereafter, it flashed brightly and released a burst of blue light that spread down, thousands of cameras on it beginning to sweep across the lands below!","Noah looked at all of this coldly as he continued.","\"Prepare for the launch of other Satellites. In a few hours, I want a mapped out area of the nearby tens of thousands of miles of this Barren wasteland. After that, we shall begin using all military force to Conquer any nearby settlements. The goal remains Pioneers and above.\"","...!","His gaze was mighty as his ambitions were unfathomably high.","What nobody had conquered before. What people feared ranging from Pioneers to even Source Complexity entities!","He wondered whether there were even competitors here in Hell Terra Firma. Did anybody have something as complex and unique as him when he came to the Infiniverse Megalos Seed?","He didn’t have the answer, but he would find out soon enough as his gaze penetrated every single part of this endless barren expanse.","\"Begin the design of analyzing signatures of all beings here and how we can differentiate between those that are Ordinance of Existence, or Existence Severing, or even Pioneers. And find me someone at Source Complexity first and foremost.\"","WAA!","The Pioneers he had use for as he needed a tremendous amount of their blood to continue Severing his concepts.","What would Source Complexity entities provide?","As he thought of this, he found his mind wandering towards none other than Barbatos.","This got him to think of the Infiniverse Megalos Seed and the other Barbatos within, as well as many other of his most important people still locked in there!"]},{"number":3455,"title":"Chapter 3455: Chapter 3454: Serendipity! II","paragraphs":["\"How is the progress with the Infiniverse Megalos Seed?\"","Many changes that occurred since his other half had enacted the Quintessential League of Existence.","These changes extended here as well.","|The size continues to gradually increase, Master. If more and more of its basal authority is unlocked, when it reaches the size of a World, I may be able to release those within safely.|","...!","Yes.","More and more changes continued to propagate as in a short period of time, Noah expected for him to get back every single thing and person he had lost access to!","As he sat on his throne, he clenched his fist while looking at all the monitors.","Waiting.","Preparing.","This was his conquest here as outside of this place, Ozymandias was facing an army of Pioneers that would bloom countless Entanglements and death.","Towards the end of it all, what would his progress in Hell Terra Firma be? When he was finally released, where would his own complexity be at?","Pioneers, or Source Complexity?!","HUUM!","The radiance of his body seemed to ever slowly be returning as the Quintessential League of Existence fully began to unfold. Soon enough, he may not even be considered a mere human as he prepared to violate the very basal workings of Hell Terra Firma!","As he imaged the type of Complexity he would have, the visage of the dark skinned Barbatos flashed as he wondered how things continued with her!","—","In a unique Frequency of Existence.","Purple Strings of Existence intricately stretched out and into a massive circular construct the size of ten Omniverses.","A hum and glow of magnificence were constantly being released from these purple strings, a terrifying luster of complexity lying within as even from afar, one could feel a sense of suffocation that came from dozens of Source Complexity entities lying within this place!","At this moment.","In a small corner of this grandiose structure filled with purple Strings of Existence.","Inside a domain less than the size of a world, radiant silver-purple radiance spread out all around as the figure of Barbatos stood on a sea of purple complexity while staring at the back of a man who was seated in a meditative position at its center.","\"What has happened, Father?\"","She asked with a sharp gaze as the man ahead of her had a back so massive- as if he was carrying an indeterminate amount of weight on his back!","His hair was a sleek black, his skin dark and radiant as he seemed like a sculpture of a nigh perfect entity.","He breathed out heavily and sighed at the question his daughter paused before he spoke out calmly.","\"Existence...is unraveling.\"","...!","Three words.","And yet they caused Barbatos to feel a heavy beat of her heart as she kept her face placid while she asked.","\"What do you mean? You know I don’t like cryptic things!\"","She voiced out her frustration as the man before her, a Pillar of the Logos of the Wheel, replied succinctly!","\"In the mission you participated in. It has become a Source Nexus Event connected to the Unraveling of Existence there, and the process is rapidly expanding. Strings of Existence have been snapping at an ever-increasing rate, and they want those involved in that event...to be used as scapegoats if need be. If this unraveling is not stopped, there will be unknown consequences, and there will be a War across Frequencies. Nobody wants that.\"","...!","The words caused Barbatos to become enraged as a habit she had long ago suppressed rose up.","\"The fuck do you mean they want a scapegoat? I only went on that mission because I was ordered to! I know nothing about an unraveling of existence or a War across Frequencies. I was only acting on orders- the Orders of the Logos of the Wheel!\"","Her gorgeous face showed indignation and anger as she continued.","\"They want a scapegoat, but so what? My Father sits atop the council, surely such a thing was shut down as soon as it rose up?\"","She asked a critical question.","One that should have a very easy and quick answer.","\"...\"","And yet...","Her father did not reply.","...!","Her gaze rapidly changed as her face became ashen!","\"You...\"","This was her father.","The man who was always there to protect her. The man who should always be on her side.","And yet at this moment...","\"I hope the unraveling stops. I hope that none of this unfolds in the worst way possible. But if it does follow the worst possible result, I will not be able to stop the others. If it can stop an eruption of a War across Frequencies, they will sacrifice anyone they can to prevent it- even me.\"","...!","His back, which was already so broad and heavy, seemed to become narrow at this moment.","His Source that was ever so radiant felt unfathomably dim to her at this moment!","He spoke as if the decision had already been made, as if there was nothing he could do, and he had accepted it!","\"I am sorry.\"","He stared at the stellar purple sea around them and uttered such empty words as Barbatos felt her heart breaking.","How many years of a relationship was this? How many complex weavings between father and daughter?","For him to just...","Barbatos was in a daze as he continued.","\"They do not know you are here. They will want to keep you under their surveillance just in case to be ready. The most I can give you...is a head start. Go and hide in a place that would make it hard for them to even find you. If things do unfold in the worst possible way, maybe they will sweep over and end before you can be affected.\"","...!","His words only felt worse and worse to her as she couldn’t help but feel a sense of revulsion!","She was so angered and betrayed that she couldn’t help but laugh!","\"Hide? Fucking where could I go hide that the Logos of the Wheel would not find me? Have you truly resigned to allowing your only daughter to be used like this?! Have you...!\"","She wanted to ask if he had truly already made his decision.","But seeing his placid gaze, she knew the answer as her heart truly couldn’t help but bleed!","The last words he said to her...","\"You should go. They do not know you are here now, but they will soon. Be safe.\"","...!","His words weren’t hurried, even though her weavings were facing tremendous peril!","She couldn’t wrap her head around all of this as she wiped her tears away, giving this man, her father, one last look before she defiantly shook her head and disappeared.","But where could she go?","How could she hide from something as vast as the Logos of the Wheel that extended their claws across the Frequencies of the Wheel?","In her complex and tumultuous emotions, the image of one man rose up as her shattered heart felt a form of solace even just thinking about him.","But...he was much lesser in complexity than even her or someone like her Father.","If even her Father chose to abandon her because he couldn’t bear the weight of the Logos of the Wheel, then what about him?","\"...\"","As her heart ached, she resigned herself to at least say goodbye as her source exploded out, going towards another Frequency of Existence!"]},{"number":3456,"title":"Chapter 3456: Chapter 3455: Serendipity! III","paragraphs":["As one entity resigned herself to say goodbye.","Within the stellar purple domain she was just in, the man she left behind retained his difficult expression for a while longer before it subtly shifted into a weary, tired expression!","His eyes held immense heaviness and regret as he sighed.","What bigger failure was there for a man than to be unable to protect their child? Worse yet, if they played a hand in the cause of their destruction, and they gave them up in order to protect themselves!","\"...\"","His gaze was unfocused as countless memories of his daughter flashed across his mind, not being able to notice when a woman adorned in a dazzling gold dress and overflowing blue hair appeared behind him.","She looked around the purple sea with a sigh before her voice echoed out.","\"I told you eons ago during your Severing for you to include your emotions and attachments among your Ordinance. Had you Severed your attachments then, today would have been very easy for you.\"","...!","Her voice was filled with understanding and coldness as it echoed out.","Yet the seated man didn’t move or turn towards her direction as he voiced out gruffly.","\"You all promised a day. A day where you would leave her alone. This must not change.\"","A day.","The most he could do was buy his daughter a single day!","How laughable was this?","The blue haired woman raised her brows while shaking her head at such a question.","\"Did you really think giving her a day was a form of mercy? You do realize how torturous this single day will be, right? She knows there is nowhere for her to hide. She knows her own father has thrown her away. Do you think this single day will be some form of solace? It is the opposite! It is why I wanted to take her in and hold her right here. You only prolonged her misery...\"","WAA!","The words were utterly cold as the man’s gaze shifted, his eyes going through many complex emotions before he asked once more.","\"The Unraveling of Existence?\"","\"It continues to accelerate. But the rate is not exponential- there are times when the rate of Unraveling jumps up, then slows down, and then it jumps up again. It doesn’t seem random....\"","It didn’t seem random.","The snapping of the Strings of Existence...seemed to hold a pattern!","\"If it continues...haaah. The Watchers of the Wheelomachy themselves are not an issue. It is that man. That bald headed demon...he is the one that will make this all that much more difficult.\"","That man.","They didn’t even say his name, but they didn’t have to.","They knew who he was!","Some people called him the Bald Headed Demon.","Others had different names.","But he was known simply as...Bob!","—","Inside another Frequency of Existence.","Megalos Ynnere, Omniverse X-999, the Secondary Infiniverse Megalos Seed!","Ozymandias and the Infiniverse Megalos Body were observing the low hums of Runes of Existence around the multicolored sea, their expansion, and the smoothness of the shocking number of things they were sending down.","Setting up a technologically advanced civilization was easy when one held the authority they grasped in their hands!","In a single day, the barren lands of Settlement in Hell Terra Firma were so drastically transformed that others may feel like it was a dream.","And now, Power Grids were laid out all around, with supercomputers, cloud quantum computers, and many more wonders required as the central base for the deployment of the Autonomous Quintessential Androids.","These Autonomous Quintessential Androids had the first batch successfully arrive as they would be able to work 24/7, allowing the setup and innovation within that place to advance at a shocking pace!","Now, it was only a matter of time.","And as they had begun distorting the weavings of Chronos around here-...!","WAP!","Their gazes both shifted as they felt the fluctuations of space, turning their eyes above as there, the visage of Barbatos with reddened eyes appeared!","Looking at her, a pang of anger rose within Ozymandias as he beckoned towards her and pulled her body towards him.","\"Who caused you to cry?!\"","His eyes radiated a terrifying might, and this anger he displayed...uniquely caused the reddened eyes of Barbatos to clear up as she threw herself to him in a hug!","With him, she felt safe.","Slowly, she contained herself after a minute and told the story of what had happened.","The Unraveling of Existence.","The possible War across Frequencies between the Logos of the Wheel and the Watchers of Wheelomachy!","Her Father...and his decision and powerlessness when it came to using Barbatos and the other Source Complexity entity who was with her on this mission.","\"That is why...I have come to say goodbye. I will ensure that nothing traces back here. Knowing the power of the Logos of the Wheel, they will likely find me in a short period of time...\"","Her eyes were heartbroken as the mentality of being chased down by her own people that she had relied on this whole time was too heavy!","Ozymandias looked at her desolate small figure as he asked calmly.","\"If there is nowhere you can run to, just stay with me. Your Father...the Logos of the Wheel, these Watchers of the Wheelomachy...none of them will be able to get their hands on you so long as you are beside me.\"","...!","Words that caused her heart to buzz echoed out as she smiled wryly!","She looked at the man before her.","His shining eyes of singularities were earnest as if he truly meant it!","Him!","Someone levels below her in power. Multiple levels below her father in power!","And yet for her, he didn’t hesitate to say he would stand against the Logos of the Wheel and the Watchers of the Wheelomachy!","He didn’t care or think about all the shockingly complex beings within these groups. He only cared for her and wanted to do right by her.","He only wanted to protect the one he loved, no matter what.","This...was a Man!"]},{"number":3457,"title":"Chapter 3457: Chapter 3456: Serendipity! IV","paragraphs":["Her own father was renounced as in her eyes, he lost the distinction of a Man.","This entity before her...he was a true Man!","But even with this...","She was about to shake her head when an instant later, Ozymandias didn’t even give her a chance to as he took her hand and flashed to appear above the multicolored sea.","\"The place you will have a vacation in for now while I take care of everything is where my other half is. I’ve turned it into a beautiful place as there, nobody will come to chase after you.\"","...!","She blinked as her eyes opened wider in shock, finally looking around her to see the remaining reserves of Fossil fuels, coals, and oil among others. Alongside massive fighter jets, satellites, spaceships that would make billionaires of a past blue planet jealous, and more!","She saw all of this and recalled what she knew about that frequency as she uttered out.","\"Just..what exactly are you doing?\"","What was he doing?","\"Only what I need to do to protect those I love. Now, this will be temporary. Sending things into this barren Frequency matters not regardless of complexity, but we have not yet tried sending anything nearly as complex as you in Existence. Are you able to utilize your complexity to the utmost and leave only a single shred remaining?\"","He took control and told her what she should do, and after she thought about it...this was definitely a place where they wouldn’t be able to find her!","Nobody from the Logos of the Wheel nor the Watchers of the Wheelomachy would dare to waste their own lives to go to a place nobody could leave.","But this meant that even she would not be able to leave.","When she thought about it, all hesitation left her as there, she would at least be with this man who wouldn’t abandon her no matter what!","So she put apart all her reservations. She didn’t even ask anything else as she nodded, looking at the Runes she had laid out around this Gateway Frequency last time as now, to expend most of her complexity...","HUUM!","She pulled from the very depths of her existence as she began to form a massive Rune of Existence.","\"I will put everything I have in here.\"","Her voice was calm and sweet.","The heavy emotions she held seemed to all be leaving her as above the multicolored sea, strokes of a single intricate rune began to form as it read...COMPLEXITY!","A literal rune of complexity.","To empower the complexity of the multicolored sea and everything around her.","And it would hold all the empowerment of a Source Complexity entity!","BOOM!","The multicolored sea churned as the massive rune rapidly went towards completion.","A minute passed.","Five minutes.","Half an hour!","Finally, Barbatos showed a weary look, her body feeling weak and empty of all power as she had truly imparted everything she held onto this single Rune of Existence that was currently radiating a heart shaking air.","It released a calm barrier all around as its complexity was contained, and it reflected all of its power on that multicolored sea that had already begun to explode in size and grandeur!","Already, it had more than doubled in size since she began designing the Rune of Existence, and it continued even now as this was a truly serendipitous event.","In the heartache and betrayal, there was always something positive on the other side!","Ozymandias knew that the Frequency Gateway was akin to a two-way street.","The influence of authorities on this side was tremendously larger, but the more this Frequency was used, the larger its space became.","Akin to a passage being used again and again, gradually expanding it and making it bigger.","Until eventually...the number and quality of things that could pass through would be drastically increased!","Ozymandias floated down and grabbed the now frail figure of Barbatos from under the dazzling Rune of Existence that was floating above the multicolored sea.","He saw her eyes that showed relaxation and peace as he kissed her forehead, their figures coming to float above the churning waves of the multicolored sea as he slowly lowered her down!","\"You will see me again before you even know it.\"","She looked towards him and smiled with a nod.","The moment her feet touched the surface of the churning sea...","WAP!","Her figure was pulled down as she instantly disappeared into the Frequency Gateway!","Waves of luminosity shone just from this action, the multicolored sea stretching out rapidly in size yet again as the massive Rune of COMPLEXITY came to settle right above the dazzling sea, radiating unfathomable waves of reinforcement and power.","In the distance, the visage of the Infiniverse Megalos Body uttered out with shining eyes.","|This has advanced our process by weeks or months...the things I only theorized of being able to send and do later, we should be able to do them soon.|","She mentioned the shocking positive boon out of all this as she continued observing the seething multicolored sea!","On the other side of this radiant sea.","Within another Frequency entirely.","\"Mmm?!\"","Barbatos felt a squeezing pain across her whole body, as if she was squeezing through an extremely tight space!","The pressure was heavy as soon, she felt like waves of water were trying to flow into her body to drown her.","But a moment later...","SPLASH!","Her figure broke above a radiant sea, her mouth opening to breathe heavily as she then felt a sense of weightlessness.","As if she were falling down!","But an instant later, a robotic hand filled with cushions reached out and grabbed her, and she breathed out while looking around her.","What she saw caused her to continue looking around in a stupor.","Multiple long robotic hands surrounded a sizable sea, huge neon platforms built around it as this sea looked to be larger than even ten football fields.","Further around it, a massive lower side of an Extremity Vein could be seen, along with the ever expanding wonders of the Infiniverse Megalos Seed that was getting bigger and bigger!","This...was the barren Frequency that all types of entities, no matter their complexity, feared?","As she thought of this, the robotic hand pulled her towards a certain neon platform as when she was turned around, she saw three figures staring towards her as behind them, hundreds of white gold Autonomous Quintessential Androids stood!","She saw...him.","Adorned in simple gold robes at this moment.","His hair was dark as stellar space, his eyes deep and mesmerizing as he smiled towards her figure that was set down seamlessly and spoke in a teasing tone.","\"You missed me so much that you entered Hell Terra Firma to join me?\"","...!","Barbatos looked at Noah’s grand figure as her eyes shook.","She then ran towards him and delved into his chest in a deep hug as at this moment, free of all attachments from the Logos of the Wheel, a Source Complexity entity joined Noah’s banner!"]},{"number":3458,"title":"Chapter 3458: Chapter 3457: Serendipity! V","paragraphs":["A Source Complexity Entity entered into Noah’s fold freely after her own people told her she was about to become a scapegoat for something she didn’t have any control over.","She didn’t know that the moment she passed through the Frequency Gateway, it just so happened that a moment later, the largest number of Strings of Existence thus far snapped all at once!","BOOM!","At the Point of Origin.","Bob was surrounded by blinding weavings of complexity, golden blood erupting from over a hundred white gold tentacles that had been wrapped around Strings of Existence nearby!","They snapped all at once, this Unraveling being the most violent one so far!","His gaze was cloudy and filled with silent anger as the ruptured white gold tentacles returned into his body, and even more erupted out from his sides as they held onto a few hundred more golden Strings of Existence.","At such a time, a deep sigh echoed out in the surroundings as space opened up like pages of a book, and an aged old man with white hair and a beard appeared from these pages!","|Even though it may all be pointless, this old man will alap join you in this endeavor.|","...!","A terrifying but silent complexity seethed around him as over a hundred white lines erupted from him to wrap onto other golden Strings of Existence.","Bob turned towards this entity as he harrumphed, his gaze also turning towards other directions as more auras came out!","|Great Sage, Persephael...you lot only decided to come in now? Useless.|","His voice was cold as, after the old man, a few more entities with utterly terrifying weavings of complexity appeared one after another, their gazes full of unknown weavings as they stared at this Point where Existence itself was Unraveling!","It was Watchers.","Watchers of the Wheelomachy!","Wheelomachy.","What did this word even mean?","The first term was simple as it related to the Wheel.","It was the second term that was more complex.","It meant battle. It meant war!","The Watchers of the Wheelomachy were literally the Watchers of the Battle of the Wheel!","The Watchers of the War of the Wheel of Existence!","But their weavings did far more than just watch.","At this moment, multiple of these Watchers appeared.","Among those to arrive, a woman adorned with golden jewels all over her body looked at the empty region of the Expanse that was absent of a few hundred Strings of Existence as she asked.","|What caused such an unraveling? What important piece of Existence did this Frequency lose to cause this phenomenon, especially one that is occurring this fast? In any other Frequencies that lost something that should have never been lost, the reaction has never been this violent. And Existence rectified itself soon after to fill the hole of the missing piece. What creature is the Wheel deeming irreplaceable that this Unraveling is continuing?|","...!","The one called Persephael asked such heavy questions.","Yes!","There had been instances in the past where events that should have never occurred...took place.","But always, the Wheel continued to churn.","What was lost was replaced.","Whatever piece that was needed for the flow of the Wheel to continue would arise even without the Watchers having to intervene, but there were instances where they did intervene and were able to solve small unravelings of existence.","|The possible Point of Origin is a creature I was drawn to not too long ago- or those connected to him. A creature barely beginning to grasp the States of Existence. He was forcefully sent into the weavings of the Purgatory Lands through the forced hand of the Logos of the Wheel. Things began to unravel from that point.|","...!","Bob waved his hands dismissively while he replied and gave the most rudimentary information.","Hearing it, the gazes of others changed as Persephael looked toward Bob inquisitively.","|You were involved even before this all began? Could your weavings have rubbed off-|","|Don’t speak any nonsense. The critical thing here is that the lost weaving of Existence was lost in the Purgatory Lands. What is lost in Purgatory Lands does not come back. And if the Wheel itself cannot rectify it...the unraveling will only accelerate.|","|...|","Silence descended as these entities listened to the words of Bob with differing expressions.","|The bigger question to ask, and those responsible will answer it- is what exactly prompted the Logos of the Wheel to issue out one of their missions for this? Was this truly an accidental event, or was it purposeful on their behalf?|","...!","Shocking words came out of Bob as the eyes of those here flashed with brilliance!","Purposeful?","The first ever unraveling of existence that was this massive in scale was a purposeful event?","|This...| The Great Sage had a hazy expression as he thought carefully before he continued.","|Is this why I hear the talks of War? That fox, Heimilzana, reached out to me to act as a mediator between the Logos of the Wheel and the Watchers if I could.|","|Oh, did she now?| Bob’s singularities became even sharper as he harrumphed and continued.","|The pretext of War makes it so that I can uproot all of those involved in this within the Logos of the Wheel. With their records, I’ll be sure whether this was truly an accident or not. I have to do this because...what do you all think will happen if this Unraveling of Existence continues?|","...!","The pretext of the War across Frequencies. Because the forces of the Logos of the Wheel were stretched out across Frequencies.","But Bob asked an even more critical question thereafter as in the distance, the bejeweled figure of Persephael sighed as she spoke out with a gloomy expression.","|When it passes a certain point, all weavings of this Frequency of Existence will destabilize, and the complexity of life within will start to be affected. Eventually, the entire Frequency will unravel as after that...|","|Yes. After that...| Bob looked at all the Watchers who had arrived here as his gaze was exceedingly cold.","He finished the words of Persephael.","|After that, this unraveling of existence will likely spread onto other Frequencies as we...will have a Catastrophic Weaving of the Wheel on our hands!|","...!"]},{"number":3459,"title":"Chapter 3459: Chapter 3458: Serendipity! VI","paragraphs":["A Catastrophic Weaving of the Wheel!","Something that the Watchers of the Wheelomachy had to ensure never even had its beginning stages.","It was a theory of things that should never come to pass.","Something that if they did their jobs properly, they wouldn’t even be hearing about it!","To hear about it now....","The Great Sage was holding on to dozens of Strings of Existence when...","SNAP!","A heavy force snapped a string he held as the white line he released was broken.","His gaze was cloudy with a pondering allure as he spoke out.","|There are only so many ways to stop the unraveling of existence. We absolutely cannot let it spread from this Frequency and unto others as the only way to do so...|","His words did not finish.","They couldn’t!","They lingered in the air as the answer was too heavy, and it was one that nobody here wanted to have on their hands.","The closest one could liken it to was a dying, decaying branch on a vibrant tree.","This decay couldn’t be allowed to spread to all other branches of this tree as naturally, it had to be cut down. Isolated. Separated from the rest!","This was the simple idea that the Great Sage mentioned without finishing his words. Because even for those like them, it was unthinkable.","A deep silence hung in the air as Bob harrumphed.","|How about we stop things where they are? The first thing to do is figure out the intent behind the origination of this event as I will seek the answers from the Logos of the Wheel.|","...!","With an eruption of brilliance, Bob’s body split in two as one disappeared right after!","The other Watchers remained silent as the Great Sage closed his eyes while releasing even more white lines- and perceptive eyes would notice these white lines burning with weavings of Anti-Matter!","The Watchers of the Wheelomachy were mysterious with their numbers unknown, and they were composed of entities from all different origins.","At this moment, they moved to stop the unraveling of existence, while one of them sought to grasp the true nature behind it- and hold certain people responsible!","As they did this, Persephael looked towards the far distance, her eyes squinting as she voiced out.","|And what the hell is going on over there?|","Her gaze was locked in a direction where it seemed dozens of Pioneers were grouping up against a single one.","Weaving of Matter and Dark Matter seemed to also be clashing at the same time!","Bob glanced towards that direction for a moment as he replied.","|The same weavings of greed that occur time and time again. In history and many frequencies, it follows the same pattern. It has occurred in this Frequency before, and it is occurring again now.|","...!","History had a tendency to repeat itself.","And at this moment, the events unfolding in the distant Immovable Sacred Palace were nothing but a repetition of history.","The other Watchers glanced at the shocking battles as the Great Sage asked.","|What is occurring there is not related to the unraveling of existence here?|","Another critical question.","In the middle of the very unraveling of existence, could the eruption of profound entropy and chaos truly have nothing to do with it?","Bob was silent at this question as he looked among the sea of moving entities with their own Complexities, his gaze coming to lock onto Ozymandias as his eyes flashed.","Stay tuned for updates on empire","And his answer was a simple one.","|No.|","...!","The other Watchers heard his words as even if any of them had a shred of doubt or suspicion, after Bob answered, it faded away.","After all, he was Bob.","He was someone who left no stone unturned as if he said there was no relation, then truly, there was no relation!","So their focus returned onto the dazzling unraveling of existence as even within their conversation...","SNAP! SNAP!","More strings of Existence continued to break!","They looked at this event as a mistake.","Something that the Wheel of Existence itself would normally correct as Existence continued to flow.","Something that needed to be reversed.","They didn’t know that the one who was actually involved....only saw it as a profound serendipity!","In the distance where they had just turned their gazes away from...","|Your Outerversal Authority is sealed|","|Your weavings of Mana are sealed!|","|Your colorless path is sealed!|","Three Ents with massive verdant gold bodies appeared around Ozymandias as they roared out.","Under the Quintessential League of Existence, one didn’t even need to know the identity of the Ordinance or Path they wanted to seal.","So long as they made their intention clear and selected the weavings of a path on the target, it would be sealed!","These three Ents appeared around Ozymandias after he had sealed the path of A Gold Ash Tree Ent Pioneer, they interjected to protect their own.","But they were shocked to find that Ozymandias still had complexity surging around him as he sealed their paths, and so they sealed more of his!","At this time, he had to have at least Four Ordinances sealed.","And yet he still moved forward, a heavy purple light blooming from him as he bellowed out.","|Your Complexity has already collapsed, everything about it is already mine!|","The Severed Weavings of Plot erupted out like a wave, the speed rapid as they covered one of the closest Ents right away.","|Ah...!|","The tree like face turned livid with fury as the other Ents around it with their Complexity sealed scrambled away not to be caught in this domineering light!","At such a time.","WAP!","A massive Golden Titan appeared above, and he didn’t even attack as instead, he released golden strings that wrapped around the Gold Ash Tree Ent Pioneer and the other two Ent Pioneers that were not yet affected, and he pulled them all back!","His eyes were callous as he watched the single affected Ent Pioneer break apart, verdant gold blood leaking from it as it all went towards Ozymandias.","And after these drops of Blood- the complexity of a Pioneer, entered his being...the pressure and complexity he radiated became even more intense!","And yet the Golden Titan only looked at this calmly as he bellowed out.","|Three of his Ordinances are now sealed so long as these three do not die! If you have your path sealed, we will save you and keep you alive until every single Ordinance this creature has...is sealed!|","WAA!","The Golden Titans took control and revealed a terrifying plan.","This Instrument of the Beyonder was a terrifying creature, yes.","But if its Ordinances continued to be sealed and remain sealed...what more could it do?!","And if three Ordinances were already sealed, how many more did he have up his sleeve? Another two? Another three?","They simply had to wait for him to seal a few more entities, keep those entities alive, and they would finally get their hands on his Complexity!"]},{"number":3460,"title":"Chapter 3460: Chapter 3459: Who Said! I","paragraphs":["The weavings of the Pioneers were sharp as they moved in synchrony to ensure that no more of them died.","After all, they were distinguished Pioneers of Existence.","They held their own dignity and pride, and the sheer fact that their complexity was getting thrashed around like this... caused them to feel a sense of violation!","They had to put a stop to it, get their hands on the body of this entity, and determine whether he held the weavings of the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian or not.","|You can make all of this easy by simply answering the question- do you deny having any connection to the weavings of Megalonians? It is such a simple question that stops all of this the moment you answer. So what will it be?!|","Above, a Golden Titan bellowed out as once more, the Instrument of the Beyonder said nothing.","At this moment.","|Bahaha, what right do you have to make the Instrument of the Beyonder answer? We will protect him from here on out!|","At this time, the tides of Outerversal Authority also arrived as multiple Great Ones- not yet observed within the Pantheons of the Megalos Beyond nor the Primal Eldritch Palace of the Expanse, appeared.","They stemmed from ancient groups that even held Source Complexity entities behind them, with their intent unknown as the blanketing Outerversal Sea covered everything around the Instrument of the Beyonder at this moment!","And amidst it...Ozymandias easily saw through the murky sea as the face of a massive octopus and its tentacles looked towards him.","|You are the Instrument we heard whispers of from the Greatest Morphon to rise amongst us? I am the Great Eater, the One Who Sleeps in the Depths! I will lend you my aid here along with my brethren, but...just let us confirm who we truly are protecting. It is unheard of for an Outerversal Morphon drenched in Dark Matter to somehow have the weavings of the purest lifeform stemming from Matter. We have to ascertain this, O Instrument.|","...!","The words were filled with a profound veiled sense of greed.","The Pioneer even made it clear as its greed was straightforward- a part of its tentacles going towards Ozymandias!","Behind the blanketing stellar black obsidian sea, other Outerversal Authorities at the level of Pioneers rose and came forward.","All of this happened in the murky darkness of a stellar black sea as the Golden Titans and other Pioneers frowned at this intrusion that would make this whole ordeal take even longer! Your journey continues at empire","In the Blancverse Domain of the Immovable Sacred Palace of the Expanse, the Immovable Sacred Guard frowned as he looked at the visage of Pioneer Heracles that had nearly collapsed, his eyes flashing as he sent a message towards a Source Complexity entity only he knew how to contact.","|Sir, any action or guidance on the report I sent regarding three offenders from different Frequencies of Existence? Possibly a Fourth one that the others claim has connections to the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian.|","A message that crossed unique weavings of existence to go towards a Source Complexity Entity that had been one of the earliest entities from the establishment of the Immovable Sacred Palace of the Expanse.","Someone who had placed himself under the banner of those Entities who oversaw the smooth flow of the weavings of the Wheel!","The Immovable Sacred Guard waited briefly after he sent a message towards such a being, and a reply rang out in his mind soon enough.","|I have sent this message upwards. It has been deemed...as nothing for us to be involved in.|","...!","What?","The Immovable Sacred Guard became stern and entirely somber.","This was exactly the type of thing they normally became involved in.","Correcting the flow of those in Frequencies of the Wheel that didn’t belong to them.","Ensuring that everyone was where they were supposed to be!","So...why was it that now was an exception?","His mind buzzed with questions, but he had no answer.","In the next moment...","ROAR!","The enraged roar of an Outerversal Morphon rang out!","Outside of the Blancverse, a stellar black sea churned as a titanic Eldritch visage of an Octopus roared while moving back- its body pulled by a humanoid Pioneer who had the head of a Squid while another Pioneer in the form of a Mollusk protected from the front!","The figure of Ozymandias erupted from this sea as he held 4 ripped tentacles that were sucked of their obsidian blood, pristine stellar obsidian Globules of Blood of Pioneers flowing into his body as his aura continued to scale upwards.","|We sought to help you, fiend!|","...!","The Outerversal Morphon in the form of an Octopus had its Path sealed, over 30% of its weavings having almost collapsed with its blood drained!","The scene was a heavy and shocking one as...the Instrument of the Beyonder even sought death against his own people?","In this moment of shock and confusion, the Instrument gazed at all beings while his complexity continued to climb up another level, his intent booming out as behind him, a dazzling purple throne began to manifest.","|I am Ozymandias, and I burn with a glorious purpose.|","HUUM!","On the purple throne, space twisted and distorted as an illusory visage of a woman that burned with crimson gold grandeur bloomed, her eyes burning with the weight of millions of suns as they looked at all Pioneers here with coldness!","In her hands, a Rune of Existence that held the word [SWORD] bloomed inside a singularity as moments later, a dazzling crimson gold sword bloomed as it pointed its tip towards the many entities here.","It was something alongside the Transcendent Megalos Techniques of the Great Beyonder- a Rune he had obtained in his Dreams.","The Sword of the Megalos!","Boundless complexity seemed condensed inside of it and ready to erupt as Ozymandias continued.","|Whoever stands against my path, whether that be someone from the Megalos Beyond burning with Outerversal Authority, or those from the Megalos Ynnere and Megalos Nihilos burning with their own weavings of Matter and Anti-Matter...every single one should be prepared for death because of such a choice!|","WAA!"]},{"number":3461,"title":"Chapter 3461: Chapter 3460: Who Said! II","paragraphs":["Whoever stood against his path, every single one should be prepared for death!","Regardless of their origins.","|And you, O Outerversal Morphon of the Megalos Beyond....|","His gaze turned fiery.","On the purple throne of Severed Tyranny, the visage of the Saintess of Fiery Damnation wielding the Sword of the Megalos turned her head towards the powerful Great Ones that were looking towards him in rage.","|Outerversal Morphons of the Megalos Beyond...The very Instrument of the Beyonder, the Great Beyonder, stands before you while waging a war. Why have you not kneeled and paid your respects?! You dare to try and lay your unworthy hands on me?!|","BOOM!","A terrifying intent exploded out as it seemed like everything was about to deteriorate!","The Severed Weavings of Tyranny exploded out with wild abandon as they pressured any entity nearby to bend their will.","Such a pressure would cause any Pioneer to be utterly enraged as it was akin to the very Path that they forged being told to bend its weavings towards another.","The Hererical Outerversal Morphons were living as more and more of them came out of the sea of obsidian authority, a massive entity that was a massive single slender tentacle with a crimson serpentine eye at the very end arising from this sea and looking towards Ozymandias as a cruel feminine voice boomed out!","|Imposter! No Instrument of the Beyonder would raise their might against other Outerversal Morphons! Apprehend this vile creature!|","...!","A drastic change in ideology.","At this moment, even his own people- those of the Dark Matter, turned against him as their eyes held burning complexities!","Down below, near the entry point of the Blancverse of the Immovable Sacred Palace of the Expanse, The Great Mother watched this unfolding with an ashen expression as she was dismayed.","She saw legends of the Outerversal Morphons she had only heard of in the Megalos Beyond- Entities that had long made their home in the Expanse.","She admired such entities and hoped to be like them one day, but at this moment, they turned their blades towards the Instrument of the Beyonder!","Towards the one that was promised!","HUUM!","She shouted out, but her intent could not even be heard amidst the roiling complexities of Pioneers.","It was only heard and passed around in the illusory scenes she displayed in the Pantheon of Umbra in the Megalos Beyond.","|Where are the true followers of the Beyonder?! The Pioneers that followed his path and tradition?! His Instrument is being besieged on all sides by our own forces, so where are you!|","A deep howl filled with indignation and misery.","And it had no answer.","In the Expanse, Ozymandias looked at the Outerversal Morphons who actually sought to lay their hands on his body just from hearing of the possible resurgence of the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian as at this moment, the Sword of the Megalos in the hands of the Saintess of Fiery Damnation pointed towards the three Outerversal Morphons protecting the Octopus he had already begun to collect the weavings of.","As he did this...","|None of your Outerversal Authorities work!|","He bellowed out as instantly, the complexity of these Morphons began to dim.","As they experienced this...","|Your tyrannical purple Ordinance is also sealed!|","|Your crimson Ordinance is sealed!|","|Your illusory authority of dreams is sealed!|","They all bellowed out in turn as around Ozymandias, the purple throne began to dim and fade away- alongside the Saintess of Fiery Damnation and the Sword of the Megalos she held as Tyranny, Helios, and Dreams were being sealed.","The Outerversal Morphons were overjoyed at this as in the background, Pioneers of Matter also began to move forward.","Was this not about 6 or 7 of his Ordinances sealed? He may not even have any more paths left in store as his path may be closed!","The Outerversal Morphon that was a single slender tentacle with an eye at the very end- the Great Spermathos, arrived above the the four Sealed Outerversal Pioneers to protect them as he watched the dimming light around Ozymandias- his eye shooting out rays of obsidian brilliance ahead.","But...the purple throne that was just fading away began to light up again, this time burning with a violet purple radiance as the Severed Weavings of Entropy surged from it.","Atop the throne, the Saintess of Fiery Damnation reformed as her body became painted scorching gold, the Severed weavings of Destiny burning within her!","And in her hands, the Sword of the Megalos came back to life as it was filled with a murky darkness that was none other than the Severed Weaving of Apocalypse.","...!","It was a scene of sheer horror as the sword swung down unhindered, the Great Spermathos feeling its own authority becoming sealed as the terrifying voice of Ozymandias thundered out. Your journey continues on empire","|Who said all my weavings were sealed?!|","WAA!","Words that boomed out and repeated in the minds of all those here spread out as a terrifying Sword of the Megalos exploded in front of five Outerversal Pioneers of Existence!","BOOM!","A Cataclysmic light of brilliance covered everything as illusions of apocalyptic pieces of Omniverses arose in the surroundings, these illusions slowly becoming real as in a short period of time, it truly seemed like decimated pieces of Omniverse were swinging around into a swirling circular storm that only expanded outwards!","Any Pioneers that approached would have to get past this blooming storm brought about by the Severed Weavings of Apocalypse that only seemed to be picking up speed and distinction.","And at the center of this storm, the figure of Ozymandias could be seen floating between the bodies of five decimated Outerversal Pioneers of Existence, his eyes of singularities blaring pillars of baleful light as his body radiated a heavy gravitational force that was devouring rivers of blood and tentacles of all of these Outerversal Pioneers!","As he did so, his aura became more and more maddening as in the distance, the Golden Titans bellowed out.","|Do not let him continue!|","...!"]},{"number":3462,"title":"Chapter 3462: Chapter 3461: Who Said! III","paragraphs":["Everyone could see that the complexity of this being only continued to rise as he directly devoured every entity he killed.","He had just killed 5 Outerversal Pioneers at this moment as they truly could not sit still!","Five Golden Titans shot out and entered the swirling circular storm of apocalypse, along with dozens of other Pioneers who knew this could not go on.","They had to ensure that no more sealed Pioneers were dying to this being, and that both he and them remained sealed as they found out the limit of the number of Ordinances this entity had!","Since he had just killed those five Outerversal Pioneers, five of his sealed Ordinances were unsealed as the brightness around him only increased- making it approximately 8-9 Ordinances they had now seen him display.","This number was gradually becoming more and more shocking, and it was one that showed just how impure this entity was in declaring all of these Ordinances. None of them could fully grasp how he had managed to amalgamate and sever all these 9 Ordinances- this alone being an impossibility!","But in the endless weavings of Existence, there were always oddities.","And the more power he displayed- the more he showed these nonsensical capabilities that were outside the scope of others...the more they were convinced of the assertion of the Resurgence of the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian!","After all, his uniqueness and complexity could be explained if one attributed it to the mystery of the Megalonians!","Arriving into the Apocalyptic severed domain around Ozymandias, the Paths of dozens of Pioneers erupted.","This time, they moved all at once as they treated this unique existence with less care than before, not wondering whether he would perish from their attacks after all they had seen.","What they needed to do was suppress!","After all, he couldn’t evade the instantaneous attacks of dozens of Pioneer even if he sealed five or even eight of them!","|O Light!|","|O Chaos!|","|O Dignity!|","|Raze, Destruction!|","|Absorb, Plunderer!|","...!","Dozens of paths struck out.","At this dire time, all by himself, Ozymandias faced the unshackled attacks of dozens of Pioneers.","It felt like heavy waves of complexity were surging at him from all around as if he didn’t do anything, their sheer complexity combined together could crush his weavings one by one!","Even if their power was limited to not unleash their true paths of Pioneers by the Quintessential League of Existence.","Their sheer complexity was heavy as from all around, manifestation of pure wonders bloomed.","Golden pillars of pure light that swung down like spears of judgment.","A manifestation of a massive Golden Titan appeared above, withstanding the swirling shattered pieces of miniaturized omniverses as it bellowed out and released beams of white light from its facial orifices!","Dark purple petals that danced with heavy destruction swirling down like a storm, cutting anything nearby apart as they all pressed towards Ozymandias.","Towards the throne behind him and the Saintess of Fiery Damnation seated on it as she wielded the Sword of the Megalos and pointed it up- thousands of singularities that looked like balls of glorious flames shooting out from the sword tip and spreading out all around!","But it was still not enough.","The pressure and complexity smashing down on all sides was suffocating, and if he didn’t reduce it, he would be the one reduced to dust!","So...","|OOOOH!|","Ozymandias bellowed out as a terrifying Sacred Primal Eye of Existence opened above him, locking onto the most dreadful paths coming down as he gave the command.","|Seal|","|Seal!","|SEAL!|","HUUUM!","Everything trembled.","Of the brightest authorities cascading down, seven instantly dimmed and began to fade away!","At the same time...bellows echoed out from the affected Pioneersas they yelled out while selecting the radiant authorities around Ozymandias.","|Motherfucker, you’re also sealed!|","...!","The price of the Quintessential League of Existence to seal authorities was equal, with many thinking such a high cost could not be borne by anyone as, eventually, they would fall after enough of their authorities were sealed.","So moments later, the Pioneers nearby were energized as those sealed...","|I’ve been sealed- pull me out!|","They yelled out towards those around them- not even their allies, but they trusted them to aid in keeping their bodies away as it would mean the Instrument of the Beyonder would have a path that remained sealed with their survival.","Thus, before the Apocalyptic storm or flaming singularities could claim anyone, Seven Pioneers were pulled out from the storm by other Pioneers!","They didn’t even get taken towards the same direction, with all seven entities being pulled towards different directions.","To ensure that even if the Instrument of the Beyonder tried to make a move against them, he may at most be able to get one or two!","Adding to the other Pioneers protected by the Golden Titans...","|That is at least 10 Ordinances of Existence of his sealed! No matter how impure he is, there cannot be too many more. Strip him of everything!|","The other Pioneers remaining in the storm of apocalyptic miniaturized shattered Omniverses pressed on as momentarily, 14 were taken out of circulation.","The weight pressing down on Ozymandias from all sides lessened, but the Pioneers did not relent!","Where other attacks used to be but had dimmed, new ones took their place.","|Do you deny it?!|","Another Golden Titan came in as he bellowed out, his golden hand stretching out and crashing down alongside other attacks.","And in front of all this...","|Seal!|","|Seal!|","All the attacks crashing down were sealed one after another, the eyes of many beginning to widen in alarm as they heard the intent of sealing from the Instrument ringing out ten times.","Ten times!","|...|","There was a momentary pause before clamor erupted as those sealed shouted out.","|Another one of your Severed Ordinances is also sealed!|","|Get us out!|","Shouts of sealing and of help boomed out as ten more Pioneers pulled out ten sealed Pioneers, and they left behind a dying down storm of Apocalypse as even this concept was sealed.","But...there was immense silence in the surroundings. Stay connected through empire","That was ten more paths of Pioneers sealed.","Ten!","For a total of 20 Ordinances of Existence sealed from the Instrument of the Beyonder!","What was this? What exactly was this being?!"]},{"number":3463,"title":"Chapter 3463: Chapter 3462: Who Said! IV","paragraphs":["20 Ordinances.","Twenty possible paths!","They actually confirmed this being to have 20 sealed Ordinances of Existence, such a thing making them extremely somber!","In the distance, the visage of the Golden Titan distinguished as the Great Marshall spoke out commandingly.","|Those who have their Paths sealed- leave this region for now to ensure your lives. Your deaths would result in the 20 sealed Ordinances of this creature to be unsealed- so stay away until the rest of his paths are sealed!|","He spoke commandingly even though he didn’t have any direct control over the other forces.","But his words held merit as to ensure their own safety, those who had their path sealed began moving even further away after accepting the help of others.","Other Pioneers were even more straightforward as they continued their aid, releasing bursts of light that contained the sealed Pioneers and sent them far from here!","But...","|Huh?|","BZZZT!","When they reached a certain distance, as if there was a terrifying and absolute barrier, they found that their bodies could not move any further!","...!","From any direction.","All those sealed Pioneers who were being led to leave...found that an undeniable force stopped them!","They didn’t know that they had simply gotten to the edge of the Relegation Zone of Existence.","|You all do not seem to understand.|","WAA!","The booming voice of the Instrument of the Beyonder thundered out.","|You may have not been heeding my words earlier but...|","As he spoke, with approximately 20 Ordinances of Existence sealed...the temperature around him began to distort and rise as the severed weavings of the Protagonist bloomed to form a dazzling Bow.","Its expression at this moment was one of scorching rage, this bow grasped on the left hand of Ozymandias as it formed with shocking intricacies!","Behind him, the throne and Saintess of Fiery Damnation fully faded as it was only his stellar visage and the bow of the Protagonist.","A bow radiating its weavings and questioning all those here- just who did they think they were pushing around?!","|You are within an entirely different League of Existence at this moment. You are now entangled with me as in these weavings of existence, none may leave!|","WAA!","His words were booming.","With the bow held in his left hand, his right hand reached out to the dazzling gold bowstring as he began to draw back- a scorching obsidian light of Vacuous brilliance forming!","|The only way to leave here is to break this Entanglement- through my death, or yours!|","...!","Either he died, or they died!","There could be no other possible result.","Such terrifying words boomed out as the Great Marshall of the Golden Titans here roared out while looking at the dangerous golden bow and formed obsidian arrow within the hands of Ozymandias.","|Protect those sealed!|","TING!","No sooner had he spoked...did Ozymandias release the terrifying obsidian arrow of Severed Vacuous lined with the golden brilliance of the Protagonist as...this arrow instantly disappeared after it was shot out.","All Pioneers tensed as they didn’t know who the target would be, many Pioneers scrambling to those sealed as... Experience tales at empire","|Ah...|","A humanoid golden titan adorned a silver suit of armor felt a sensation of a void in his chest as when he looked down, he saw half of his chest missing as a dazzling obsidian arrow bloomed from his body.","It was akin to a dazzling singularity blooming and eating away at his existence, this singularity devouring his blood and complexity as an instant later, it exploded to decimate and collapse his sealed path entirely!","On the other side, a singularity bloomed behind Ozymandias as it gushed out crimson gold blood and complexity unto him.","His body also lit up as a sealed Ordinance was unsealed.","|....|","Silence hung in the surroundings as in an instant, from afar, the Instrument had sniped another Pioneer to oblivion while devouring their complexity!","And after this, his shining singularities blazed as he roared out, raising his bow while pulling it back multiple times in an instant.","Dazzling lines of severed weavings of Vacuous formed and shot out, their destinations unknown!","And Ozymandias did not stop as he continued to pull the bowstring and form more deadly arrows where a single one had bloomed to collapse the weavings of a sealed Pioneer.","The Great Marshall of the Golden Titans saw this deterioration as he roared out while moving himself.","|Useless wretches, protect those sealed!|","Pioneers scrambled.","Those not sealed appeared around the sealed Pioneers and released their paths around them protectively to isolate any entrance of foreign attacks, with the Golden Titans radiating heavy complexity and moving out from the command of Great Marshall to ensure his orders!","At this critical time.","The gaze of Ozymandias that had been roaring and bellowing this whole time became focused.","His gaze became straight as he calmly stared.","He stared at the Great Marshall roaring out orders.","The Pioneer with the most complex weavings of existence here.","And he uttered silently.","|Your Complexity is sealed.|","...!","In the distance, the gaze of the Great Marshall giving out commands rapidly changed.","The booming weavings of complexity around him became suppressed and stifled as before he could do anything...","HUUM!","Over a dozen obsidian gold arrows bloomed inches away from his body, and they thundered down like havenly spears of hellish judgment!","...!","The Instrument of the Beyonder played many Pioneers and conducted a move that caused many to turn in shock!","His many arrows and show of power were not aimed at anybody else.","They were aimed at the strongest Pioneer here!","BOOOM!","|Great Marshall!|","The Golden Titans, who had left his side to protect others, bellowed out as their eyes burned red with shock and wrath.","Others watched on in stupefaction as the strongest among them had his weavings sealed while he was bombarded with more attacks than any other sealed Pioneers!","And in the midst of their shock, the hand of Ozymandias never stopped as he continued to pull the bowstring, using this momentary lapse to also target others.","It was a critical turning point in this great battle!"]},{"number":3464,"title":"Chapter 3464: Chapter 3463: A Clean Sweep! I","paragraphs":["Devastation.","Pioneers looked left and right as at the edges of the Relegation Zone of Existence, the sealed Pioneers faced an unprecedented attack where from the very center of their beings, an obsidian gold singularity bloomed and ravaged everything.","With their paths being sealed, the complexity they could unleash was unfathomably less as they could not withstand the heavy attack brought about by the Instrument of the Beyonder!","And they could only watch in dismay and utter horror as their complexities- their very existence that they raised in complexity since they were young...collapsed right before their eyes.","As it collapsed, their blood and very weavings of existence were devoured as the singularity brought forth by an arrow returned back to the one that pulled back the bow string.","A glorious flourishing of rivers of the Blood of Pioneers streamed from all directions towards Ozymandias, his body taking in every single thing as at this moment, he began channeling every single drop that formed into a singular concept.","OOOOH!","His complexity reached unfathomable levels. He had not undergone Ordinance Amalgamation. He had only jumped to Sever his existence as they were all considered small aspects of who he was!","Yet right now, the aura that he radiated seemed like something that only the most stupendous and excellent entities of the Existence Severing stage could ever radiate. Its complexity seemed so much more that it didn’t truly match the parameters of what one would consider an entity of the Severing stage to be.","|The Ordinance of Cheats has undergone its 25th Severing!|","|The Ordinance of Cheats has undergone its 26th Severing!|","Dazzling prompts constantly buzzed within his mind as he went for a certain accomplishment he only theorized about before.","Continued Severing...until he reached the limit!","But when he reached a certain point....","|The Ordinance of Cheats has undergone its 27th Severing!|","BZZT!","His weavings of existence buzzed.","As if a barrier lay ahead.","Ozymandias looked within the depths of himself as he saw the terrifying complexity that cheats had achieved, where it seemed like it was being compressed and refined again and again.","But when it reached this point, to compress it even more- to Sever its weavings of existence further...much more would be required!","|The requirement analyzed to get past the 27th Severing of Existence has been determined to be three Globules of Blood of a Pioneer.|","...!","The cost of elevation was made known.","To Sever Existence so many times, again and again, the cost did not remain the same!","So Ozymandias looked hungrily towards his target that should have been holding the most complex Blood of a Pioneer.","The area where many eyes were currently honed in as they wondered of the fate of the one called the Great Marshall of the Golden Titans over here.","And what this saw caused all eyes to open wide as there, the scene of a once glorious Pioneer of Existence- a Golden Titan at that, had his body pierced by countless small holes as the vast majority of his blood was drained.","But around him, a golden water lily floated in front of him and radiated a terrifying glow of gold.","It seemed to have protected him as after this, it was not done.","The skewered body of the Great Marshall that seemed nearly about the fall began to brim with life ever so slowly as from this golden water lily, a sea of complexity surged out and bathed him.","His expression was currently that of utmost rage and ferocity as he bellowed out.","|Do you truly think that you could kill one of the Great Marshalls of the Golden Frequency Monarch?!|","WAA!","Even with his path sealed, his life force seemed to be brimming with an unfathomable radiance!","Who was he?!","A Great Marshall of the Golden Frequency Monarch- this was a Frequency Monarch!","How could he not be protected? How could he not have life saving means that others could not even imagine?","At this moment, he stood tall as five Golden Titans appeared instantly after surrounding him on all sides as their bodies pulsed with unleashed paths that covered him entirely.","Even with his path sealed, he still roared out!","|Do not let him continue! Do not let him continue unsealing all the paths that are blocked from him!|","He roared out commandingly, but at this point in time, a truth had settled in.","Seeing so many Pioneers being killed had already made many beings hesitant.","Now, after watching even a Great Marshall of the Golden Titans nearly perish, many had begun to rethink all this!","They weren’t as organized as before, and this only allowed Ozymandias to shoot more arrows as he began to turn his gaze to others here.","|Your Path is sealed!|","|Your Path is sealed!|","Stay tuned for updates on empire","He selected entities and sealed their paths as the instant after their paths were sealed, terrifying obsidian gold arrows already arrived to claim their complexity.","But the moment he sealed them, the Great Marshall also roared out as if he had been waiting and watching.","\"Your nullifying black authority is sealed! Your golden fateful authority is sealed!|","He called out for the sealing of the Protagonist and Vacuous as moments later, the golden bow and dark arrows began to slowly fade away!","And before they could do so completely...","’O Genesis. O Chronos.’","HUUM!","White brilliance gushed out maddeningly as the severed weavings of Genesis filled the disappearing golden bow as a dazzling white bow bloomed.","And from his pulled-back fingertips of the bowstring, a terrifying purple brilliance of Chronos unfolded.","The scene only caused more eyes of the Pioneers to turn somber as in the far distance, the rageful eyes of Outerversal Pioneers that had begun to come out of the heavy obsidian sea turned calmer and more controlled.","They stopped their movements as they and many others looked at each other while all thinking the same thing.","Was...it really worth risking their lives in the hopes that this being truly was the Resurgence of the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian when they might die before they even get close to him?","...!","A heavy thought.","It crossed through many heads while Ozymandias himself continued his rampage!"]},{"number":3465,"title":"Chapter 3465: Chapter 3464: A Clean Sweep! II","paragraphs":["A terrifying idea passed through the minds of many Pioneers as they questioned the risks and benefits of where they were right now.","The potential benefits at this moment as Pioneers and their paths forever closed left and right seemed infinitely small when one ascertained the heavy risks that lay all around them.","The risks of death with any possible sealing as even now...they had not confirmed the final number of Ordinances this being had!","At the highest they had sealed all at once was twenty, but with every dying Pioneer- even more of his sealed Ordinances were being recovered as it felt like they were making no progress.","Some even held a sense of hopelessness when they fought as initially; the idea was that the Instrument of the Beyonder held two or three ordinances!","This idea was overthrown when he showed five and then six, and then ten. Each time he showed a higher number, they always raised the bar and stated that surely...he would run into his maximum number of Ordinances soon.","This occurred when he reached 10, when he reached 15, and even when he reached 20 as many began questioning at this moment.","What if this number continued to 25 or 30 or even more? And just how many more concepts and Pioneers do they have to keep alive all at once to truly and entirely seal all the Ordinances of this being?","They did not have an answer.","They only knew Pioneers were being butchered left and right as at this moment...","|Whether you are the Resurgence of the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian or not is of no consequence to the Pure Heart Sacred Palace of the Expanse. Our people are not participating in this endeavor!|","...!","A group of humanoid Pioneers from a Sacred Palace voiced out as they hung around the edges of the Relegation Zone of Existence.","They shockingly stated their intent to pull out!","They were the first, as the moment they did so, the gazes of the Golden Titans turned furious, while even fewer Pioneers were intent on attacking Ozymandias!","Following their lead...","|The Pioneers from the Royal Existential Sacred Palace of the Expanse have not entangled themselves by attacking you. We do not seek any conflict.|","WAA!","Another group of Pioneers rose up and made their intent known!","At this moment, many were stepping back as the benefits of this whole endeavor truly seemed far too low at the risk of their own lives.","But some were more staunch than others.","Some came from lineages that were too important across the weavings of the Expanse!","The Golden Titans looked at this scene with utter rage as the healing Great Marshall bellowed out.","|You do not seek conflict? You do not seek conflict?! You are the dignified Pioneers who have enacted your own grand path in the expanse! Members of Palaces of the Expanse that have stood for Cycles! You would take a step back?! Do you truly think this creature will allow any of you to take a step back?!|","The voice was booming.","But it did lay out some truly critical pieces of information and questions.","Many could seek to say they no longer wanted any part of this conflict.","But the response of the Instrument of the Beyonder himself...","BOOM! BOOM!","Was a silent one, but booming one.","As if he didn’t hear any of their words.","He continued to pull on his bowstring while terrifying arrows formed and disappeared, with his voice echoing out ever so often.","|Seal!|","|SEAL!|","...!","The gazes of many turned utterly sour as entities with their Complexities could come to conclusion very quickly.","He had already said it.","It would either end with their deaths, or his!","Along with the words of the Great Marshall of the Golden Titans, dozens of terrifying lights of Pioneers began to light up all around this region.","There had been a momentary lull in the number of authorities being exchanged as some had tried to back off and even leave, but now...","The concentration and number of authorities that began to light up exceeded even the initial volley of participants.","Because at this moment, everyone knew that their very lives were on the line!","The Great Marshall looked at this and nodded his head as even with his sealed path...","|To me.|","He called out calmly as all remaining Golden Titans lined up around him in different positions.","Around them, scorching golden heat began to spread as a massive illusory Golden Titan began to form around all of them!","The complexity radiating from it was utterly stifling as two golden singularities bloomed for its eyes that coldly stared towards Ozymandias.","|We can clearly see that this creature poses a high likelihood of truly being the Resurgence of the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian.|","WAA!","|Do not hold anything back as at this moment, we fight for our very lives before it. Sometime soon, A Source should arrive to aid us in breaking this domain of this Megalonian, and his fate will be sealed completely.|","...!","|So fight! Fight! FIGHT!|","BOOM!","The forming Golden Titan shot out as a Stanchion of trillions of suns was grasped in its hand, throwing it towards Ozymandias like a celestial spear as truly terrifying details came from its words and actions.","One thing was paramount.","They had to give it all they had as sometime soon, this domain nobody could leave would be broken through by a Source!","What was a Source? Explore more stories at empire","Some Palaces of the Expanse held such beings if they had truly deep histories, and making even a single one move was unfathomably difficult.","There were weavings of rumors that those at the level of Source Complexity were bound by rules others did not even know- rules instituted by the Watchers of the Wheelomachy!","Weavings of rumors.","Nothing substantiated.","And certainly, nothing that Pioneers could speak about as there had been too few instances in history where a Source Complexity entity interfered in anything, and even if they did, their power was so high that others might not be capable of recognizing their interference!","Nobody here knew that not too long ago, there had actually been an interference by Source Complexity entities from the Logos of the Wheel- and their interference was actually what kicked off a set of events that led exactly where they were now..."]},{"number":3466,"title":"Chapter 3466: Chapter 3465: A Clean Sweep! III","paragraphs":["The precipice of the battle.","Everybody knew they had arrived at such a place as they could feel how fickle their lives could be.","Many came here because their Palaces of the Expanse sent them to confirm and obtain the possible weavings of the Megalonians.","They weren’t able to obtain a definitive confirmation, but everything they saw so far pointed to a single conclusion.","And now, with the very real threat of death towards entities such as them, their paths kindled brightly as they gave it everything they had.","In the periphery of the Relegation Zone of Existence, there were also the Existence Severing entities who came, and yet they had been shockingly ignored this entire battle as only the Pioneers had joined in!","Every single one of them turned against the Instrument of the Beyonder who even at this moment radiated the aura of Severing.","But...","|That is not existence severing...!|","...!","A group of humanoid Existence Severing entities adorned in white robes had ashen expressions as they watched their remaining Pioneers surge toward Ozymandias.","The more they looked at this being who was pulling on a bowstring and releasing bursts of heavy complexity, the more they confirmed again and again that he seemed to be in an entirely different League!","He had shown at the very least twenty Severed weavings of Existence.","Did this mean that he held a power equivalent to twenty Existence Severing entities in his body?","No!","Even this felt wrong as at this moment, even though his aura felt like Existence Severing, even though it looked and smelled like Existence Severing, they were convinced that it was not!","These Existence Severing entities who became wallflowers in the background felt the same stifling sensation from Ozymandias as the renowned Pioneers they knew.","And this sensation was continuing to rise in an even more obscene manner. His complexity continued to climb!","This could not be allowed to continue!","The Existence Severing Palace Masters knew this, and the Pioneers knew this even more.","So the last assault began.","Pioneered Paths flourished.","In the middle of all this, Ozymandias held a dazzling white bow filled with the coursing aura of Genesis, his hands moving nonstop as he pulled on the bowstring and released arrows filled with the Severed Weavings of Chronos!","At this moment, time felt like it slowed.","Around him, rivers of blood of Pioneers poured in large numbers as finally, all those 20+ Pioneers who were sealed and sent towards the edges of the Relegation Zone of Existence perished.","All of their collapsed weavings and blood flowed into him with the estimate of a single Pioneer giving approximately more than 25+ Globules of Blood.","It meant a gain of more than 500 Globules of Blood of Pioneers.","|...|","In the slowed time, as Pioneers surged all around him to fight their very lives, Ozymandias paused to wonder how he got here.","How a young man from a blue planet was standing in a place known as the Expanse while entities that had lived for billions of years before him...were dying due to his means.","Pioneers.","He closed his eyes as he felt all of his Ordinances that were unsealed.","He felt the beat of his heart. He felt his Invictus Wings. He felt...his weavings.","His weavings! What made him who he was.","What allowed him to do what he was doing now with no regrets or worries on what the consequence could be in the future.","He felt it all...as it turned unfathomably bright at this moment.","|All your Ordinances of Existence have undergone at least a Single Severing.|","|Your Weavings seek complete Severing of all Aspects.|","Your next chapter is on empire","...!","He went about things differently.","With the Blood of Pioneers, he was able to sever aspects of himself, and he had now severed nearly all of them to arrive here.","Nearly all of them.","|Invictus Maximus is undergoing its first Severing.|","|The Amarantos Dream of the Megalos Rune of Existence is undergoing its first Severing, seeking to break from the source of the one who forged it and become your own.|","|The Sacred Primal Eye of Existence is undergoing its first Severing.|","|Your connection with the Infiniverse Megalos Seed is undergoing its first Severing.|","All of the minute, small aspects of himself each achieved their own Severing as after a sufficient amount did so...","|A critical percentage of your weavings of existence have all undergone Severing. It is sufficient enough to consider and distinguish your entire being as a Severed Complexity of Existence.|","|You are constructing and embarking on a new path towards the peaks of the Constellation Complexity.|","WAA!","In his unique state of profundity, he felt all his weavings cut off from...something as he felt a profound sense of joy and loss at the same time.","He felt as light as a feather.","He felt like he could do many more complex things with much greater ease and fewer requirements of authority.","But the sense of loss was also tremendous as he felt like he had entirely and completely cut himself off from something he was always a part of.","The overall existence. The overall weavings of existence!","They were bright and had a very clear path, but they came with their own regulations and flow.","All beings had to follow this flow.","But once one severed themselves, they broke apart from this flow and attained a powerful state where they could impose their own flow- their own regulations to achieve terrifying effects of their surrounding weavings of Existence!","Normally.","Usually.","For the vast majority of entities.","When they underwent Severing, they had first Amalgamated with their concept to make it part of themselves fully, and even after severing, there was still a sense of attachment with nature.","With Existence. After all, they were fully one with a concept that stemmed from nature.","No Amalgamation was done by Noah Osmont.","No Amalgamation was done by Ozymandias.","And then, his weavings had gone even further to singularly and completely sever many, many small aspects of himself from Existence.","By the time all of him was Severed...","SAAA!","An unfathomable phenomenon occurred as all noise faded.","The scene of Pioneers and all other entities faded!"]},{"number":3467,"title":"Chapter 3467: Chapter 3466: A Clean Sweep! IV","paragraphs":["When he opened his eyes again, all he saw...was darkness.","Not the Expanse. Not the Immovable Sacred Palace of the Expanse, nor the Pioneers or the few hundred Palace Masters surrounding him!","He had truly, utterly, and completely Severed himself from Existence in a manner that no other being had done before!","Complete Severing.","True Severing!","The darkness all around him felt extremely stifling as he found that he could barely move around. He could also barely see or even spread his senses out too far as everything felt far, far too heavy!","As if his complexity was extremely small for having arrived at this place.","For him to truly be able to move around with ease and understanding, his complexity had to be raised multiple times over from where he was right now.","He looked around him as he could only sense himself, but a small part of him felt an inkling.","A sensation that there was something else around him.","He focused on this sensation as very quickly, he recognized it to be something he knew.","The weavings of existence that he had known this whole time, he was just simply and truly disconnected from them at this moment.","To exist within their landscape and their regulations would require him to be familiar with them, understand them, and then analyze just to what extent he could now exert his control over these weavings of Existence!","Ever so slowly, the complete darkness all around him began to light up with brilliance as he returned towards the weavings of existence, but he was not the same being he was before! Experience exclusive tales on empire","—","Within the Expanse.","Dozens of Pioneers were seriously putting their lives on the line at this moment as they unleashed their glorious paths unto Ozymandias.","They saw his distinct figure that grasped the luminously white bow and continued to shoot out blazing arrows that disappeared the moment they were shot and emerged right before their bodies!","Their terrifying paths were about to arrive on him in the next moment when...","WAP!","He faded away.","...!","He faded out of existence as if he were never there to begin with!","Their eyes became stern as they were shocked to find that the oppressive domain that hung around all of them also disappeared.","The massive fused form of the Golden Titans became unfathomably bright as from its very center, the Great Marshall roared out as his power fully returned!","|Where is he?!|","He rode out maddeningly as their auras all spread out, and yet they couldn’t find a single shred of evidence that Ozymandias was here.","|WHERE. IS. HE?!|","HUUM!","The full power of a Pioneer erupted out.","With nothing to seal or hamper it, it was akin to a blazing, scorching sun that radiated its might all around- even causing the outer ring of the Blancverse in the distance to fluctuate!","The Great Marshall of the Golden Titans here was so powerful that in his enraged state, even other Pioneers nearby felt stifled and turned somber.","But even as they all looked around, they truly couldn’t find a single trace of Ozymandias.","At such a time.","\"What are you talking about?\"","....!","A voice echoed out.","A voice filled with ancientness and power, and a profound sense of dignity that could not be imitated so freely!","And yet at the same time, it felt familiar.","It did not seem to be filled with authority, but they recognized this voice to be Ozymandias!","They couldn’t trace its origin as in the next moment, it echoed out again.","\"I have been right here this whole time.\"","...!","Light flickered.","Exactly where Ozymandias was before, he reappeared once more.","And yet his aura could not be felt.","Even though he was speaking to them, they couldn’t be certain that his voice truly stemmed from where he was!","A certain sense of errieness spread as even when their powerful complexities gazed at him, they couldn’t sense anything regarding his.","What his level of power was.","Nothing was given off!","His stellar obsidian form and the obsidian gold wings behind him seemed to all have a certain sense of calmness and immovability as his mere appearance caused a heavy silence to descend in the surroundings!","The massive fused form of the Golden Titans looked towards Ozymandias with emboldened rage, this massive entity grasping an even more sizable Stanchion of scorching complexity that it threw forward at this moment!","It was the power of a full fledged Pioneer fused with other Pioneers as the Relegation Zone of Existence was not yet reinstated.","It crossed the vast distance of a quarter of an Omniverse to appear right before the visage of Ozymandias!","By the time it occurred, many eyes finally realized what had happened, and they became regretful soon after.","Because of the eeriness of the whole situation, the Great Marshall had moved due to his rage as currently, such a horrific attack of multiple Pioneers in a fused formation smashed onto Ozymandias. They did not expect even a shred of him to survive.","How regretful was this?","This was an entity who very likely had the resurgent weavings of the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian!","As many weavings moved with complex emotions, the heavy and scorching Stanchion that could burn away an Omniverse into ash with a millisecond arrived before Ozymandias as...","PAH!","His hand arose as a single finger of his moved forward to stop it.","...!","A single finger.","Even his own eyes seemed to be blinking in confusion before readjusting as one could see a thin veil between his finger and the massive Stanchion, as if they were on different planes of existence entirely!","On a different complexity!","Much of the complexity and damage of the Stanchion was mitigated by the single complexity on the tip of the finger of Ozymandias, and he flicked this finger towards the pillar of scorching brilliance as an instant later, it flew back at nearly five times the speed as it came with.","Towards the one who had thrown it.","And there...utter horror unfolded!"]},{"number":3468,"title":"Chapter 3468: Chapter 3467: My Weavings Are My Own! I","paragraphs":["The scene was one that those who managed to survive here today would never forget for the rest of their existence.","Stay connected via empire","A terrifying Stanchion of scorching complexity was thrown towards the Instrument of the Beyonder as in retaliation, this entity actually raised his hand and used a single finger to stop it!","A single finger!","Nobody knew or understood the mechanics of how he did it, but they only observed the flick of the finger thereafter.","It was simple, but it was also unfathomably heavy.","It shot out the stanchion of light many times faster than when it came, this stanchion arriving at the chest of the massive formation made of multiple Golden Titans as the moment it struck...","BOOM!","Brilliant sparks flew as the massive illusory visage of the Golden Titan illuminated cracks instantly, its complexity shattering as the widening eyes of the Great Marshall were seen at the very center.","The Stanchion arrived right before the Great Marshall, its front end pillar smashing into him and disintegrating his chest instantly- creating a sizable hole as the Stanchion then continued piercing through and disappearing like a flash of golden brilliance in the distance!","...!","The Great Marshall stared down at the massive hole in his chest, his complexity there facing disintegration as the force was so heavy that...","CRACK!","Cracks began to spread across his body, his path being so unfathomably shaken that it was no longer capable of holding itself.","At this moment in time, his gaze was that of astonishment and incredulity as he looked towards Ozymandias.","Around him, the other Golden Titans had ashen expressions as they spat out blood, their faces drained of color as they looked towards the Great Marshall they all admired...his complex weavings seemingly disintegrating from the reflected attack they had sent out!","A Pioneer.","Not a Sealed one, not one who could only express weavings of an Existence Severing entity...but a full-fledged Pioneer.","At this moment, such a creature had their weaving collapsing from a reflected attack born from multiple other Pioneers and the Great Marshall himself...an attack that was reflected back with a flick of a finger!","|...|","A horrid silence settled in the surroundings.","Utterly horrid as nobody wanted to be the one to break this silence.","In the distance, the figure of the great mother had her tentacles trembling jovially and with uttered disbelief as she looked towards Ozymandias.","In her mind, words of fanaticism and wonder replayed again and again, the figure of the Instrument of the Beyonder etched on her soul as his actions just now were put on full display to the Pantheon of Umbra in the Megalos Beyond!","Within the Blancverse, the always calm figure of the Immovable Sacred Guard was filled with solemnity as his eyes showed great shock.","He was a Pioneer, and he understood his complexity very well. Compared to the Great Marshall, who was currently collapsing, his own complexity could be considered slightly less!","And yet...","And yet...!","The appalling silence was deafening, as it seemed like it could be heard the equivalent length of tens of Omniverses.","This whole time, the Instrument of the Beyonder himself who had done such a shocking action was looking at his hands as if he himself was just now understanding exactly what he had just done!","—","Megalos Ynnere.","Omniverse X-999, Secondary Infiniverse Megalos Seed.","In this area that was filled with dazzling multicolored brilliance, there were the briefest flashes of darkness and light.","The body of Ozymandias had disappeared and reappeared right after as when it did, the very weavings of the nearby Secondary Infiniverse Megalos Seed began to shake!","His weavings were fully severed.","Truly Severed.","So was his connection to the Infiniverse Megalos Seed.","And what, pray tell, was the Infiniverse Megalos Seed made of at its core?","The very same weavings he had Severed from Existence!","HUUUM!","The Infiniverse Megalos Seed began to tremble as the tens of thousands of Runes of Existence all around began to swirl.","The multicolored sea seethed and expanded as it seemed to flash in and out of existence alongside the Secondary Infiniverse Megalos Seed itself, its body expanding in breadth and complexity rapidly!","Ozymandias arrived above this sea as it resonated with his weavings, feeling the unshakable connection between him and this Secondary Infiniverse Megalos Seed as alongside it, through the sea...he now very clearly and distinctly began to feel his connection with the main Infiniverse Megalos Seed.","After truly severing this connection from Existence, it crossed and defied all set norms of Existence as he felt it clearly at this moment!","This Frequency had its weavings of existence.","Hell Terra Firma...also held its own scope of existence as it seemed far more unique and complex when compared to any other Frequencies.","But, it was still a frequency.","It still held weavings of existence.","And he was cut off from all of this now as the inviolable workings of Hell Terra Firma...how could he not bend them, even if just a little?!","Ozymandias stood above the multicolored sea- the Frequency Gateway, as he opened his mouth.","\"My weavings of existence are my own.\"","WAA!","His words felt like a silent, ancient bellow of existence.","It felt old, archaic, and filled with complexity!","\"My body, origin, and soul are my own!\"","...!","\"How could I ever be separated from myself?!\"","BOOM!","The Frequency Gateway churned.","Its multicolored brilliance seethed as if one delved into it; they would cross waves of complexity for an indeterminate length of time, and by the time they got across it, they would come to find the neon anterior of another sea!","They would come within Hell Terra Firma.","Since a new entrant came in through the Frequency Gateway, time had distorted as nearly a day had passed here.","At this moment, inside of a white villa.","\"I need a one week break!\"","The visage of a dark-skinned Barbatos lay sprawled on a bed, her dazzling figure covered by white sheets as she heaved with a face full of defiance while glaring towards Noah, who was currently chugging a bottle of water.","He was about to reply as a smile hung on his lips when...","BZZT!","His body buzzed as if he had jolts of electricity coursing through him!"]},{"number":3469,"title":"Chapter 3469: Chapter 3468: My Weavings Are My Own! II","paragraphs":["Jolts of electricity.","They were silent, but they were there!","He felt....","\"Ozymandias...\"","He felt himself. He felt the other half of his existence as a flood of memories came rushing in!","Everything that had occurred on the other side. Everything that had just occurred recently.","The Severing of his many aspects of Existence until he attained...True Severing!","True Severing allowed him to be on his own terms of existence as he recalled that dark place Ozymandias had appeared in the moment it occurred.","It was a stifling place that felt like he needed a tremendously high level of complexity just to move around it, but it represented a new flow of existence for him to understand!","Hell Terra Firma...held its own flow as even now, after truly severing himself from Existence, he still could not break its workings.","He could not outwardly radiate any weavings of power as he wasn’t able to conjure fireballs or summon undead.","But within his body...he began to feel the wakings of brilliance.","The wakings of severed weavings of existence that were always with him!","Most profoundly of all, the one concept that had been severed 37 times now....Cheats.","He felt it.","He felt the severed weavings of Mana, of Quintessence, and of the Protagonist!","He felt all of them as the jolts of electricity that were always with him...but he just could not express them in Hell Terra Firma.","That was how terrifyingly complex this place was that even after truly severing his weavings of existence, the alteration of the existence of Hell Terra Firma was still almost impossible!","Almost.","New waves of information continued to flow in his mind.","Alongside this flood of information was...a sensation.","Something that Noah could not exactly put his finger on as this sensation made him want to try something!","He raised his hands and stared at his palm, but nothing occurred.","There wasn’t an explosion of authority or anything like that, but he still felt something as he reached out and adorned his robe, leaving the room within the villa and going towards the Infiniverse Megalos Seed!","\"I’ll be back soon.\"","He left behind a tired Barbatos who waved her hands without even looking up.","A minute later, Noah saw the shocked figures of Ruination and The Infiniverse Megalos Body join him, their eyes holding tremendous brilliance as Noah only nodded towards them while they went into the Infiniverse Megalos Seed!","The Infiniverse Megalos Seed that seemed to be contracting and expanding rapidly at this moment, as if shackles were unleashed and let loose.","It was transferred onto a protected hangar that was called the first Quintessential Base of Existence, and it had been placed in an empty clearing due to its increasing size as Noah had the Autonomous Quintessential Androids build a wide empty protective base around it!","Neon metallic floors stretched out for hundreds of miles all around it as if one wanted to walk towards it, it would take days.","But Noah, Ruination, and the Infiniverse Megalos Seed had simply boarded an Advanced Aerial Drone that rose into the skies and shot out with a blinding hum of blue light to very quickly arrive near the Infiniverse Megalos Seed.","It was rapidly expanding and taking on more space as its insides glittered with brilliance, the Extremity Vein seemingly coming to life as the sea within churned.","Its size had grown so much that it now reached 500 miles, and it still continued to expand as if it wanted to take back its old stature!","Noah looked towards the Infiniverse Megalos Body as her eyes were shining brilliantly while the Drone passed through the wide gaps and entered.","\"The Infiniverse Megalos Seed...I can feel nearly every part of it as its previously unusable features are slowly coming back to life, Master!\"","Her voice felt ecstatic.","And how could it not be when, at this moment, there was a possibility of them being capable of doing something nobody had done before?","The vessel they were in passed into the interior of the Infiniverse Megalos Seed as Noah looked up to see the discs that used to be Aletheian Havens, their weavings now looking fuller as they seemed like they wanted to return back to their actual size!","His family was within these dazzling rings surrounding the Extremity Vein.","And soon enough, he would be able to bring them out!","He looked towards the Infiniverse Megalos Body for affirmation as she nodded.","Find your next adventure on empire","\"Yes, Master. I can sense the life forms within the Infiniverse Megalos Seed smoothly, and with the gradual return of its workings, I should be able to pull in and out all miniaturized beings. As if they are passing through a gateway to enter Hell Terra Firma themselves.\"","...!","It would occur soon!","Noah nodded at this as he arrived above what used to be a pond days ago, but was now a sea expanding to 100 miles.","Its waters bubbled with brilliance and wonder as the Advanced Aerial Drone opened its doors, Noah looking down into this vibrant sea as...he felt that inkling again!","That sensation!","Across this sea, past its unknown depths, he could sense the Secondary Infiniverse Megalos Seed and Ozymandias.","He could sense himself as even while locked away with an untold distance, the sensation he had told him...that nothing should be able to stop his weavings from rejoining!","After all, they were truly and completely severed.","His weavings were his own. His existence was his own!","He remembered the words his other half had said not too long ago.","With his hair whipping about madly, he spoke out with a voice that seemed to be filled with archaic grandeur.","\"My body, origin, and soul are my own!\"","WAA!","The jolts of electricity within him became even more intense.","That sensation he felt...became even more potent!","He stood on the edge of the vessel he was on as he stared at the dazzling sea below and bellowed out.","\"How...could I ever be separated from myself?!\"","And without any hesitation, he dove towards the dazzling sea.","Towards the Frequency Gateway in Hell Terra Firma...that led towards another Frequency entirely!","He wanted to do something that nobody else had been able to do in history!"]},{"number":3470,"title":"Chapter 3470: Chapter 3469: A Change! I","paragraphs":["Noah knew that he had arrived at a critical point in time the moment that he plunged into the multicolored sea.","His eyes only saw brilliance as an instant later, he found himself drawn further into the depths of the sea at a rapid rate.","As this occurred, his surroundings began to crackle with an astounding amount of complexity as after his rapid descent, he began to slow down.","This slowness continued until the point that he came to a complete stop and could not go any further down.","As if it was not possible for such a thing to occur.","Around him within the weavings of the multicolored sea, he saw tendrils of grey brilliance coursing through it and forming a sort of a channel.","Through this channel, things thrown from the Secondary Infiniverse Megalos Seed within Omniverse X-999 could flow in smoothly, but something sent in the other direction- especially something with as much complexity as Noah... was impossible.","Before.","Before he had completely and truly Severed his weavings of existence!","OOOH!","He bellowed out with unfathomable majesty at the point he was stopped at in this channel.","He seemed to be in between Frequencies- one being Hell Terra Firma and the other being his home frequency.","And there was a barrier he could not cross.","But because it was in between...","BOOM!","His body flickered out of existence entirely as he found himself in the unique obsidian space.","That space of darkness where his complexity felt so immensely minuscule that it could barely move- he found himself here as in that space, he proceeded to burn his weavings of complexity to take a single step forward.","A single step.","It was a miserable step to take as it felt like his very weavings were creaking and it was unfathomably hard to even raise a single foot!","And yet he took the single step.","He took it as thereafter, he focused on the sensation of existence where he was just at, and his figure found the multicolored radiance returning again as this time...","He had moved past that point where his body was stopped in place.","...!","A single step.","But it was far too critical!","BOOOM!","The channel that he was in trembled and seethed as more and more tendrils of grey authority from Hell Terra Firma filled this place!","After he passed that point where he could not move forward from, his body still felt a sense of resistance, but he could proceed forward on his own as his complexity was waking up rapidly.","He felt Mana coursing through him.","He felt Quintessence and Infinity!","He felt Cheats.","Cheats burned with ambition as its Quintessential League of Existence was deployed, the unfathomably heavy tendrils of resistance in the surroundings being shaken off even more work as Noah began to charge through this channel.","—","Within Noah’s home Frequency.","In the Expanse.","At the Point of Origin where a number of Strings of Existence had been snapping one after another, the eyes of Bob and multiple other Watchers of the Wheelomachy suddenly turned unfathomably bright as they gazed up to see....","CRACK!","The splintering of the weavings of existence themselves where there wasn’t even a single String of Existence!","Splintering!","Space itself seemed as if it were shattering and breaking apart akin to a broken mirror, and from the cracks of this mirror, terrifying tendrils of gray brilliance instantly spread out.","These tendrils of gray brilliance instantly caused the Atmospheric Weavings of Existence to tumble and deplete at a rapid rate, and the cracking Expanse only continued to get bigger and bigger as the fractures of the mirror-like space extended out for a distance of multiple Omniverses.","Bob and the other Watchers saw this scene as their gazes rapidly changed, recognizing this terrifying grey authority.","\"Hell Terra Firma! Hell Terra Firma! Its weavings are leaking from this point of Origin!\"","Persephael shouted out while the Great Sage looked extremely somber, his gaze going towards Bob as he spoke out gravely.","\"We have to make the choice right now- whether we isolate this incidence into this Frequency of Existence, or we do nothing and allow it to possibly extend to all other Frequencies. It is not too late.\"","...!","The lives of countless many, and the lives of countless few.","Since they could do nothing to stop it, at most they could isolate it and ensure that the damage would not be too extensive. That the Wheel of Existence would not be severely affected!","This was their job as the Watchers!","Bob’s eyes showed a flash of hesitation as he waved his hands and pulled out the manifestation of a tree.","This tree was unique as it was made up of threads, of strings. Your adventure continues at empire","These strings were entwined with each other as they formed a massive trunk and extended outwards to form innumerable branches that attached to a round wheel.","This tree seemed to be sending its branches upwards and downwards, with the main trunk holding most of the dazzling strings- of the dazzling Spokes!","At this moment towards the center of the trunk, there was a particular String that had been shining with a golden radiance, but this golden radiance seemed to be rapidly dimming as a grey point of light bloomed at its very center.","It was a change.","This singular string that was affected was intricately connected to other strings all around it. If it was affected by this change, it was very likely that in time, the other strings- the other Spokes, the other frequencies would also be affected!","After all, the snapping of a single Spoke could go ahead and affect an entire Wheel.","Bob looked at this representation calmly as he replied.","\"You are not just talking about the isolation of Frequency. You are talking about Megalocide- the erasure, closure, and decimation of all the Megalos and all their forms within this Frequency of Existence- as that is the only way to isolate and close down a Frequency.\"","...!","Magalocide!"]},{"number":3471,"title":"Chapter 3471: Chapter 3470: A Change! II","paragraphs":["There was genocide- the act of horror of decimating and wiping out an entire group of people.","And then there was Megalocide.","The action of wiping out entire Megalos.","Very few had the power to do such a thing. Very few could even comprehend, or think about such a complex issue.","The Watchers were entities that fit such a description due to their complexity and power!","At this moment, a heavy silence settled as they watched the Expanse crackling all around them, and the Great Sage sighed.","He raised his hand as weavings of Anti-Matter bloomed on his palm, and he felt the levels of Atmospheric Weavings of Existence in the surroundings.","They continued to get less and less, as it was very easy to imagine what sort of problems could arise from such a phenomenon in the future.","And the Great Sage closed his eyes as he mumbled something only he should have been able to hear.","\"Is this it? Were we truly powerless to stop it?\"","...!","Was this it?","He asked such a question because the Watchers had long known that something was coming. A Change. And they just did not know what the change could be. In recorded history, there had been many events that they looked at as the potential sources of the change, but they never led to anything. This one though...they seemed powerless to stop it if it was truly the one.","The Erasure of entire Megalos was not something that he could do alone in a short period of time.","He needed the others to agree, as there were many who backed Bob.","If he was not convinced of Megalocide, many would not be.","And what it meant...was that they would not be able to do anything at this moment but continue to Watch.","Was this the right choice? Was it truly the proper path and stand to take in the face of this unfolding phenomenon that none of them could say, with certainty, what it truly stood for?","There was no answer as the mirror-like fractures continued to spread across the expanse.","A distance away.","The eerie silence of the battle near the Immovable Sacred Palace of the Expanse was broken by the sounds of space shattering.","Many turned around to witness Strings of Existence snapping rapidly around them as it was followed by the Expanse itself having cracks spread out- and then tendrils of gray energy blooming from these cracks!","Instantly, all of them felt the rapid drop in the levels of Atmospheric Weavings of Existence.","What others needed to replenish, communicate with, and resonate to ensure a smooth flow of existence.","The very same weavings that were distorted whenever an Existence Severing powerhouse or a Pioneer made a move to alter the surrounding existence.","Because there was an abundance of weavings of existence, they were able to effect great change and unleash stupendous capabilities.","But if these very Atmospheric Weavings of Existence began thinning out, just what would happen?","Nobody knew as at this moment, the figure of Ozymandias raised his head and looked at this phenomenon.","The cracks.","The tendrils of gray energy.","They were familiar!","None of this was coincidental, where somehow the moment that his other half was seeking to leave Hell Terra Firma, the phenomenon of the Unraveling of Existence became even worse.","He knew it was connected to him.","He knew that if his other half made the sacrifice and chose to remain in Hell Terra Firma, this unraveling may be stopped, slowed, or gone entirely!","And so, a choice came.","Should he proceed with the path that he was on where he would be able to return to his home, and be able to bring his family from a barren place where their lives were capped, and would likely perish within a hundred or a few hundred years?","Or should he turn back. Forget about Noah Osmont.","Live his life in Hell Terra Firma and die in time.","Maybe over time, be able to see his family as they were taken out of the Miniaturized Havens.","Maybe.","\"...\"","He closed his eyes as he felt the profound changes all around him.","As he felt his own weavings of existence.","DUM!","He felt the beat of his heart.","His mind buzzed as the memories of Adelaide, Henry, and his Mother arose.","His mind buzzed as he thought about his own future.","And...he already knew the answer.","His mind had never wavered.","Not once!","HUUM!","His eyes opened with ferocity and valor as he bellowed out.","\"Come!\"","...!","Whatever may come.","Let it come.","His roar was guttural as far from here, the figure of Noah that was crossing a certain channel...proceeded ahead with even more tremendous speed as his complexity was fully waking up the further across he went!","And after a second...his body burning with complexity saw the surface of a churning sea ahead.","And...","POP!","The glorious visage of Noah Osmont appeared above a multicolored sea.","It was a moment that would be unforgettable in his Weavings of Existence and the Weavings of Existence of many other entities.","The moment he arrived above the sea, a dazzling cylindrical channel followed his path and solidified itself!","It looked like a wormhole beginning to form as the very center of the Frequency Gateway was constructing an extremely solid pathway for the traversal of one side to another.","Continue your adventure with empire","But the more this pathway solidified...","BOOM!","It eventually led to an eruption of an unfathomably heavy and complex blast of light.","A blast of gray brilliance that propagated from this place, from Omniverse X-999... and spread out all around.","Across the Omniverses of Megalos Ynnere.","Across complex weavings of existence towards the Megalos Beyond. Across into the Megalos Nihilos!","The complex blast of gray radiance truly spread out from one point and covered all the Megalos!","A choice was made.","\"Ahh...\"","And a man brimming with complexity looked around as he felt the boundless waves of mana seething within him.","As he felt the severed Weavings of Existence as well as the unique resonance of the surrounding existence in response to him.","He was the first man to cross Hell Terra Firma and back.","It was Noah Osmont!"]},{"number":3472,"title":"Chapter 3472: Chapter 3471: The Descent of a Dark Age! I","paragraphs":["He felt everything about himself.","His concepts.","His authority.","His connections.","His Atlas!","Even his Atlas was Severed as it glowed with its own fantastical brilliance, the changes brought about due to this being unknown!","The changes.","At this moment Noah looked up to see the gaze of Ozymandias and the Infiniverse Megalos Body that showed elation, but he didn’t return this elation. He had to grasp and understand exactly what his choice had led to at this moment as behind him, the Frequency Gateway that looked like a wormhole swirled with multicolored radiance- gray light brightly showing a stable channel.","A stable channel where one could easily pass through from any side.","After he crossed through once, the pathway was fully set and stabilized as there was now a direct path established between Hell Terra Firma and another Frequency of the Wheel!","For the first time.","Now, what came from such an action?","A distance equivalent to a few thousand Omniverses away from Omniverse X-999.","Omniverse X-1.","Outerversal Authority was running rampant as hundreds of Morphons fought against thousands of Simians.","At the forefront, the Sword of the Commonwealth gloriously stood above a unique runic structure that seemed to be made of wood- its strokes making the character [SU]!","It was none other than a Piece of a Phantom Trace of the Wheel of Existence!","With it, The Sword of the Commonwealth who was fused with multiple other Simians at Ordinance of Existence and Ordinance Amalgamation level...stood against three Existence Severing Outerversal Morphons.","An entity in the form of a starfish, another who looked like a purple gold jellyfish, and an eel who radiated stellar obsidian grandeur!","And yet...","They all couldn’t get past a bunch of Ordinance Amalgamation Simians with the Sword of the Commonwealth in the lead precisely because of the unfathomable power of a single thing.","The treasure that gave The Commonwealth their power.","The Piece of a Phantom Trace of the Wheel!","Not much was known about it apart from its closeness to the Wheel of Existence, but with it, the campaign of Outerversal Morphons may actually be halted.","The Outerversal Morphon in the shape of a jellyfish, a Great One known as the Deep Sea Violator, roared out while constantly unleashing inky black flames that formed sharp typhoons forward.","|You will soon fall when you cannot power up that tool! When your weavings cannot sustain it anymore, do you know what we will do to your people?! Do you know?!|","Its gaze was filled with interminable brilliance as its flames that burned with complexity were warded off by a dim gold radiance that stemmed from the Piece of a Phantom Trace of the Wheel!","If only-","BOOM!","At such a time, a blast of gray light passed through this area as it caused every single entity to feel alarm, and in the next moment, the Deep Sea Violator felt the complex and scorching dark flames it was releasing by imposing his existence onto the surroundings...he felt it rapidly weaken and falter as it reduced in complexity and size by at least ten times. Read latest stories on empire","At least!","He was shocked to see this as he wasn’t the only one, with even the Simians experiencing this but...","\"Haha...!\"","The Sword of the Commonwealth laughed raucously as he felt the brilliance of the Piece of a Phantom Trace of the Wheel...remain exactly as powerful while every other weavings of existence seemed to be weakening.","His complexity and the complexity of those fused with him flooded into the Piece of a Phantom Trace of the Wheel as in the next moment, it released a blinding arc of golden light that formed into a complex spinning Wheel- one that speedily went towards the Deep Sea Violator who roared out and manipulated existence with his severed Ordinance, but he barely managed to gather a shred of his normal weavings!","SHIING!","The attack arrived as the Existence Severing Outerversal Morphon instantly had a huge gash spread across its body, its complexity shaking unsteadily and with shock while it looked at the Simians who seemed energized by the tool around them.","The Sword of the Commonwealth looked at this scene with blinding eyes as he roared out.","|Kill them all. Kill them ALL!|","BOOM!","Wonder and heaviness unfolded.","Away from here.","On another Battlefield, the Prisoner stood surrounded by dozens of Golden Titans- his body filled with faint marks of injuries as if it were made from reinforced steel.","And yet he stood undaunted by all of these attacks as the Golden Titans that were fused into a single massive one roared out at this moment.","|We just want our people! Simply give our people back, and all of this is over!|","Their roars were maddening ones filled with rage.","And in the midst of all of this, a shocking blast of gray brilliance flashed past them and caused everything to change.","All of them were alarmed as they gazed around, their weavings erupting out to discern and analyze exactly what had happened.","What they discovered startled them as the illusory form of the massive Golden Titan rapidly shrunk in size, and the few dozen Golden Titans that formed it could now be seen as it dissipated!","The level of Atmospheric Weavings of Existence in the surroundings...had reduced tremendously in that short period of time that the input of weavings they were placing in to form that illusory visage were no longer sufficient to keep it portrayed in the outside weavings of existence.","...!","At the same time.","The eyes of the Prisoner and the Golden Titans all looked towards a certain direction.","There, the blast of gray brilliance had revealed the grandeur of a massive multicolored tree that branched out towards the Omniverses of the Megalos Ynnere.","It was none other than the Tresoverse Primaltree of Existence from the Tresoverse Domain of the Omnifather!","It was now unveiled as from the depths of its massive trunk, the Golden Titans could feel the lineage of their brethren there!"]},{"number":3473,"title":"Chapter 3473: Chapter 3472: The Descent of a Dark Age! II","paragraphs":["The Golden Titans held looks of elation as they roared out, feeling their lineage closely!","|Let’s go!|","...!","Many changes bloomed.","Of these changes, the vast majority of entities were initially shocked as they studied what had happened, but then continued on with their weavings of existence as they were before.","As if they didn’t think what was happening now would be a big deal.","As if like many things before, it would come to be understood and pass.","That it was momentary!","And then, there were those who knew better.","In the Expanse.","At the Point of Origin.","Cracks spread out with even greater abundance as if something critical had been broken, with Strings of Existence continuing to snap by the hundreds as the landscape of the Expanse changed rapidly.","Bob and the other Watchers observed this scene with cold eyes filled with complexity as each one had their own thoughts.","Their Sources were far too complex and advanced as what they saw and what others saw was very different.","They saw the changes taking place that looked irreparable.","Irreversible.","\"There are always countless paths. But over the cycles, the paths that make way for chaos and disorder always seem to triumph.\"","...!","Persephael spoke out with a tired gaze as she looked at everything. Enjoy exclusive chapters from empire","Chaos.","Disorder.","It always spread freely and without fear as when she said this, Persephael looked towards Bob.","He knew a lot regarding Chaos.","After all...","\"No path can ever be perfectly predicted. The chaos that blooms is always and has always been part of the Weavings of the Wheel. The Chaos comes, and the Chaos recedes- leaving behind a brighter path thereafter. That is our job. To ensure this bright path even in the midst of all the chaos.\"","Bob’s visage shone lustrously as his bald head radiated majesty.","The Great Sage was silent as Anti-Matter seethed around him, his voice echoing out.","\"There is chaos, and there is this. This...is something far past the rungs of chaos.\"","...!","It was too heavy.","Too widespread!","At this moment, they could feel that it was already on its way to cover this vast Frequency of Existence, and very soon, it would spread to other Frequencies!","\"Feeling these changes in the weavings of Existence, this change will be akin to the descent of darkness after eons of brilliance. A descent of an age that many may not survive. A change...\"","\"A change that we knew was coming, but did not know exactly what it could be. But we knew something was coming, and we now deal with it.\"","WAA!","Bob cut off the Great Sage as his singularities thought about many things.","The Nine he had warned and prepared from across the Megalos and Expanse of a coming change.","One had disappeared into Hell Terra Firma as the point where he disappeared from became the Point of Origin for the change.","What about the rest? How would they fare?","Weavings buzzed with heaviness and complexity as the space around them continued to shatter like mirrors, tendrils of gray radiance spreading all around as another Watcher chimed in!","\"What now?\"","What now?","Bob blinked at this question before he replied.","\"Observe and understand, while I...shall wage a War to understand the Origins of those behind all of this. The Logos of the Wheel has gotten too comfortable. Too much leeway. If they truly saw these weavings of change and jumped to start them, then maybe the Logos of the Wheel should no longer exist after this.\"","WAA!","Terrifying words bloomed as the other Watchers listened, some sighing and turning away as they had to observe the extent of these changes all around!","In a far, far distance from here, Ozymandias was watching the eruptions of shattered space and the reduction of Atmospheric Weavings of Existence as his gaze was solemn.","The result of his choice was clear, but he would never regret the choice that he made.","The Atmospheric Weavings of Existence were reduced tremendously as in order to cause change and impose one’s own weavings on the surrounding existence, there had to be a much larger concentration of authority released.","In simple terms, if it took ten points of mana to cause a flaming fireball the size of a Sun to appear in the surrounding weavings of existence, it may now cost a hundred points of mana to do the same.","The expenditure of authority was going to be that much higher, while the change itself would not be as significant.","For countless entities out there, they would come to find this change to be a heavy shackle around their existence.","But then, there was him.","Did it matter to him whether he had to spend ten points of mana or a thousand points of mana to achieve a single change in the weavings of existence?","With his infinite mana, would he be at all affected in this drastically changing environment while others adapted to a landscape where their very authorities were that much harder to impose?!","The answer was a clear one as he raised his left hand again.","Amidst crackling and shattering space in the background, his weavings were silent as not a shred of the aura leaked out of his body, but his voice was indistinguishably clear.","\"Let us finish this.\"","HUUUM!","In his left hand, a dazzling cerulean bow formed as it brimmed with endless waves of mana.","The Pioneers and the Existence Severing experts in the surroundings who were startled and shocked by the sudden changes had their faces become even more solemn as they realized that this being would not leave any stone unturned.","Even at a time like this where something that none of them understood was occuring!","In the brief moment of shock, others who had felt at the disappearance of the weavings of the Instrument of the Beyonder briefly when he truly severed his Weavings of Existence- they had already discreetly left this region and continued running extremely far away.","As for those who did not realize to take this chance and stayed behind...","They may as well leave their Weavings of Existence here as Noah would need a great deal of the Blood of Pioneers in order to achieve complete Severing of his concepts many times over!"]},{"number":3474,"title":"Chapter 3474: Chapter 3473: The Descent of a Dark Age! III","paragraphs":["Within the Expanse.","Ozymandias floated with silent brilliance all around him as his complexity barely gave off any gravitas.","And yet the Pioneers and Existence Severing entities here all felt trepidation as Ozymandias called out.","\"Let the Quintessential League of Existence be established once more.\"","HUUM!","Blue light of shocking immensity surged out of him as to alter the weavings of existence- the requirement being so high that to alter existence at this scope, an Existence Severing entity would have their entire reserves and complexity drained just to establish it!","Just to unleash the Quintessential League of Existence.","And yet it was laid out as this time, even with the greater requirement of input of weavings, it covered a distance equivalent to five Omniverses!","This was the wondrous rise of complexity due to true severing of his weaving, but he knew he needed a whole lot more resources in order to continue elevating his complexity.","Every 27 Severings, he needed 3 Drops of Blood of Pioneers instead of 1. For over a hundred Ordinances...","The number was tremendous as he spoke calmly, making another choice.","\"Let us end our current Entanglement. You all came here to know whether I held the Resurgence of the lineage of Megalonians. I will tell you now that I hold what could not be obtained eons ago. The singular Megalonian who chose to dissipate his weavings of Existence instead of being devoured. I have taken the weavings of the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian for myself!\"","WAA!","\"Since you came for precisely this, you all can leave your weavings here forever.\"","...!","The Golden Titans looked towards him with hatred and burning brilliance as the massive stature of the Great Marshall collapsed entirely- scorched ash falling on the bodies of other Golden Titans.","Other Pioneers had ugly expressions as they just gained affirmation that they came here for, and yet they did not want to stay!","They did not want to stay.","At such a moment.","Ozymandias closed his eyes as he pulled back the bow string.","\"Ashes to Ashes.\"","HUUM!","In the surroundings, the Pioneers began to scramble.","The Existence Severing entities began to rush out!","They all sought to unleash their complexity to protect, and yet they found that it was nearly ten times harder to exact any effect of altering existence compared to before.","The power they could unleash was that much less.","They were furious, and now deeply fearful of losing their complex workings here!","But the Instrument of the Beyonder did not even wait for them.","From the pulled bowstring, it seemed like a sea of complexity was being charged to be released, the aura of a deep and ancient Severing only now being felt as it caused all dozens of Pioneers nearby to roar out!","The sensation they felt from it was utterly horrendous as their paths lit up like never before, spending every ounce of reserves of complexity they held within them as bright Runes of Existence lit up within their bodies.","Methods of operation seethed.","New ways to course weavings across meridians flashed!","And yet...","\"Dust to Dust.\"","Ozymandias let go of the bowstring.","And a gorgeous flourishing of cerulean brilliance unfolded as...one might swear they could hear the cries of birds.","But it wasn’t that.","It was the unfolding of petals of cerulean arrows- an endless array of petals of arrows flourished in shocking abundance!","They were utterly beautiful to observe and yet, the Pioneers and Existence Severing entities in the surroundings had ashen expressions as these petals bloomed right before their bodies.","A single petal smashed onto the body of an Existence Severing entity as he exploded into a mass of blood and complexity right after. Complexity that was drawn into a singularity that was absorbed by another flashing blue petal as it appeared above the Instrument of the Beyonder to be devoured!","And then multiple petals appeared before a Golden Titan with the weavings of a Pioneer, this entity erupting with golden flaming snakes as his body burned with blood gold tattoos.","And yet when the petals landed...","BOOM!","The complexity of the Pioneer dimmed before they were utterly shredded, with the rest of the petals ravaging the body of this Pioneer as each petal drew over a tenth of its complexity and devoured it entirely. Your next chapter awaits on empire","In a short instant, this Pioneer was gone.","This was one, but such a scene had occurred simultaneously across this wide Expanse for dozens of Pioneers!","Blue arrows of petals flashed in wild abundance and glory.","Alongside it, the Blood of Pioneers was drawn.","What followed were cries of rage, anguish, anger, and helplessness as eventually..there was only a deafening silence that followed!","\"...\"","....!","—","Within the Megalos Nihilos.","In a space filled with murky white radiance and storms of gray Anti-Matter, a blast of gray radiance had also passed through here as the Atmospheric Weavings of Existence were tremendously falling down.","In a nondescript corner of Nihilos.","A massive Acanthamoeba that looked like an iridescent silver Worm floated grandly while radiating the air of a Pioneer.","Behind it, a sizable white Mountain a few thousand times greater in size could be seen, trillions of life forms felt within that had been protected by this Acanthamoeba for eons!","As this Pioneer observed the changes in the surroundings with shock and grimness.","In the next moment.","RIIIP!","A distance of a tenth of an Omniverse away, space tore apart like paper as unique entities the size of worlds walked out from the ripped space!","Covered by obsidian-gray armaments, some were humanoid, some held animalistic features, and others looked like worms or trees!","And yet the one unique thing...was that these Entities did not have any eyes, ears, nose, or any distinct facial features.","No faces at all!","The only characteristic they shared was a single shining white line that was etched from the bottom to the top of where their faces should be!","Such entities appeared as they looked around at the changes and spoke freely.","|This is far off from the calculations we were told. It is too early, and we aren’t as prepared as we were supposed to be.|","...!"]},{"number":3475,"title":"Chapter 3475: Chapter 3474: The Descent of a Dark Age! IV","paragraphs":["Early.","Something arriving at a time when it was not anticipated.","It would have required prior knowledge regarding that thing...as well as the timing of when it would actually arrive!","At this moment, unknown entities appeared as one stated that what had occurred was far too early.","In response, a humanoid entity with four hands, carrying the same faceless quality with a vertical white bar shining up where his face used to be, replied.","|We adapt to changing circumstances. We follow orders and do what we are told, so let us proceed.|","...!","His visage seemed commanding as after he spoke others quieted down.","The vertical white bars of their Faceless heads shone as they looked around, and after a moment, the white mountain in the far distance was spotted- along with the blazing aura of a Pioneer who stood before it!","|A Viable Cluster of Complexity has been located. Move out.|","The command was a quick one as a moment later, the figures covered in seamless obsidian-gray armaments disappeared.","A distance away.","The visage of the Acanthamoeba was a brilliant one as it studied the changing weavings of existence with caution, its feelers sensing one change after another when suddenly...","BZZT!","It was shocked to find that a party of entities without faces appeared not too far from it!","|Who...!|","Its body pulsed with weavings of Anti-Matter as white flames began to swirl in the surroundings, but the newly appearing entities did not bat an eye to this as the Four Armed Faceless creature simply moved forward while radiating an intent.","|Do not resist.|","...!","Do not resist.","A Pioneer was told such a thing as it was furious, the white flames around it beginning to form into concentrated galaxies when suddenly.","Speedily.","Unfathomably!","The Four Armed Faceless creature flashed to appear inches away from the Acanthamoeba, one of its four hands shooting out as on its faceless head...one could now see a brief flash of something wondrous!","It was...a Rune of Existence!","But not just that.","This Rune of Existence carried a heart-shaking allure as, from its brief flash, one could sense the weavings of a Source from it.","A Source Rune of Existence!","It only flashed on its faceless visage briefly as its fist landed on the Acanthamoeba Pioneer.","Thereafter, the most terrifying thing occurred as the weavings of the Acanthamoeba Pioneer seemed to be suppressed and contained as the punch neared, and by the time it landed on the skin of the Acanthamoeba Pioneer...its weavings of a path all but disappeared as the glorious white flames that were just surging nearby were nowhere to be seen.","The feelers of the Acanthamoeba Pioneer trembled as after that, a formidable unknown power seemingly pressed it from all around- a dull boom echoing out from where the fist of the Faceless entity landed on it as an instant later, the consciousness of the Pioneer began to dissipate!","Its complexity...was suppressed and sealed as its massive body soon only floated in the white space without an ounce of authority.","\"...\"","No sign of life. No sign of weavings of complexity.","A Pioneer...was eviscerated by a single punch!","After that, the Four Armed Faceless entity waves its hands to pull out an obsidian cylinder.","|Laying down the Banner.|","Your journey continues with empire","A Banner, it was called.","And yet this being took this obsidian cylindrical object and plunged it into the body of the Pioneer- a low hum being released from it as a moment later, it entirely disappeared.","The body of the Pioneers convulsed thereafter before its skin split apart, an illusory image of...a tower rising from it!","This illusory image of a tower seemed to be drinking from the complexity of the Pioneer, this tower emanating a dreadful darkness as one could see a single, radiant vertical band of white running up the obsidian tower.","It rose up rapidly and expanded in size while the massive body of the Acanthamoeba Pioneer shriveled up.","The figure of the Four Armed Faceless creature pulled back to join the others as they watched this scene gloriously, the faceless heads not being able to show any emotions, but one could distinctly feel a fervent sense of complexity on the white beam of light on their faces!","They watched the illusory dark tower grow as after it reached a certain point, it pulsed and released a vibrant domain of obsidian light that spread out all around, going on to cover the white mountain that the Acanthamoeba Pioneer had been guarding this whole time as it stretched out even further.","It stretched out a distance equivalent to five Omniverses before it stopped, and all life forms within this encapsulated domain...began to feel their complexity of existence be slowly drained!","It was an eerie and terrifying chain of actions, and those responsible observed it gloriously while the vertical white bars on the faceless heads began to hum with fervent brilliance!","Away from Megalos Nihilos.","In the Megalos Beyond.","Above a Pantheon.","Faceless entities floated above dominantly as a titanic Faceless Wolf stood above a lifeless figure of a squid shaped Outerversal Morphon that radiated terrifying Megalos Regnum at the level of a Pioneer!","|We are not prepared. This will take even longer now...|","Its voice was thick and heavy as its claws waved down, an obsidian cylindrical pillar shooting out and inserting itself into the lifeless body of the Great One as moments later, a vibrant obsidian tower began to rise while the body of the Outerversal Morphon shriveled!","The other Faceless entities near the Faceless Wolf were silent as they observed the booming domain that erupted from the Tower, the white bands of radiance on their faceless heads shining brightly as if they were bringing forth an advent of something grand.","Away from the Megalos Beyond.","In the Megalos Ynnere.","Omniverse X-1.","The Shield of the Commonwealth breathed heavily as he stood near the Piece of a Phantom Trace of the Wheel, hundreds of other Simians around him as they looked towards defeated Outerversal Morphons that were roaring out maddeningly!","At such a time.","Above them, space tore as Faceless Entities appeared, the visage of a dominating Faceless Nine Tailed Fox wreathed in black flames looking down towards the Piece of a Phantom Trace of the Wheel as its white band flashed with brilliance!"]},{"number":3476,"title":"Chapter 3476: Chapter 3475: A Piece! I","paragraphs":["A Faceless Nine Tailed Fox.","The vertical white band on its head pulsed with heavy brilliance as it locked onto the Piece of a Phantom Trace of the Wheel over anything else.","Behind it, other Faceless entities appeared as the moment they did, the Faceless Nine Tailed Fox made a move!","It flashed and disappeared instantly, its figure reappearing behind the Sword of the Commonwealth and his forces as a single tail out of its nine released hundreds of obsidian hair-like fur.","They acted like silent spears that targeted all entities here- Ordinance Amalgamation and the suppressed Existence Severing Morphons alike!","On the Faceless head of the fox, an obscure rune brimming with a Source pulsed silently as the weavings of those here were not even able to react in time.","They only felt dread.","And a moment later...","|Ah...!|","Discover hidden tales at empire","|No!|","Sudden cries of shock and fury erupted as, in the next second, there was only silence.","Hundreds of Simians at Ordinance of Existence and even those like the Sword of the Commonwealth at Ordinance Amalgamation....dead.","Existence Severing Outerversal Morphons, dead!","The disparity in complexity was far too large.","An eerie silence hung in the surroundings after this as the Faceless Nine Tailed Fox looked towards the Piece of a Phantom Trace of the Wheel warily, an obsidian pillar rising from it and sinking into the body of the entity that had the highest complexity here.","HUUM!","The massive body of an Outerversal Morphon shriveled as a dark tower rose from it, unique weavings emerging from the Tower as the moment they did, the Faceless Nine Tailed Fox roared out through the vibrant white line across its head, its tails dancing chaotically as a net of obsidian weavings erupted from it to cover the Piece of a Phantom Trace of the Wheel!","WU! WU! WU!","Yet the Piece of a Phantom Trace of the Wheel released a dim glow of radiance that evaded all the lines of the net, along with the terrifying light of the Tower as an instant later, it warped into the folds of space and disappeared!","The Faceless Nine Tailed Fox breathed out heavily with frustration while looking at this as behind it, a Faceless Obsidian Titan appeared as his intent was a laughing one.","|Our power isn’t nearly enough to obtain a Piece of a Phantom Trace of the Wheel. The Degree of Rejection is simply too high for our Complexity to overcome. Leave it to the Forelders. Come, this early start of the change has thrown many things haywire, and Forelder Noxus has already given us new orders.|","...!","The Faceless Obsidian Titan stated such words as the Faceless Nine Tailed Fox was still looking at the spot where the Piece of a Phantom Trace of the Wheel had disappeared.","|What are the new orders?|","|To hunt down one of the possible contributors to the Change. Not much is known about the one we are assigned to apart from the fact that they originate from the Megalos Ynnere. But we have been told that when we meet them, we will know.|","WAA!","The reply of the Faceless Obsidian Titan was heavy as the Faceless Nine Tailed Fox and others nodded with affirmation.","The Faceless Nine Tailed Fox could not seem to take the Piece of a Phantom Trace of the Wheel out of its mind as it asked while staring at the spot it disappeared to.","|Where do you think it went? Another Frequency entirely, or still here? This is the third one I see up close that disappeared right before me.|","...!","The Faceless Obsidian Titan scratched his head while shaking it ruefully.","|The objects that reject us are the ones you’re most interested in? What an odd creature you are. As for that Piece of a Phantom Trace of the Wheel...who knows where it went? You may never see that particular one again.|","WAA!","Dreadfully unique words were left behind as the battlefield where Outerversal Morphons and Simians were fighting...was turned into a land of death.","Silently, the Sword of the Commonwealth perished.","When the light of the dark Tower reached all of Omniverse X-1, what would happen to the Viceroy and all the core members of the Commonwealth here?","Everything was unknown.","Further away within Megalos Ynnere.","Near Omniverse X-999.","A dim glow of gold flashed as space tore, something with fantastic unique weavings emerging from the folds of space as it was but a Piece.","A single Piece!","—","Omniverse X-999.","The Secondary Infiniverse Megalos Seed.","Noah stood side by side with Ozymandias as he felt the concentration of severed authority, his next steps outlined clearly as he thought of exactly what had to occur.","The resources that he needed were too numerous as the one place to obtain them in abundance was Hell Terra Firma. But without authority, the passage of time there was far too slow.","What was needed was the acceleration of time as he collected pioneers en masse. Revealed the weavings of the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian in the Expanse would also draw in even more fodder for him to eat up as-...!","HUUM!","He felt a buzzing all of a sudden.","It was loud, and it seemed to come from a close distance!","It resonated with the Atmospheric Weavings of Existence even here as he- someone who was entirely severed from Existence, felt this buzzing frequency clearly!","His eyes flashed brightly as his figure disappeared, crossing a distance equivalent to more than a single Omniverse as he appeared a distance away from Omniverse X-999.","The buzzing of a frequency was now extremely clear as he appeared near a dim brilliance- his eyes capturing a complex object that was miniaturizing itself at this moment.","He didn’t know its initial size, but it became smaller than a world in a few milliseconds, and then the size of a human head after another few milliseconds!","It became something a bit over ten inches in size, and yet its radiance was frightening as it held truly potent complexity.","Noah stared at this object with caution and alarm as he saw it was made with countless strokes, and it made the word...[SU]!"]},{"number":3477,"title":"Chapter 3477: Chapter 3476: A Piece! II","paragraphs":["His Sacred Primal Eye of Existence instantly opened while he took a step forward to grab this shocking object.","In one fell swoop, it fell into his hands as he felt like he was holding a piece of a hot stone.","It felt extremely heavy and unfathomably light at the same time!","Grasping it, the terrifying gold eye above him radiated a light of Severing as it peered at the details, his own complexity burning in his hands as he felt subtle changes begin to unfold.","In a moment, the weavings of what he held flowed into his mind as his eyes gradually opened wider and wider.","[A Piece of the Core Trace of the Wheel]:: Over the cycles, the Weavings of the Wheel remain abstruse and indecipherable. Something unforeseen has been the emergence of Traces of the Wheel of Existence. Something that allowed one a deeper look and understanding of the Wheel, but could not be held or obtained unless one had sufficient enough complexity. Some entities who were not able to grasp it could, at most, make Phantom Traces of what they observed. But even this contained tremendous power of the actual Trace. This Piece of a Core Trace of the Wheel has been mistaken to be a Piece of a Phantom Trace of the Wheel by many before as they barely grasped a percentage of its power. Its true usage can only be understood when a heavy enough complexity cycles through it...","...!","A Piece of the Core Trace of the Wheel!","A Tracing.","The Wheel of Existence was unfathomable to grasp or understand as a trace was akin to observing the Wheel itself up close!","And this wasn’t just a Phantom Trace of the Wheel, but a piece of the Core Trace itself!","Noah looked at it with somber eyes as its touch that felt hot to the touch felt like it was just asking him to pour his complexity into it.","But he didn’t do it.","Not yet.","His figure looked around this region before he disappeared, reappearing a moment later in the Secondary Infiniverse Megalos Seed.","He held the Piece of the Core Trace of the Wheel in his hands as the moment he returned here with it, the surroundings instantly began to buzz as the thousands of Runes of Existence lit up.","There were Runes stretched out around the multicolored sea and inside of it, and yet they vibrated with resonance at this moment at their light- what they were intended to accomplish...was getting elevated rapidly!","As if there was some catalyst that made them that much more powerful.","Noah grasped the wooden-like object in his hands as, at this point, his body began to light up with waves of mana that began to flow into it.","Since it was something related to the Wheel.","Since it reacted to the language of the Wheel itself!","What could actually be done with it?","HUUM!","The influx of his severed mana caused a dull gold glow to erupt along with a hum, a calm intent of feedback actually being released from the object in his hands and into his mind!","||What action would you like to accomplish?||","...!","Not even a voice.","It was an intent, and it felt foreign and unique! As if it was a different language being translated right before him.","It asked him what he wished to accomplish from the waves of complexity he was placing into the Piece of a Core Trace of the Wheel!","His eyes were bright as he looked around this radiant area, eventually coming to land on the multicolored sea as the one thing that plagued him came to the forefront.","\"Time.\"","WAA!","\"I need the smooth alteration of the flow of time between here and Hell Terra Firma. It is already occurring, but I need to control it under my own banner.\"","...!","He wanted for a day to pass out here, but for hundreds of days to have passed in Hell Terra Firma!","To give himself time to go through Settlements and Conquer those there as he enacted his farms to obtain complexities of others.","This was what he wanted to do.","The Piece of a Core Trace of the Wheel felt his intent and began to buzz, ultimately responding with a glorious intent.","||The proposed action could be accomplished by the utilization of the True Rune of Existence, TEMPUS. Its weavings will be passed on to you. For its construction, more waves of complexity are required.||","...!","A True Rune of Existence!","True. Continue reading on empire","He looked around at the thousands of runes in the surroundings that he and the Infiniverse Megalos Body had made as did this make them false? The Runes that the alternate Barbatos forged, were these considered false too?","His eyes were luminously bright as the heat of the object in his hand became more intense, musings of a terrifying language flowing into him as he saw...a word!","A single word!","But to simply utter this word out was nearly impossible as one had to have immense reserves of authority- just to speak it.","It could be written down by unique means until one became familiar with the trillions of strokes that made up this single word, and for Noah to construct it right now...","He raised the Piece of a Core Trace of the Wheel in his hands as he allowed his severed mana to flow freely into it.","Without limit.","||Pure Grade A Weavings of Complexity of Existence have been detected.||","||The forging of the True Rune of Existence will hold even higher quality due to the Grade of Purity of the Weavings of Existence.|","...!","Purity.","Many entities stuck on a single path for the sake of purity to the Wheel of Existence.","That it was purity which kept the wheel turning!","So why...was Noah’s Mana that could form many things considered of stupendous Purity?","Seas of it surged out.","Seas of severed authority blasted this unique object as moments later, it spun in his hand like a scorching sun as it began to release tendrils of white gold light that formed into strokes to form a word!","A True Rune of Existence!","HUUM!","Everything nearby tumbled and vibrated as Noah saw the rapid formation of a letter that was a mile long, its structure looking ancient and old as it looked like a carved white gold piece of wood.","Trillions of lines and strokes came together to form it as a subsequent letter began to form right after, this process being extremely fast due to the endless waves of Mana Noah was releasing!","In a short period of time, all letters were forged as a single True Rune of Existence bloomed, its weavings reading TEMPUS as this entire word looked like an ancient white gold wooden carving.","And yet the air it radiated was utterly fantastical- all other forged runes nearby, even the last one that Barbatos formed, trembling at its appearance as it released a vortex of white gold light that went on to cover the multicolored sea down below!","||A True Constellation Rune of Existence has been forged for the first time.||","||You have gained the distinction of Scholar of Runes.||","...!"]},{"number":3478,"title":"Chapter 3478: Chapter 3477: Are You Free? I","paragraphs":["A True Constellation Rune of Existence!","Noah forged one for the first time through the Piece of a Core Trace of the Wheel by putting in Pure Grade [A] Weavings of Complexity of Existence.","Grandly, the white gold brilliance of the Rune of TEMPUS permeated all around as a storm of temporal complexity seethed around it, covering all of the Secondary Infiniverse Megalos Seed!","It looked like a word made from a piece of ancient wood as Noah felt like he truly grasped what it stood for.","As if he was learning the words of a brand new language for the first time.","He looked at the terrifying temporal storm that was rising due to this single Rune as the Piece of a Core Trace of the Wheel in his hands slowly stopped burning!","The feedback from it stopped as it had achieved the usage based on what Noah communicated with it.","At this moment, the usual prompts stemming from his system of Existence flowed as his eyes grasped every single ounce of change occurring here.","|Complexity stemming from severed weavings of existence have tremendously altered the flow of time that was already innately disorganized between the Frequencies on opposite sides of the Frequency Gateway.|","...!","An alteration of an already existing state of disorder!","Time already moved in slowed or accelerated motions, and the True Rune of Existence forged went on to further alter this distortion of time...towards Noah’s favor!","|The altered distortion of time has been established to be a rate of 1:100. Every passing day on this side of the Frequency Gateway is equivalent to 100 days on the other side of the Frequency Gateway.|","WAA!","A clear distinction was made as the TEMPUS True Constellation Rune of Existence hung in the space above the Frequency Gateway, its light spreading even into the established channel as it achieved what Noah and the Infiniverse Megalos Seed were seeking to do this whole time...in an instant.","|It’s marvelous...|","The Secondary Infiniverse Megalos Body flickered beside Noah as she looked at the object in his hand that blazed with a silent complexity akin to holding a burning sun.","It was the closest thing they had gotten in relation to the Wheel of Existence!","Noah looked at it thoughtfully as his body split in two, one beginning to float towards the Frequency Gateway while the other stood still.","\"A Piece of the Core Trace of the Wheel...\"","It was a Piece.","Meaning there were other Pieces.","And with this Piece alone, he was able to forge a True Rune of Existence- one of a Constellation tier at that!","He was sure there was a lot more to understand regarding this unique tool as he grasped it while sending more waves of complexity into it.","\"Where are the other Pieces of the Core Trace of the Wheel?\"","WAA!","He asked a daring question.","And the tracing within his hands flickered dimly as it sent a feedback that...a tremendous amount of Complexity would be required to even portray anything related to this!","Continue reading on empire","|The Grade [A] of Purity and Complexity of your Weavings of Existence are high enough to cause a slight resonance between the Pieces of the Core Trace of the Wheel, but the moment you do, the Holder of another Piece will also sense that same resonance. If the Piece has no Holder, this is of no consequence.|","\"...\"","A feedback that made him stop from pumping waves of mana into the treasure in his hands bloomed.","He had many things to do currently, and after he was prepared, he could proceed with this.","He turned the object around as he spoke towards the Infiniverse.","\"The Grades of Purity and Complexity- the distinction is being made along the descending order of A, B, C, D?\"","The ranking of the purity and complexity of existence!","The Infiniverse Megalos Body nodded as her eyes flickered with a flow of information.","|The Runic Language seemed to fall back on more basal and simpler forms of communication. As you continue Severing your Ordinances more, their Purity and Complexity may theoretically be placed into the [S] Grade or [SS] Grade. Or this may be entirely wrong, and the runic language could have another distinction entirely by the time we get there.|","...!","The musings of the Infiniverse Megalos Body flowed as Noah nodded and looked down to see the other body he had just released sink into the Frequency Gateway.","A brilliant gray light flashed as he only felt a slight pull with the body he left behind, but...","HUUM!","His Severed Weavings buzzed as he withstood this pull and remained right where he was!","He could send another part of himself into Hell Terra Firma...without being affected by its pull!","He was able to escape it.","He could enter and leave it freely.","And now, there was only conquest left upon it as it was a sandbox of hidden treasures from Matter, Dark Matter, and Anti-Matter all clustered within waiting for him!","So long as a day passed here, a hundred would have passed on the other side.","The progression and gains that would be made were bound to be heavy.","And then...there was understanding exactly what the extent of the Change that was occurring because of his actions of leaving Hell Terra Firma were.","And for this...he could already sense many things.","As someone who had truly Severed his weavings, he sensed many things differently.","His interactions with the weavings of other people were also severed.","Not in a way where they were cut off, nor something along the lines of him severing the attachments or emotions with other Existences that he interacted with.","Because even these weavings were severed, he could more clearly see the intricacies of his interactions with the weavings of others akin to many strings that rose from him and extended out.","He floated at the center, and there were countless strings shooting out from him like a spider web!","If he so wanted, he could cut these strings. If he so wanted, he could study these strings.","He raised his hands to feel these invisible strings as many led to Hell Terra Firma, and there were those leading towards the Expanse, the Megalos Beyond, other points of the Megalos Ynnere, and even Megalos Nihilos!"]},{"number":3479,"title":"Chapter 3479: Chapter 3478: Are You Free? II","paragraphs":["He looked at the string leading to Megalos Nihilos as the image of the Great Usurper flashed in his mind.","This severed string was tout strong as he didn’t need to worry about this unique friend of his, but...","He stared at the Strings leading to areas in the Megalos Ynnere that were dimming one after another.","Simians of the Commonwealth he had met before.","The Sword of the Commonwealth.","Ordinance Amalgamation and Ordinance of Existence Entities met in the Tresorverse Sacred Domain of the Omnifather.","One after another, they had dimmed or were dimming as it seemed like something, or someone...was killing off the most powerful entities within the Megalos Ynnere!","But Noah didn’t even have to sit around and wonder.","In his Severed state of existence, he could do many things as currently...his intuition told him that he could do and see far more with these strings that represented his causality with others!","There would be a level of difficulty when it came to those with tremendous complexity, or those with higher complexity than him, but if it was anyone else lower or even someone who had perished...","\"Show me.\"","He spoke commandingly towards the string that showed the causality between him and the Sword of the Commonwealth.","Faint.","Barely discernible.","But it was there.","At this moment, this dead string began to light up as musings of the Sword of the Commonwealth began to flow!","What he experienced right before his weavings collapsed... Your adventure continues at empire","As Noah did this, the body of Ozymandias close by flickered and disappeared- seas of Outerversal Authority wrapping around his body as he returned to the Megalos Beyond!","—","In the Expanse.","Near the Immovable Sacred Palace of the Expanse.","Mirror-like cracks could be observed throughout as, at this moment, there was a deafening silence all around.","No roars of Pioneers of Existence or Existence Severing entities could be heard.","Even in the Blancverse of the Immovable Sacred Palace of the Expanse that held the Sacred Guard and his people showed gazes of doubts with numbness in their eyes as the radiant space of the Expanse before them that was filled with terrifying complexities of Existences they had heard names of or been knowledgeable of across different Palaces of the Expanse... had all perished.","Golden Titans- perished!","Outerversal Great Ones- Perished!","Ents- gone!","Any of the myriad lineages of entities that were here had all been eradicated by the magisterial scene they all just witnessed.","A single entity pulled back a bowstring, and from that bowstring came terrifying devastation.","A heavy complexity that seemed to surpass any type of Severing they had seen before erupted as it shredded apart other severed weavings of existence and the paths of the Pioneers- and quite literally devoured their complexity where they stood as surrounding the body of the Instrument of the Beyonder...were streams of rivers of crimson gold Globules of blood that all entered into his fold.","|....|","Nobody within the Immovable Sacred Palace of the Expanse spoke.","What they had just witnessed, paired with the unfathomable changes occurring across the Expanse, made them all send messages to the strongest backers they knew- depicting everything that happened here while seeking to understand the changes around them!","At such a moment.","HUUM!","The area surrounding the Instrument of the Beyonder flickered with a unique brilliance as the shattered mirrors of reality that were spread out all around gathered together- a wall forming on all sides as his visage became enclosed, no longer visible to their eyes even if they sent their weavings forward!","But would anyone even dare to send their weavings forward after what they had just witnessed?","Inside of the enclosed weaving of space.","The weavings of the Expanse were brought together in this manner by a terrifying Source, Ozymandias opening his eyes as he swallowed multiple Drops of Blood of Pioneers and directed them to sever different parts of himself.","When his eyes opened, he saw the visage of an entity with a smooth round head without a shred of hair and a humanoid appearance underneath a white robe!","His head seemed to be flashing with a mixture of white, gold, and black radiance at this moment as if his skin couldn’t decide what color to take on.","It was someone he had met before with another body.","The one who gave him access to a Blancverse after arriving in the Expanse.","Bob!","He looked towards Ozymandias as he let out a sigh, gazing at the shattered weavings of existence around them as he began to speak!","\"I thrive on chaos. I get stronger, and have been getting stronger with every passing eon and increase of chaos. My Path is that of Khaos. A more ancient, older form of disorder.\"","....!","\"Over the years, I’ve come to find that Chaos is necessary for a long period of Order. That there was never just Order...without a period of Chaos. So I was preparing for the Change that I knew was coming. For periods of chaos and wars as in these past eons, things had been far too peaceful. I found entities that could either be those who contributed to order or chaos and sought to help them. Some in different Frequencies. Others in this Frequency.\"","As he stated this, his gaze lingered on Ozymandias before he continued.","\"I did this because of what I came to understand over the eons. Chaos was necessary for change, yes, but not the unpredictable and utterly disastrous chaos. It had to be controlled chaos. Controlled disorder. Paradoxical, is it not?\"","He seemed to want to talk.","Since he wanted to talk, Ozymandias would listen as even though this being was unfathomable, Ozymandias did not fear him. So he continued to listen as in the swirling singularities of Bob’s eyes, light flashed as he continued deeply.","\"Sometimes...I think of letting go. Let the other parties aside from me do whatever they wish regarding the Wheel of Existence. Let chaos unfold without any control or direction. But every time I think this, I am always pulled back in to intervene. I can’t seem to sit still. So I eventually came to ask myself...am I doing that out of my own free will? Am I bound and controlled by the Wheel in a manner I do not know? A slave to existence even though I have severed it long ago? Am I free to choose what I want to do as every time, I choose the same? Am I free? Are you...free?\"","HUUUM!"]},{"number":3480,"title":"Chapter 3480: Chapter 3479: Are You Free? III","paragraphs":["The question was a simple and yet unfathomably complex one.","Was he free?","The choices that he made. The distortions of causality.","His entrance into the Purgatory Lands and his subsequent exit seemed to be part of a chain of reactions that caused all the things occurring right now.","He thought of Vitalis and Vacuous.","He came from a place that could be considered a farm for Fruits of Existence- built upon the labor and weavings of others.","And even those who used to be mysterious entities that lived far above...were crushed under his heel in time.","He thought of the Infiniverse Megalos Seed and Ruination.","He thought of many things in this short span of time as...","Was he free?","\"I am free.\"","WAA!","He replied succinctly.","The choices that he had made were his own.","There was nobody whispering in his ear telling him to take this step or that step. There was nobody forcing him to do anything.","But even while saying all of this, there was no denying that there could be an influence.","He made his choices, yes, but that was after he was put in certain situations. This was the influence and the complexity of interactions of others.","In all of existence, he was not alone. There were others with their own weavings resonating with him and countless more, and it was only through this unfathomable web of weaving that everything existed!","Interactions. Causality.","He felt it more and more at this moment, with him being truly severed from existence as he saw that his control over his interactions and lines of causality connecting him from one person to another could be modified or cut off in a way he could not do before.","So even with all of this considered, he still knew that he was free.","And yet this unfathomable being before him asked him such a question as he himself wondered whether he was free.","He was more advanced in complexity than he was. He had lived for more years than he had. He was even closer to the Wheel of Existence than he was.","And even he questioned!","After he answered, the visage of Bob looked at him for a few seconds, staring deeply into his eyes as if he could peer through and understand the thought processes that led him here.","After a brief silence, Bob waved his hands and sighed as an illusory screen appeared in between them.","\"This could be considered not too long ago in the variation of time depending on your complexity, or it could be considered days or months ago.\"","\"Right after The Change began, I left this frequency to go to one that is dominated by a group called the Logos of the Wheel. A band of creatures that formed many Cycles ago who made it their intent to intervene in many Frequencies of the Wheel. To appoint the right people in control for the sake of Order. To eliminate those who would impose chaos into certain Frequencies. It was all for the sake of the wheel of existence or so they said. But of course, behind every purpose, there is an uneven truer purpose. For many of them, it was to elevate the Complexity of their Existence. To exceed their paths of Pioneers and attain a Source, and experience even grander complexities across the Frequencies of the Wheel as only in this manner can one truly get close to the Wheel of Existence.\"","WAA!","\"One frequency could have a resource or an item that was helpful in elevating one’s complexity, and if one remained in a single Natal Frequency, they may never be able to advance. So the Logos of the Wheel formed to serve themselves and others. They had been at odds for most points over the Cycles with another group intent on keeping the flow of the Wheel as it should be...the Watchers of the Wheelomachy\"","...! Discover hidden content at empire","The Logos of the Wheel!","The Watches of the Wheelomachy!","Noah’s weavings heard these terms not for the first time as he remained placid- with him having gotten some answers out of Barbatos in Hell Terra Firma after she let go of her reservations!","He had to pry them out of her, but he had his means that even caused her to tap out in the end.","So he continued listening calmly as the illusory screen conjured up between them showed a scene of Bob crossing untold complexities to arrive above a sea that held a single man.","The intricacies of this illusory screen were so unique that Noah didn’t feel like he was just watching it, but it was radiating a light of weaving that allowed him to feel as if he was right there. As if he was in Bob’s place in that incandescent sea.","The scene was paused as Bob looked at it while continuing to speak.","\"As a watcher, I have lived many cycles ensuring that people jumping between Frequencies or those coming where they should not, or doing what they should not- are returned to their rightful places. This fixes chaotic events or simply aligns things before the Wheel of Existence itself fully straightens out how things should be.\"","\"I and many others knew of a coming Change, and I even sought out unique individuals and sought to help them as this Change came. But the way this change occurred felt...filthy. Dirty. As if yes, it was supposed to occur, but this was not the way nor the time that it should have bloomed. And so, I sought answers from those responsible. The ones involved in the Point of Origin where many of these things unraveled. And so I went to another Frequency to ask questions and likely start a War.\"","HUUM!","The scene between them finally began to play out as the brilliance of the weavings pulsating from it made Noah’s eyes feel like he was involved within the scene itself.","He felt the waters below his feet as he looked towards the distant figure of a man who turned towards him, towards Bob, with a complicated expression.","And in the scene, Bob waves his hands to show images of two entities.","One was someone that Noah was extremely familiar with, having been exploring every inch of her body recently. The other was a man with a cold expression on his face. It was the two beings that held his Blancverse in place while he was swallowed by the light of Hell Terra Firma!"]},{"number":3481,"title":"Chapter 3481: Chapter 3480: Are You Free? IV","paragraphs":["Bob portrayed the images of the two beings clearly before the man standing above a radiant sea as he spoke out coldly.","\"These two creatures acted from orders under you to ensure that someone else entered the Purgatory Lands. It was an event that initiated a Point of Unraveling that has led to utterly drastic and disastrous changes as of now.\"","\"Now, I cannot seem to find these two, so it just leads me to come to you- the one responsible for giving the order. May I ask just what prompted you to do something like this?\"","His question was a simple one.","The man who heard it had a complex expression as he stared at the image of the woman between the two entities that Bob had portrayed.","He seemed to feel a mixture of guilt and relief at Bob’s words as he sighed.","\"Would you believe me if I told you that this was not my own doing? That even I was following the orders of someone else without knowing what they would lead to?\"","...!","His eyes looked distraught and filled with unknown weavings of complexity as Bob looked towards him coldly!","\"You, who sits on the Council of the Logos of the Wheel, was following the orders of another? Do you mind enlightening me as to who this another is?\"","His gaze was cold. His figure had begun cracking with boundless weavings of authority.","But at such a time...","HUUUM!","A burst of authority radiated outwards as behind the figure of the Council Member of the Logos the Wheel, another entity appeared!","The appearance of this entity caused Bob’s eyes to become unfathomably sharp as he was someone that Bob knew.","Someone that Bob had just been with not too long ago!","This Entity who looked like a wizened old man looked towards Bob and spoke out while shaking his head and tapping out towards the Council Member near him.","\"You never could just leave things alone, Bob. Do there always have to be answers? At times, I think it is better when things are left to the unknown. When mysteries remain a mystery. When there aren’t always clear answers to every single thing.\"","...!","He had only tapped out towards the council member, and yet this being who had a terrifying Source Complexity found his mouth disappearing while his weavings became entirely locked down!","His eyes showed an ashen expression of shock and incredulity as an instant later, he was wrapped up in an undeniable light as he disappeared!","The one responsible for this looked towards Bob calmly as around him, space began to distort as other figures also appeared.","The wizened old man....was none other than the Great Sage!","Bob looked towards him and the complexities of other entities currently appearing as his eyes became exceedingly cold and callous.","The Great Sage.","A Watcher of the Wheelomachy!","He appeared at this juncture as, behind him, entities filled with unique and eerie complexities appeared one by one as there were nine in number.","Find exclusive stories on empire","What was even more unique was that these entities were covered in obsidian armaments, with their heads showing no facial features as only a single brilliant vertical white band of light could be seen!","And it wasn’t just this as towards his left and right, space distorted as on one side, a massive entity that looked like a round singularity radiating thousands of obsidian tentacles all around appeared.","Behind it, variations of similar obsidian armored entities with vertical white bands on their faceless heads could also be seen.","Another group appeared to his right with similar get ups, and behind him...","WUUU!","A gorgeous woman palpating with weavings of power appeared, her body adorned in multiple golden jewels, crystals, and necklaces as she glittered from head to toe.","It was Persephael of the Watchers of the Wheelomachy.","She also had the unknown Faceless Entities behind her as at this moment, they entirely surrounded Bob.","Looking at all of them, Bob turned silent and introspective as he grabbed his chin and spoke.","\"Members of the Wheelomachy, and the Logos of the Wheel working hand in hand, and now you have these unknown vile creatures behind you. I almost want to ask why. I almost want to ask for the reason behind all of this. What you all could possibly hope to achieve with everything that you have already attained with existence. If the reason for this is greater complexity, I ask you, even after you attain that...do you think it will be enough? You already sit atop the Frequencies of the Wheel, observing and seeing the countless complexities of existence. If even this was not fulfilling for you, do you truly think your voracious complexities would ever be fulfilled?\"","He uttered out his words calmly as if he was not just surrounded by an unknown number of terrifyingly powerful complex existences.","A heavy silence fell in the surroundings as nobody spoke.","The Great Sage looked contemplative as Persephael only shook her head.","\"You are right. No reason for questions and answers. Just know that you stood as an obstacle to something, and that obstacle needs to be cleared.\"","WAA!","As she spoke, her surroundings glittered with dazzling gems and crystals as a terrifying complexity was about to erupt from her.","Bob looked towards her and others in the surroundings as he shook his head with a sigh.","\"You seem to have prepared a great deal. Do you think all of this will be enough to kill me?\"","...!","His words were so calm that one would think he was asking about the weather.","And yet towards his words, everyone here became grim as the Great Sage shook his head.","\"Killing you would be far, far too hard. Containing a majority of your complexity here though...that is manageable.\"","With those words...","BOOM!","Everything exploded.","The scene that Noah was observing and feeling as if he was at the center where Bob experienced all of these things shattered.","His eyes were somber, and the illusory screen between them faded away as Bob looked towards him calmly.","\"I am currently bound and held down without being able to move much. The Watchers of the Wheelomachy... I do not know who among them is compromised. I also do not know the extent to which the Logos of the Wheel is compromised.\"","...!","\"Thus, I have to turn towards other sources to see if they can help. Others who may be able to ride this erupting chaos like never before and possibly restore a semblance of order to it. I come to you to ask whether you are willing. It will be incredibly dangerous, with those you come across being Pioneers and Source Complexity entities that have waded across Existence for cycles. You may gain something, or you may not. You may achieve something, or you may not. The results are completely unclear.\"","WAA!"]},{"number":3482,"title":"Chapter 3482: Chapter 3481: The Wheelomachy! I","paragraphs":["The results were completely unclear as he may be able to achieve something, or achieve nothing!","He could live through it gloriously, or he could die under the weight of complexity.","Bob was sure to state this with clarity as truly, much about what would soon unfold...was unknown.","His singularities were calm.","Almost as if he wasn’t currently under siege by multiple terrifying existences!","He looked towards Ozymandias as he continued.","\"They tried to peer into you before, but I turned their attention away for the most part when they questioned the single Existence Severing entity that was waging a war against Pioneers. But since you were involved within this Point of Origin where existence unraveled, they’re likely to send their forces after you- or a version of you. Be ready and prepared for something like this. What choice will you make?\"","Choices.","As always, it came down to a choice that Noah himself had to make.","Bob looked out to the shattered weavings of existence all around them as his voice echoed out mesmerizingly.","\"You could very well choose to walk away. That might even be a wise choice. But I will need to know soon if that is the case so that I can make other preparations.\"","...!","It was a choice, but the matter was time sensitive.","And yet in the span of an instant, millions of calculations and thoughts could be computed as Noah’s weavings had long since come to a decision.","\"I am willing. Although I don’t know how much help I will be when it comes to these entities that have already attained their Source complexity far too long ago. I have only just recently Severed the Weavings of my Existence.\"","...!","Yes.","The enemies were truly far too big.","Far too distant!","And yet towards such a reality, Bob smiled.","\"Does that not make it more fun? There’s increasing chaos and disorder, and the possible collapse of the Wheel of Existence as the end goal of this unknown force, but it doesn’t have to be all doom and gloom, right?\"","WAA!","The eyes of Ozymandias flashed coldly.","\"The collapse of the Wheel of Existence?\"","He had to ask.","And Bob only waved his hands dismissively as he replied.","\"Just a possible theory among many that I have as to what exactly could set off people that I have known for eons to leave behind everything they preached. But what matters the most is understanding the why. The why...is always the crux to everything. For what is all of this occurring? Why should this Change occur? Why and how did others jump off the threads of this Change to use it to their advantage? And last but not least, who the fuck are these Faceless Lifeforms, and why are we only seeing them now for the first time?\"","...!","There were a great deal of things to understand regarding what had happened and what would be coming.","Bob shook his head as he asked all of this, his singularity coming to focus on Ozymandias once more.","\"I do not have much time as my weavings continue to be sealed even now. To be prepared for what is to come since you are up to the task, you will need to understand the origins of many things and increase your complexity. I stem from the Wheelomachy. I have been a Watcher of the Wheelomachy for as long as I can remember. There is very little that I kept from them, but I of course had a cautious nature. I hid a shred of myself- completely separate from the current me as they will not be able to seal that part of me, but it lies dormant and weak in another Frequency of Existence. That will need to be woken up if I am to be of any help in the future to come. But to get to that Frequency...you will have to use the channels of the Wheelomachy.\"","The Channels of the Wheelomachy!","\"Established Channels through different Frequencies of Existence. To access them, you will need to enter the Palaces of the Wheelomachy that stand veiled in the highest edges of the Expanse- into areas that mainly those of the Source Complexity could easily access. It will be arduous, but you will have to find a way into these domains and not be captured by any Watchers as I truly cannot say who has been turned or not. It will also be within my domains as you may even have enemies wading through them to ensure I am sealed. Here are some secret pathways I enacted myself into the Palaces of the Wheelomachy within this Frequency, along with the information on which Frequency you will need to reach where my dormant isolated self is hidden, and other miscellaneous things that may be of use...\"","Bob tapped his finger out as threads of gold light unfurled and flowed towards Ozymandias.","Records.","Information.","Read exclusive content at empire","\"The Wheelomachy...was something that I now realize I took great pride in. It gave me a great sense of purpose. The one who introduced me to it...was a great woman. She taught me purpose and direction of complexity. A modus operandi for life. I had her teach me for many years just what it meant to be a Watcher. I learned...from the First Watcher of the Wheelomachy.\"","WAA!","His singularities seemed despondent and filled with complex emotions as if he was recalling a distant past.","But he continued nonetheless.","\"I do not ask of you to be a Watcher of the Wheelomachy, but you following this path would fit the description that she set down when she first taught me. You would fit the description to be her Great Disciple. The Great Disciple of the First Watcher, just second in line after me. Well, that is if you do not die and get your weavings of complexity utterly obliterated in the chaos to come. After all, you have to be alive to enjoy your distinctions, right?\"","...!","As he said this.","Bob’s body began to splinter and crack!"]},{"number":3483,"title":"Chapter 3483: Chapter 3482: The Wheelomachy! II","paragraphs":["The visage of someone unfathomably powerful...was splitting apart and beginning to fade.","\"Those assholes really planned well. Especially those Faceless Entities you observed in that scene. They seem to hold a sort of complexity that is resistant to The Change that has begun spreading with this Frequency as the Source. Take caution against them when you do come across them. I do not fully grasp your level of complexity, but it is possible for anyone who has Severed their weavings of existence and then Pioneered their own path to potentially leave a Frequency of Existence. If a path is available for them. If they have unique means. For you, if you can access the paths I set within the Wheelomachy, they can lead you to anywhere you wish to go. As of this moment onward, you can take and consider yourself distinguished as a Watcher of the Wheelomachy. Not just any Watcher, but one of Direct Descent from the First Watcher of the Wheelomachy who passed her weavings to me. That is if you wish to take on this distinction. And if I have one last piece of advice for you...\"","...!","His singularities turned melancholic and filled with complexity.","A last piece of advice.","As he said this, his lower half began to shatter and fade away while his voice was just as resonant.","\"Everyone seems to be chasing after more and more complexity. To get closer and closer to the Wheel. If this is the only drive one has- just an endless need to increase the complexity of existence, you will come to find that it never ends. You will always want more no matter what you achieve. Your life...would never have that sense of fulfillment and happiness.\"","WAA!","\"Do you know who I envy? The farmer who wakes up daily to tend to his fields. No recognition of Mana, Extremes, or weavings of existence. Just a mundane life where they live every day doing what they love. There are hardships here and there. Sickness. Loss. But at the end of the day, they live a century of fulfillment before they die peacefully. I envy the quintillions of entities out there whose lives are filled with simplicity- who are not seeking a constant drive for greater complexity. The more complex our existences become, the more entwined we seem to ever increasing problems. That...is our burden to bear. But for you my friend, I would advise you to find simplicity. Fulfillment for you to enjoy this fickle weaving of life now, and not as some distant goal in the future. After all, the future is not guaranteed.\"","HUUUM!","His visage began to shake and dissipate.","His round head glistened in the fractured space as he looked towards Ozymandias for a few more seconds before...he entirely disappeared.","His words buzzed within Noah’s weavings.","Fulfillment.","Contentment!","Every single entity was just constantly chasing for greater and greater complexity as many never stopped to think about anything else.","Noah genuinely loved the feeling whenever he did make advancements, whenever he understood more about the mysteries of power and complexity.","This was part of his contentment. He also had other things that he never gave up no matter how complex he became.","His family. Read exclusive adventures at empire","His women.","The mundane action of intimacy he had with his women- he never left it behind as this was also part of his fulfillment.","While he was stuck in Hell Terra Firma as existence unraveled around him, did he not enjoy this fulfillment with Barbatos?","So when it came to a sense of happiness and contentment, Noah’s weavings did not leave companionship behind.","But there was one thing he thought of that he had not gone around to doing.","It may seem like years ago when mere days and weeks had passed, but he had envisioned that when he reached a level of power where he did not have to worry about others harming him or those he loved, he would retire to be a farmer and just enjoy his days!","Every day, he seemed to be reaching a new level of power.","But his enemies also became stronger with every passing day.","Threats became more and more immense with every passing day!","If it continued like this, would he not be forever waiting for that day to retire on some fantastical farm that would never exist?","He watched Bob dissipate entirely as this being left him with bundles of information regarding the Expanse, the Wheelomachy, the Logos of the Wheel, and more as a truly arduous road lay ahead!","Did he have to always keep the end goal he only imagined towards a peaceful end that may never come? What stopped him from doing it now even amidst all of this chaos?","There was nothing denying him of this as he nodded while thinking of his next steps.","Around him, the veiled cluster of shattered space began to unravel as the memories and bundles of information from Bob all flowed throughout his weavings.","Many things had occurred.","The Change that many people felt was coming bloomed as Noah was either a core figure in its initiation or simply one of the figures that contributed to this Change as his first entrance and exit into Hell Terra Firma had given free reign.","Akin to a spark lighting up dry leaves in a forest, and now a fire was spreading rapidly all around.","But the stage had already been prepared.","Dried branches and leaves were stretched out across this Frequency and other Frequencies of the Wheel.","And as the Weavings of Existence began to burn, those who were always there to watch it or aid in its correction were currently preoccupied in their own musings of war.","The Logos of the Wheel was compromised alongside the Watchers of the Wheelomachy!","And in the middle of all of this, the appearance of unknown Faceless Entities embroiled in the midst of all of this chaos.","Now, Noah had to pick apart and face all of this all, all the while dealing with his own aims of expansion into the Purgatory Lands as he obtained enough fuel to elevate his own increasing Complexity of Existence!","The stage was set, and now there was only magnificence to follow...."]},{"number":3484,"title":"Chapter 3484: Chapter 3483: The Wheelomachy! III","paragraphs":["The Expanse.","A once gorgeous place filled with golden Strings of Existence stretching throughout!","Now, many of these strings had snapped or seemed deteriorated, their brilliance heavily gone as the surroundings were filled with tendrils of gray light that seemed to greatly lower the Atmospheric Weavings of Existence.","At this moment.","CRACK!","The bright Blancverse holding a core force of the Immovable Sacred Palace of the Expanse had a crack emerge on it, its brilliance dimming greatly!","Near it, the Great Mother had a complex expression as she looked out towards the area where the Instrument of the Beyonder had been enclosed in, but his figure was gradually appearing as the tentacles of the Great Mother called out.","|O Great Instrument! Something is occurring in the Megalos Beyond! Something even heavier than here!|","She let out all her reservations and called out.","It mattered not if he truly had the Resurgence of the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian.","He was still Ozymandias.","He was still the Instrument she followed!","And at this moment, something that caused her to even feel a sense of terror was occurring within the Megalos, her connections telling her many things.","So she called out to the Great Instrument.","And...","HUUUM!","Space distorted as he appeared right before her tentacled form.","...!","The sensation that she felt was...that of great pressure. As if a stifling being of pure power was standing before her!","This...was the same lifeform that the Observer of Old and Young had brought before her mere days ago?","Standing before him, she didn’t let the heavy sense of pressure emanating from him cause her to feel lesser, but she instead felt even more exhilaration as she continued.","|O Great Instrument...let me be the first to congratulate you on your grand rise in power and ask for your aid and brilliance to shine over the Megalos Beyond as foretold by the Great Beyonder! At this moment, I am receiving weavings that in different areas, terrifying and brutal Faceless Entities have appeared as they massacre our people and erect Towers from their bodies that radiate complex domains of oppression!|","WAA!","She called out to him for help.","She didn’t think to send word to the grand Palaces of the Expanse where Existence Severing Outerversal Morphons and Pioneer Great Ones might be- because these very same beings had stood against the Great Instrument of the Beyonder just recently for their own aims.","They were merely Heretics.","So she looked up towards the promised being as he looked down at her, his weavings erupting out silently to wrap around her as he nodded.","|Let’s go.|","...!","Without fear. Without asking for benefits.","He moved.","The Great Mother watched such an unfolding weaving as her convictions became ever stronger!","The figures disappeared as they left behind the Blancverses of the Immovable Sacred Palace of the Expanse- those within them filled with chaotic weavings as they reacted to the Changes around them!","Away from this region, away from the Expanse entirely.","Megalos Ynerre.","In the Secondary Infiniverse Megalos Seed.","At the center of the illusory Extremity Vein that had the Frequency Gateway underneath it.","A ring of a cerulean Aletheian Haven of pure mana could be seen at the very center of the Extremity Vein!","Inside of this ring.","Layers of stellar blue rivers flowed in the surroundings as they seemed to isolate any possible effects of the Change that was affecting everything across the Megalos and the Expanse.","Uniquely, it was not just within this haven, but even within the Secondary Infiniverse Megalos Seed, the effects of reduced Atmospheric Weavings of Existence were minimal if any at all!","This was because Noah’s connection to the Infiniverse Megalos Seed and the very pillars of authorities that made it up... were truly severed from existence.","The sheer implications of this were far too grand to have even portrayed themselves yet, with the boons of true severing still only just showing a small part of themselves at this moment.","So within that cerulean haven, boundless stellar rivers seethed and continued to bloom every second as the concentration of Atmospheric Weavings of Existence had risen to terrifying levels, and it was all filled with Mana!","This Mana Haven did not contain much within it apart from these stellar rivers and seas of potent authority, with the only thing being a small world at its very center.","A small blue world brimming with life as currently, the figure of Noah and the Infiniverse Megalos Body were the only ones here.","They were located in an area filled with the aura of abundant life, with a small wooden structure standing tall while surrounded by many plots nearby.","A Ranch.","Surrounded by dazzling fertile land and radiant streams of rivers nearby.","Small clusters of floating islands hung in the skies, white gold clouds permeating through them as they looked like ornamental stars.","It was a gorgeous scene as in front of the empty plots of farmland, Noah could be seen standing serenely with a sense of peace!","His body was adorned in loose white pants and an unbuttoned white shirt, a straw hat on his head as his whole body glimmered with complex radiance.","Not too far from him, the Infiniverse Megalos Body held a gold basket with her two hands as she was adorned with a simple white dress filled with musings of runes, her eyes bright as her expression held a wry smile.","Noah had an expression of contentment as a Piece of a Core Trace of the Wheel was held in his hand as he looked at all of this.","A simple ranch behind him, cultivated plots rich with mana in front of him.","Even in the midst of erupting chaos.","Even as it seemed existence was burning!","Nothing prevented him from living his dream.","Farming.","\"I have seeds of all sorts of spiritual herbs used in the Infiniverse Megalos Seed, Master.\"","Beside him, the Infiniverse Megalos Body walked forward while bringing the golden basket forward, but Noah shook his head.","\"From this day onward, I will live my little dream of peacefully retiring on a farm, but I will not be planting mere seeds of just anything.\" Experience tales at empire","WAA!","As he spoke, his body began to light up with countless complex weavings of brilliance.","Loot. Cheats. Protagonist. Quintessence. Infinity!","Many severed weavings of existence bloomed as Noah’s figure looked like an ancient king waking up to see his lands!","\"I will be cultivating Seeds of Existence itself and see what sprouts.\"","...!"]},{"number":3485,"title":"Chapter 3485: Chapter 3484: The Wheelomachy! IV","paragraphs":["The cultivation of Seeds of Existence themselves!","Noah spoke such grand words as he waved his hands and caused the appearance of pieces of bodies of Pioneers and Existence Severing entities to appear en masse above.","Moments later, they began to flow down and sink into the plots of earth seamlessly.","\"For fertilizer, there should be abundant mana and the dredges of Existence Severing entities and Pioneers that have built up their existence for eons.\"","...!","The fertilizer- the fuel alone for the things that he would cultivate were the records and weavings of entities that had severed their own existence and even Pioneered their paths as they searched for a source!","As for the seeds...","His right hand rose as on his palm, incandescent blue light gathered until it formed a singularity.","It was a Severed Seed of Mana.","What he was cultivating was himself. His aspects. His concepts.","Enriched in his own severed weavings of existence, the weavings of the Infiniverse Megalos Seed and of the Megalos themselves...just what would he be able to pluck at the end of it all?","The blue singularity in his hands floated out and sank into the center of the first plot before Noah- the intense waves of complexity within it being suffocating as at this time, a simple white gold throne rose from the earth behind Noah as he sat down.","He closed his eyes.","From his body, countless threads of severed weavings were visualized as they stemmed from him and spread out over the throne and the earth, going towards many different directions.","One thread was connected to the singularity he just planted. This thread was getting brighter and brighter as he continued to fill it with authority, weavings of Cheats, Loot, Quintessence, and many others flowing into it with unfathomable purity and grandeur.","If one looked at Noah right now, they would only observe a scene of utter peace and tranquility as he began cultivating severed existence itself- seated on a white gold throne as countless strings flowed from him and stretched out in different directions, with the figure of a gorgeous woman by his side who stood patiently!","In such peace and tranquility.","\"This is it....\" Noah nodded while breathing out as he opened his eyes.","He waved his left hand to bring forth the illusionary figures of Faceless Entities with white bands on their heads, and the illusory image of a spinning Wheel!","Faceless Entities.","They seemed to have come forth the moment after the change began as even the compromised Watchers of the Wheelomachy and Logos of the Wheel had these entities behind them.","And apart from this, Noah had also glimpsed them from the remnant memories of the Sword of the Commonwealth, and now even the Great Mother mentioned them within the Megalos Beyond.","They were spread out everywhere.","Noah had many things to do, and these unknown Faceless Entities were at the forefront of the mystery as he turned his head to look at the spinning wheel he also conjured.","A Representation of the Wheelomachy!","The place he had to enter in order to obtain the weavings Bob left behind- to locate the channel that would lead to the Frequency of Existence where he left behind a small part of himself.","Bob had given Noah many threads of knowledge regarding the Palaces of the Wheelomachy and which regions he could cross while evading the danger of unknowns as, at this moment, even Bob was not sure who could be trusted.","It was bound to be dangerous.","He could just as easily be captured by a Source Complexity Watcher of the Wheelomachy!","So in the face of such a difficult task that made even Bob blatantly say success or failure was unknown, how would Noah approach it?","How could he obtain more information about the Faceless Entities and even infiltrate the Wheelomachy?!","The answer he came up with was a surprisingly simple one.","\"Dream...\"","HUUM!","Above him, a dazzling Severed Rune of Amarantos Dream of the Megalos bloomed.","Severed.","Elevated!","Noah knew that with it, he could be even more purposeful in the Dreams he had as currently, he held bountiful weavings of what he wanted to Dream about.","\"From the weavings of Bob, I accept the distinction of a Watcher of the Wheelomachy.\"","HUUM!","The Severed Weavings of the Rune of Amarantos Dream of the Megalos began to spin.","In his hand, the Piece of a Core Trace of the Wheel burned brightly as it released a dull gold light that covered the Rune of Existence spinning above Noah, covering it and beginning to modify it entirely as Noah continued!","\"Not just any Watcher, but one stemming from the line of the First Watcher who founded the Wheelomachy!\"","His voice gradually gained more and more authority as he lay back on his throne.","While farming. While cultivating his weavings of existence.","\"I will dream of the Wheelomachy. The Watchers of the Wheelomachy of these very weavings of existence.\"","...!","He gave the severed weavings purpose and direction as the modified Rune of AMARANTOS spun heavily, releasing blinding light as a part of Noah’s weavings...fell into a slumber.","While cultivating his very existence, he also began to dream as beside him, the Infiniverse Megalos Body nodded while pointing to the blue skies.","The areas she pointed to split wide open as from above, dazzling crimson gold Globules of Blood of Pioneers appeared- these being products brought out of Hell Terra Firma recently as the distortion of time went into full effect.","The Globule of Blood of a Pioneer fell down from the skies and drenched the plot of land containing the Severed Seed of Mana, vibrant incandescence exploding out as complex weavings of existence came together!","At the same time, Noah’s body continued to pulse as even though he had begun to dream, he still felt everything.","One after another, more and more Severed Seeds of Existence formed around him like dazzling singularities before they flew towards an empty plot to be cultivated.","Occasionally, the skies would open and rain down drops of Blood of Pioneers as what he was doing was enough to baffle any normal entity at this moment! Discover hidden stories at empire","And yet he did such grandiose actions as while proceeding with the Severing and cultivation of his weavings, he dreamed!","He dreamed of the Megalos.","He dreamed of the Expanse.","He dreamed of the Wheelomachy!"]},{"number":3486,"title":"Chapter 3486: Chapter 3485: The Wheelomachy! V","paragraphs":["There was only darkness.","But the darkness did not last long as gradually, an emergence of light bloomed.","He felt like he was waking up from an extremely long slumber but unlike before, when he woke up this time, he felt everything with extreme clarity.","He knew who he was, and he knew exactly who he had commandeered the weavings of.","’Tam of the Singed, a Disciple of the Great Watcher, Bob!’","...!","His power was now extremely purposeful and precise.","He wanted to dream of the Wheelomachy, and he wanted to dream of the weavings, closest to Bob!","And so he came to dream through the eyes of one of his Disciples.","There were many disciples among the Watchers of the Wheelomachy- entities who took care of the daily living of the Watchers themselves and managed to keep a contact with Palaces of the Expanse to send word of any happenings.","They would judge what is prevalent and important to pass on to Watchers as they were akin to gatekeepers.","At times, they would even set off themselves to fix issues that did not need the attention of the Watchers.","The Disciple of the Watchers, Tam, was one such being as at this moment, Noah’s weavings within him opened his eyes and silently observed everything without radiating his authority.","After all, he was bound to be in a land filled with entities that held terrifying complexities. A single glance at him may just expose that he was someone else and cause the stream to end rather early.","When he opened his eyes, he saw that he was not alone. A few inches away from him, there was the figure of a gorgeous woman with a frowning expression. She was adorned in white battle robes, and her red hair danced calmly below her shoulders.","Her crimson eyes looked like vertical slits as she stared ahead.","Ahead.","Ahead of them, one could see a radiant space filled with a calm white-gold glow as within it, the suspended brilliance of multiple different colored wheels could be seen.","The wheels that lay flat and were used as platforms as on top of them, the auras of terrifying entities who at the very least were Pioneers could be seen.","The least powerful complexities...were Pioneers.","Noah was one such being as currently, he was exploring the path of Tam while looking around.","The atmosphere was a somber and heavy one as there were dozens of small wheel platforms like the one he was standing on, with many of them holding Pioneers while others...radiated the same suffocation as Barbatos!","Source Complexity!","And at the very forefront.","Where all eyes were currently gathered towards.","There was a golden wheel platform that had utterly majestic auras flowing on it.","It was the aura of Watchers!","All others on the suspended wheel platforms in the surroundings seem to be looking towards them as the woman near Noah had a stern expression while she voiced out to him.","|None of this makes sense. Why can we not contact Sir Bob? And those complexities behind the Watchers...|","Her voice was stern. She was known as Vashti.","A powerful Disciple who was working under Sir Bob for many eons, someone close to finding her Source!","But she spoke of the complexities behind the Watchers.","Because behind the Watchers at this moment, one could see the appearance of entities silently standing in the back.","Their bodies were all humanoid, and they were...Faceless.","White bands went up in the center of where their faces used to be as many were staring towards them, even one or two Watchers on that golden platform also frowning while gazing towards them as if they didn’t know who or what they were!","Noah looked at them with shining eyes as it seemed things were going to be exceedingly difficult.","The Faceless Entities had already reached the highest rungs of the Wheelomachy as Bob feared.","So he shook his head calmly as complexity began to bloom up ahead.","|Let’s just watch for now.|","They were all gathered here for something after the Change bloomed.","After one Frequency and now many more were being affected!","|O Disciples of the Wheelomachy! O Watchers of the Wheelomachy!|","HUUUM!","Up ahead, on the singular golden platform where many eyes were locked onto, an ancient voice began to echo out.","The one speaking was a man advanced in years as his eyes showed immense complexity and wisdom.","Adorned in a white robe with a head full of white hair and a long white beard, he was none other than the Great Sage. Your next chapter awaits on","Interminable brilliance of Anti-Matter swirled around him as beside him, the Watcher Persephael could be seen among a dozen other Watchers.","Once the Great Sage held everyone’s attention, his wizened eyes shone as he continued.","|Over the years, we all expected a Change. We all knew the change was coming, but none of us knew that it would be this drastic. But we do not fear such Change. We are Watchers of the Wheel. We have seen Ages come and go in the past. We have seen Lineages rise and fall, Palaces of Existence radiantly shine for an Age before crumbling in another. We observe and we correct as needed. But this change...it came with a heavy loss.|","...!","His aged face looked to be filled with sadness.","His eyes that had seen too much lustrously shone as he continued!","|Rarely, if ever, do we have a Watcher of the Wheelomachy fall. Our complexities are far too bright for this. And yet today, with the emergence of this Change, A Watcher has fallen.|","HUUM!","The gazes of many changed.","Shock overtook many eyes.","Disbelief flashed on the Disciple of Bob, Vashti!","She looked at the Watchers of the platform as some seemed equally surprised and in disbelief at such words!","And yet the Great Sage continued.","|One of the strongest among us. An Entity of illustrious stature whose weavings stretch back to the very First Watcher. Sir Bob...has fallen.|","BOOM!","A heavy silence of disbelief descended.","Sir Bob?","He had his intricacies.","He had his personality.","But he was the one Watcher that nobody would associate with death!"]},{"number":3487,"title":"Chapter 3487: Chapter 3486: The Wheelomachy! VI","paragraphs":["Sir Bob!","He was just too powerful for many to even imagine he would fall.","And yet the Great Sage stated such a shocking fact as near Noah...","|Impossible!|","Vashti gritted her teeth as her single word roared out in his mind. Continue reading at","She wasn’t the only one as on the gold wheel platform of the Watchers, there were multiple Watchers that turned towards the Great Sage with heavy questions!","Noah looked at this and sneered inwardly as he remembered the scene of the Great Sage and Persephael surrounding Bob with many other forces.","Even entities as distinguished as them could do this?","Just what reason lay behind the betrayal of their very values?!","At such a time...","|Silence!|","A booming roar echoed out as Persephael, glittering in golden jewels and necklaces, pulled in everyone’s gazes.","She looked at the Watchers and Disciples as she spoke out with a trace of burning anger in her voice.","|It is something that should be impossible, and yet it occurred! Do you know why? It is because he was betrayed!|","...!","|If you look, you can also see that on this platform, other Watchers apart from him are missing. Watcher Nigel, Watcher Noxana, Watcher Richter! As of this moment, they are all suspect and complicit in the decimation of the Weavings of Bob! After the advent of this Change, when Sir Bob went to understand its Origins in the domains of the Logos of the Wheel...his weavings disappeared there alongside these beings. Traitors of the Wheelomachy!|","Shocking words echoed out from Persephael as the rage in her eyes was palpable.","Yet her words only caused more somber gazes and shock to spread as she continued.","|In the history of the Wheelomachy, we have never faced something like this. For our own people to do this- the complexities behind it are too unfathomable to grasp! We know that they did not work alone if they were able to do this to Sir Bob, and what is left to do now is understand why...and ensure that the weavings of complexities of these traitors are collapsed on sight! To understand just why this Change would bring something like this to our own peop-...!|","The Great Sage placed his hand on Persephael and stopped her words as she heaved.","His gaze was somber as he looked at everyone and spoke deeply.","|The Wheelomachy is an unshakable behemoth across the ages. Whatever comes and goes, the Wheelomachy remains standing because it has to. We are stretched out in this Frequency of the Wheel and many other Frequencies as our job...is to observe and ensure. There is a Change, yes. We will understand it. The Change has caused some complexities to shift their allegiances, and we will understand this too. Behind us here...|","The Great Sage pointed towards the Faceless Entities emanating a unique air of power this whole time.","|These are Impartial Watchers that Sir Bob, Persephael, and I have been developing these past years. The only Legacy left behind by Sir Bob as he sensed what was coming more than any of us ever did. I did not understand why the secrecy at the time, why he asked us to keep it from others- but it seems to be precisely for this moment. These Impartial Watchers are the greatest weapon he left behind as their complexities cannot be influenced. Their weavings cannot be corrupted. They only take the best possible route to ensure the turns of the Wheel of Existence. To ensure order and stability in the coming chaos. They will stand guard alongside you in the Palaces of the Wheelomachy. They will aid in the observation of the flow of Frequencies...and root out any remaining enemies within the Wheelomachy!|","...!","Noah’s weavings seethed as he listened to all of this with bright eyes.","To distort falsehood and truth this well...this Great Sage was truly something else!","A clamor rose out as many looked towards the Faceless Entities.","The Impartial Watchers!","Beside Noah, Vashti had a cold expression as she shook her head.","|What is this? We have been with Sir Bob all of these years along with others. Nothing like this...-|","Her words stopped.","Noah had placed his hand on her shoulders as silently, behind them...","An Impartial Watcher floated over and descended on the Wheel they were on!","Not just them, but all Disciples of Watchers on other platforms of Wheels had a similar occurrence!","The Great Sage looked at all of this as he voiced out.","|The Watchers of the Wheelomachy have remained a force of the Wheel across the Ages, and this will not change. We will be in communication with other Great Watchers across the Frequencies. We will observe and understand as in no time, the flow of the Wheel will be returned to what it was. Until then, continue your honored duties. Your selfless tasks. Observe the weavings of the Megalos and the Expanse. Any findings can be passed on to the Impartial Watchers as if there is any sickness, it will be purified. If there are any rats...they will not be able to hide in the dark for much longer!|","WAA!","|Return to your posts and prepare. Observe. Watch. Our Watch..is never over.|","...!","Brilliance shone all around as heavy complexity seethed.","On the Platform of the Wheel that Noah and Vashti were on...","|Come with me.|","An intent bloomed from the Faceless Entity- The Impartial Watcher behind them as a channel that looked like a wormhole opened up behind them!","There were many such channels that led to different areas in the Palaces of the Wheelomachy.","Vashti’s gaze was cold as she heard the cold, commanding voice of the Impartial Watcher, but she gazed in other areas where many were returning to their posts as she was also going to follow, even with all her doubts!","Yet Noah kept his hand on her shoulder as he gazed at the Faceless Entity before him who was already entering the channel without even waiting for their affirmation.","His weavings were unique.","His weavings were truly Severed.","He was the Weaver of Extremity.","He was the Weaver of Existence.","Having Severed Existence itself, he was extremely perceptive to the possible changes others wanted to exert on his weavings!","And this Impartial Watcher before them- this Faceless Entity...was intending to collapse the weavings of Vashti and Tam!","The few Disciples of Sir Bob.","Was it a cleanup?","As Noah wondered this, he sent his intent towards Vashti silently.","|That so called Impartial Watcher ahead of us intends to collapse our weavings. There is a plot afoot. If you wish to live...do not make any move against it. Let me take the fall.|","...!","Vashti’s visage subtly trembled before her crimson eyes flashed furiously, but she followed!","As for Noah...it seemed like he would have to stretch his muscles out fully to understand the extent of power of just this single Faceless Entity, and plan a path ahead for him to enter the abode of Bob after this Dream ended!"]},{"number":3488,"title":"Chapter 3488: Chapter 3487: Impartial?! I","paragraphs":["History was always written by the victors.","There were ages of war that came and went, with countless atrocities being committed over time as after the end of these wars...it was always unique that one barely heard anything relating to them, or if they were recorded in history, it was only a mere mention of them.","The Megalonians undergoing a genocide and being cleansed out of existence.","It was an event that many simply knew had occurred a great number of years ago!","There were no waves of outpouring sympathy for the Megalonians, nor did many have thoughts of empathy or understanding regarding them.","At most, other complex entities would look at this event and regret that they were not there to be able to partake in such a thing to increase their own complexity!","This was war. This was history.","At this very moment, the history of the Wheelomachy was being rewritten as there was nobody to stand against this.","Nobody spoke up and said it was entirely false!","Because even if they had their doubts, how could they raise their complexities against those at the very peak of power who were actively writing this history?","So many followed.","The Watchers of the Wheelomachy here and the Disciples of the Wheelomachy saw the Faceless Entities- the so called Impartial Watchers, spread out across the channels of the Palaces of the Wheelomachy as they would arrive in regions where one could observe any large scale changes on certain Spokes of the Wheel among other things!","They watched, and they followed.","In one corner, Vashti heard Noah’s weavings that told her to not make any moves- that the Impartial Watcher ahead of them was already planning and set in stone to collapse their weavings of existence!","She heard this as her heart lurched, thinking about everything else that had just occurred as well as their positions as she gritted her teeth and continued forward.","They were the Disciples of Bob.","Bob had gone missing as he was considered fallen, while other Watchers were accused of plotting against him and currently missing!","So what would happen to the Disciples of Watchers that were missing? The Disciples of Bob?","Vashti closed her eyes at this reality as she kept her torn complexity in her heart, proceeding ahead while getting ready for anything.","She followed Sir Bob because it gave her purpose. Because she saw all the good that he did over the eons!","But now...he was gone.","And now, what would happen to the rest of them?","In her musings.","They crossed across a channel built like a wormhole as they arrived in a domain filled with dazzling radiance.","Far ahead, there was a massive construct that looked like a Wheel surrounded by multicolored floating islands filled with power.","The massive structure that looked like a wheel held a brilliant singularity at its very center, with a dozen brilliant Lines- Frequencies, shown extending from the central singularity and connecting to the ends of the wheel!","12 brilliant lines. 12 Spokes of the Wheel.","Noah looked at them calmly as the memories that Bob had left behind slowly overlapped.","This place he knew.","His eyes further honed in one of Spoke of the Wheel ahead- one that seemed no different from the others as this was actually something that Bob left behind!","For anyone observing it, it may seem like a representation of a Spoke of a Wheel- of a Frequency of Existence.","But it was actually a secret passage Bob left behind that led into a deeper area within the Wheelomachy where he had to cross through in order to enter the isolated secret domain.","The isolated domain that would have an established channel leading to the Frequency of Existence where Bob hid another part of him.","This...was the pathway he needed to take as others could not see this, nor could they follow him.","Otherwise, if a Source Complexity or higher was close behind, everything would be for naught.","So in this dream...he wasn’t able to do too much but set up the opportunity for himself and plan ahead.","In this Dream, he would get familiar with these Faceless Entities.","These beings seeking to impose themselves as Impartial Watchers!","Noah looked ahead at the muscular oversized humanoid entity covered by some sort of obsidian wrapping as he voiced out nonchalantly.","\"For someone seeking to call themselves an Impartial Watcher, you sure emanate a large amount of killing intent. I ask you, where exactly is the impartiality here?\"","...!","WAA!","A few words were uttered from him.","And yet the heavy visage of the Faceless Entity ahead stopped in its place as...its head turned around unnaturally!","Even without the rest of its body turning, its head made a 180 degree turn as the vertical band of white brilliance on its face shone, the head then tilting to the side as an eerie intent radiated from this creature!","|I was giving absolutely nothing away. How could a creature like you have sensed my intent?|","The words were calm.","The words were eerie!","This creature didn’t even deny it as when Vashti heard its intent, her face turned more ashen as the gravity of the situation fully settled in!","These Impartial Watchers were instated by the very higher echelons of the Watchers of the Wheelomachy!","The Great Sage and Persephael herself stated that they were things worked on jointly with Bob!","What did it truly mean if these Faceless Entities, these Impartial Watchers, were turning their swords unto them?","...!","The implications caused her to feel a heavy sense of suffocation as even her path wavered slightly. But the voice of the man beside her rang out once more in her mind.","|He intends to kill us both, but you can still save yourself. Do not attack him. Instead...begin directing your attacks unto me. As if you found something wrong with me and joined this Impartial Watcher to stand against me. This...is the only way for you to survive this ordeal. After that, bide your time and wait. Someone sent by Sir Bob himself will contact you. Be ready!|","HUUM!","Brilliance unfolded.","Complexity began to burn!"]},{"number":3489,"title":"Chapter 3489: Chapter 3488: Impartial?! II","paragraphs":["Complexity burned as at this moment, inside of a dream...the Quintessential League of Existence unfurled!","The visage of the Faceless Entity did not seem to care that the direction of its face did not match its body- as if inside of that obsidian suit, it was not even a skeletal structure to match the humanoid appearance it held.","It only looked at the changing weavings of Existence after Noah released the Relegation Zone of Existence as it raised one of its hands to the skies.","|Dull creature, I commend you for your bravery in facing something that you do not understand. For that, I will teach you the difference between you and I before you perish.|","WAA!","Its fist was raised to the skies.","The vertical white band on its head shone with radiance as it uttered out.","\"Between you and I...Existence is of no consequence to me.\"","HUUM!","Its fist clenched.","And the surroundings instantly felt like they were being squeezed as weavings of Existence shattered to reveal...obsidian Runes.","|These are my Exodus Runes that have nearly grasped a Source. A path I follow that you could never understand. If a single one of these Exodus Runes touch you, your existence collapses. Your Path collapses. Regardless of your Complexity, unless you have attained a Source...you will perish. Before something like this...what can a creature like you even do?|","WU!","WU!","As the Impartial Watcher finished speaking, drums like the beat of a heart began to boom out in the surroundings.","As if a symphony was being played!","As if a soundtrack to a grand battle blooming was just now unfolding!","Inside the weavings of a Dream, Noah fully brought out his truly severed Weavings of Existence as the bounds that were there for him before were nonexistent at this moment.","If he couldn’t fully take out his Infinite Mana, his Quintessence, and anything else inside a Dream... he could do so this moment with utter ease!","True Severing.","If Noah could express what it meant the most at this moment, there could be only a single word for it.","Freedom.","Freedom!","DUM!","In the surroundings, terrifying obsidian Rules that caused space to quake and shatter as they moved swirled towards him by the dozens!","Exodus Runes.","If a single one touched you, you were dead.","If a single one made contact with you, your path would collapse!","These were the assertions of the Impartial Watcher as could they truly do such a thing against Noah’s severed weavings of existence?! Especially when the Quintessential League of Existence was already deployed?!","Noah felt the Freedom that came with True Severing of Existence as he closed his eyes towards the incoming Exodus Runes.","The freedom that came with his severing made him feel like you could do anything.","He didn’t need a preset movement. No skill. No modus operandi.","He simply had to take his severed existence and unleash it outwardly as at this moment, he called out grandly.","\"Aura.\"","HUUM!","Around his body.","As if it were the emergence of multiple different colored flames of magisterial light, multiple paths bloomed in the form of auras that dripped of majesty!","They caused his figure to seem like an otherworldly celestial as the moment that the Exodus Runes pummeling towards his body neared him, the eruption of all of these Auras knocked them away!","|...?|","Alongside this contact, multiple of the newly rising auras also dimmed and shattered.","The different colored auras caused his body to emanate a heart shaking feeling of brilliance and oppression.","So much so that even the figure of Vashti nearby looked over in alarm as if she didn’t recognize him!","\"Interesting.\"","Noah looked at the auras around him that had either dimmed or shattered as terrifyingly enough, these Exodus Runes were no joking matter!","And seeing his opposition to them, the Faceless Entity had its white bar flash as it brought its hands forward and slapped out.","BOOM!","Even more Exodus Runes flourished as it felt like Existence itself was being drained to bring them to fruition.","Gray cracks unfolded in the surroundings as the levels of Atmospheric Weavings of Existence went further down, making it twice as hard for others to affect existence!","And yet the Impartial Watcher moved as if this didn’t bother him one bit!","Towards the emergence of even more Exodus Runes, Noah’s weavings flourished as he uttered out once more.","\"Haki.\"","WU!","A silent and clear oppressive air erupted from him and covered everything nearby.","It felt like the weight and tonnage of an unfathomable weaving of Existence crashed down, its pressure suffocating everything as the Exodus Runes slowed!","But more than that...","\"Severed Passages of Existence...\"","His voice echoed out again as above and below, radiant multicolored mountains shattered space and emerged from the cracks.","They were not illusory.","They seemed unfathomably solid and real as they pointed their mountain peaks towards the Faceless Entity and the Exodus Runes floating around- these runes shaking from the pressure as some even began to splinter and shatter!","...!","Some of the Severed Passages of Existence shone with a lustrous cerulean radiance, others were colorless, and others shone gold and purple!","But they emerged and gushed out seas of brilliance that covered everything nearby, exerting their influence at this moment and utterly denying the shocking weavings of the Faceless Entity.","It was a shocking emergence of complex weavings of existence as at such a scene...","|Incorrigible.|","The Faceless Entity uttered out with a great sense of distaste.","He brought his hands to his chest as in the next moment, a horrific complexity radiated from him as an illusory dark tower began to form around him!","A dark tower that gradually turned from illusory to real, moving along with the figure of the Faceless Entity as he shot towards Noah!","BOOM!","Seas of lustrous multicolored brilliance were cleaved apart like paper.","The heavy tonnage of Haki and widespread auras was withstood!","RIIP!","The peak of the Dark Tower passed through a cerulean Severed Passage of Existence as this passage...was cut in half!","And the Dark Tower twisted space and tore through everything to arrive right before Noah.","...!","His magisterial auras buzzed and squeezed, his severed existence feeling a heavy pressure that sought to tear him apart!","A type of Complexity...that he had never come across.","A type of complexity that felt...dirty.","A complexity that was unlike any that he had faced before!","\"OOOH!\"","He bellowed out towards the peak of the Dark Tower threatening to pierce his weavings, multiple Severed Passages of Existence lining up behind him and supporting him as his figure burned with glorious multicolored auras.","And an unfathomable impact that tore apart the very fabric of the weavings of existence bloomed!"]},{"number":3490,"title":"Chapter 3490: Chapter 3489: Collapse! I","paragraphs":["A heavy impact.","One that caused all nearby weavings to tear, the gray tendrils of light that were spread out across the Expanse blooming from the cracks as the Atmospheric Weavings of Existence tremendously began to reduce. Explore hidden tales at","In the chaotic mess of weavings, the visage of Noah became clear as his multicolored auras of Severed Ordinances danced wildly around him, but there lay a huge gash on his chest as radiant gold blood was spilling out!","Opposite him, a Dark Tower flickered around an Impartial Watcher as he raised his hand to feel his head- feeling a tear around the vertical white band on its head.","A tear!","From this tear, countless viscous masses wriggled like trillions of worms that threatened to come out- as if the whole body of the Faceless Entity was made up of this wriggling mass for its structure.","It was an extremely eerie thing to observe as feeling the wound on its head, the Impartial Watcher radiated weaving of utter horror as if it were enraged.","|A dull creature with your complexity actually dares to wound me?! With a measly complexity such as that, you are lucky that you did not perish from the last hit- and this luck is over!|","HUUM!","The Dark Tower that was flashing on and off around him became even more solidified as in its surroundings, the Exodus Runes manifested by the dozens.","Noah looked at all of this as in the distance, his gaze was cold as he actually did not refute this being.","Currently, his complexity was still low in comparison to them.","\"You are right...\"","So he admitted it freely.","But at the same time...","\"And yet, even with this level of complexity, I will get to see what lies behind that half-torn veil.\"","...!","He spoke as he gazed intently at the tear near the white band of brilliance on the head of the Faceless Entity.","Yes, this being was right regarding Noah’s complexity being a little off. But...what exactly was Noah’s strongest point?","What could he do that others could only dream of?","\"If the pressure of a few mountains could cause a tear on your body...what about a few more?\"","...!","A simple question.","One that was followed by the emergence of 9 dazzlingly radiant Severed Passages of Existence.","Each one shone with a different Severed Ordinance under his banner as after they appeared, the Faceless Entity harrumphed as he pointed the tip of the Dark Tower swirling with Exodus Runes in his direction once more!","But after the appearance of the 9 dazzlingly radiant Severed Passages of Existence...another 9 bloomed.","|...|","They gushed out seas of weavings that were all focused on the Faceless Entity, the swirling Exodus Runes and the Dark Tower being halted where they stood at this moment from the sheer accumulated pressure of all of these celestial mountains!","And another instant later, nine more Severed Passages of Existence bloomed as the shattered space in the surroundings seemed to be getting packed by radiant mountains.","They did not stop!","From the top. From the bottom. From the left and right!","Dazzling mountains appeared and gushed out their pressure all around- the center of their target being a single Faceless Entity!","He no longer moved.","He couldn’t!","The accumulated complexities of all of the Severed Passages of Existence that had already wounded him before were now much more numerous, and they continued to bloom more and more endlessly as...","CRACK!","The tear around the white band on the head of this entity became wider and wider.","The pressure he withstood became heavier and heavier!","And all around, the number of Severed Passages of Existence only increased!","As if the cost to bring them to fruition didn’t matter.","As if there were endless reserves of weavings to bring more and more out endlessly.","And well...this wasn’t too far off.","HUUUM!","A unique melody played and reached a crescendo as the massive mountains gushing out heavy pressure compounded their force, only adding more and more over time as the visage of the Faceless Entity could not move a single muscle.","Its body creaked as more and more tears appeared, and that which lay underneath its black veil continued to wriggle madly as if it was about to break out!","Noah looked at all of this as he uttered out coldly.","\"Sever.\"","WU!","His own body, covered in glorious auras and radiating waves of Haki, became surrounded by purple radiance as it turned into a streak of light that passed through the gushing mountain peak of one Severed Passage of Existence, and it flickered out from another Severed Passage of Existence!","SAA! SAA! SAA!","He turned into a blur of light that disappeared into one Passage and reappeared from another, with his immensity and pressure only becoming more intense through every Passage he passed through.","Eventually, he was only a flicker of light that was passing through from one dazzling mountain to another until ultimately...","SAA!","After passing through mountains that felt like hundreds of times in an extremely short span, his figure aimed towards the suspended Faceless Entity who bore all the terrifying pressure at this moment!","It was too fast.","It was too bright!","BOOM!","A light of severing passed through a Faceless Entity.","True Severing through and through!","Brilliance unfurled as Noah’s figure reappeared miles away from the Faceless Entity.","He raised his hands to look at the body he occupied as currently, it was fissured and breaking apart.","He...had overdone the complexity of this Pioneer he possessed who was destined for death in the hands of this Faceless Entity!","His output exceeded what this body could handle.","But behind him...","CRACK!","A Dark Tower crumbled along with Exodus Runes, with the dominating visage of the Faceless One being utterly still as in the next moment, the white band of brilliance on the head of this being shattered!","It shattered.","And the moment it did, a deathly howl of utmost vileness, vengeance, and retribution erupted as the black veil holding the form of the humanoid Faceless Entity tore and split apart- an obsidian mass beginning to wiggle out of it!","Almost as if that white band had been a shackle that kept everything in!"]},{"number":3491,"title":"Chapter 3491: Chapter 3490: Collapse! II","paragraphs":["The dazzling white band!","The moment that it shattered, an ancient and deep howl filled with countless negative weavings echoed out, and from the black veil, a mass of wriggling obsidian weavings began to spill out.","The composition felt like oil. Yet there was a form of solidity as it was extremely eerie to observe!","The humanoid appearance instantly deformed as this expanding mass of darkness veered all of its weavings behind and began to roar out towards Noah, its complexity achieving a level at least three times what it was before.","Meaning it was inescapable.","And yet...","Noah felt a profound sensation within his weavings of existence as he stayed still.","As his own body was cracking apart, he watched as in the next moment...","HUUU!","The exposed obsidian mass that had spilled out of the Faceless Entity...seethed in space as it began to burn with scorching black flames!","As if there was some sort of revulsion with the very surrounding weavings of Existence!","Noah kept his eyes opened wide as he saw without the alteration of nearby weavings by anyone, the very calm and unbothered Atmospheric Weavings of Existence in the surroundings pressed down and caused the mass spilling out the Faceless Entity to be scorched.","As if an object that had a very negative reaction to the weavings of existence themselves appeared, and they were finally discovered the moment that they were no longer contained in that humanoid body and that shining white band!","|SCREE!|","A screech bellowed out from the wriggling burning mass, Noah feeling that even with its terrifying complexity, it could not do anything against the extremely volatile reaction it was facing with the surrounding weavings of Existence, and his own eyes captured everything occurring with rapt attention as he came to see...small, faint wooden translucent Runes of Existence by the Millions swirling and pressing down on the Faceless Entity from all around.","Barely observable!","It was only because of his proximity and rapt attention that he even observed them at this moment and because their structure closely resembled the wooden-like rune he had seen forged from something he had obtained recently.","The Piece of a Core Trace of the Wheel!","He glimpsed millions of runes similar to what it produced, and these runes had bloomed silently and without the effort of anyone else to scorch the body of the Faceless Entity that rapidly reduced in size and complexity, leaving behind a pungent smell!","...!","No matter its complexity.","No matter how much it struggled.","The horrific reality unfolded swiftly and powerfully as, within a few milliseconds, the black mass was entirely scorched and eradicated- the obsidian remnants slowly becoming translucent before they exploded in a shower of complexity!","Complexity that instantly permeated the surroundings and fantastically caused the shattered space and gray tendrils of light to recede, the concentration of Atmospheric Weavings of Existence rapidly rising and becoming enriched as even Noah’s body that was breaking apart felt a heavy sense of rejuvenation momentarily.","...!","It was an astounding scene.","And it was one that Noah could not dwell in for too long as he instantly turned towards a shocked Vashti in the distance, sending his intent out as he ’attacked’ her!","|My weavings are already collapsing. Finish them off to ensure that my death is not in vain- otherwise, you will soon follow me in death.|","WAA!","The commotion here was quick, but it was also grand.","They were still within the bounds of the many Palaces of the Wheelomachy as many terrifying weavings were drawn over!","The most powerful ones were just about to arrive as Vashti hid the torn emotions in her eyes and steeled herself, shouting out as her body stepped forward with dominance.","Around her, an illusory visage of a primordial bullet ant formed as it pulsed with complexity- an invisible stinger shooting out towards Noah’s body!","It was a culmination of a finishing battle as at such a time, multiple auras also bloomed from different directions.","BOOM!","The stinger of the massive primordial bullet ant pierced through the body Noah’s weavings currently possessed, his weaving further continuing their collapse as he looked towards Vashti coldly.","|Someone will reach out to you. Be ready.|","...!","Feeling the overbearing auras leaking from all around, Noah dissipated his weavings entirely as his dream...came to an end!","As his dream came to an end...","|What happened here?!|","The commanding voice of Persephael boomed as a few other Watchers and Disciples appeared all around, the figure of Vashti looking torn as she looked towards all of them while pointing towards the figure of Disciple Tam of the Singed that was entirely collapsing.","|A traitor of the Wheelomachy...he attacked the Impartial Watcher as I barely managed to help, but it was too late!|","...!","A story was weaved.","Persephael’s eyes were sharp as she looked around and saw the overly enriched Atmospheric Weavings of Existence, the Faceless Entity nowhere to be seen. Discover stories with","Near her, there was another Watcher who was not aligned with her who also came here, and he was watching her reaction and the weavings down below closely!","Even if Persephael did not believe the weavings of this story, she could not delve too deeply into it as the disappearance of the Impartial Watcher meant far too many things.","It was also a consequential moment because as far as she knew...this was the first Faceless Entity to fall since their campaign began!","And the one who had done so...was a mere Disciple of Bob?","|...|","Persephael turned silent as complex weavings covered this small part of the Palaces of the Wheelomachy!","Far from here.","Outside the Expanse.","On a budding farm contained inside a dazzling Haven within the Secondary Infiniverse Megalos Seed!","|A short dream has come to an end.|","A humble farmer opened his eyes while he sat on a throne, continuing his peaceful endeavors as nobody knew he had closed his eyes briefly to dream...and had infiltrated the Wheelomachy while killing a Faceless Entity at the same time!","From the closure of his eyes.","From a Dream!","Ah!"]},{"number":3492,"title":"Chapter 3492: Chapter 3491: Singed! I","paragraphs":["|The weavings of the Amarantos Dream of the Megalos you can obtain are Quintessential.|","|All memories of Tam of the Singed are retained.|","|The Weavings of this single Dream can be retrieved, with all components viable for retrieval due to the current Proficiency of the Amarantos Dream of the Megalos.|","|The Components of the Dream capable of being retrieved are as follows.|","|Source of Existence of the Singed- entities burned with the Flame of the Wheel of Existence and hold complex weavings around it. The Ordinance of the Singed. Cycles of refinement of the purity of an Ordinance of Existence.|","|Weavings and the Reconstruction of Tam of the Singed. The accumulated Path of the Singed that has been compressed into an Ordinance of Existence matching the complexity of other Ordinances under your banner.|","Two dazzling singularities danced above his opened eyes- circulating around a Rune of Existence as this time, he didn’t have to make a choice!","Due to Severing the weavings of Amarantos, he could obtain absolutely everything.","And so he did.","|All aforementioned components of the Dream of Tam of the Singed have been selected for retrieval.|","|Nothing of the Dream of Tam of the Singed has been lost.|","...!","Around Noah, weavings burned richly and with heavy radiance.","He looked around him as he felt the descent of fantastical complexity- all from the AMARANTOS Rune as it pulled the Source of Existence of the Singed!","They were entities who were burned with the Flame of the Wheel of Existence and held complex weavings around it. But what did that truly mean?","Alongside it came the Ordinance of the Singed and cycles of refinement of this Ordinance, and the Weavings and the Reconstruction of Tam of the Singed himself!","The entity who would have died along with Vashti had Noah not begun to Dream when he did.","His weavings collapsed regardless, and yet at this moment, they were being reconstructed!","Was this what it meant to be Singed? Touched by the Flame of the Wheel of Existence? What even was this Flame, and what would happen as Noah obtained the very Source of Existence of the Singed?!","HUUM!","The storm of weavings around him felt ancient and pristine as his Atlas vibrated and howled like a beast.","Another Mundi of Power lit up!","The process was fast.","The process was seamless as after all, he had Severed Absolute Efficiency among many other things!","|The System of Existence of the Singed is deemed sufficiently different enough to occupy its own Mundi of Power.|","Inside of the unfathomably heavy Severed Atlas of Existence, a small, gold flame bloomed within a Mundi.","It was miniscule.","And yet the moment it bloomed...","WUU!","An ancient and chaotic air of brilliance emanated from Noah!","No sooner had such an air begun to bloom did he wave his hands to produce a drop of Blood, and it sank into his body right after.","|The System of Existence of the Singed is undergoing its first Severing.|","...!","The air emanating out became even more intense!","At the same time.","In front of Noah, a humanoid body was being reconstructed, its musculature shimmering bright gold as its makeup looked scorched.","Burnt.","And yet this burnt makeup gave this form such tremendous glory that within seconds of its conception, it opened its mouth to breathe heavily as if it had been drowning this whole time!","Deep, heavy, breaths.","And gradually, cognizance and recognition rose within his bronze eyes, his slightly bronze burnt skin and golden hair shining brightly as he almost looked solid.","Almost. Find more to read on","After he acclimated, he turned towards the visage of Noah seated on a simple throne as the moment he did so, he felt the ancient air leaking from him as he also felt like he recognized this being!","A flash of recognition flashed in the bronze eyes of Tam of the Singed as he bowed towards Noah a moment later while voicing out.","\"I knew an end was coming alongside a new beginning, but I never knew what it would entail. The Wheel turns as the wheel turns without a path being too clear. My thanks to you, O Origin Singed, for your help.\"","...!","His words were serene and full of respect.","Noah’s eyes opened wide as he felt the continued changes within his body, his hands holding the Piece of a Core Trace of the Wheel feeling a burning sensation as his rising Source of the Singed was reacting to it!","Tam of the Singed- his Reconstruction anyways, stood before him and called him an Origin Singed.","\"Why do you call me an Origin Singed?\"","He asked succinctly as over his skin, golden flames began to burn.","And Tam bent his head even deeper as he answered.","\"The Singed is a rare Lineage that cannot be passed down. There are not many of us across the Frequencies of the Wheel. We were blessed to be burned by the Flame of the Wheel of Existence, giving us greater purpose and understanding- a closeness to the Wheel that others cannot imagine. I have only met a few other Singed across a few Frequencies, but none have radiated a flame as bright as yours, Sir. You can only be someone much more blessed than us, and the only one I can think of is an Origin Singed.\"","...!","Tam maintained his calmness and reverence as Noah looked at him closely while feeling the changes brought about by the System of Existence of the Singed.","Within him, the severed weavings of Runes resonated and burned heavily due to it as he felt like he was a beginner of this language before, but he was now rapidly becoming proficient as he attained a more advanced level!","The System of Existence of Kuklos also burned brightly as the Piece of a Core Trace of the Wheel in his hands did the same.","Everything...relating to the Wheel.","To be burned by the Flame of the Wheel.","To be Singed.","Just what did it entail?"]},{"number":3493,"title":"Chapter 3493: Chapter 3492: Singed! II","paragraphs":["As Noah grasped the ongoing changes, he waved his hands up and asked calmly.","\"What does it mean to you to be a Singed?\"","A simple enough question was asked as Tam raised his upper body and replied with clear eyes.","\"To be Singed is to be freed. To look past existence and what is good or evil. What is right and what is wrong. To only observe and ensure the flow of the Wheel of Existence when needed to. I joined the service of the Wheelomachy because they closely sought something like this. As a Singed, there is no outlined purpose or path for one to take, and the only thing you need to do is exist. By simply existing as someone burned by the Flame of the Wheel, things will naturally unfold around you, and you will become entangled if ever the flow of weavings requires assistance to keep the Wheel turning.\"","...!","\"My flow of weavings were entangled with Sirs precisely because it seems at this moment in time, the flow of the weavings of the Wheel are not as they should be. Things have gotten chaotic. For my old weavings to collapse and be reborn here simply means I am where I need to be in order to aid in the restoration of the smooth flow of the Wheel.\"","\"...\"","His words were filled with absolute confidence as he spoke, Noah tapping the side of his throne as beside him, the Infiniverse Megalos Body had a calm expression.","\"Is that right?\"","A question and a statement that didn’t need an answer.","Noah gazed out towards his plots of farms as at the very center, saplings were already blooming and radiating a heavy glow of complexity- their progression being extremely fast as soon enough, they would bear fruits.","The cultivated severed weavings bathed in the Blood of Pioneers could only bear fruit that should allow for multiple severings once consumed- and this would allow for continued elevation of complexity while satisfying Noah’s dream!","But he looked at the growing saplings as he thought of the words of Tam.","The flow of the Wheel.","For one to be where they need to be, or where they should be.","There was no outline or set path for one to take or follow, but they would inevitably be entangled in some way if ever the flow of the Wheel was off and needed to be set back.","Noah looked out at the brilliance all around him as he felt like he was constantly struggling against this.","The singular struggle ever since he began as a hunter on that blue planet.","The struggle of control. Of Choices. Of freedom.","He didn’t like it when it felt like there was an invisible hand steering things forward!","The words of Tam said otherwise as he stated that one was not given a set purpose or path to follow, and that simply by existing, they would be entangled in a way that eventually...they may play a part in restoring the flow of the Wheel!","The flow.","\"The flow...\"","HUUM!","He uttered two words as in his body, the weavings of the Singed entirely became Severed and free of influence, golden flames burning around him as the ancient air he radiated only became more intense.","Before him, Tam’s back was slightly bent as if he could sense the opposition in Noah’s words, and he spoke out slowly.","\"The flow does not necessarily mean a predestined path that has to be followed. What many do not understand regarding order and chaos is that they believe the flow of the Wheel is the maintenance of stability and order. Even the Watchers of the Wheelomachy have a similar ideology. As a Singed, we know this to not be true. Order and chaos are simply part of the flow of the Wheel. The Change currently unfolding is not something to be scared of as it should also be part of the flow, part of the turn of the Wheel. A period of chaos before a period of order. Or even a period of prolonged chaos- none of us truly know. But nobody is forced to follow a particular destiny of order or chaos. Nobody. Sir can even look within the depths of your Flame and feel. There, you can observe that at any moment if you so choose, you can disperse the flame that makes you Singed.\"","WAA!","Noah’s eyes were placid as he looked within the depths of his existence.","The flickering golden flame in a Mundi of Power that had just bloomed!","At its depths, this flame had a center that seemed indestructible, and yet if Noah so chose, a mere thought from him could collapse it.","And everything about it would fade away.","The Flame of the Burnt Ones.","The Singed who were touched by the Flame of the Wheel of Existence!","Noah was now one of these beings as he didn’t have some austere flame smash into him and burn him, but retrieved and took the weavings of a Singed himself before he severed them away from Existence.","And now, he would be involved in even more Entanglements that involved the flow of the Wheel of Existence.","The closer one was to the Wheel, the more Entanglements there would be. Simply because they knew the language. They could more easily go with the flow. But they all also had a choice...to not be involved!","In that case, another entity would be entangled for the sake of the flow of the Wheel.","\"...\"","Noah’s weavings burned silently as he finished his thoughts.","The struggle of influence and control...seemed to be getting more and more complex!","As a Flame burned around his body, his eyes became ever so brighter as he gradually came to a realization.","The Severed Weavings of Causality burned.","Uncertainty and Relativity burned!","Experience more tales on","Destiny burned!","He came to a realization that if he wished for a level of extreme control over his weavings without any influence or bursts of causality, he would have to not interact with others at all.","To isolate himself and do absolutely nothing.","If he closed up shop and retreated to Hell Terra Firma without worrying about what Bob left behind. What the Change meant for all Frequencies, or who the Faceless Entities were...he could effectively isolate and cut himself off of all these possible weavings!","Whenever he continued interacting with others, a level of outside influence came as he would have to make choices.","Like the choice to agree to Bob’s request and enter the line descending from the First Watcher.","This choice led for him to Dream in order to enter the Palaces of Wheelomachy, and he now became entangled with Faceless Entities and even held another System of Existence due to it...and not even an hour had passed!","If he didn’t isolate himself and not bother with anything, how would this affect his own complexity? If he continued to interact with the weavings and flow of the Wheel...how would this continue to affect his complexity?!"]},{"number":3494,"title":"Chapter 3494: Chapter 3493: Singed! III","paragraphs":["The struggle for control over his weavings!","To obtain control absolutely, isolation was the only path and this way, there would be no interactions with other weavings.","No choices to make due to causality that came from interacting with others.","Just seclusion away from everything as if the flow of the Wheel flows as it should always flow, would there be someone else who can come along and face whatever mystery was currently unfolding?","If Noah didn’t bother with Bob’s weavings and he remained sealed.","Would there be someone similar to Bob in other Frequencies who would be able to stand against the Faceless Entities and return leadership to the Wheelomachy?","The more he thought of isolation as means of absolute control, the more he thought as his weavings went towards a few specific beings.","The Great Beyonder. The Omnifather.","Where were they in all this? If they couldn’t be found currently, did they take that step of isolation to attain full control of their own weavings?","\"...\"","Millions of thoughts crossed Noah’s mind as he felt the not so subtle changes to his physiology and being as the System of Existence of the Singed continued to empower everything.","He waved his hands as he called out Severed Outerversal Authority.","WU!","Obsidian brilliance bloomed, but around it- silent golden flames seethed as even these weavings became burnt!","And its severed intensity and complexity took a step higher- at least by a factor of two.","Noah was musing the possibility of isolation, but in the depths of his heart, he knew that it wasn’t something he would do.","Just lock himself away?","He knew that eventually, there would be someone or something that takes the reins, and in his isolation- such a being or their forces could appear and destroy everything he had built!","Hell Terra Firma was isolated and unique, but even he could go in and out. What if another force came that could do something similar with all these ongoing changes?","No amount of isolation would be enough.","So was there actually a choice, or an illusion of one?","He would actively continue to be involved.","Because his involvement led to something like this.","He raised his and observed the golden flames burning around him.","To become a Burnt One.","To be Singed by the Flame of the Wheel!","It seemed to carry a grandiose meaning as he wondered- apart from Tam of the Singed, how many more lay out there?!","—","Within the same Frequency of Existence.","Megalos Nihilos.","Across the stretches of the vast regions equivalent to the size of tens of thousands of Omniverse, there was one region that was free of any signs of complexity and life forms apart from a single one.","A massive creature in the form of a massive 81 legged spider.","The 81 legs looked like massive spikes as each one was the size of a hundredth of an Omniverse, and it held nine shining gold eyes that looked ahead with wisdom and serenity.","The gold eyes showed a shocking level of complexity that far exceeded anything a Pioneer could exhibit as they could seemingly see through too many things.","Its exterior looked white gold as at this moment, it was staring out blankly as an intent radiated from it- almost as if it was talking to itself.","|There exist a great many parasites out there, but a Parasite of Existence like you is rare. Lazy, slovenly, and idle in nature, and yet the spread is rapid.|","...!","This massive entity was talking as if there was someone before it, and yet it was the only form of life here!","But it continued regardless.","|You clutched onto my underlings and then latched onto my weavings through that connection. A blindspot. But even then, I sensed it right away as soon as it occurred.|","Its words were filled with ancient power as it became silent after these last words.","As if it was waiting.","And after a few seconds...another voice echoed out, also from the massive white gold spider!","|Why did you leave me be? I have only continued to assimilate small parts of you since then. Even now, you could cut these parts off and extinguish me at will, and yet you haven’t. Why?|","Why.","It was always a why.","The eyes of the massive spider sparkled at such a question as it answered calmly.","|You should have felt it too the moment that you latched onto me. You became burnt beyond recognition. You were singed by my very own existence as from that moment on, you became part of something larger. The moment you became tainted by the Flame of the Wheel of Existence, your position exceeded even my earliest underlings who could not have my lineage passed down to. You became part of me as that could not have been a mistake. So why would I have done anything to you?|","...!","An immense silence followed.","The ancient voice that had echoed out seemed amused by this as it continued.","Continue your journey with","|You were called the Great Usurper, yes? Does this scare you? The possibility of a purpose grander than anything you had before? Becoming singed by the Flame of the Wheel of Existence means that whether you like it or not, events will start unraveling around you. Causality will twist and distort in ways you cannot even imagine- all for the flow of the Wheel. You can run from it, or choose to ignore it I suppose, but I’ve only found myself at peace just going with the flow. And hey, there is the added bonus of an accelerated rise in complexity compared to any other creatures.|","|...|","The intent of the Usurper was silent at all of these words.","After some time, his voice echoed out.","|You realize that I will not stop assimilating your weavings? In some time, your complexity will disappear as I take it over entirely. Is that purpose for you?|","His voice carried a hint of defiance.","As if he detested the idea of some destined purpose!"]},{"number":3495,"title":"Chapter 3495: Chapter 3494: Singed! IV","paragraphs":["And yet the reply of the white gold spider burning with Source complexity was a somber one.","\"Maybe, maybe not. If you do succeed in assimilating my weavings, will you still be you, or will my source be potent enough where you won’t be the same anymore? Either way, whoever is in control will continue to have access to weavings of the Wheel. You will begin to see the flow clearly, and you can decide on whether you will kindle chaos or order. Choices. At the end of the day, it’s all about choices...\"","The voice remained as ancient as ever as at that moment, the massive figure of the white gold spider began moving across the gray white space of Megalos Nihilos.","Inside of it, a uniquely terrifying will continued assimilating its weavings without pause!","Far from Megalos Nihilos.","Within the weavings of the Megalos Beyond.","Near a Pantheon that was known as the Pantheon of Desoto.","A collection of humanoid Faceless Entities could be seen descending on the top of this Pantheon, the aura of a slumbering Pioneer and a dozen Existence Severing entities arising from it to face these unknown enemies!","An even further distance away from this Pantheon, there was a figure shining with obsidian gold light who was watching this entire event unfold.","It was a massive entity that had a worm like body for the bottom, and above, 18 serpentine heads sprouted!","Each of these heads shone with a golden brilliance as its eyes burned with a terrifying gold flame.","|What vile creatures are you? To mask yourselves like this bloom along with this Change?|","It asked the question to itself as there was nobody to answer, but its gold eyes could already see what would happen once the Outerversal Morphons and these Faceless Entities clashed.","Decimation would ensue.","And so, it made a choice.","|Starfall.|","HUUM!","From a distance.","An unfathomably far distance!","This entity uttered out calmly as the very fabric of the Megalos Beyond trembled. Your next chapter is on","Outerversal authority surged madly as golden flames also converged around them like singularities, forming massive swirls of black and gold that were the size of a hundredth of an Omniverse!","Starfall, this entity called it.","The fall of stars.","And yet, what formed were swirling masses of black and gold simmering with an ember of a scorching flame that was the size of a hundredth of an Omniverse.","Thousands of them formed as when observing the Pantheon in the far distance, this single cluster of scorching black gold masses...would cover all of this Pantheon!","The heat was so scalding that after they formed and began to descend, those down below felt their veiled skins prickling even from afar.","The white bands on the Faceless Entities brightened as they looked up and saw the scene.","The Outerversal Morphons below that were just rising to fight saw this scene and sought to back away in fright!","And yet regardless of their size, they came down with such shocking speed that they were already above the Faceless Entities and above the Pantheon before even an instant passed.","OOOH!","Roars of utter complexity bloomed from the Faceless Entities as terrifying dark towers erupted from their bodies, with some blooming with millions of terrifying dark Runes to explode out heavily as if they were directed towards the Pantheon below, it would be eradicated in an instant!","And yet...","SKEE!","When the scorching masses of black and gold came down, all of these millions of runes and towers lit up as if they were paper and became scorches entirely- turned into ash!","Thereafter, the thousands of scorching black gold masses smashed and uniquely passed through the Faceless Entities, descending onto the Pantheon below as they also...passed through the Pantheon as if they weren’t even real.","Outerversal Morphons cried out and expected death, but they were shocked to find that they only felt a warmness as these terrifying masses passed through them and the black earth below them too.","But the Faceless Entities...","Their bodies trembled as the white bands on their heads vibrated only slightly before their white bands burnt away, and the masses within began to wriggle as they revealed themselves right after!","But even before they came out, even they became covered by a golden flame as they were scorched out of existence.","...!","The scene was horror inducing to look at as Outerversal Morphons down below only stared dumbly.","Far above, the 18 headed black gold Outerversal Morphon had grim eyes as it looked at the wriggling masses that erupted from the bodies that were no longer veiled.","|Unnatural...|","Unnatural.","This was the word that this creature used as golden flames of a Singed burned within its eyes!","|O Master, why are you not here for this? What path did you take as all we are left with is your supposed Instrument in these times of uncertainty?|","The terrifyingly complex entity called out silently as in the distance, the utterly gorgeous scene of thousands of fantastical black gold masses passing through a Pantheon harmlessly and extending down below played out.","Far from here.","Away from these Megalos and Expanse- away from this Frequency of Existence entirely.","Inside another Spoke of the Wheel, within the Expanse.","A secret abode inside of a Blancverse within a Blancverse that only the highest echelons of the Logos of the Wheel knew of.","Here, in an isolated domain, a man found himself confined as all around him, there was only white blankness.","In such a space, light flickered as...a pristine and utterly magisterial black cat with a jewel on its head appeared, her serpentine eyes looking at the man with calmness as he also rose up to look at her.","His eyes flashed coldly as he spoke out.","\"You give me a mission to issue, one that has caused a rift between the Wheelomachy and the Logos of the Wheel, and now I stand here confined. Do you care to explain any of this at all?\"","...!"]},{"number":3496,"title":"Chapter 3496: Chapter 3495: Entanglements! I","paragraphs":["A black cat in an expanse of white looked at a man who was seeking answers!","A father who had left behind his daughter.","\"O McAllister, why point any fingers at this moment? In these grand weavings of the Wheel, everybody makes their own choices and owns up to their consequences.\"","...!","The cat opened her mouth and uttered such words with a smile as McAllister remained cold and impassive.","His Source may not be as complex as hers, but he was not afraid of her. He was not afraid of death!","She saw his cold gaze as her smile became even wider.","\"Okay, okay, it was my choice to hand you that mission and subsequently, I shall bear the consequences. What answers do you want? I will speak about what I can to the best of my abilities.\"","Her serpentine eyes blinked with honesty.","McAllister looked at her sharply as he asked.","\"Those Faceless...Entities I barely glimpsed before being taken away. What are they? Since when did the Logos become aligned with them?\"","...!","The Black Cat blinked as it promised to answer the best it could, but the first question alone was already so heavy!","She paced around the white space for a moment before she spoke out seriously.","\"For now, think of them as distant allies that have been with the Logos for some time, but are only able to move right now.\"","Allies.","Allies!","This word resounded in McAllister’s mind as he asked sharply.","\"When did the Logos of the Wheel ever need allies? Even the Watchers of the Wheelomachy, we didn’t get too close to. Why these beings? For what purpose is the Logos of the Wheel moving towards at this moment?\"","Purpose.","Every single entity seemed to be looking for it!","What were the Logos of the Wheel moving towards now with these Faceless Entities also at the helm?","The Black Cat was silent as after some time, she resumed once more.","\"In the past, many of the missions completed...had inferences and ideas from them. Assassinate this entity, propel that entity, destroy that Alliance, ensure the eradication of these Lineages across the Frequencies...many different aspects of what the Logos of the Wheel has done had their influence behind it. I tell you this to allow you to understand where we came from, as only after understanding this can you understand where we are going. And as of this moment, I can tell you that it is all for greater Complexity.\"","...!","Complexity.","\"All of this...just for Complexity?\"","The eyes of McAllister were dazed slightly as the Black Cat nodded.","\"That and more, but you don’t have the qualifications just yet. You can gain them. You can get access to understand more if you want.\"","\"If I want?\"","\"Mmm. And I will keep it simple too. Join us- truly join us, and we can get you your daughter back. I know the regret you feel must be consuming you whole. And you won’t even have to do anything crazy. The first and only mission you will be given is leading a few Faceless Lifeforms to track down the last thing we could recover from the weavings of your daughter before she disappeared. You see, they consider it truly important to wrap up loose ends, especially those involved directly or indirectly in contributing to the change. Your daughter is already pardoned as we simply need the one she became entangled with after her mission. A name we were able to dig out after much arduous work before the weavings of your daughter disappeared, and this same name is your target- should you choose to accept it.\"","...!","Before the weavings of his daughter disappeared entirely, she had an entanglement!","Who? What was the target being put down for him to chase?","He calmly listened to the Black Cat as she opened her feline mouth.","\"All I have for you is a name. You will have to find its weavings and everything else. Your target, should you choose to accept, will be someone called Noah Osmont. Just digging up that name came with a tremendous cost as we know nothing else. But this creature needs to be captured preferably. The Faceless Lifeforms will do the work, you will simply lead them. What shall it be?\"","A choice had to be made.","McAllister thought about his daughter as he closed his eyes.","Her rage. Her disappointment.","He convinced himself he didn’t care. He told himself he had Severed everything! Find exclusive stories on","And yet...","\"Haa....\" He sighed as he rose from the white blank space.","\"Let us get it over with.\"","...!","\"Haha, I’m glad we can see eye to eye. It is good to have you back, little guy.\"","WUU!","The white space around them fluctuated.","It broke down and deteriorated as if it were a painting, revealing clear skies nearby as McAllister felt terrifying auras bloom behind him as if they were already there to begin with.","His gaze turned around to see the blank expressionless heads of Faceless Lifeforms who had a radiant white bar on their heads- and there were 12 in number as each one did not seem to have complexity any lesser than his!","They gave him an eerie feeling as the Black Cat in front of him spoke out.","\"Your Faceless Squadron to lead. They will listen to your orders for the most part, and they would only not listen under very unique circumstances.\"","\"Oh? And what would be designated as a unique circumstance?\"","McAllister asked as the Black Cat only smiled.","\"Don’t worry too much about that. Head towards where you sent your daughter, and start there to find the weavings and location of this Noah Osmont. You get to him, you get to your daughter. Good luck.\"","WAP!","With a glimmer, the Black Cat disappeared as McAllister was left behind with the Faceless Lifeforms.","He glanced at them as the unfamiliar sense only increased, but he buried it deep within himself as he spoke out.","\"Let’s go!\"","He moved.","They moved.","Their goal was someone called Noah Osmont!"]},{"number":3497,"title":"Chapter 3497: Chapter 3496: Entanglements! II","paragraphs":["A Black Cat had disappeared in one region and appeared in another.","At this moment, she appeared in a serene blue domain that had a sea stretching out in all directions, and at its very center, there was an illusion of a massive tree.","The sea seemed to be reflecting itself above with a scintillating light, but the tree took center point!","The trunk of the tree was made up of countless lines, and it had branches shooting out from the top and bottom of the trunk as they connected onto a round ring brimming with brilliance.","A Round Wheel!","A wheel that spun with a buzzing humming sound as while it did so, the cerulean waters of the vast sea gravitated upwards before they fell off to the side, creating a fabulous scene filled with beauty.","It was a representation of something grand as at this moment, the Black Cat stepped on the blue waters to near this massive illusory image that had a single entity near it.","A humanoid entity shrouded in black, his head entirely covered as only a white vertical band of light was present at its very center.","The Black Cat came to stand near him as she looked at her reflection in the water.","Her clear eyes.","Her deep complexity.","She looked at herself, and a moment later, she spoke out.","\"Must things be done this way in order for us to achieve what we want?\"","...!","Her words held no doubt, but they genuinely asked!","She genuinely wanted to know!","And the being before her continued watching the representation of a grand construct before he turned around.","His blank face locked onto the Black Cat looking at her reflection as an intent weaved out from him slowly.","\"To effect changes...sometimes violence is required. A type of necessary violence.\"","Necessary violence.","The Black Cat mulled over this word before she shook her head and replied.","\"From my experience, those who rush to violence are those most incompetent- regardless of the form of violence it is.\"","Your journey continues at","\"We did not rush to this. For eons, we thought, for eons, we planned. Only after countless calculations and possibilities did we make a move.\"","His reply was a placid one as at such a moment, the Black Cat stopped staring at her reflection and looked at this being directly.","She looked at the black suit covering him as well as the white band shining brilliantly over his face.","She remembered eons of a face. Eons!","And now, she could no longer see it.","\"Did you have to change yourself for this violence? From now on until our complexities collapse, I will never be able to see your face again, O Giuseppe.\"","...!","The Black Cat stared at the Faceless Lifeform as she asked this, and it was followed by a heavy silence before the white band radiated a warm smile and replied.","\"Out there, the Wheel of Existence has far too many complexities. Ankyras of Omniverses and Frequencies. Singed Ones, and other mysteries we cannot even fathom. Choosing to go against the Wheel is tantamount to choosing death. Unless there is true confidence behind everything, I would not have changed. To be able to stand for what is to come, to be able to fight the terrifying monsters out there...sometimes the only solution is to become one yourself.\"","WAA!","\"Oh, and once we succeed, our weavings of existence will never collapse, O Azzurra. Wait for me. Continue waiting for me. When the dust settles. When the Wheel burns like never before. When all Frequencies stand below our feet...wait for me!\"","...!","The words were filled with conviction and confidence, and a Black Cat listened to them calmly as she couldn’t reply!","Weavings continued to unfold.","The Wheel continued to turn.","In another Frequency of Existence entirely, weavings of change continued to unfold as causality spun its web.","Within the Expanse, inside a stretch of a vast golden sea.","Golden Titans floated within in large numbers as at the very center, a massive Golden Titan brimming with Source Complexity opened its eyes.","\"I can finally move freely, but...\"","A heavy golden brilliance burned around its body as before it, an illusory scene of events that had occurred not too long ago played out!","The scene was showing an obsidian gold winged Outerversal Morphon standing against Pioneers of all shapes and sizes as he bellowed out.","\"Let us end our current Entanglement. You all came here to know whether I held the Resurgence of the lineage of Megalonians. I will tell you now that I hold what could not be obtained eons ago. The singular Megalonian who chose to dissipate his weavings of Existence instead of being devoured. I have taken the weavings of the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian for myself!\"","...!","A confession.","A grand one at that as the Golden Titan looked at with a burning gaze and repeated the words uttered by the being in that scene right after.","\"Ashes to ashes, dust to dust...is that right? Since a big guy like you appeared, since you affirm the weavings of a Megalonian, and even go further to eradicate my people...!\"","His gaze was filled with a brutal rising rage as his Source burned.","\"Let’s see, you also killed the Pioneers of Palaces of Dark Matter and Antimatter...even your own Morphons. That will make it even easier. In this budding chaos, the weavings of a Megalonian and what that can produce will be critical. I...am coming for you, so called Instrument!\"","WAA!","Weavings of plans began to be hatched.","It wasn’t just occurring in this one area as multiple Palaces faced the decimation of their people at the hands of the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian.","At this moment, they confirmed his weavings as if they were going to send anything towards him, it would have to be the allure of a Source Complexity!","And so, causality began to distort as the entanglements of the past bloomed into new Entanglements for the future.","One thing led to another, and the grand weavings of the Wheel continued to unfold!"]},{"number":3498,"title":"Chapter 3498: Chapter 3497: Entanglements! III","paragraphs":["The Expanse began to burn with activity.","Very few times in the eons past has there been a cluster of organized activity as much as at this moment.","Multiple factors came together to bring this to fruition as the very structure of the Expanse changed, with many Palaces of the Expanse experiencing the drop of Atmospheric Weavings of Existence as Strings of Existence snapped, and rifts of gray light spread throughout.","The root cause of a change like this had to be discovered, and while they were doing this...the weavings of the Megalonian that had made an enemy out of dozens of Palaces had to be obtained.","And so, like a roaring machine, complexity erupted and unfolded towards unknown directions. Explore stories on","One of the key figures at the center of all of this remained in the Megalos Ynnere.","He was but a humble farmer!","Inside Omniverse X-999. Secondary Infiniverse Megalos Seed.","Noah sat on a throne surrounded by plots of farms as in front of him, the figure of Tam of the Singed bowed down while continuing to voice out its weavings.","\"I seek permission from the Origin Singed to uncover more regarding those Faceless creatures that are now permeating across the Wheelomachy.\"","The reconstruction of Tam recalled everything up to its death. Within it, the Faceless Entities took center point in terms of importance.","\"They seem opposed not to existence itself...but the very flow of the Wheel. The white band of light on their heads should serve as some form of a veil that keeps their true selves hidden. If ever they are exposed, their weavings fundamentally break down just from being exposed to the weavings of the Wheel. I believe these beings are extremely dangerous, and the fact they managed to enter the depths of the Wheelomachy is even more. Permit me to understand more about them, O Origin Singed.\"","Tam made a plea.","Noah looked at him calmly and thought of the Faceless Entity- as well as the massive eruption of what seemed like True Runes of Existence grinding their true body down the moment that it was revealed.","As if the Wheel itself was against these creatures.","This begged a critical question to be asked.","Exactly what types of entities would be so entirely opposed to the weavings of the Wheel that unless they were wrapped in a unique Faceless veil, they would be turned to ash?","\"...\"","A question without an answer as Noah nodded while pushing his straw hat up and looking around him.","\"Your weavings were perfectly reconstructed as you hold the power of a Pioneer. If you want to come in contact with Faceless Entities that you should be able to handle, you can do so in the Megalos Ynnere. Here, in the Omniverses of the Commonwealth, there should be Faceless Entities running rampant.\"","...!","Noah said such words as he thought of the memories of a now eradicated Sword of the Commonwealth.","If it was happening in one Omniverse, it was happening in others.","Tam listened to this as he bowed down even further.","\"You had already grasped the flow of the Wheel this much, forgive me for being presumptuous in even asking. With your permission, I will take my leave right away.\"","Within Tam of the Singed, a dazzling gold flame still burned brightly as this entity remained one of the Burnt Ones.","He didn’t hesitate to entangle himself in more things as Noah nodded with a sigh, sending forward a burst of weavings of information regarding the Omniverses of the Commonwealth into Tam before he waved.","\"Go.\"","The Singed bowed before him again before the light of a gold flame wrapped around him, and he disappeared.","This was yet another choice that was made. From this, there would be more Entanglements as Noah wondered how it would unfold.","Tam of the Singed sets out to eradicate Faceless Entities under his permission. He is able to handle them enough as alarms are raised towards stronger Faceless Entities, and after a day or two- they descend onto Megalos Ynnere as at that time, who would be there to oppose them?","\"Is that how causality will play out?\"","Noah smiled as he thought of that possibility.","Causality. Entanglements!","Since he confirmed with himself that he would not go to the route of isolation to prevent being swept by the flow of the Wheel, he might as well jump in fully and control the flow as much as he could.","So that later on down the line, he would not be put in a position where he was forced to make a certain choice.","The more control that he had, the easier the choices that he could make. And as always, the answer lay with complexity.","The more powerful he was, the more complex he was, the more choices became viable to him.","And before him, there lay a few paths of increasing complexity.","One he had to wait for, with him not being able to contact Disciple Vashti within the Wheelomachy to enter the channel Bob left behind until things cooled down.","At this moment, other Watchers should still be questioning her or observing the surroundings heavily.","Another path was the Resurgence of the Origin Sacred Primal Megalonian that many would chase after, meaning powerful entities would rush to wherever he appeared.","But this time, they knew his terrifying level of power as it would not just be Pioneers of Existence.","And even the Pioneers of Existence that would come may be of extremely high tier as defeating them would not be as easy. And when Source Complexity entities arrived? It would only mean a body of his getting captured.","So once more, it boiled down to power and complexity.","At this moment, he did not fear Pioneers of Existence as every single part of his was truly severed, with some surging up towards the first blockade.","The 27th Severing where the resources required jumped up by three times.","At this moment, only cheats had crossed this threshold as coming in close behind were Infinity, Quintessence, Protagonist, and a few others.","But at the same time, his heart was telling him to Sever the Atlas of Existence itself and the Systems of Existence contained within it many times over!","Because what would happen if he was able to sever the System of Existence of the Singed to the theoretical 81st Severing?"]},{"number":3499,"title":"Chapter 3499: Chapter 3498: Entanglements! IV","paragraphs":["There were many possibilities on which routes he could take regarding his own complexity.","Just as it was a daring question to ask what would happen if he was able to sever the System of Existence of the Singed to the theoretical 81st Severing, it was just as daring to ask what Cheats would bring if it reached that same height.","Or Infinity.","Or Mana.","Or even the Amarantos Rune of Existence!","Each possibility seemed to hold heavy implications as the main thing in all of this...were the required resources for the Severings.","This was the fuel to his complexity at this moment as he felt like the more rounds of severings his aspects went through, the more complex he would become to the extent that even entities who had attained their Source would be manageable to him.","Source Complexity. Continue your journey on","Many wondered just what shocking intricacies such a stage held, but Noah didn’t have to!","He had a Source Complexity entity tell him exactly how her power felt at that stage as from this, Noah was confident in not being able to suppress one at this moment.","He thought of the qualities Barbatos spoke of and shook his head.","\"A Source is a qualitative jump. To overcome it...\"","His figure rose from the throne and arrived before a stellar blue stalk that had bloomed into a tree.","He felt the vibrant complexity of this tree he was cultivating as after a few seconds...he spoke commandingly to the Infiniverse Megalos Body standing calmly beside his throne.","\"Proceed with the switch. The Infiniverse Megalos Seed cannot be collecting dust in Hell Terra Firma like this.\"","...!","Yes.","Many answers lay in Hell Terra Firma.","The answer to rapid complexity without much danger lay in Hell Terra Firma!","Satellites had been deployed. The lands were being mapped. More Settlements would be conquered as more Pioneers would follow, and eventually...even Source Complexity entities!","But Hell Terra Firma still held something far too critical.","The Infiniverse Megalos Seed itself.","The Secondary Infiniverse Megalos Seed was a good representation, but it was a shell compared to the Infiniverse Megalos Seed within Hell Terra Firma!","The Extremity Vein there. The Aletheian Havens there that were forged unceasingly. Its complexity that exceeded many Omniverses.","And the fact that even though its components had undergone True Severing...it was locked away in a place without Authorities to show just what heavy brilliance it could now unleash.","But most of all.","Noah’s connection to the Infiniverse Megalos Seed was unbreakable.","Irrefutable.","Indefatigable!","He was Singed.","His Ordinances were Singed.","The pillars of authority that made up the Infiniverse Megalos Seed...were also Singed!","Just what did something like that mean?","To be touched by the Flame of the Wheel of Existence, entities were elevated to a shocking extreme.","But it was something that could not even be passed on to one’s Lineage.","In history, has a Planet ever been Singed? A Galaxy? A Reality? An Existential Domain? An Omniverse? A Megalos?!","The Infiniverse Megalos Seed was something far more special than any of these, and at this moment, it became Singed.","It couldn’t be locked away any longer!","\"I was just waiting for the command, Master. All preparations have been set.\"","Beside his throne, the Infiniverse Megalos Body smiled brilliantly as everything began to shake.","Noah’s body was surrounded by an ever burning golden flame as he looked at his stellar farm before taking a step forward, disappearing from this domain and reappearing outside of it a moment later!","Outside, many things had changed.","The stable Frequency Gateway that looked like a wormhole stood like a multicolored circular sea by itself.","Above it, the bounds of the Secondary Infiniverse Megalos Seed had been pulled and miniaturized as currently, it floated like an incandescent star above the Frequency Gateway.","That was where Noah had just come from!","The Infiniverse Megalos Body already prepared everything as Noah stared at the Frequency Gateway below, the miniaturized Infiniverse Megalos Seed beginning to descend freely at this moment!","Past the Frequency Gateway.","In Hell Terra Firma.","At the center of an advanced metallic technological base where not even a fly could pass through.","Another body of Noah stared at the Infiniverse Megalos Seed that was currently the size of a basketball.","Just as it could deny the terrifying rulings of Hell Terra Firma to expand into hundreds of miles while its power increased, it could miniaturize itself with even greater ease!","The dazzling multicolored Frequency Gateway that was now a stable channel was easy to isolate and leave by itself.","The Miniaturized Infiniverse Megalos Seed now slowly descended onto the channel as beside Noah, Barbatos, Ruination, and the Infiniverse Megalos Body looked at this with shining eyes.","Those who were locked within could be taken out in just a few more days safely.","This method would be even quicker while achieving a terrifying feat.","As the process unfolded, Noah turned to look at Ruination.","\"You go in as well. Let us see how bright your flame is. The Autonomous Quintessential Androids will take care of things here.\"","...!","Ruination was another unbreakable connection that was nearly a part of Noah.","Another Burnt One!","She couldn’t remain in Hell Terra Firma to collect dust either.","The crimson haired girl looked towards her Master and nodded, her figure sprinting on the metallic floor below them before she arrived on the outer ring of the Frequency Gateway and dove down gracefully!","Things went in, and other things would come out.","The Infiniverse Megalos Body here held bright eyes as she spoke.","\"Monitoring for any changes as the Infiniverse Megalos Seed and the Secondary Infiniverse Megalos Seed both cross through the Frequency Gateway simultaneously.\"","...!","Two unfathomably massive objects were miniaturized and passing across the same gateway!","It was a critical point in time as Noah closed his eyes, feeling his connection to both as they traveled across the only stable channel in and out of Hell Terra Firma!","A moment where another choice was made that would heavily change the direction of the flow of weavings from here on out!"]},{"number":3500,"title":"Chapter 3500: Chapter 3499: The Embers of a Flame! I","paragraphs":["A stable pathway that, the moment it was established...fissures and cracks extended across the Expanse as an unraveling reached an irreversible point.","A Change bloomed.","Whether it was a piece of the puzzle or a main part of it didn’t matter- whether it was simply a small domino- a grand piece that was tipped over and caused everything else to fall did not matter!","What mattered was that it was there.","That one could pass through Hell Terra Firma and out.","And at this moment, something utterly massive crossed out!","It was made small.","It crossed the waters of the channel rapidly as while sharing the unbreakable connection, Noah observed it all!","Beside him, the Infiniverse Megalos Body continued her monitoring.","\"Approaching 50% progress across the Frequency Gateway on both sides and accelerating.\"","A unique point approached.","Within the channel, the Secondary Infiniverse Megalos Seed and the Infiniverse Megalos Seed passed each other.","Fantastical arcs of multicolored light flashed between them- almost as if the Infiniverse Megalos Seed was about to pull and swallow the Secondary Infiniverse Megalos Seed whole!","But all there was...remained to be this interaction of arcs of light that allowed for a small segment of the Secondary Infiniverse Megalos Seed to be pulled into the Infiniverse Megalos Seed.","A farm and its radiant cerulean haven it was on.","That was it!","SAA!","The two objects passed each other and accelerated ever faster.","In Hell Terra Firma, Noah got ready to receive the Secondary Infiniverse Megalos Seed.","Outside of Hell Terra Firma, another body of his got ready for the return of the Infiniverse Megalos Seed for the first time since its disappearance!","|The passage of the Infiniverse Megalos Seed outside of Hell Terra Firma has been deemed a success.|","An intent rang out from the Infiniverse Megalos Body within Noah’s mind.","It was the affirmation of a successful action as on the other side of the Frequency Gateway, a blinding ball of brilliance ascended with a terrifying weight and pressure!","With its ascension back into a Frequency of Existence, its complexity was shooting up rapidly as what it was made of was completely Severed.","Manadynamics. Relativity. Genesis. Dreams. Helios. Polarity! All these and more were severed as if the pillars of a structure became even more immense; the structure itself would be even more so!","But...there was something else in addition to many severings.","All these Severings had been affiliated with burns.","The Infiniverse Megalos Seed itself became afflicted with these burns!","It became Singed.","At this moment, it broke out of the Frequency Gateway entirely and spun above the isolated domain within Omniverse X-999, and in the next moment...","BOOOM!","One of the heaviest explosions of complexity Noah had ever come across thundered out.","It was accompanied by an eruption of a blinding golden flame that covered the Infiniverse Megalos Seed, this flame radiating such a terrifyingly complex light that it was reflected across Omniverse X-999 and a distance of tens of Omniverses beyond it!","That was just heavy and complex it was.","|Countless changes within the Infiniverse Megalos Seed are occurring and being analyzed for quantification in real-time.|","|The Extremity Vein is increasing in depth and complexity.|","|The Aletheian Havens are increasing in depth and complexity.|","|An Unknown Factor is budding from the center of the Infiniverse Megalos Seed and catalyzing an advanced process.|","...!","Noah’s eyes were bright.","He basked in the grandiose light of the Infiniverse Megalos Seed as prompts continued!","|The Analysis of the budding Unknown Factor causing an advanced change has been analyzed to be the Embers of the Flame of the Wheel of Existence.|","HUUM!","Immense heat was given off from the Infiniverse Megalos Seed.","Heat so complex and so unfathomable that it brought with it countless changes!","In Omniverse X-999, the Atmospheric Weavings of Existence were low just like many other areas across Megalos Ynerre, with cracks spread out across.","The moment that the blinding heat of complexity stemming from Embers within the Infiniverse Megalos Seed spread out...the cracks in space were pulled together as if the heat forced them close!","The Atmospheric Weavings of Existence...began to rise up once more!","At the center of Omniverse X-999, a certain Omniversal Ankyra looked around somberly as Autarchical authorities surrounded him protectively, and yet they felt like bundles of paper that could be shredded at any second with the swirling complexity nearby.","All that occurred was being monitored heavily as the one responsible for it all continued to receive shocking prompts.","|Through the Embers of the Flame of the Wheel of Existence and the true severing of Existence, the Infiniverse Megalos Seed begins to bloom into the Infiniverse Megalos.|","...!","|The Extremity Vein is transforming into the Severed Vein of Existence.|","|The Aletheian Havens are transforming into Severed Megalos Pantheonic Havens.|","|Embers begin to gather intensity at the center of the blooming Infiniverse Megalos.|","WAA!","The process was shocking to observe.","The massive infinity shaped Vein constricted and expanded over and over again as it was made aflame- iridescent golden flames raging over it and roaring out maddeningly!","The Aletheian Havens...rapidly expanded and increased in size and complexity as they became Severed Megalos Pantheonic Havens.","Find adventures at","All over these different colored Havens, massive golden mountainous passages bloomed as they had eruptions of lava like gold flames blasting down and bathing absolutely everything.","It was a glorious scene to observe as while all of this occurred, Noah felt his own complexity rising in feedback to the budding Infiniverse Megalos!","It was always like this, wasn’t it?","The more complex he became, the more complex the Infiniverse Megalos became...and vice versa.","The two of them only propelled each other higher and higher as currently, the Infiniverse Megalos had taken center stage while it bloomed from a Megalos Seed and into a Megalos!","|Weavings of Complexity have reached a critical level.|","|Embers make way for an impossibility.|","|A Sliver of the Flame of the Wheel of Existence has been born in the Infiniverse Megalos.|","...!"]}]);
